          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub514\uc2a4\ud50c\ub808\uc774\uc11c"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De verdringer"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wypieracz"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O deslocador"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0418\u0437\u0433\u043d\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0438\u043a"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yer de\u011fi\u015ftirici"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6392\u6c34\u6cf5"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7f6e\u63db\u5668"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q1": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bekommst eine unerwartete R\u00fcckzahlung von 800\u20ac (Steuer, Kaution, Versicherung). Was passiert in den n\u00e4chsten 48 Stunden?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You get an unexpected refund of \u20ac800 (tax, deposit, insurance). What happens in the next 48 hours?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtienes un reembolso inesperado de 800 \u20ac (impuestos, dep\u00f3sito, seguro). \u00bfQu\u00e9 pasar\u00e1 en las pr\u00f3ximas 48 horas?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiez d'un remboursement inattendu de 800 \u20ac (taxes, caution, assurance). Que se passe-t-il dans les prochaines 48 heures ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u20ac800 (\u0915\u0930, \u091c\u092e\u093e, \u092c\u0940\u092e\u093e) \u0915\u093e \u0905\u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0936\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u093f\u092b\u0902\u0921 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0947 48 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ottieni un rimborso inaspettato di 800\u20ac (tasse, deposito, assicurazione). Cosa succede nelle prossime 48 ore?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e88\u671f\u305b\u306c 800 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed (\u7a0e\u91d1\u3001\u30c7\u30dd\u30b8\u30c3\u30c8\u3001\u4fdd\u967a) \u306e\u6255\u3044\u623b\u3057\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6b21\u306e 48 \u6642\u9593\u3067\u4f55\u304c\u8d77\u3053\u308b\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc608\uc0c1\uce58 \ubabb\ud55c \u20ac800(\uc138\uae08, \ubcf4\uc99d\uae08, \ubcf4\ud5d8)\ub97c \ud658\ubd88\ubc1b\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc55e\uc73c\ub85c 48\uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \ubb34\uc2a8 \uc77c\uc774 \uc77c\uc5b4\ub0a0\uae4c\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je krijgt onverwacht \u20ac 800,- terug (belasting, borg, verzekering). Wat gebeurt er de komende 48 uur?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otrzymujesz nieoczekiwany zwrot pieni\u0119dzy w wysoko\u015bci 800 \u20ac (podatek, kaucja, ubezpieczenie). Co stanie si\u0119 w ci\u0105gu najbli\u017cszych 48 godzin?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea recebe um reembolso inesperado de \u20ac 800 (impostos, dep\u00f3sito, seguro). O que acontece nas pr\u00f3ximas 48 horas?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u044b \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0436\u0438\u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043c\u0435\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0432 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043c\u0435\u0440\u0435 800\u20ac (\u043d\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433, \u0437\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0433, \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0445\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435). \u0427\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0438\u0437\u043e\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0435 48 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beklenmedik bir \u015fekilde 800\u20ac tutar\u0131nda geri \u00f6deme al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z (vergi, depozito, sigorta). \u00d6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki 48 saat i\u00e7inde ne olacak?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u4f1a\u6536\u5230\u4e00\u7b14\u610f\u5916\u7684800\u6b27\u5143\u9000\u6b3e\uff08\u7a0e\u6b3e\u3001\u62bc\u91d1\u3001\u4fdd\u9669\uff09\u3002\u63a5\u4e0b\u6765\u768448\u5c0f\u65f6\u4f1a\u53d1\u751f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u610f\u5916\u7372\u5f97 800 \u6b50\u5143\u7684\u9000\u6b3e\uff08\u7a05\u91d1\u3001\u62bc\u91d1\u3001\u4fdd\u96aa\uff09\u3002\u63a5\u4e0b\u4f86\u7684 48 \u5c0f\u6642\u5167\u6703\u767c\u751f\u4ec0\u9ebc\u4e8b\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q1.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist weg \u2013 ich wei\u00df ehrlich gesagt nicht genau, wof\u00fcr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's gone - I'm honestly not sure why."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha desaparecido; sinceramente, no estoy seguro de por qu\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est parti - honn\u00eatement, je ne sais pas pourquoi."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u091a\u0932\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948 - \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0908\u092e\u093e\u0928\u0926\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0915\u093f \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non c'\u00e8 pi\u00f9, onestamente non sono sicuro del perch\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u6d88\u3048\u307e\u3057\u305f - \u6b63\u76f4\u306b\u8a00\u3046\u3068\u3001\u7406\u7531\u306f\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0ac\ub77c\uc84c\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc194\uc9c1\ud788 \uc65c \uadf8\ub7f0\uc9c0 \uc798 \ubaa8\ub974\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het is weg - ik weet eerlijk gezegd niet zeker waarom."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Znikn\u0119\u0142o \u2013 szczerze m\u00f3wi\u0105c, nie jestem pewien dlaczego."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acabou - honestamente, n\u00e3o sei por qu\u00ea."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0437\u043b\u043e \u2014 \u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044f, \u044f \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e, \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gitti; a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7as\u0131 neden oldu\u011fundan emin de\u011filim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u4e0d\u89c1\u4e86\u2014\u2014\u8001\u5b9e\u8bf4\uff0c\u6211\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u5177\u4f53\u662f\u4e3a\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u6d88\u5931\u4e86\u2014\u2014\u8001\u5be6\u8aaa\u6211\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u70ba\u4ec0\u9ebc\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q1.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kaufe mir erstmal etwas, das ich schon lange wollte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First I'll buy something that I've wanted for a long time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero comprar\u00e9 algo que quiero desde hace mucho tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais d\u2019abord acheter quelque chose que je veux depuis longtemps."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0910\u0938\u093e \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e \u091c\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0932\u0902\u092c\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0925\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per prima cosa comprer\u00f2 qualcosa che desidero da molto tempo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u307e\u305a\u306f\u305a\u3063\u3068\u6b32\u3057\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3092\u8cb7\u304a\u3046\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uba3c\uc800 \uc624\ub7ab\ub3d9\uc548 \uac16\uace0 \uc2f6\uc5c8\ub358 \uac83\uc744 \uc0ac\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eerst koop ik iets wat ik al heel lang wil."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Najpierw kupi\u0119 co\u015b, o czym marzy\u0142em od dawna."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primeiro vou comprar algo que desejo h\u00e1 muito tempo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u0430 \u044f \u043a\u0443\u043f\u043b\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0447\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e, \u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u044f \u0434\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0445\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6ncelikle uzun zamand\u0131r istedi\u011fim bir \u015feyi sat\u0131n alaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5148\u4e70\u4e00\u4e9b\u6211\u65e9\u5c31\u60f3\u8981\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9996\u5148\u6211\u6703\u8cb7\u4e00\u4e9b\u6211\u60f3\u8981\u5f88\u4e45\u7684\u6771\u897f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q1.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es geht direkt auf mein Sparkonto oder in eine geplante Ausgabe."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It goes directly into my savings account or a planned expense."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Va directamente a mi cuenta de ahorros o a un gasto planificado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il va directement sur mon compte \u00e9pargne ou sur une d\u00e9pense planifi\u00e9e."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u0938\u0940\u0927\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u092f\u093e \u0928\u093f\u092f\u094b\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u092f \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Va direttamente nel mio conto di risparmio o in una spesa pianificata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u79c1\u306e\u666e\u901a\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u307e\u305f\u306f\u8a08\u753b\u3055\u308c\u305f\u652f\u51fa\u306b\u76f4\u63a5\u5165\u91d1\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub0b4 \uc800\ucd95\uacc4\uc88c\ub098 \uacc4\ud68d\ub41c \ube44\uc6a9\uc73c\ub85c \ubc14\ub85c \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac11\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het gaat rechtstreeks naar mijn spaarrekening of een geplande uitgave."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trafia bezpo\u015brednio na moje konto oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowe lub na planowany wydatek."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vai diretamente para minha conta poupan\u00e7a ou para uma despesa planejada."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u043c\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0445\u043e\u0434\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do\u011frudan tasarruf hesab\u0131ma veya planlanm\u0131\u015f bir gidere gidiyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u76f4\u63a5\u8fdb\u5165\u6211\u7684\u50a8\u84c4\u8d26\u6237\u6216\u7528\u4e8e\u8ba1\u5212\u4e2d\u7684\u652f\u51fa\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u76f4\u63a5\u5b58\u5165\u6211\u7684\u5132\u84c4\u5e33\u6236\u6216\u8a08\u5283\u958b\u652f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q1.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00fcberlege eine Woche lang, tue aber am Ende nichts damit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I think about it for a week but end up doing nothing with it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo pienso durante una semana pero termino sin hacer nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'y pense pendant une semaine mais je finis par ne rien faire avec."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u0924\u0915 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u0902\u0924\u0924: \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930 \u092a\u093e\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ci penso per una settimana ma finisco per non farci niente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1\u9031\u9593\u304f\u3089\u3044\u8003\u3048\u305f\u3051\u3069\u7d50\u5c40\u4f55\u3082\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc77c\uc8fc\uc77c \ub3d9\uc548 \uace0\ubbfc\ud588\uc9c0\ub9cc \uacb0\uad6d \uc544\ubb34\uac83\ub3c4 \ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik denk er een week over na, maar doe er uiteindelijk niets mee."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My\u015bl\u0119 o tym przez tydzie\u0144, ale ostatecznie nic z tym nie robi\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Penso nisso por uma semana, mas acabo n\u00e3o fazendo nada."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0443\u043c\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044e, \u043d\u043e \u0432 \u0438\u0442\u043e\u0433\u0435 \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0441 \u044d\u0442\u0438\u043c \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir hafta boyunca bunu d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcyorum ama sonunda hi\u00e7bir \u015fey yapm\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8003\u8651\u4e86\u4e00\u5468\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u540e\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e5f\u6ca1\u505a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u60f3\u4e86\u4e00\u500b\u661f\u671f\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u7d42\u4ec0\u9ebc\u4e5f\u6c92\u505a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q2": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Freund schw\u00e4rmt von einer Investment-App. Du hast 500\u20ac \u00fcbrig. Was tust du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your friend is raving about an investment app. You have \u20ac500 left. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu amigo est\u00e1 entusiasmado con una aplicaci\u00f3n de inversi\u00f3n. Te quedan 500\u20ac. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre ami raffole d\u2019une application d\u2019investissement. Il vous reste 500 \u20ac. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092e\u093f\u0924\u094d\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0910\u092a \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u093e\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u20ac500 \u092c\u091a\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902. \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo amico \u00e8 entusiasta di un'app di investimento. Ti restano 500\u20ac. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u53cb\u4eba\u306f\u6295\u8cc7\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u3092\u7d76\u8cdb\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u307e\u3060 500 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u6b8b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uce5c\uad6c\uac00 \ud22c\uc790 \uc571\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc5f4\uad11\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 500\uc720\ub85c\uac00 \ub0a8\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vriend is enthousiast over een beleggingsapp. Je hebt nog \u20ac 500,- over. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j znajomy zachwyca si\u0119 aplikacj\u0105 inwestycyjn\u0105. Zosta\u0142o Ci 500 \u20ac. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu amigo est\u00e1 entusiasmado com um aplicativo de investimento. Voc\u00ea ainda tem 500\u20ac. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433 \u0432\u043e\u0441\u0445\u0438\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0446\u0438\u0439. \u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c 500 \u0435\u0432\u0440\u043e. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arkada\u015f\u0131n\u0131z bir yat\u0131r\u0131m uygulamas\u0131 hakk\u0131nda \u00f6vg\u00fcler ya\u011fd\u0131r\u0131yor. 500\u20ac'nuz kald\u0131. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u5bf9\u4e00\u4e2a\u6295\u8d44\u5e94\u7528\u8d5e\u4e0d\u7edd\u53e3\u3002\u4f60\u8fd8\u6709500\u6b27\u5143\u5269\u4f59\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u5c0d\u4e00\u6b3e\u6295\u8cc7\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\u8b9a\u4e0d\u7d55\u53e3\u3002\u60a8\u9084\u5269 500 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q2.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lade sie sofort runter und probiere es direkt aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll download it straight away and try it out straight away."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo descargar\u00e9 de inmediato y lo probar\u00e9 de inmediato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais le t\u00e9l\u00e9charger imm\u00e9diatement et l'essayer imm\u00e9diatement."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0921\u093e\u0909\u0928\u0932\u094b\u0921 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0906\u091c\u093c\u092e\u093e\u090a\u0901\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo scaricher\u00f2 subito e lo prover\u00f2 subito."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e9\u901f\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3057\u3066\u3001\u65e9\u901f\u8a66\u3057\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubc14\ub85c \ub2e4\uc6b4\ubc1b\uc544\uc11c \ubc14\ub85c \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud574\ubcf4\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik download hem meteen en probeer hem meteen uit."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaraz go pobior\u0119 i wypr\u00f3buj\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou baix\u00e1-lo imediatamente e test\u00e1-lo imediatamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0436\u0435 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0441\u043a\u0430\u0447\u0430\u044e \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u044e \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u043e \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen indirip deneyece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9a6c\u4e0a\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5b83\u5e76\u76f4\u63a5\u5c1d\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7acb\u5373\u4e0b\u8f09\u4e26\u7acb\u5373\u8a66\u7528\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q2.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich google die App, lese 3 Reviews und entscheide dann."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I google the app, read 3 reviews and then decide."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Busco en Google la aplicaci\u00f3n, leo 3 rese\u00f1as y luego decido."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je recherche l'application sur Google, lis 3 avis, puis je d\u00e9cide."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0910\u092a \u0915\u094b \u0917\u0942\u0917\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, 3 \u0938\u092e\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e\u090f\u0902 \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0923\u092f \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerco l'app su Google, leggo 3 recensioni e poi decido."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u3092\u30b0\u30fc\u30b0\u30eb\u3067\u691c\u7d22\u3057\u30013\u4ef6\u306e\u30ec\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u8aad\u3093\u3067\u304b\u3089\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uad6c\uae00\uc5d0 \uc571\uc744 \uac80\uc0c9\ud558\uace0 \ub9ac\ubdf0 3\uac1c\ub97c \uc77d\uace0 \uacb0\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik google de app, lees 3 reviews en beslis dan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sprawdzam aplikacj\u0119 w Google, czytam 3 recenzje i wtedy decyduj\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu pesquiso o aplicativo no Google, leio 3 coment\u00e1rios e ent\u00e3o decido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0433\u0443\u0433\u043b\u044e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435, \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u044e 3 \u043e\u0442\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uygulamay\u0131 Google'da ara\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131m, 3 yorumu okudum ve karar verdim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u8c37\u6b4c\u4e0a\u641c\u7d22\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5e94\u7528\uff0c\u8bfb\u4e863\u6761\u8bc4\u8bba\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u518d\u51b3\u5b9a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7528\u8c37\u6b4c\u641c\u5c0b\u8a72\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5e8f\uff0c\u95b1\u8b80 3 \u689d\u8a55\u8ad6\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u505a\u51fa\u6c7a\u5b9a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q2.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klingt interessant \u2013 aber ich tue letztlich nichts."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sounds interesting - but in the end I don't do anything."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suena interesante, pero al final no hago nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela semble int\u00e9ressant, mais au final, je ne fais rien."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0926\u093f\u0932\u091a\u0938\u094d\u092a \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 - \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sembra interessante, ma alla fine non faccio nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9762\u767d\u305d\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u7d50\u5c40\u306f\u4f55\u3082\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc7ac\ubbf8\uc788\uc744 \uac83 \uac19\ub124\uc694. \ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uacb0\uad6d \uc800\ub294 \uc544\ubb34\uac83\ub3c4 \ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klinkt interessant - maar uiteindelijk doe ik niets."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brzmi interesuj\u0105co \u2013 ale ostatecznie nic nie robi\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parece interessante - mas no final n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o nada."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0432\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043d\u043e \u2014 \u043d\u043e \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u043e\u0432 \u044f \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kula\u011fa ilgin\u00e7 geliyor ama sonu\u00e7ta hi\u00e7bir \u015fey yapm\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u542c\u8d77\u6765\u5f88\u6709\u8da3\u2014\u2014\u4f46\u6211\u6700\u7ec8\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e5f\u6ca1\u505a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u807d\u8d77\u4f86\u5f88\u6709\u8da3\u2014\u2014\u4f46\u6700\u7d42\u6211\u4ec0\u9ebc\u4e5f\u6c92\u505a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q2.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich frage ihn nach konkreten Zahlen und Belegen, bevor ich irgendetwas tue."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I ask him for specific numbers and evidence before I do anything."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le pido n\u00fameros espec\u00edficos y pruebas antes de hacer cualquier cosa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je lui demande des chiffres pr\u00e9cis et des preuves avant de faire quoi que ce soit."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u0941\u091b \u092d\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0928\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u093f\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0906\u0902\u0915\u0921\u093c\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u092c\u0942\u0924 \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli chiedo numeri e prove specifici prima di fare qualsiasi cosa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u4f55\u304b\u3092\u3059\u308b\u524d\u306b\u3001\u5177\u4f53\u7684\u306a\u6570\u5b57\u3068\u8a3c\u62e0\u3092\u5c0b\u306d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc77c\uc744 \ud558\uae30 \uc804\uc5d0 \uadf8\uc5d0\uac8c \uad6c\uccb4\uc801\uc778 \uc22b\uc790\uc640 \uc99d\uac70\ub97c \uc694\uccad\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik vraag hem om specifieke cijfers en bewijsmateriaal voordat ik iets doe."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zanim cokolwiek zrobi\u0119, prosz\u0119 go o konkretne liczby i dowody."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pe\u00e7o a ele n\u00fameros e evid\u00eancias espec\u00edficas antes de fazer qualquer coisa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043e \u043a\u043e\u043d\u043a\u0440\u0435\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0446\u0438\u0444\u0440\u0430\u0445 \u0438 \u0434\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430\u0445, \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043c \u0447\u0442\u043e-\u043b\u0438\u0431\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Herhangi bir \u015fey yapmadan \u00f6nce ondan belirli rakamlar ve kan\u0131tlar isterim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6211\u91c7\u53d6\u4efb\u4f55\u884c\u52a8\u4e4b\u524d\uff0c\u6211\u4f1a\u5411\u4ed6\u8be2\u95ee\u5177\u4f53\u7684\u6570\u5b57\u548c\u8bc1\u636e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6211\u505a\u4efb\u4f55\u4e8b\u60c5\u4e4b\u524d\uff0c\u6211\u90fd\u6703\u5411\u4ed6\u8a62\u554f\u5177\u9ad4\u7684\u6578\u5b57\u548c\u8b49\u64da\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q3": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist der 25. des Monats. Wei\u00dft du, wie viel Geld du noch auf dem Konto hast \u2013 ohne nachzuschauen?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the 25th of the month. Do you know how much money you have left in your account without looking?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el d\u00eda 25 del mes. \u00bfSabes cu\u00e1nto dinero te queda en tu cuenta sin mirar?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous sommes le 25 du mois. Savez-vous combien d\u2019argent il vous reste sur votre compte sans regarder ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 25 \u0924\u093e\u0930\u0940\u0916 \u0939\u0948. \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0906\u092a \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c8 il 25 del mese. Sai quanti soldi ti sono rimasti sul tuo conto senza guardare?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u6708\u306f25\u65e5\u3067\u3059\u3002\u898b\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3082\u53e3\u5ea7\u306b\u3044\u304f\u3089\u6b8b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub9e4\uc6d4 25\uc77c\uc774\uc5d0\uc694. \ubcf4\uc9c0\ub3c4 \uc54a\uace0 \uacc4\uc88c\uc5d0 \ub3c8\uc774 \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ub0a8\uc558\ub294\uc9c0 \uc544\uc2dc\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het is de 25e van de maand. Weet jij zonder te kijken hoeveel geld er nog op je rekening staat?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jest 25 dzie\u0144 miesi\u0105ca. Czy wiesz, ile pieni\u0119dzy zosta\u0142o Ci na koncie bez sprawdzania?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c9 dia 25 do m\u00eas. Voc\u00ea sabe quanto dinheiro resta na sua conta sem olhar?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f 25-\u0435 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u043b\u043e \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0430. \u0417\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043b\u0438 \u0442\u044b, \u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043d\u0435\u0433 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0447\u0451\u0442\u0435 \u2014 \u043d\u0435 \u0433\u043b\u044f\u0434\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ay\u0131n 25'i. Bakmadan hesab\u0131n\u0131zda ne kadar para kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 biliyor musunuz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u5929\u662f\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6708\u768425\u53f7\u3002\u4f60\u77e5\u9053\u4f60\u8d26\u6237\u91cc\u8fd8\u6709\u591a\u5c11\u94b1\u5417\u2014\u2014\u4e0d\u770b\u4e5f\u80fd\u77e5\u9053\u5417\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u73fe\u5728\u662f\u9019\u500b\u6708\u7684 25 \u865f\u3002\u4e0d\u770b\u4f60\u5c31\u77e5\u9053\u4f60\u7684\u5e33\u6236\u88e1\u9084\u5269\u591a\u5c11\u9322\u55ce\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q3.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grob ja, innerhalb von 100\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Roughly yes, within \u20ac100."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aproximadamente s\u00ed, dentro de 100\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En gros oui, dans la limite de 100 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u094b\u091f\u0947 \u0924\u094c\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0901, \u20ac100 \u0915\u0947 \u092d\u0940\u0924\u0930\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pi\u00f9 o meno s\u00ec, entro i 100\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u304a\u304a\u3088\u305d\u306f\u3044\u3001100 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u4ee5\u5185\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub300\ub7b5 \uadf8\ub807\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \u20ac100 \uc774\ub0b4\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ongeveer ja, binnen \u20ac 100,-."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mniej wi\u0119cej tak, w granicach 100 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aproximadamente sim, dentro de 100\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0446\u0438\u043f\u0435 \u0434\u0430, \u0432 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0445 100\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yakla\u015f\u0131k olarak evet, 100 \u20ac civar\u0131nda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5927\u81f4\u662f\uff0c\u5728100\u6b27\u5143\u4ee5\u5185\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5927\u7d04\u662f\u7684\uff0c100 \u6b50\u5143\u4ee5\u5167\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q3.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Irgendwas zwischen 200 und 800\u20ac, ich bin mir nicht sicher."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Something between \u20ac200 and \u20ac800, I'm not sure."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entre 200 y 800\u20ac, no estoy seguro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelque chose entre 200 et 800 \u20ac, je ne suis pas s\u00fbr."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac200 \u0914\u0930 \u20ac800 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u0915\u0941\u091b, \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092f\u0915\u0940\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualcosa tra i 200 e gli 800 euro, non ne sono sicuro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "200\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u304b\u3089800\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306e\u9593\u304f\u3089\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\u3001\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac200\uc5d0\uc11c \u20ac800 \uc0ac\uc774\uc778 \uac83 \uac19\uc740\ub370 \uc798 \ubaa8\ub974\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iets tussen de \u20ac200 en \u20ac800, ik weet het niet zeker."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Co\u015b pomi\u0119dzy 200 a 800 euro, nie jestem pewien."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algo entre 200\u20ac e 800\u20ac, n\u00e3o tenho a certeza."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0427\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u043c\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0443 200 \u0438 800\u20ac, \u044f \u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "200\u20ac ile 800\u20ac aras\u0131nda bir \u015fey, emin de\u011filim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5927\u7ea6\u5728200\u5230800\u6b27\u5143\u4e4b\u95f4\uff0c\u6211\u4e0d\u592a\u786e\u5b9a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "200 \u6b50\u5143\u5230 800 \u6b50\u5143\u4e4b\u9593\uff0c\u6211\u4e0d\u78ba\u5b9a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q3.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Ahnung. Ich schaue ungern auf den Kontostand."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No idea. I don't like looking at the account balance."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni idea. No me gusta mirar el saldo de la cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune id\u00e9e. Je n'aime pas regarder le solde du compte."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0936\u0947\u0937 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u093e \u092a\u0938\u0902\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nessuna idea. Non mi piace guardare il saldo del conto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u53e3\u5ea7\u6b8b\u9ad8\u3092\u898b\u308b\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubaa8\ub974\uaca0\uc5b4\uc694. \ub098\ub294 \uacc4\uc88c \uc794\uc561\uc744 \ubcf4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc88b\uc544\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen idee. Ik hou er niet van om naar het rekeningsaldo te kijken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie mam poj\u0119cia. Nie lubi\u0119 patrze\u0107 na stan konta."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia. N\u00e3o gosto de olhar o saldo da conta."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u043d\u044f\u0442\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0435 \u0438\u043c\u0435\u044e. \u042f \u043d\u0435 \u043b\u044e\u0431\u043b\u044e \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7bir fikrim yok. Hesap bakiyesine bakmay\u0131 sevmiyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\u6211\u4e0d\u559c\u6b22\u67e5\u770b\u8d26\u6237\u4f59\u989d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\u6211\u4e0d\u559c\u6b61\u770b\u5e33\u6236\u9918\u984d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q3.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich wei\u00df es auf den Euro genau."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I know it exactly to the euro."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo s\u00e9 exactamente al euro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le sais exactement \u00e0 l'euro."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u092f\u0942\u0930\u094b \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo so esattamente all'euro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u307e\u3067\u306f\u6b63\u78ba\u306b\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc720\ub85c\ud654\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc815\ud655\ud788 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc5b4\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik weet het precies tot op de euro."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wiem to dok\u0142adnie co do euro."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu sei exatamente para o euro."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0441 \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0434\u043e \u0435\u0432\u0440\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Euro'yu tam olarak biliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u786e\u5207\u7684\u91d1\u989d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c0d\u6b50\u5143\u975e\u5e38\u4e86\u89e3\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q4": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du zahlst seit 6 Monaten ein Abo, das du kaum nutzt. Was ist der Status heute?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've been paying for a subscription for 6 months that you hardly use. What is the status today?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llevas 6 meses pagando una suscripci\u00f3n que apenas utilizas. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es el estatus hoy?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous payez depuis 6 mois un abonnement que vous utilisez peu. Quelle est la situation aujourd\u2019hui ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a 6 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0938 \u0938\u0926\u0938\u094d\u092f\u0924\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0906\u092a \u0936\u093e\u092f\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u091c \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0924\u093f \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono 6 mesi che paghi un abbonamento che utilizzi pochissimo. Qual \u00e8 la situazione oggi?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6 \u304b\u6708\u5206\u306e\u30b5\u30d6\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u6599\u91d1\u3092\u652f\u6255\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4eca\u65e5\u306e\u72b6\u6cc1\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uac70\uc758 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294 \uad6c\ub3c5\ub8cc\ub97c 6\uac1c\uc6d4 \ub3d9\uc548 \uc9c0\ubd88\ud558\uace0 \uacc4\uc168\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc624\ub298 \uc0c1\ud669\uc740 \uc5b4\ub5a4\uac00\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je betaalt al 6 maanden voor een abonnement dat je nauwelijks gebruikt. Wat is de status vandaag?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "P\u0142acisz za abonament przez 6 miesi\u0119cy, z kt\u00f3rego prawie nie korzystasz. Jaki jest stan dzisiaj?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 pagando por uma assinatura h\u00e1 6 meses que quase n\u00e3o usa. Qual \u00e9 a situa\u00e7\u00e3o hoje?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0448\u044c \u0437\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443 \u0443\u0436\u0435 6 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0435\u0432, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044c\u0441\u044f. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432\u043e \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "6 ayd\u0131r neredeyse hi\u00e7 kullanmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bir aboneli\u011fin paras\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6d\u00fcyorsunuz. Bug\u00fcnk\u00fc durum nedir?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u8ba2\u9605\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u51e0\u4e4e\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528\u7684\u4f1a\u5458\u516d\u4e2a\u6708\u4e86\u3002\u4eca\u5929\u7684\u72b6\u6001\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5df2\u7d93\u652f\u4ed8\u4e86 6 \u500b\u6708\u7684\u8a02\u95b1\u8cbb\u7528\uff0c\u4f46\u5e7e\u4e4e\u6c92\u6709\u4f7f\u7528\u904e\u3002\u4eca\u5929\u7684\u72c0\u6cc1\u5982\u4f55\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q4.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe es l\u00e4ngst gek\u00fcndigt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I canceled it a long time ago."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo cancel\u00e9 hace mucho tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je l'ai annul\u00e9 il y a longtemps."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0930\u0926\u094d\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0925\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ho cancellato molto tempo fa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305a\u3063\u3068\u524d\u306b\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ub798\uc804\uc5d0 \ucde8\uc18c\ud588\uc5b4\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik heb het al lang geleden opgezegd."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ju\u017c dawno to odwo\u0142a\u0142em."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancelei h\u00e1 muito tempo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0433."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uzun zaman \u00f6nce iptal ettim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u65e9\u5c31\u5df2\u7ecf\u53d6\u6d88\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5f88\u4e45\u4ee5\u524d\u5c31\u53d6\u6d88\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q4.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es l\u00e4uft noch. Ich wei\u00df davon, k\u00fcndige es aber bewusst nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's still running. I know about it, but I consciously don't cancel it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todav\u00eda est\u00e1 funcionando. Lo s\u00e9, pero conscientemente no lo cancelo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est toujours en marche. Je le sais, mais je ne l'annule pas consciemment."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948. \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u092c\u0942\u091d\u0915\u0930 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0930\u0926\u094d\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c8 ancora in funzione. Lo so, ma consapevolmente non lo annullo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u307e\u3060\u5b9f\u884c\u4e2d\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305d\u308c\u306f\u5206\u304b\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u610f\u8b58\u7684\u306b\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u306f\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\uc9c1 \uc2e4\ud589 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc758\uc2dd\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ucde8\uc18c\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het draait nog steeds. Ik weet ervan, maar ik annuleer het bewust niet."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nadal dzia\u0142a. Wiem o tym, ale \u015bwiadomie tego nie odwo\u0142uj\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ainda est\u00e1 funcionando. Eu sei disso, mas conscientemente n\u00e3o cancelo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442. \u042f \u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c, \u043d\u043e \u0441\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u044a\u044f\u0432\u043b\u044f\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hala \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Bunu biliyorum ama bilin\u00e7li olarak iptal etmiyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u4ecd\u5728\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u8fd9\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u6709\u610f\u8bc6\u5730\u6ca1\u6709\u53bb\u7ec8\u6b62\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u4ecd\u5728\u904b\u884c\u3002\u6211\u77e5\u9053\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u6709\u610f\u8b58\u5730\u4e0d\u53d6\u6d88\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q4.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es l\u00e4uft noch \u2013 ich hatte es komplett vergessen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's still running - I had completely forgotten about it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todav\u00eda est\u00e1 funcionando; lo hab\u00eda olvidado por completo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il fonctionne toujours, je l'avais compl\u00e8tement oubli\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0939 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948 - \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0942\u0932 \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0925\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funziona ancora, me ne ero completamente dimenticato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u307e\u3060\u5b9f\u884c\u4e2d\u3067\u3059 - \u79c1\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\uc9c1 \uc2e4\ud589 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uc78a\uc5b4\ubc84\ub838\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het draait nog steeds - ik was het helemaal vergeten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nadal dzia\u0142a - zupe\u0142nie o tym zapomnia\u0142em."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ainda est\u00e1 funcionando - eu tinha esquecido completamente disso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u0442\u043e \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442 \u2013 \u044f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0437\u0430\u0431\u044b\u043b \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hala \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor; bunu tamamen unutmu\u015ftum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u8fd8\u5728\u8fd0\u884c\u2014\u2014\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u5fd8\u8bb0\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b83\u4ecd\u5728\u904b\u884c\u2014\u2014\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u5fd8\u8a18\u4e86\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q4.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe gerade mindestens zwei solcher Abos entdeckt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I just discovered at least two such subscriptions."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acabo de descubrir al menos dos de esas suscripciones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je viens de d\u00e9couvrir au moins deux de ces abonnements."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u0915\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e \u0926\u094b \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u0938\u0926\u0938\u094d\u092f\u0924\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0916\u094b\u091c\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ho appena scoperto almeno due di questi abbonamenti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u305d\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u30b5\u30d6\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u5c11\u306a\u304f\u3068\u3082 2 \u3064\u767a\u898b\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubc29\uae08 \uadf8\ub7ec\ud55c \uad6c\ub3c5\uc744 \ub450 \uac1c \uc774\uc0c1 \ubc1c\uacac\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik heb zojuist minstens twee van dergelijke abonnementen ontdekt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u0142a\u015bnie odkry\u0142em co najmniej dwie takie subskrypcje."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acabei de descobrir pelo menos duas dessas assinaturas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0431\u043d\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0438\u043b \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0443\u043c \u0434\u0432\u0435 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Az \u00f6nce bu t\u00fcrden en az iki abonelik ke\u015ffettim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u521a\u521a\u53d1\u73b0\u4e86\u81f3\u5c11\u4e24\u4e2a\u8fd9\u6837\u7684\u8ba2\u9605\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u525b\u525b\u767c\u73fe\u81f3\u5c11\u6709\u5169\u500b\u9019\u6a23\u7684\u8a02\u95b1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q5": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du k\u00f6nntest in 10 Jahren 50.000\u20ac mehr haben, wenn du jetzt 150\u20ac/Monat zur\u00fccklegst. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You could have \u20ac50,000 more in 10 years if you put aside \u20ac150/month now. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podr\u00edas tener 50.000\u20ac m\u00e1s en 10 a\u00f1os si ahorras 150\u20ac/mes ahora. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pourriez disposer de 50 000 \u20ac de plus dans 10 ans si vous mettez de c\u00f4t\u00e9 150 \u20ac/mois d\u00e8s maintenant. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092f\u0926\u093f \u0906\u092a \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u20ac150/\u092e\u093e\u0939 \u0905\u0932\u0917 \u0930\u0916 \u0926\u0947\u0902 \u0924\u094b 10 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0937\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u20ac50,000 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u094b \u0938\u0915\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potresti avere 50.000 \u20ac in pi\u00f9 tra 10 anni se metti da parte 150 \u20ac al mese adesso. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u6708\u984d 150 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u7a4d\u307f\u7acb\u3066\u3066\u304a\u3051\u3070\u300110 \u5e74\u5f8c\u306b\u306f\u3055\u3089\u306b 50,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u624b\u306b\u5165\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc9c0\uae08 \ub9e4\ub2ec \u20ac150\ub97c \uc800\ucd95\ud558\uba74 10\ub144 \ud6c4\uc5d0\ub294 \u20ac50,000\ub97c \ub354 \ubc8c \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U kunt over 10 jaar \u20ac 50.000 meer hebben als u nu \u20ac 150 per maand opzij zet. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mo\u017cesz mie\u0107 o 50 000 euro wi\u0119cej w ci\u0105gu 10 lat, je\u015bli od\u0142o\u017cysz teraz 150 euro miesi\u0119cznie. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea poderia ter mais 50.000\u20ac em 10 anos se reservar 150\u20ac/m\u00eas agora. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0427\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 10 \u043b\u0435\u0442 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 50.000\u20ac \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435, \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0442\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043e\u0442\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c 150\u20ac/\u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015eimdi ayda 150 \u20ac ay\u0131r\u0131rsan\u0131z 10 y\u0131l i\u00e7inde 50.000 \u20ac daha fazla kazanabilirsiniz. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u73b0\u5728\u6bcf\u6708\u5b58150\u6b27\u5143\uff0c\u5341\u5e74\u540e\u4f60\u53ef\u80fd\u4f1a\u591a\u51fa50,000\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5982\u679c\u60a8\u73fe\u5728\u6bcf\u6708\u5b58\u5165 150 \u6b50\u5143\uff0c\u60a8\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728 10 \u5e74\u5167\u591a\u8cfa 50,000 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q5.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich richte heute noch einen Dauerauftrag ein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll set up a standing order today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Establecer\u00e9 una orden permanente hoy."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais \u00e9tablir un ordre permanent aujourd'hui."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0906\u091c \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092f\u0940 \u0906\u0926\u0947\u0936 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092a\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fisser\u00f2 un ordine permanente oggi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u6ce8\u6587\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ub298\uc740 \uc0c1\uc2dc \uc8fc\ubb38\uc744 \ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik zal vandaag een doorlopende opdracht instellen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dzisiaj ustawi\u0119 zlecenie sta\u0142e."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou estabelecer uma ordem permanente hoje."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f \u0436\u0435 \u043e\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u043b\u044e \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bug\u00fcn kal\u0131c\u0131 bir emir olu\u015fturaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u8fd8\u8981\u8bbe\u7acb\u4e00\u4e2a\u5b9a\u671f\u652f\u4ed8\u6307\u4ee4\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u5929\u6211\u5c07\u8a2d\u7acb\u4e00\u500b\u9577\u671f\u8a02\u55ae\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q5.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gute Idee \u2013 ich denke dr\u00fcber nach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good idea - I'll think about it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buena idea, lo pensar\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonne id\u00e9e, je vais y r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e \u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 - \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buona idea, ci penser\u00f2."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u826f\u3044\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u3067\u3059\u306d - \u8003\u3048\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc88b\uc740 \uc0dd\uac01\uc774\uc5d0\uc694 - \uc0dd\uac01\ud574 \ubcfc\uac8c\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Goed idee, ik zal erover nadenken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dobry pomys\u0142 - pomy\u015bl\u0119 o tym."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boa ideia - vou pensar sobre isso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0425\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0430\u044f \u0438\u0434\u0435\u044f \u2013 \u044f \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130yi fikir - Bunu d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u597d\u4e3b\u610f\u2014\u2014\u6211\u4f1a\u8003\u8651\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u597d\u4e3b\u610f\u2014\u2014\u6211\u6703\u8003\u616e\u4e00\u4e0b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q5.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kann mir das gerade nicht leisten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I can't afford this right now."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No puedo permitirme esto ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne peux pas me le permettre pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0930\u094d\u0926\u093e\u0936\u094d\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non posso permettermelo adesso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u306f\u305d\u3093\u306a\u4f59\u88d5\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc9c0\uae08 \uc774\uac83\uc744 \uac10\ub2f9\ud560 \uc5ec\uc720\uac00 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik kan dit nu niet betalen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie mog\u0119 sobie na to teraz pozwoli\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e3o posso permitir isso agora."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u0443 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015eu anda bunu kar\u015f\u0131layamam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u73b0\u5728\u4e70\u4e0d\u8d77\u8fd9\u4e2a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u73fe\u5728\u8cb7\u4e0d\u8d77\u9019\u500b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q5.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 Jahre ist mir zu weit weg \u2013 das Jetzt z\u00e4hlt mehr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 years is too far away for me \u2013 the now counts more."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 a\u00f1os es demasiado para m\u00ed; el ahora cuenta m\u00e1s."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 ans, c\u2019est trop loin pour moi \u2013 le moment pr\u00e9sent compte plus."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f 10 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0926\u0942\u0930 \u0939\u0948\u0902 - \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0914\u0930 \u092d\u0940 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u092e\u093e\u092f\u0928\u0947 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 anni sono troppo lontani per me, il presente conta di pi\u00f9."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306b\u3068\u3063\u3066 10 \u5e74\u306f\u9060\u3059\u304e\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4eca\u306f\u3082\u3063\u3068\u91cd\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10\ub144\uc740 \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c \ub108\ubb34 \uba40\ub2e4. \uc9c0\uae08\uc774 \ub354 \uc911\uc694\ud558\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 jaar is voor mij te ver weg \u2013 het nu telt meer."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 lat to dla mnie za daleko \u2013 teraz liczy si\u0119 bardziej."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 anos est\u00e1 muito longe para mim \u2013 o agora conta mais."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 \u043b\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0448\u043a\u043e\u043c \u0434\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043a\u043e \u2014 \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0435\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 y\u0131l benim i\u00e7in \u00e7ok uzak; \u015fimdi daha \u00f6nemli."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10\u5e74\u5bf9\u6211\u6765\u8bf4\u592a\u9065\u8fdc\u2014\u2014\u73b0\u5728\u66f4\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 \u5e74\u5c0d\u6211\u4f86\u8aaa\u592a\u9059\u9060\u4e86\u2014\u2014\u73fe\u5728\u66f4\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q6": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bekommst pl\u00f6tzlich 400\u20ac netto mehr im Monat. Was \u00e4ndert sich an deinem Leben?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You suddenly get \u20ac400 more net per month. What changes in your life?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De repente obtienes 400 \u20ac netos m\u00e1s al mes. \u00bfQu\u00e9 cambios en tu vida?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous gagnez du coup 400 \u20ac nets de plus par mois. Quels changements dans votre vie ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0905\u091a\u093e\u0928\u0915 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f \u092e\u093e\u0939 \u20ac400 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0928\u0947\u091f \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u091c\u0940\u0935\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0924\u0928 \u0906\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All'improvviso ricevi 400 \u20ac netti in pi\u00f9 al mese. Cosa cambia nella tua vita?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7a81\u7136\u3001\u6708\u3042\u305f\u308a\u7d14\u984d\u304c 400 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u5897\u52a0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u4eba\u751f\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u304c\u5909\u308f\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uac11\uc790\uae30 \ud55c \ub2ec\uc5d0 \u20ac400\ub97c \ub354 \ubc1b\uac8c \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc0b6\uc5d0\ub294 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \ubcc0\ud654\uac00 \uc788\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je krijgt ineens \u20ac 400,- meer netto per maand. Wat verandert er in je leven?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nagle otrzymujesz o 400 \u20ac netto miesi\u0119cznie wi\u0119cej. Jakie zmiany w Twoim \u017cyciu?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De repente, voc\u00ea ganha mais \u20ac 400 l\u00edquidos por m\u00eas. O que muda na sua vida?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u043f\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 400\u20ac \u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u0432 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0438?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aniden ayda net 400 \u20ac daha fazla kazan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z. Hayat\u0131n\u0131zda ne gibi de\u011fi\u015fiklikler oluyor?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6bcf\u4e2a\u6708\u7a81\u7136\u591a\u4e86400\u6b27\u5143\u51c0\u6536\u5165\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u751f\u6d3b\u4f1a\u6709\u4ec0\u4e48\u53d8\u5316\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u6bcf\u500b\u6708\u7684\u6de8\u6536\u5165\u7a81\u7136\u589e\u52a0\u4e86 400 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u751f\u6d3b\u767c\u751f\u4e86\u4ec0\u9ebc\u8b8a\u5316\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q6.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich g\u00f6nne mir endlich eine teurere Wohnung oder ein besseres Auto."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm finally treating myself to a more expensive apartment or a better car."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por fin me permitir\u00e9 un apartamento m\u00e1s caro o un coche mejor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m'offre enfin un appartement plus cher ou une meilleure voiture."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0905\u0902\u0924\u0924\u0903 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u092e\u0939\u0901\u0917\u093e \u0905\u092a\u093e\u0930\u094d\u091f\u092e\u0947\u0902\u091f \u092f\u093e \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finalmente mi concedo un appartamento pi\u00f9 costoso o un'auto migliore."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3088\u3046\u3084\u304f\u81ea\u5206\u3078\u306e\u3054\u8912\u7f8e\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3088\u308a\u9ad8\u4fa1\u306a\u30a2\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u3084\u3088\u308a\u826f\u3044\u8eca\u3092\u8cb7\u3046\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub9c8\uce68\ub0b4 \ub354 \ube44\uc2fc \uc544\ud30c\ud2b8\ub098 \ub354 \uc88b\uc740 \ucc28\ub97c \uad6c\uc785\ud558\uac8c \ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik trakteer mezelf eindelijk op een duurder appartement of een betere auto."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W ko\u0144cu pozwalam sobie na dro\u017csze mieszkanie lub lepszy samoch\u00f3d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finalmente estou me presenteando com um apartamento mais caro ou um carro melhor."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0446-\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044f\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0443\u044e \u043a\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0443\u044e \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sonunda kendime daha pahal\u0131 bir daire ya da daha iyi bir araba \u0131smarl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ec8\u4e8e\u7ed9\u81ea\u5df1\u4e70\u4e00\u5957\u66f4\u8d35\u7684\u516c\u5bd3\u6216\u4e00\u8f86\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u8f66\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7d42\u65bc\u53ef\u4ee5\u70ba\u81ea\u5df1\u8cb7\u4e00\u9593\u66f4\u8cb4\u7684\u516c\u5bd3\u6216\u662f\u4e00\u8f1b\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u6c7d\u8eca\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q6.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nichts aktiv, aber das Geld verschwindet am Monatsende trotzdem auf dem Girokonto."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing active, but the money still disappears into the checking account at the end of the month."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nada activo, pero el dinero a\u00fan desaparece en la cuenta corriente a fin de mes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien d'actif, mais l'argent dispara\u00eet toujours sur le compte courant \u00e0 la fin du mois."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u0941\u091b \u092d\u0940 \u0938\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u0948\u0938\u093e \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u091a\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0917\u093e\u092f\u092c \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niente di attivo, ma i soldi spariscono comunque sul conto corrente a fine mese."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f55\u3082\u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304c\u3001\u6708\u672b\u306b\u306f\u304a\u91d1\u304c\u5f53\u5ea7\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u306b\u6d88\u3048\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud65c\uc131\ud654\ub41c \uae08\uc561\uc740 \uc5c6\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc6d4\ub9d0\uc5d0 \ud574\ub2f9 \uae08\uc561\uc774 \ub2f9\uc88c \uc608\uae08 \uacc4\uc88c\uc5d0\uc11c \uc0ac\ub77c\uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niets actiefs, maar het geld verdwijnt aan het einde van de maand nog steeds op de betaalrekening."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nic aktywnego, ale pieni\u0105dze nadal znikaj\u0105 na koncie bie\u017c\u0105cym pod koniec miesi\u0105ca."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nada ativo, mas o dinheiro ainda desaparece na conta corrente no final do m\u00eas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0430\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e, \u043d\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0433\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0437\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0441 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0447\u0451\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u0447\u0451\u0442\u0430 \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktif bir \u015fey yok ama ay sonunda para h\u00e2l\u00e2 \u00e7ek hesab\u0131nda kayboluyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6ca1\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u6d3b\u52a8\uff0c\u4f46\u6708\u5e95\u94b1\u4ecd\u7136\u4f1a\u4ece\u6d3b\u671f\u8d26\u6237\u4e2d\u6d88\u5931\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6c92\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u6d3b\u52d5\uff0c\u4f46\u9322\u5728\u6708\u5e95\u4ecd\u7136\u6d88\u5931\u5728\u652f\u7968\u5e33\u6236\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q6.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich passe meinen Sparplan/Dauerauftrag am selben Tag um 300\u20ac bis 400\u20ac nach oben an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I adjust my savings plan/standing order upwards by \u20ac300 to \u20ac400 on the same day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajusto mi plan de ahorro/orden permanente al alza de 300\u20ac a 400\u20ac el mismo d\u00eda."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ajuste mon plan d'\u00e9pargne/ordre permanent \u00e0 la hausse de 300 \u20ac \u00e0 400 \u20ac le m\u00eame jour."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0938\u0940 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u092f\u094b\u091c\u0928\u093e/\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092f\u0940 \u0911\u0930\u094d\u0921\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u20ac300 \u0938\u0947 \u20ac400 \u0924\u0915 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u092f\u094b\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo stesso giorno adeguo il mio piano di risparmio/ordine permanente da 300 \u20ac a 400 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u540c\u3058\u65e5\u306b\u8caf\u84c4\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3/\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0\u30aa\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc\u3092 300 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u304b\u3089 400 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u4e0a\u65b9\u4fee\u6b63\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uac19\uc740 \ub0a0 \uc800\ucd95 \uacc4\ud68d/\uc815\uae30 \uc8fc\ubb38\uc744 \u20ac300\uc5d0\uc11c \u20ac400\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc0c1\ud5a5 \uc870\uc815\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik pas dezelfde dag mijn spaarplan/doorlopende opdracht met \u20ac 300,- naar \u20ac 400,- aan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tego samego dnia dostosowuj\u0119 sw\u00f3j plan oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowy/zlecenie sta\u0142e w g\u00f3r\u0119 o 300\u2013400 EUR."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajusto o meu plano de poupan\u00e7a/ordem permanente para cima em 300\u20ac a 400\u20ac no mesmo dia."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0443\u0432\u0435\u043b\u0438\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u043c\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d/\u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0432 \u0442\u043e\u0442 \u0436\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u043d\u0430 300\u20ac \u0434\u043e 400\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tasarruf plan\u0131m\u0131/bekleyen emrimi ayn\u0131 g\u00fcn i\u00e7inde 300\u20ac'dan 400\u20ac'ya kadar art\u0131r\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u5929\u5c06\u6211\u7684\u50a8\u84c4\u8ba1\u5212/\u5b9a\u671f\u8f6c\u8d26\u589e\u52a0300\u6b27\u5143\u5230400\u6b27\u5143\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u5929\u5c07\u6211\u7684\u5132\u84c4\u8a08\u5283/\u5b9a\u671f\u8a02\u55ae\u5411\u4e0a\u8abf\u6574\u4e86 300 \u6b50\u5143\u81f3 400 \u6b50\u5143\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q6.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich warte ein paar Monate ab, um zu sehen, wie viel am Ende wirklich \u00fcbrig bleibt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll wait a few months to see how much is actually left over at the end."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esperar\u00e9 unos meses para ver cu\u00e1nto queda al final."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'attendrai quelques mois pour voir combien il en reste r\u00e9ellement \u00e0 la fin."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u0941\u091b \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e \u0915\u093f \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u092c\u091a\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aspetter\u00f2 qualche mese per vedere quanto effettivamente rimarr\u00e0 alla fine."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u7d42\u7684\u306b\u5b9f\u969b\u306b\u3069\u308c\u3060\u3051\u6b8b\u308b\u304b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u6570\u304b\u6708\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uacb0\uad6d \uc2e4\uc81c\ub85c \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ub0a8\uc558\ub294\uc9c0 \uba87 \ub2ec\uc744 \uae30\ub2e4\ub824 \ubcf4\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik wacht nog een paar maanden om te zien hoeveel er uiteindelijk nog over is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poczekam kilka miesi\u0119cy, \u017ceby zobaczy\u0107, ile faktycznie zosta\u0142o na koniec."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou esperar alguns meses para ver quanto sobra no final."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0443 \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0435\u0432, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0443\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044c, \u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0447\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0438\u0442\u043e\u0433\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sonunda ne kadar kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6rmek i\u00e7in birka\u00e7 ay bekleyece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7b49\u51e0\u4e2a\u6708\uff0c\u770b\u770b\u6700\u540e\u7a76\u7adf\u5269\u4e0b\u591a\u5c11\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7b49\u5e7e\u500b\u6708\u770b\u770b\u6700\u5f8c\u5230\u5e95\u9084\u5269\u4e0b\u591a\u5c11\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q7": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast 10.000\u20ac f\u00fcr dein Traumauto gespart, aber dein aktuelles Auto f\u00e4hrt noch einwandfrei. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You saved \u20ac10,000 for your dream car, but your current car still runs perfectly. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ahorraste 10.000 \u20ac en el coche de tus sue\u00f1os, pero tu coche actual sigue funcionando perfectamente. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez \u00e9conomis\u00e9 10 000 \u20ac pour la voiture de vos r\u00eaves, mais votre voiture actuelle fonctionne toujours parfaitement. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u092a\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u20ac10,000 \u092c\u091a\u093e\u090f, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0924\u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u0920\u0940\u0915 \u0938\u0947 \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai risparmiato 10.000 \u20ac per l'auto dei tuoi sogni, ma la tua auto attuale funziona ancora perfettamente. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5922\u306e\u8eca\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b 10,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u7bc0\u7d04\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u73fe\u5728\u306e\u8eca\u306f\u307e\u3060\u5b8c\u74a7\u306b\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uafc8\uc758 \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28\ub97c \uad6c\uc785\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \u20ac10,000\ub97c \uc808\uc57d\ud588\uc9c0\ub9cc \ud604\uc7ac \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28\ub294 \uc5ec\uc804\ud788 \uc644\ubcbd\ud558\uac8c \uc791\ub3d9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U heeft \u20ac 10.000 gespaard voor uw droomauto, maar uw huidige auto rijdt nog steeds perfect. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaoszcz\u0119dzi\u0142e\u015b 10 000 euro na sw\u00f3j wymarzony samoch\u00f3d, ale Tw\u00f3j obecny samoch\u00f3d nadal dzia\u0142a idealnie. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poupou 10.000\u20ac no carro dos seus sonhos, mas o seu carro atual ainda funciona perfeitamente. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u043b 10.000\u20ac \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u044e \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0443 \u043c\u0435\u0447\u0442\u044b, \u043d\u043e \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u043d\u044b\u043d\u0435\u0448\u043d\u044f\u044f \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043e\u0442\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hayalinizdeki araba i\u00e7in 10.000\u20ac tasarruf ettiniz ama mevcut araban\u0131z hala m\u00fckemmel \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u4e3a\u4f60\u7684\u68a6\u60f3\u6c7d\u8f66\u5b58\u4e8610,000\u6b27\u5143\uff0c\u4f46\u4f60\u76ee\u524d\u7684\u8f66\u4ecd\u7136\u8fd0\u884c\u826f\u597d\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u70ba\u60a8\u7684\u5922\u60f3\u4e4b\u8eca\u7bc0\u7701\u4e86 10,000 \u6b50\u5143\uff0c\u4f46\u60a8\u76ee\u524d\u7684\u6c7d\u8eca\u4ecd\u7136\u904b\u884c\u5b8c\u7f8e\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q7.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kaufe das Traumauto sofort. Daf\u00fcr habe ich schlie\u00dflich gespart."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll buy the dream car immediately. That's what I ended up saving for."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprar\u00e9 el coche de mis sue\u00f1os inmediatamente. Para eso termin\u00e9 ahorrando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ach\u00e8terai imm\u00e9diatement la voiture de mes r\u00eaves. C'est pour \u00e7a que j'ai fini par \u00e9conomiser."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0938\u092a\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964 \u0906\u0916\u093c\u093f\u0930\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0907\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0915\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprer\u00f2 subito l'auto dei sogni. Questo \u00e8 ci\u00f2 per cui ho finito per risparmiare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5922\u306e\u8eca\u3092\u3059\u3050\u306b\u8cb7\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u305d\u308c\u304c\u79c1\u304c\u7d50\u5c40\u7bc0\u7d04\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc7a5 \ub4dc\ub9bc\uce74\ub97c \uc0ac\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \ubc14\ub85c \uc81c\uac00 \uc800\ucd95\uc744 \ud558\uac8c \ub41c \uc774\uc720\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik koop onmiddellijk de droomauto. Daar heb ik uiteindelijk voor gespaard."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupi\u0119 od razu wymarzony samoch\u00f3d. W\u0142a\u015bnie na tym sko\u0144czy\u0142em oszcz\u0119dzaj\u0105c."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprarei o carro dos sonhos imediatamente. Foi para isso que acabei economizando."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u043a\u0443\u043f\u043b\u044e \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0443 \u043c\u0435\u0447\u0442\u044b. \u041d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u044f, \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u043e\u0432, \u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hayalimdeki arabay\u0131 hemen sat\u0131n alaca\u011f\u0131m. \u0130\u015fte bunun i\u00e7in para biriktirdim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u7acb\u5373\u8d2d\u4e70\u68a6\u60f3\u4e2d\u7684\u6c7d\u8f66\u3002\u6bd5\u7adf\uff0c\u6211\u4e3a\u6b64\u4e00\u76f4\u5728\u5b58\u94b1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7acb\u5373\u8cfc\u8cb7\u5922\u60f3\u4e4b\u8eca\u3002\u9019\u5c31\u662f\u6211\u6700\u7d42\u5b58\u9322\u7684\u76ee\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q7.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich fahre das alte Auto weiter und stecke die 10.000\u20ac in ein Investment."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll continue to drive the old car and put the \u20ac10,000 into an investment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seguir\u00e9 conduciendo el coche viejo y invertir\u00e9 los 10.000 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais continuer \u00e0 conduire la vieille voiture et investir les 10 000 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u0941\u0930\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u093e\u0928\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u20ac10,000 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer\u00f2 a guidare la vecchia macchina e investir\u00f2 i 10.000 euro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53e4\u3044\u8eca\u306b\u4e57\u308a\u7d9a\u3051\u3066\u300110,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u6295\u8cc7\u306b\u6ce8\u304e\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uacc4\uc18d\ud574\uc11c \uc624\ub798\ub41c \ucc28\ub97c \uc6b4\uc804\ud558\uace0 \u20ac10,000\ub97c \ud22c\uc790\ud560 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik blijf in de oude auto rijden en stop de \u20ac 10.000 in een investering."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u0119d\u0119 nadal je\u017adzi\u0107 starym samochodem i zainwestuj\u0119 10 000 euro."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuarei a conduzir o carro antigo e investirei os 10.000\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0435\u0437\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0435 \u0438 \u0432\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0434\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e 10 000\u20ac \u0432 \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0446\u0438\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eski arabay\u0131 kullanmaya devam edece\u011fim ve 10.000\u20ac'yu yat\u0131r\u0131ma yat\u0131raca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ee7\u7eed\u5f00\u90a3\u8f86\u65e7\u8f66\uff0c\u5e76\u5c06\u8fd91\u4e07\u6b27\u5143\u6295\u5165\u4e00\u9879\u6295\u8d44\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c07\u7e7c\u7e8c\u958b\u9019\u8f1b\u820a\u8eca\uff0c\u4e26\u5c07\u9019 10,000 \u6b50\u5143\u7528\u65bc\u6295\u8cc7\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q7.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kaufe das Auto auf Kredit, um meine gesparten 10.000\u20ac auf dem Konto zu behalten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm buying the car on credit to keep the \u20ac10,000 I've saved in the account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compro el coche a cr\u00e9dito para conservar los 10.000\u20ac que tengo ahorrados en la cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ach\u00e8te la voiture \u00e0 cr\u00e9dit pour conserver les 10 000 \u20ac que j'ai \u00e9conomis\u00e9s sur le compte."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u091a\u093e\u090f \u0917\u090f \u20ac10,000 \u0915\u094b \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f \u0930\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0921\u093f\u091f \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compro l'auto a credito per mantenere i 10.000\u20ac che ho risparmiato sul conto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u53e3\u5ea7\u306b\u8caf\u3081\u305f10,000\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u7dad\u6301\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u30af\u30ec\u30b8\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u8eca\u3092\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uacc4\uc88c\uc5d0 \uc800\ucd95\ud55c \u20ac10,000\ub97c \uc720\uc9c0\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uc2e0\uc6a9\uc73c\ub85c \ucc28\ub97c \uad6c\uc785\ud560 \uc608\uc815\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik koop de auto op krediet om de \u20ac 10.000,- die ik heb gespaard op de rekening te houden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupuj\u0119 samoch\u00f3d na kredyt, \u017ceby zachowa\u0107 na koncie zaoszcz\u0119dzone 10 000 euro."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou comprar o carro a cr\u00e9dito para manter na conta os 10.000\u20ac que poupei."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0443\u043f\u0430\u044e \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0431\u0438\u043b\u044c \u0432 \u043a\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u043e\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 10 000\u20ac \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hesab\u0131mda biriktirdi\u011fim 10.000\u20ac'yu korumak i\u00e7in arabay\u0131 krediyle sat\u0131n al\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7528\u8d37\u6b3e\u4e70\u8fd9\u8f86\u8f66\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u4fdd\u7559\u6211\u8d26\u6237\u4e0a\u5b58\u76841\u4e07\u6b27\u5143\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4ee5\u8cd2\u8cfc\u65b9\u5f0f\u8cfc\u8cb7\u6c7d\u8eca\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fdd\u7559\u5e33\u6236\u4e2d\u5b58\u5165\u7684 10,000 \u6b50\u5143\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q7.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich fahre das alte Auto weiter, lasse die 10.000\u20ac aber unverzinst liegen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll continue to drive the old car, but leave the \u20ac10,000 lying around without interest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seguir\u00e9 conduciendo el coche viejo, pero dejar\u00e9 los 10.000\u20ac tirados sin intereses."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je continue \u00e0 conduire l'ancienne voiture, mais je laisse tra\u00eener les 10 000 \u20ac sans int\u00e9r\u00eats."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u0941\u0930\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u093e\u0928\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u20ac10,000 \u0915\u094b \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u092c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u091c \u0915\u0947 \u092a\u0921\u093c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer\u00f2 a guidare la vecchia macchina, ma lascer\u00f2 i 10.000\u20ac in giro senza interessi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53e4\u3044\u8eca\u306b\u4e57\u308a\u7d9a\u3051\u308b\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059\u304c\u300110,000\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306f\u5229\u5b50\u3082\u4ed8\u3051\u305a\u306b\u7f6e\u3044\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0a1\uc740 \ucc28\ub97c \uacc4\uc18d \uc6b4\uc804\ud560 \uac83\uc774\uc9c0\ub9cc \u20ac10,000\ub294 \uc774\uc790\ub97c \ubc1b\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \uadf8\ub300\ub85c \ub450\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik blijf in de oude auto rijden, maar laat de \u20ac 10.000 zonder rente rondslingeren."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u0119d\u0119 nadal je\u017adzi\u0107 starym samochodem, ale pozostawi\u0119 10 000 euro bez odsetek."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou continuar a conduzir o carro antigo, mas deixo os 10.000\u20ac espalhados sem juros."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0435\u0437\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0435, \u043d\u043e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u044e 10 000\u20ac \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043e\u0432."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eski arabay\u0131 kullanmaya devam edece\u011fim ama 10.000 \u20ac'yu faizsiz b\u0131rakaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ee7\u7eed\u5f00\u90a3\u8f86\u65e7\u8f66\uff0c\u4f46\u628a1\u4e07\u6b27\u5143\u653e\u7740\u4e0d\u8d5a\u5229\u606f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c07\u7e7c\u7e8c\u958b\u90a3\u8f1b\u820a\u8eca\uff0c\u4f46\u5c07\u9019 10,000 \u6b50\u5143\u7121\u606f\u9592\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q8": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist mit Freunden essen. Sie wollen die 300\u20ac-Rechnung durch vier teilen. Du hattest nur Salat und Wasser. Deine Reaktion?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're having dinner with friends. You want to divide the \u20ac300 bill by four. You only had salad and water. Your reaction?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Est\u00e1s cenando con amigos. Quieres dividir el billete de 300\u20ac entre cuatro. S\u00f3lo comiste ensalada y agua. \u00bfTu reacci\u00f3n?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous d\u00eenez avec des amis. Vous souhaitez diviser par quatre la facture de 300 \u20ac. Vous n'aviez que de la salade et de l'eau. Votre r\u00e9action ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0921\u093f\u0928\u0930 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902. \u0906\u092a \u20ac300 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0932 \u0915\u094b \u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u092d\u093e\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u0938\u0932\u093e\u0926 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u0916\u093e\u092f\u093e\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stai cenando con gli amici. Vuoi dividere la banconota da 300 euro per quattro. Hai mangiato solo insalata e acqua. La tua reazione?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u5915\u98df\u3092\u98df\u3079\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002 300 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u7d19\u5e63\u3092 4 \u3067\u5206\u5272\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30b5\u30e9\u30c0\u3068\u6c34\u3057\u304b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u53cd\u5fdc\u306f\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uacfc \uc800\ub141\uc744 \uba39\uace0 \uc788\uc5b4\uc694. 300\uc720\ub85c\uc9dc\ub9ac \uc9c0\ud3d0\ub97c 4\uac1c\ub85c \ub098\ub204\uace0 \uc2f6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc0d0\ub7ec\ub4dc\uc640 \ubb3c\ub9cc \ub4dc\uc168\uc5b4\uc694. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubc18\uc751\uc740?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je gaat uit eten met vrienden. U wilt het biljet van \u20ac 300,- delen door vier. Je had alleen salade en water. Jouw reactie?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jesz kolacj\u0119 z przyjaci\u00f3\u0142mi. Chcesz podzieli\u0107 rachunek 300 euro na cztery. Mia\u0142e\u015b tylko sa\u0142atk\u0119 i wod\u0119. Twoja reakcja?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 jantando com amigos. Voc\u00ea quer dividir a nota de 300 euros por quatro. Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 comeu salada e \u00e1gua. Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0441 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c. \u041e\u043d\u0438 \u0445\u043e\u0442\u044f\u0442 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0430 300\u20ac \u043d\u0430 \u0447\u0435\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u044b\u0445. \u0422\u044b \u0435\u043b \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0441\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0442 \u0438 \u0432\u043e\u0434\u0443. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arkada\u015flar\u0131n\u0131zla ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi yiyeceksiniz. 300 Euro'luk banknotu d\u00f6rde b\u00f6lmek istiyorsunuz. Sadece salata ve su vard\u0131. Tepkiniz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u548c\u670b\u53cb\u4eec\u4e00\u8d77\u5403\u996d\u3002\u4ed6\u4eec\u60f3\u628a300\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u8d26\u5355\u5e73\u5747\u5206\u6210\u56db\u4efd\u3002\u4f60\u53ea\u5403\u4e86\u6c99\u62c9\u548c\u6c34\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u5e94\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6b63\u5728\u548c\u670b\u53cb\u4e00\u8d77\u5403\u665a\u9910\u3002\u60a8\u8981\u5c07 300 \u6b50\u5143\u7684\u9214\u7968\u9664\u4ee5\u56db\u3002\u4f60\u53ea\u5403\u4e86\u6c99\u62c9\u548c\u6c34\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u61c9\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q8.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich zahle ohne Murren mit, um keine schlechte Stimmung zu machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pay without complaining so as not to create a bad mood."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago sin quejarme para no crear mal humor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je paie sans me plaindre pour ne pas cr\u00e9er de mauvaise humeur."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0936\u093f\u0915\u093e\u092f\u0924 \u0915\u093f\u090f \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0924\u093e\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0942\u0921 \u0916\u0930\u093e\u092c \u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago senza lamentarmi per non creare cattivo umore."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5acc\u306a\u96f0\u56f2\u6c17\u306b\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u6587\u53e5\u3082\u8a00\u308f\u305a\u306b\u652f\u6255\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uae30\ubd84\uc774 \ub098\ube60\uc9c0\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub3c4\ub85d \ubd88\ud3c9\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \uc9c0\ubd88\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik betaal zonder te klagen, om geen slecht humeur te cre\u00ebren."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "P\u0142ac\u0119 bez narzekania, \u017ceby nie robi\u0107 z\u0142ego nastroju."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago sem reclamar para n\u00e3o criar mau humor."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u043e\u043f\u043e\u0442\u0430, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043f\u043b\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K\u00f6t\u00fc bir ruh hali yaratmamak i\u00e7in \u015fikayet etmeden \u00f6deme yap\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc3\u7518\u60c5\u613f\u5730\u4ed8\u6b3e\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u5236\u9020\u4e0d\u597d\u7684\u6c14\u6c1b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6beb\u7121\u6028\u8a00\u5730\u4ed8\u9322\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u9020\u6210\u4e0d\u597d\u7684\u5fc3\u60c5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q8.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich zahle meinen Anteil plus Trinkgeld, lehne die Viertel-Teilung aber freundlich ab."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pay my share plus a tip, but politely decline to split it into quarters."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago mi parte m\u00e1s una propina, pero cort\u00e9smente me niego a dividirla en cuartos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je paie ma part plus un pourboire, mais je refuse poliment de la diviser en quatre."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0939\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0938\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u091f\u093f\u092a \u0915\u093e \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0935\u093f\u0928\u092e\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0915 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u091a\u093e\u0930 \u092d\u093e\u0917\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0935\u093f\u092d\u093e\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0907\u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago la mia quota pi\u00f9 la mancia, ma rifiuto gentilmente di dividerla in quarti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u53d6\u308a\u5206\u3068\u30c1\u30c3\u30d7\u3092\u652f\u6255\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u30014\u5206\u306e1\u306b\u5206\u5272\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306f\u4e01\u91cd\u306b\u304a\u65ad\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \ubaab\uacfc \ud301\uc744 \uc9c0\ubd88\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uadf8\uac83\uc744 4\ub4f1\ubd84\uc73c\ub85c \ub098\ub204\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc815\uc911\ud788 \uac70\ubd80\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik betaal mijn deel plus een fooi, maar weiger beleefd om het in vieren te verdelen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "P\u0142ac\u0119 swoj\u0105 cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 plus napiwek, ale grzecznie odmawiam podzia\u0142u na \u0107wiartki."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago minha parte mais uma gorjeta, mas me recuso educadamente a dividi-la em quartos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u044e \u0434\u043e\u043b\u044e \u043f\u043b\u044e\u0441 \u0447\u0430\u0435\u0432\u044b\u0435, \u043d\u043e \u0432\u0435\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0432\u043e \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043e\u0442 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0447\u0435\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay\u0131m\u0131 art\u0131 bir bah\u015fi\u015f \u00f6d\u00fcyorum ama kibarca onu d\u00f6rde b\u00f6lmeyi reddediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u652f\u4ed8\u6211\u7684\u4efd\u989d\u52a0\u5c0f\u8d39\uff0c\u4f46\u53cb\u597d\u5730\u62d2\u7edd\u5206\u56db\u4efd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u652f\u4ed8\u4e86\u6211\u7684\u4efd\u984d\u548c\u5c0f\u8cbb\uff0c\u4f46\u79ae\u8c8c\u5730\u62d2\u7d55\u5c07\u5176\u5206\u6210\u56db\u4efd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q8.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich diskutiere lautstark aus, dass mir noch 4,50\u20ac Wechselgeld zustehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I loudly argue that I am still owed \u20ac4.50 in change."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Argumento en voz alta que todav\u00eda me deben 4,50\u20ac de cambio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'affirme haut et fort qu'on me doit encore 4,50 \u20ac de monnaie."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u094b\u0930-\u091c\u094b\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0924\u0930\u094d\u0915 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0941\u091d \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u20ac4.50 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0924\u0928 \u092c\u0915\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sostengo ad alta voce che mi sono ancora dovuti 4,50\u20ac di resto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u307e\u3060\u5c0f\u92ad\u3068\u3057\u3066 4.50 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u652f\u6255\u3046\u7fa9\u52d9\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3068\u5927\u58f0\u3067\u4e3b\u5f35\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc544\uc9c1\ub3c4 \uac70\uc2a4\ub984\ub3c8\uc73c\ub85c 4.50\uc720\ub85c\ub97c \ube5a\uc9c0\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4\uace0 \ud070 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub85c \uc8fc\uc7a5\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik beweer luidkeels dat ik nog \u20ac 4,50 aan wisselgeld schuldig ben."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u0142o\u015bno twierdz\u0119, \u017ce nadal nale\u017c\u0105 mi si\u0119 4,50 euro reszty."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Argumento em voz alta que ainda me devem \u20ac 4,50 em troco."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043a\u043e \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u044e \u043e \u0442\u043e\u043c, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043e 4,50 \u0435\u0432\u0440\u043e \u0441\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hala 4,50\u20ac bozuk para borcum oldu\u011funu y\u00fcksek sesle savunuyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u58f0\u4e89\u8bba\u8bf4\u6211\u8fd8\u5e94\u8be5\u5f97\u52304,50\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u627e\u96f6\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u8072\u722d\u8faf\u8aaa\u6211\u9084\u6b20 4.5 \u6b50\u5143\u627e\u96f6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q8.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00fcbernehme spontan die gesamte Rechnung, um Eindruck zu schinden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I spontaneously take over the entire bill to make an impression."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De forma espont\u00e1nea me hago cargo de toda la factura para causar una buena impresi\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je reprends spontan\u00e9ment toute l\u2019affiche pour marquer les esprits."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092d\u093e\u0935 \u0921\u093e\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0905\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0939\u0940 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u092c\u093f\u0932 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0925 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0932\u0947 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi faccio carico spontaneamente dell'intero conto per fare colpo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u5370\u8c61\u3092\u6b8b\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306b\u81ea\u767a\u7684\u306b\u6cd5\u6848\u5168\u4f53\u3092\u5f15\u304d\u53d7\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc778\uc0c1\uc744 \ub0a8\uae30\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uc790\ubc1c\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uccad\uad6c\uc11c \uc804\uccb4\ub97c \uc778\uc218\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik neem spontaan de hele rekening over om indruk te maken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spontanicznie przejmuj\u0119 ca\u0142y rachunek, \u017ceby zrobi\u0107 wra\u017cenie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assumo espontaneamente toda a conta para causar uma boa impress\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0431\u0435\u0440\u0443 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0438\u0437\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0432\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0442\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir izlenim b\u0131rakmak i\u00e7in kendili\u011finden t\u00fcm tasar\u0131y\u0131 devral\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e34\u65f6\u51b3\u5b9a\u652f\u4ed8\u6574\u5f20\u8d26\u5355\uff0c\u4ee5\u7ed9\u4eba\u7559\u4e0b\u6df1\u523b\u5370\u8c61\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u81ea\u767c\u6027\u5730\u63a5\u7ba1\u4e86\u6574\u500b\u8cec\u55ae\u4ee5\u7d66\u4eba\u7559\u4e0b\u6df1\u523b\u7684\u5370\u8c61\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q9": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein K\u00fchlschrank ist kaputt und dein Auto braucht am selben Tag eine 600\u20ac-Reparatur. Wie bezahlst du das?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your fridge is broken and your car needs a \u20ac600 repair on the same day. How do you pay for that?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu nevera est\u00e1 rota y tu coche necesita una reparaci\u00f3n de 600\u20ac el mismo d\u00eda. \u00bfC\u00f3mo se paga por eso?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre frigo est en panne et votre voiture a besoin d'une r\u00e9paration de 600 \u20ac le jour m\u00eame. Comment payez-vous cela ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092b\u094d\u0930\u093f\u091c \u091f\u0942\u091f \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u0909\u0938\u0940 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u20ac600 \u0915\u0940 \u092e\u0930\u092e\u094d\u092e\u0924 \u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0917\u0947?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo frigorifero \u00e8 rotto e la tua auto ha bisogno di una riparazione da \u20ac 600 lo stesso giorno. Come lo paghi?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u51b7\u8535\u5eab\u306f\u58ca\u308c\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u8eca\u306f\u540c\u65e5\u4e2d\u306b600\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306e\u4fee\u7406\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305d\u308c\u306f\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u652f\u6255\u3046\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ub0c9\uc7a5\uace0\ub294 \uace0\uc7a5\ub0ac\uace0 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ucc28\ub294 \ub2f9\uc77c\uc5d0 \u20ac600\uc758 \uc218\ub9ac\uac00 \ud544\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8 \ube44\uc6a9\uc740 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \uc9c0\ubd88\ud558\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uw koelkast is kapot en uw auto heeft dezelfde dag een reparatie van \u20ac 600,- nodig. Hoe betaal je dat?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Twoja lod\u00f3wka jest zepsuta, a samoch\u00f3d wymaga naprawy za 600 euro jeszcze tego samego dnia. Jak za to p\u0142acisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O seu frigor\u00edfico est\u00e1 avariado e o seu carro precisa de uma repara\u00e7\u00e3o de 600\u20ac no mesmo dia. Como voc\u00ea paga por isso?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0445\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043a \u0441\u043b\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d, \u0438 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0435 \u0432 \u0442\u043e\u0442 \u0436\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u0430 \u0440\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0442 \u0437\u0430 600\u20ac. \u041a\u0430\u043a \u0442\u044b \u0437\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buzdolab\u0131n\u0131z bozuldu ve araban\u0131z\u0131n ayn\u0131 g\u00fcn i\u00e7inde 600\u20ac'luk tamire ihtiyac\u0131 var. Bunun bedelini nas\u0131l \u00f6d\u00fcyorsunuz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u51b0\u7bb1\u574f\u4e86\uff0c\u4f60\u7684\u8f66\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u5929\u9700\u8981\u82b1\u8d39600\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u4fee\u7406\u8d39\u3002\u4f60\u600e\u4e48\u652f\u4ed8\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u51b0\u7bb1\u58de\u4e86\uff0c\u60a8\u7684\u6c7d\u8eca\u9700\u8981\u5728\u540c\u4e00\u5929\u4fee\u7406 600 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u5982\u4f55\u652f\u4ed8\u8cbb\u7528\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q9.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Problem, das zahle ich direkt aus meinem aufgebauten Notgroschen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No problem, I'll pay for it directly from the nest egg I've built up."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No hay problema, lo pagar\u00e9 directamente con los ahorros que he acumulado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas de probl\u00e8me, je le paierai directement avec le p\u00e9cule que j'ai constitu\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0938\u0940\u0927\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0918\u094b\u0902\u0938\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nessun problema, lo pagher\u00f2 direttamente con il gruzzolo che ho accumulato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5927\u4e08\u592b\u3001\u79c1\u304c\u80b2\u3066\u305f\u5de3\u306e\u5375\u304b\u3089\u76f4\u63a5\u652f\u6255\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubb38\uc81c \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc81c\uac00 \uc313\uc544\ub454 \ub465\uc9c0 \uc54c\uc5d0\uc11c \uc9c1\uc811 \uacb0\uc81c\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen probleem, ik betaal het direct uit het spaarpotje dat ik heb opgebouwd."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie ma problemu, zap\u0142ac\u0119 za to bezpo\u015brednio z oszcz\u0119dno\u015bci, kt\u00f3re zgromadzi\u0142em."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e3o tem problema, pagarei diretamente com o p\u00e9-de-meia que acumulei."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0411\u0435\u0437 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c, \u044f \u043e\u043f\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u043e \u0438\u0437 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043d\u0430 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sorun de\u011fil, do\u011frudan olu\u015fturdu\u011fum yuva yumurtas\u0131ndan \u00f6deyece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6ca1\u95ee\u9898\uff0c\u6211\u76f4\u63a5\u4ece\u6211\u79ef\u6512\u7684\u5e94\u6025\u57fa\u91d1\u91cc\u652f\u4ed8\u8fd9\u7b14\u94b1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6c92\u554f\u984c\uff0c\u6211\u6703\u76f4\u63a5\u7528\u6211\u7d2f\u7a4d\u7684\u7a4d\u84c4\u4f86\u652f\u4ed8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q9.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich muss daf\u00fcr den Dispokredit nutzen oder eine Ratenzahlung vereinbaren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have to use the overdraft facility or agree to pay in installments."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tengo que utilizar el servicio de sobregiro o aceptar pagar a plazos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dois utiliser la facilit\u00e9 de d\u00e9couvert ou accepter de payer en plusieurs fois."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0913\u0935\u0930\u0921\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092b\u094d\u091f \u0938\u0941\u0935\u093f\u0927\u093e \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u092f\u093e \u0915\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0938\u0939\u092e\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devo utilizzare la possibilit\u00e0 di scoperto o accettare di pagare a rate."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u5ea7\u8cb8\u8d8a\u6a5f\u80fd\u3092\u5229\u7528\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u5206\u5272\u6255\u3044\u306b\u540c\u610f\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc88c\ub300\uc6d4 \uc81c\ub3c4\ub97c \uc774\uc6a9\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ubd84\ud560 \ub0a9\ubd80\uc5d0 \ub3d9\uc758\ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik moet gebruik maken van de roodstand of akkoord gaan met betaling in termijnen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musz\u0119 skorzysta\u0107 z kredytu w rachunku bie\u017c\u0105cym lub zgodzi\u0107 si\u0119 na p\u0142atno\u015b\u0107 w ratach."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tenho que usar o cheque especial ou concordar em parcelar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0444\u0442 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0434\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u043e \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0440\u043e\u0447\u043a\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kredili mevduat olana\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kullanmam veya taksitle \u00f6demeyi kabul etmem gerekiyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u987b\u4f7f\u7528\u900f\u652f\u4fe1\u7528\u6216\u8005\u540c\u610f\u5206\u671f\u4ed8\u6b3e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u9808\u4f7f\u7528\u900f\u652f\u8a2d\u65bd\u6216\u540c\u610f\u5206\u671f\u4ed8\u6b3e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q9.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich muss Familie oder Freunde anpumpen, weil ich komplett blank bin."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have to tell family or friends because I'm completely exhausted."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tengo que cont\u00e1rselo a familiares o amigos porque estoy completamente agotado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dois en parler \u00e0 ma famille ou \u00e0 mes amis car je suis compl\u00e8tement \u00e9puis\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u092f\u093e \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092c\u0924\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0925\u0915 \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devo dirlo alla famiglia o agli amici perch\u00e9 sono completamente esausto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u75b2\u308c\u679c\u3066\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u5bb6\u65cf\u3084\u53cb\u9054\u306b\u5831\u544a\u3057\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc644\uc804\ud788 \uc9c0\ucce4\uae30 \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 \uac00\uc871\uc774\ub098 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c \ub9d0\ud574\uc57c \ud574\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik moet het aan familie of vrienden vertellen omdat ik totaal uitgeput ben."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musz\u0119 powiedzie\u0107 rodzinie lub przyjacio\u0142om, bo jestem totalnie wyczerpany."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tenho que contar \u00e0 fam\u00edlia ou aos amigos porque estou completamente exausto."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0443 \u0441\u0435\u043c\u044c\u0438 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0439 \u0432\u0437\u0430\u0439\u043c\u044b, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0443 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0441\u0435\u043c \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tamamen bitkin oldu\u011fum i\u00e7in aileme veya arkada\u015flar\u0131ma s\u00f6ylemek zorunday\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u987b\u5411\u5bb6\u4eba\u6216\u670b\u53cb\u501f\u94b1\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u4e00\u5206\u94b1\u90fd\u6ca1\u6709\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u9808\u544a\u8a34\u5bb6\u4eba\u6216\u670b\u53cb\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u5df2\u7d93\u7b4b\u75b2\u529b\u76e1\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q9.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich ignoriere die Autoreparatur vorerst und fahre auf eigenes Risiko weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I ignore the car repair for now and continue driving at my own risk."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro la reparaci\u00f3n del coche por ahora y sigo conduciendo bajo mi propia responsabilidad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ignore la r\u00e9paration de la voiture pour l'instant et continue de conduire \u00e0 mes propres risques."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092b\u093f\u0932\u0939\u093e\u0932 \u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0940 \u092e\u0930\u092e\u094d\u092e\u0924 \u092a\u0930 \u0927\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u091c\u094b\u0916\u093f\u092e \u092a\u0930 \u0917\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u091a\u0932\u093e\u0928\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per il momento ignoro la riparazione dell'auto e continuo a guidare a mio rischio e pericolo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u4eca\u306e\u3068\u3053\u308d\u8eca\u306e\u4fee\u7406\u3092\u7121\u8996\u3057\u3001\u81ea\u5df1\u8cac\u4efb\u3067\u904b\u8ee2\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc9c0\uae08\uc740 \uc790\ub3d9\ucc28 \uc218\ub9ac\ub97c \ubb34\uc2dc\ud558\uace0 \uc790\uae30 \ucc45\uc784\uc73c\ub85c \uc6b4\uc804\uc744 \uacc4\uc18d\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik negeer de autoreparatie voorlopig en rijd verder op eigen risico."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na razie ignoruj\u0119 napraw\u0119 samochodu i kontynuuj\u0119 jazd\u0119 na w\u0142asne ryzyko."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro o conserto do carro por enquanto e continuo dirigindo por minha conta e risco."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430 \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0440\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0442 \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0431\u0438\u043b\u044f \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0435\u0445\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0440\u0438\u0441\u043a."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015eimdilik araban\u0131n tamirini g\u00f6rmezden geliyorum ve riski kendime ait alarak arabay\u0131 s\u00fcrmeye devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6682\u65f6\u5ffd\u7565\u6c7d\u8f66\u7ef4\u4fee\uff0c\u7ee7\u7eed\u81ea\u5df1\u627f\u62c5\u98ce\u9669\u5f00\u8f66\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u66ab\u6642\u5ffd\u7565\u6c7d\u8eca\u4fee\u7406\u4e26\u7e7c\u7e8c\u99d5\u99db\uff0c\u98a8\u96aa\u7531\u6211\u627f\u64d4\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q10": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast Krypto/Aktien f\u00fcr 1.000\u20ac gekauft. Es ist nur noch 200\u20ac wert und das Projekt ist offensichtlich gescheitert. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You bought crypto/stocks for \u20ac1,000. It is only worth \u20ac200 and the project has obviously failed. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compraste criptomonedas/acciones por 1.000 \u20ac. S\u00f3lo vale 200\u20ac y el proyecto evidentemente ha fracasado. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez achet\u00e9 des crypto/actions pour 1 000 \u20ac. Cela ne vaut que 200 \u20ac et le projet a visiblement \u00e9chou\u00e9. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u20ac1,000 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092a\u094d\u091f\u094b/\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u0915 \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926\u0947\u0964 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u0940\u092e\u0924 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u20ac200 \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u092f\u094b\u091c\u0928\u093e \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u092b\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai acquistato criptovalute/azioni per \u20ac 1.000. Vale solo 200 euro e il progetto \u00e8 ovviamente fallito. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u4eee\u60f3\u901a\u8ca8/\u682a\u5f0f\u3092 1,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3067\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u305f\u3063\u305f 200 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306e\u4fa1\u5024\u3057\u304b\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306f\u660e\u3089\u304b\u306b\u5931\u6557\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadc0\ud558\ub294 \uc554\ud638\ud654\ud3d0/\uc8fc\uc2dd\uc744 \u20ac1,000\uc5d0 \uad6c\ub9e4\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uac00\uaca9\uc740 \u20ac200\uc5d0 \ubd88\uacfc\ud558\uba70 \uc774 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ub294 \ubd84\uba85\ud788 \uc2e4\ud328\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt crypto/aandelen gekocht voor \u20ac 1.000. Het kost slechts \u20ac200,- en het project is duidelijk mislukt. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupi\u0142e\u015b kryptowaluty/akcje za 1000 \u20ac. Jest wart tylko 200 euro i projekt najwyra\u017aniej si\u0119 nie powi\u00f3d\u0142. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea comprou criptomoedas/a\u00e7\u00f5es por \u20ac 1.000. Vale apenas 200\u20ac e o projecto falhou obviamente. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043a\u0443\u043f\u0438\u043b \u043a\u0440\u0438\u043f\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b\u044e\u0442\u0443/\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0438 \u043d\u0430 1000\u20ac. \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043e\u043d\u0438 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e 200\u20ac, \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u043e\u0447\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0434\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438\u043b\u0441\u044f. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1.000 \u20ac kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131nda kripto/hisse sat\u0131n ald\u0131n\u0131z. Sadece 200\u20ac de\u011ferinde ve proje a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u82b1\u4e861000\u6b27\u5143\u4e70\u4e86\u52a0\u5bc6\u8d27\u5e01/\u80a1\u7968\u3002\u73b0\u5728\u53ea\u503c200\u6b27\u5143\uff0c\u800c\u4e14\u8fd9\u4e2a\u9879\u76ee\u663e\u7136\u5931\u8d25\u4e86\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u4ee5 1,000 \u6b50\u5143\u8cfc\u8cb7\u4e86\u52a0\u5bc6\u8ca8\u5e63/\u80a1\u7968\u3002\u5b83\u53ea\u503c200\u6b50\u5143\uff0c\u800c\u4e14\u9019\u500b\u8a08\u756b\u986f\u7136\u5df2\u7d93\u5931\u6557\u4e86\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q10.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich halte. Man macht erst Verlust, wenn man verkauft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I hold. You only make a loss when you sell."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sostengo. S\u00f3lo pierdes cuando vendes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je tiens. Vous ne faites une perte que lorsque vous vendez."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u0915\u0921\u093c \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0941\u0901\u0964 \u091c\u092c \u0906\u092a \u092c\u0947\u091a\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u0918\u093e\u091f\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "tengo. Perdi solo quando vendi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30db\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u58f2\u3063\u305f\u3089\u640d\u3059\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ubd99\uc7a1\ub294\ub2e4. \ud314\ub54c\ub9cc \uc190\uc2e4\uc774 \ubc1c\uc0dd\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik houd vast. Je maakt pas verlies als je verkoopt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trzymam. Sprzedaj\u0105c tracisz tylko."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu seguro. Voc\u00ea s\u00f3 tem preju\u00edzo quando vende."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0443. \u041f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430, \u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tutuyorum. Sadece satarken zarar edersiniz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u575a\u6301\u3002\u53ea\u6709\u5728\u5356\u51fa\u65f6\u624d\u4f1a\u4e8f\u635f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6301\u6709\u3002\u53ea\u6709\u7576\u4f60\u8ce3\u51fa\u6642\u4f60\u624d\u6703\u8667\u640d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q10.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kaufe f\u00fcr weitere 200\u20ac nach, um meinen Durchschnittspreis zu senken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll buy another \u20ac200 to lower my average price."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprar\u00e9 otros 200\u20ac para bajar mi precio medio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'en rach\u00e8terai 200 \u20ac suppl\u00e9mentaires pour baisser mon prix moyen."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0914\u0938\u0924 \u0915\u0940\u092e\u0924 \u0915\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u20ac200 \u0914\u0930 \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne comprer\u00f2 altri 200\u20ac per abbassare il mio prezzo medio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5e73\u5747\u4fa1\u683c\u3092\u4e0b\u3052\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u3055\u3089\u306b 200 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud3c9\uade0 \uac00\uaca9\uc744 \ub0ae\ucd94\uae30 \uc704\ud574 200\uc720\ub85c\ub97c \ub354 \uad6c\ub9e4\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik koop nog eens \u20ac 200,- om mijn gemiddelde prijs te verlagen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupi\u0119 kolejne 200 euro, aby obni\u017cy\u0107 moj\u0105 \u015bredni\u0105 cen\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprarei mais 200\u20ac para baixar o meu pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0443\u043f\u0430\u044e \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u043d\u0430 200\u20ac, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u043d\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043c\u043e\u044e \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043d\u044e\u044e \u0446\u0435\u043d\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ortalama fiyat\u0131m\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcrmek i\u00e7in 200 \u20ac daha alaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u518d\u4e70200\u6b27\u5143\u4ee5\u964d\u4f4e\u6211\u7684\u5e73\u5747\u4ef7\u683c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u518d\u8cb7 200 \u6b50\u5143\u4f86\u964d\u4f4e\u6211\u7684\u5e73\u5747\u50f9\u683c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q10.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verkaufe sofort, nehme den Verlust hin und rette die restlichen 200\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I sell immediately, take the loss and save the remaining \u20ac200."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vendo inmediatamente, asumo la p\u00e9rdida y ahorro los 200\u20ac restantes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vends imm\u00e9diatement, j'accepte la perte et j'\u00e9conomise les 200 \u20ac restants."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u092c\u0947\u091a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0928\u0941\u0915\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u0909\u0920\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0936\u0947\u0937 \u20ac200 \u092c\u091a\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vendo subito, assumo le perdite e risparmio i restanti 200\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3059\u3050\u306b\u58f2\u3063\u3066\u640d\u5931\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u3001\u6b8b\u308a\u306e 200 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u7bc0\u7d04\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc989\uc2dc \ub9e4\ub3c4\ud558\uace0 \uc190\uc2e4\uc744 \uac10\uc218\ud558\uace0 \ub0a8\uc740 \u20ac200\ub97c \uc800\ucd95\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verkoop onmiddellijk, neem het verlies en spaar de resterende \u20ac 200,-."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sprzedaj\u0119 natychmiast, ponosz\u0119 strat\u0119 i oszcz\u0119dzam pozosta\u0142e 200 \u20ac."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vendo imediatamente, assumo o preju\u00edzo e economizo os restantes 200\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e \u0443\u0431\u044b\u0442\u043e\u043a \u0438 \u0441\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0448\u0438\u0435\u0441\u044f 200\u20ac."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen sat\u0131yorum, zarar\u0131 \u00fcstleniyorum ve kalan 200\u20ac'yu biriktiriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u51fa\u552e\uff0c\u63a5\u53d7\u635f\u5931\uff0c\u5e76\u633d\u6551\u5269\u4e0b\u7684200\u6b27\u5143\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u51fa\u552e\uff0c\u627f\u64d4\u640d\u5931\u4e26\u7bc0\u7701\u5269\u9918\u7684 200 \u6b50\u5143\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q10.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schaue aus Frust gar nicht mehr in mein Portfolio."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't even look at my portfolio anymore out of frustration."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya ni siquiera miro mi portafolio por frustraci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne regarde m\u00eame plus mon portfolio par frustration."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0939\u0924\u093e\u0936\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u0905\u092c \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u094b\u0930\u094d\u091f\u092b\u094b\u0932\u093f\u092f\u094b \u0915\u094b \u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non guardo nemmeno pi\u00f9 il mio portfolio per la frustrazione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a4\u30e9\u30a4\u30e9\u3057\u3066\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30ea\u30aa\u3055\u3048\u898b\u306a\u304f\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc88c\uc808\uac10\uc5d0 \ub354 \uc774\uc0c1 \ub0b4 \ud3ec\ud2b8\ud3f4\ub9ac\uc624\ub97c \ubcf4\uc9c0\ub3c4 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uit frustratie kijk ik niet eens meer naar mijn portfolio."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z frustracji ju\u017c nawet nie patrz\u0119 na swoje portfolio."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu nem olho mais para o meu portf\u00f3lio por frustra\u00e7\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0447\u0430\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044e \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0444\u0435\u043b\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Art\u0131k hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan portf\u00f6y\u00fcme bile bakm\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u56e0\u4e3a\u6cae\u4e27\u6839\u672c\u5c31\u4e0d\u518d\u770b\u6211\u7684\u6295\u8d44\u7ec4\u5408\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u51fa\u65bc\u6cae\u55aa\uff0c\u6211\u751a\u81f3\u4e0d\u518d\u770b\u6211\u7684\u6295\u8cc7\u7d44\u5408\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q11": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du ziehst mit deinem Partner zusammen. Ab welchem Moment forderst du offene Zahlen \u00fcber seine/ihre Schulden ein?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You move in with your partner. At what point do you demand open figures about his/her debts?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te mudas con tu pareja. \u00bfEn qu\u00e9 momento exige cifras abiertas sobre sus deudas?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous emm\u00e9nagez avec votre partenaire. \u00c0 quel moment exigez-vous des chiffres ouverts sur ses dettes\u00a0?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0906\u0917\u0947 \u092c\u0922\u093c\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u093f\u0938 \u092c\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0941 \u092a\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u090b\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0941\u0932\u0947 \u0906\u0902\u0915\u0921\u093c\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vai a vivere con il tuo partner. A che punto chiedi cifre aperte sui suoi debiti?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u30ca\u30fc\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u5f15\u3063\u8d8a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3069\u306e\u6642\u70b9\u3067\u5f7c/\u5f7c\u5973\u306e\u501f\u91d1\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u516c\u958b\u306e\u6570\u5b57\u3092\u8981\u6c42\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108\uc640 \ud568\uaed8 \uc774\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5b4\ub290 \uc2dc\uc810\uc5d0\uc11c \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ubd80\ucc44\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uacf5\uac1c \uc218\uce58\ub97c \uc694\uad6c\ud569\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U gaat samenwonen met uw partner. Op welk punt eist u open cijfers over zijn/haar schulden?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wprowadzasz si\u0119 ze swoim partnerem. W kt\u00f3rym momencie \u017c\u0105dasz otwartych danych na temat jego d\u0142ug\u00f3w?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea vai morar com seu parceiro. Em que momento voc\u00ea exige n\u00fameros abertos sobre suas d\u00edvidas?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0435\u0437\u0436\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043a \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0442\u043d\u0451\u0440\u0443. \u0421 \u043a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043c\u043e\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430 \u0442\u044b \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0442\u044b\u0445 \u0446\u0438\u0444\u0440 \u043e \u0435\u0433\u043e/\u0435\u0451 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0433\u0430\u0445?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Partnerinizin yan\u0131na ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131yorsunuz. Bor\u00e7lar\u0131yla ilgili ne zaman a\u00e7\u0131k rakam talep edeceksiniz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u548c\u4f60\u7684\u4f34\u4fa3\u540c\u5c45\u3002\u4ece\u4ec0\u4e48\u65f6\u5019\u8d77\uff0c\u4f60\u4f1a\u8981\u6c42\u4ed6/\u5979\u516c\u5f00\u503a\u52a1\u60c5\u51b5\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u642c\u53bb\u548c\u4f60\u7684\u4f34\u4fb6\u4f4f\u5728\u4e00\u8d77\u3002\u60a8\u5728\u4ec0\u9ebc\u6642\u5019\u8981\u6c42\u4ed6/\u5979\u7684\u50b5\u52d9\u516c\u958b\u8cc7\u6599\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q11.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gar nicht. \u00dcber Geld spricht man nicht in einer romantischen Beziehung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not at all. You don't talk about money in a romantic relationship."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De nada. No se habla de dinero en una relaci\u00f3n rom\u00e1ntica."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas du tout. On ne parle pas d'argent dans une relation amoureuse."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0930\u094b\u092e\u093e\u0902\u091f\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u093e\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affatto. Non si parla di soldi in una relazione romantica."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5168\u304f\u306a\u3044\u3002\u604b\u611b\u95a2\u4fc2\u3067\u306f\u304a\u91d1\u306e\u8a71\u306f\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3088\u306d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubcc4\ub9d0\uc500\uc744\uc694. \uc5f0\uc560\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \ub3c8\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc774\uc57c\uae30\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helemaal niet. In een romantische relatie praat je niet over geld."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zupe\u0142nie nie. W romantycznym zwi\u0105zku nie m\u00f3wi si\u0119 o pieni\u0105dzach."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De jeito nenhum. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o fala sobre dinheiro em um relacionamento rom\u00e2ntico."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u0442. \u041e \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0433\u0430\u0445 \u043d\u0435 \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044f\u0442 \u0432 \u0440\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u043e\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7 de bile. Romantik bir ili\u015fkide para hakk\u0131nda konu\u015fulmaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u70b9\u4e5f\u4e0d\u3002\u5728\u6d6a\u6f2b\u5173\u7cfb\u4e2d\u4e0d\u8c08\u94b1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u9ede\u4e5f\u4e0d\u3002\u5728\u6200\u611b\u95dc\u4fc2\u4e2d\uff0c\u4f60\u4e0d\u6703\u8ac7\u8ad6\u91d1\u9322\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q11.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwingend bevor wir den gemeinsamen Mietvertrag unterschreiben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mandatory before we sign the joint rental agreement."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obligatorio antes de firmar el contrato de alquiler conjunto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obligatoire avant de signer le contrat de location commune."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u0902\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u093f\u0930\u093e\u092f\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u091d\u094c\u0924\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0939\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092f\u0939 \u0905\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obbligatorio prima di firmare il contratto di noleggio congiunto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5171\u540c\u30ec\u30f3\u30bf\u30eb\u5951\u7d04\u306b\u7f72\u540d\u3059\u308b\u524d\u306b\u5fc5\u9808\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uacf5\ub3d9 \uc784\ub300 \uacc4\uc57d\uc744 \uccb4\uacb0\ud558\uae30 \uc804 \ud544\uc218 \uc0ac\ud56d\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verplicht voordat wij de gezamenlijke huurovereenkomst ondertekenen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obowi\u0105zkowe przed podpisaniem wsp\u00f3lnej umowy najmu."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obrigat\u00f3rio antes de assinarmos o contrato de loca\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041e\u0431\u044f\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043c \u043c\u044b \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043f\u0438\u0448\u0435\u043c \u0441\u043e\u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440 \u0430\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0434\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ortak kira s\u00f6zle\u015fmesini imzalamadan \u00f6nce zorunludur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6211\u4eec\u7b7e\u7f72\u5171\u540c\u79df\u8d41\u5408\u540c\u4e4b\u524d\u662f\u5f3a\u5236\u6027\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u6211\u5011\u7c3d\u7f72\u806f\u5408\u79df\u8cc3\u5354\u8b70\u4e4b\u524d\u5fc5\u9808\u9019\u6a23\u505a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q11.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich gehe davon aus, dass er/sie mir schon sagen w\u00fcrde, wenn es Probleme g\u00e4be."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I assume that he/she would tell me if there were problems."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supongo que me dir\u00eda si hubiera problemas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suppose qu'il me dirait s'il y avait des probl\u00e8mes."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0926\u093f \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u0940 \u0924\u094b \u0935\u0939 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092c\u0924\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e/\u0915\u0930\u0947\u0917\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presumo che lui/lei mi direbbe se ci fossero problemi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u554f\u984c\u304c\u3042\u308c\u3070\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u308c\u308b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8/\uadf8\ub140\uac00 \ubb38\uc81c\uac00 \uc788\uc73c\uba74 \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c \ub9d0\ud574 \uc904 \uac83\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \uc0dd\uac01\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ga ervan uit dat hij/zij het mij zou vertellen als er problemen waren."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zak\u0142adam, \u017ce on/ona by mi powiedzia\u0142, gdyby by\u0142y jakie\u015b problemy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presumo que ele/ela me diria se houvesse problemas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043f\u043e\u043b\u0430\u0433\u0430\u044e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043e\u043d/\u043e\u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043b(\u0430) \u0431\u044b \u043c\u043d\u0435, \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0431\u044b \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0438 \u043a\u0430\u043a\u0438\u0435-\u043b\u0438\u0431\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir sorun olsa bana s\u00f6yleyece\u011fini varsay\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8ba4\u4e3a\uff0c\u5982\u679c\u6709\u95ee\u9898\u7684\u8bdd\uff0c\u4ed6/\u5979\u4f1a\u544a\u8bc9\u6211\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u60f3\u5982\u679c\u6709\u554f\u984c\u4ed6/\u5979\u6703\u544a\u8a34\u6211\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q11.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn finanzielle Probleme auftauchen, l\u00f6sen wir sie einfach spontan."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When financial problems arise, we simply solve them spontaneously."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando surgen problemas financieros, simplemente los solucionamos espont\u00e1neamente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lorsque des probl\u00e8mes financiers surviennent, nous les r\u00e9solvons simplement spontan\u00e9ment."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u091c\u092c \u0935\u093f\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0940\u092f \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0906\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0924\u094b \u0939\u092e \u0909\u0928\u094d\u0939\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0932 \u0915\u0930 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando sorgono problemi finanziari, li risolviamo semplicemente spontaneamente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7d4c\u6e08\u7684\u306a\u554f\u984c\u304c\u767a\u751f\u3057\u305f\u5834\u5408\u3001\u79c1\u305f\u3061\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u81ea\u7136\u306b\u89e3\u6c7a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uae08\uc804\uc801\uc778 \ubb38\uc81c\uac00 \uc0dd\uae30\uba74 \uc6b0\ub9ac\ub294 \uc790\uc5f0\uc2a4\ub7fd\uac8c \ubb38\uc81c\ub97c \ud574\uacb0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wanneer zich financi\u00eble problemen voordoen, lossen wij deze eenvoudigweg spontaan op."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiedy pojawiaj\u0105 si\u0119 problemy finansowe, po prostu rozwi\u0105zujemy je spontanicznie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando surgem problemas financeiros, simplesmente os resolvemos espontaneamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0444\u0438\u043d\u0430\u043d\u0441\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u044b, \u043c\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0435\u043c \u0438\u0445 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mali sorunlar ortaya \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda bunlar\u0131 kendili\u011finden \u00e7\u00f6zeriz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u51fa\u73b0\u8d22\u52a1\u95ee\u9898\u65f6\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u5c31\u968f\u65f6\u89e3\u51b3\u5b83\u4eec\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7576\u7d93\u6fdf\u51fa\u73fe\u554f\u984c\u6642\uff0c\u6211\u5011\u53ea\u662f\u81ea\u767c\u6027\u5730\u89e3\u6c7a\u5b83\u5011\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q12": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jemand bietet dir ein brandneues Investment an, das dir 'garantiert 15\uff05 Rendite pro Jahr ohne Risiko' bringt. Deine Reaktion?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone offers you a brand new investment that gives you a 'guaranteed 15\uff05 return per year with no risk'. Your reaction?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alguien le ofrece una nueva inversi\u00f3n que le ofrece un \"rendimiento garantizado del 15\uff05 anual sin riesgo\". \u00bfTu reacci\u00f3n?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu'un vous propose un tout nouvel investissement qui vous offre un \u00ab rendement garanti de 15 \uff05 par an sans risque \u00bb. Votre r\u00e9action ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0928\u090f \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0940 \u092a\u0947\u0936\u0915\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b '\u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u091c\u094b\u0916\u093f\u092e \u0915\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0937 15\uff05 \u0930\u093f\u091f\u0930\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u0917\u093e\u0930\u0902\u091f\u0940' \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualcuno ti offre un investimento nuovo di zecca che ti d\u00e0 un \"rendimento garantito del 15\uff05 annuo senza rischi\". La tua reazione?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u300c\u30ea\u30b9\u30af\u306a\u3057\u3067\u5e74\u9593 15\uff05 \u306e\u30ea\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u4fdd\u8a3c\u300d\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3063\u305f\u304f\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u6295\u8cc7\u3092\u63d0\u6848\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u53cd\u5fdc\u306f\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub204\uad70\uac00 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0\uac8c '\uc704\ud5d8 \uc5c6\uc774 \uc5f0\uac04 15\uff05 \uc218\uc775 \ubcf4\uc7a5'\uc744 \uc81c\uacf5\ud558\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud22c\uc790\ub97c \uc81c\uc548\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubc18\uc751\uc740?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iemand biedt u een gloednieuwe investering aan die u een 'gegarandeerd rendement van 15\uff05 per jaar zonder risico' oplevert. Jouw reactie?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kto\u015b oferuje Ci zupe\u0142nie now\u0105 inwestycj\u0119, kt\u00f3ra zapewni Ci \u201egwarantowany zwrot w wysoko\u015bci 15\uff05 rocznie bez ryzyka\u201d. Twoja reakcja?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algu\u00e9m lhe oferece um investimento totalmente novo que lhe d\u00e1 um \u201cretorno garantido de 15\uff05 ao ano, sem risco\u201d. Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0435 '\u0433\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0438\u0442 15\uff05 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0430'. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432\u0430 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birisi size 'hi\u00e7bir risk olmadan y\u0131lda \uff0515 garantili getiri' sa\u011flayacak yepyeni bir yat\u0131r\u0131m teklif ediyor. Tepkiniz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u4eba\u5411\u4f60\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e00\u4e2a\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u6295\u8d44\uff0c\u2018\u4fdd\u8bc1\u6bcf\u5e74\u65e0\u98ce\u9669\u6536\u76ca15\uff05\u2019\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u5e94\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u4eba\u5411\u60a8\u63d0\u4f9b\u4e00\u9805\u5168\u65b0\u7684\u6295\u8cc7\uff0c\u300c\u4fdd\u8b49\u6bcf\u5e74 15\uff05 \u7684\u56de\u5831\uff0c\u7121\u98a8\u96aa\u300d\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u61c9\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q12.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich stecke sofort einen gro\u00dfen Teil meines Geldes rein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I put a lot of my money into it straight away."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puse mucho de mi dinero en ello de inmediato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J\u2019y ai mis beaucoup d\u2019argent tout de suite."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092a\u0948\u0938\u093e \u0907\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0932\u0917\u093e \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ci ho messo subito molti soldi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3059\u3050\u306b\u5927\u91d1\u3092\u6ce8\u304e\u8fbc\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc989\uc2dc \ub9ce\uc740 \ub3c8\uc744 \ud22c\uc790\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik heb er meteen een groot deel van mijn geld in gestoken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Od razu w\u0142o\u017cy\u0142em w to mn\u00f3stwo pieni\u0119dzy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coloquei muito do meu dinheiro nisso imediatamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0432\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0443 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0443\u044e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u0435\u0433."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Param\u0131n b\u00fcy\u00fck bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 hemen yat\u0131rd\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u6295\u5165\u6211\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u7684\u94b1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u6295\u5165\u4e86\u5f88\u591a\u9322\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q12.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich investiere eine kleine Summe, um zu testen, ob es funktioniert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I invest a small sum to test whether it works."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invierto una peque\u00f1a suma para probar si funciona."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'investis une petite somme pour tester si \u00e7a marche."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092f\u0939 \u091c\u093e\u0902\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u091b\u094b\u091f\u0940 \u0930\u093e\u0936\u093f \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Investo una piccola somma per testare se funziona."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3046\u307e\u304f\u3044\u304f\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3092\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u5c11\u984d\u3092\u6295\u8cc7\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \uc791\ub3d9\ud558\ub294\uc9c0 \ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b8\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uc18c\uc561\uc744 \ud22c\uc790\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik investeer een klein bedrag om te testen of het werkt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inwestuj\u0119 niewielk\u0105 kwot\u0119, aby sprawdzi\u0107, czy to dzia\u0142a."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu invisto uma pequena quantia para testar se funciona."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043d\u0435\u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0443\u044e \u0441\u0443\u043c\u043c\u0443, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044c, \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0438 \u044d\u0442\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130\u015fe yaray\u0131p yaramad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 test etmek i\u00e7in k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck bir miktar yat\u0131r\u0131m yap\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6295\u8d44\u4e00\u5c0f\u7b14\u94b1\u6765\u6d4b\u8bd5\u662f\u5426\u6709\u6548\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6295\u5165\u4e86\u4e00\u5c0f\u7b46\u8cc7\u91d1\u4f86\u6e2c\u8a66\u5b83\u662f\u5426\u6709\u6548\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q12.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lehne sofort ab. Rendite ohne Risiko existiert nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I refuse immediately. There is no return without risk."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me niego inmediatamente. No hay retorno sin riesgo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je refuse imm\u00e9diatement. Il n'y a pas de retour sans risque."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0928\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e. \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u091c\u094b\u0916\u093f\u092e \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0935\u093e\u092a\u0938\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi rifiuto immediatamente. Non esiste rendimento senza rischio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3059\u3050\u306b\u62d2\u5426\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30ea\u30b9\u30af\u306a\u304f\u3057\u3066\u30ea\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u306a\u3057\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc989\uc2dc \uac70\uc808\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc704\ud5d8 \uc5c6\uc774\ub294 \uc218\uc775\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik weiger onmiddellijk. Er is geen rendement zonder risico."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odmawiam natychmiast. Bez ryzyka nie ma powrotu."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu recuso imediatamente. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 retorno sem risco."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c. \u0414\u043e\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0430 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0440\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u0435\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen reddediyorum. Risk olmadan geri d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f olmaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u62d2\u7edd\u3002\u6ca1\u6709\u98ce\u9669\u5c31\u6ca1\u6709\u56de\u62a5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u62d2\u7d55\u3002\u6c92\u6709\u98a8\u96aa\u5c31\u6c92\u6709\u56de\u5831\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q12.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bitte um Bedenkzeit, mache aber aus Angst vor Betrug am Ende nichts."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I ask for time to think about it, but in the end I don't do anything for fear of fraud."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pido tiempo para pensarlo, pero al final no hago nada por miedo al fraude."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je demande du temps pour r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir, mais au final je ne fais rien par peur de fraude."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0927\u094b\u0916\u093e\u0927\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0921\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chiedo tempo per pensarci, ma alla fine non faccio nulla per paura di truffe."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8003\u3048\u308b\u6642\u9593\u3092\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u7d50\u5c40\u306f\u8a50\u6b3a\u3092\u6050\u308c\u3066\u4f55\u3082\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0dd\uac01\ud560 \uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \ub2ec\ub77c\uace0 \ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uacb0\uad6d \uc0ac\uae30\uac00 \ub450\ub824\uc6cc \uc544\ubb34 \uac83\ub3c4 \ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik vraag tijd om erover na te denken, maar uiteindelijk doe ik niets uit angst voor fraude."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prosz\u0119 o czas do namys\u0142u, ale ostatecznie nic nie robi\u0119 z obawy przed oszustwem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pe\u00e7o um tempo para pensar, mas no final n\u00e3o fa\u00e7o nada por medo de fraude."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0443 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0443\u043c\u044c\u044f, \u043d\u043e \u0438\u0437 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0445\u0430 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u043e\u0431\u043c\u0430\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432 \u0438\u0442\u043e\u0433\u0435 \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnmek i\u00e7in zaman istiyorum ama sonunda doland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131l\u0131k korkusuyla hi\u00e7bir \u015fey yapm\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8bf7\u6c42\u4e00\u4e9b\u8003\u8651\u65f6\u95f4\uff0c\u4f46\u51fa\u4e8e\u5bf9\u6b3a\u8bc8\u7684\u6050\u60e7\u6700\u7ec8\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e5f\u4e0d\u505a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8acb\u6c42\u6642\u9593\u8003\u616e\u4e00\u4e0b\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u7d42\u6211\u6c92\u6709\u63a1\u53d6\u4efb\u4f55\u884c\u52d5\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u64d4\u5fc3\u88ab\u9a19\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q13": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast 2.000\u20ac Kreditkartenschulden (12\uff05 Zinsen) und gleichzeitig 2.000\u20ac auf dem Sparbuch (2\uff05 Zinsen). Was tust du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have \u20ac2,000 in credit card debt (12\uff05 interest) and at the same time \u20ac2,000 in your savings account (2\uff05 interest). What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tienes 2.000\u20ac de deuda en tu tarjeta de cr\u00e9dito (12\uff05 de inter\u00e9s) y al mismo tiempo 2.000\u20ac en tu cuenta de ahorros (2\uff05 de inter\u00e9s). \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez 2 000 \u20ac de dettes de carte de cr\u00e9dit (int\u00e9r\u00eat 12 \uff05) et en m\u00eame temps 2 000 \u20ac sur votre compte \u00e9pargne (int\u00e9r\u00eat 2 \uff05). Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0921\u093f\u091f \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u090b\u0923 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u20ac2,000 (12\uff05 \u092c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u091c) \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0939\u0940 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u20ac2,000 (2\uff05 \u092c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u091c) \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai 2.000 \u20ac di debito sulla tua carta di credito (12\uff05 di interesse) e allo stesso tempo 2.000 \u20ac sul tuo conto di risparmio (2\uff05 di interesse). Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u30af\u30ec\u30b8\u30c3\u30c8 \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u501f\u91d1 (\u5229\u606f 12\uff05) \u304c 2,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3042\u308a\u3001\u540c\u6642\u306b\u666e\u901a\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u306b\u3082 2,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed (\u5229\u606f 2\uff05) \u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc2e0\uc6a9\uce74\ub4dc \ube5a\uc774 \u20ac2,000(\uc774\uc790 12\uff05)\uc774\uace0 \ub3d9\uc2dc\uc5d0 \uc800\ucd95 \uacc4\uc88c\uc5d0 \u20ac2,000(\uc774\uc790 2\uff05)\uac00 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U heeft \u20ac 2.000,- aan creditcardschuld (12\uff05 rente) en tegelijkertijd \u20ac 2.000,- op uw spaarrekening (2\uff05 rente). Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masz 2000 euro zad\u0142u\u017cenia na karcie kredytowej (12\uff05 odsetek) i jednocze\u015bnie 2000 euro na koncie oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowym (2\uff05 odsetek). Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tem 2.000\u20ac em d\u00edvidas de cart\u00e3o de cr\u00e9dito (juros de 12\uff05) e ao mesmo tempo 2.000\u20ac na sua conta poupan\u00e7a (juros de 2\uff05). O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f 2.000\u20ac \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0433\u043e\u0432 \u043f\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043a\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0435 (12\uff05 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445) \u0438 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e 2.000\u20ac \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0435 (2\uff05 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445). \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kredi kart\u0131 borcunuzda 2.000 \u20ac (%12 faiz) ve ayn\u0131 zamanda tasarruf hesab\u0131n\u0131zda 2.000 \u20ac (%2 faiz) var. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u67092000\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u4fe1\u7528\u5361\u503a\u52a1\uff08\u5229\u606f12\uff05\uff09\uff0c\u540c\u65f6\u5728\u50a8\u84c4\u8d26\u6237\u4e0a\u67092000\u6b27\u5143\uff08\u5229\u606f2\uff05\uff09\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u4fe1\u7528\u5361\u50b5\u52d9\u70ba 2,000 \u6b50\u5143\uff08\u5229\u606f\u70ba 12\uff05\uff09\uff0c\u540c\u6642\u60a8\u7684\u5132\u84c4\u5e33\u6236\u4e2d\u6709 2,000 \u6b50\u5143\uff08\u5229\u606f\u70ba 2\uff05\uff09\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q13.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich tilge die Schulden sofort mit dem Sparbuch auf 0."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pay off the debt immediately with the savings account to 0."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago la deuda inmediatamente con la cuenta de ahorros a 0."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je rembourse la dette imm\u00e9diatement avec le compte \u00e9pargne \u00e0 0."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0915\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 0 \u0915\u093e \u0915\u0930\u094d\u091c \u091a\u0941\u0915\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saldo subito il debito con il conto di risparmio a 0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3059\u3050\u306b\u666e\u901a\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u501f\u91d1\u30920\u5186\u306b\u8fd4\u6e08\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc800\ucd95\uacc4\uc88c\ub97c 0\uc73c\ub85c \ud558\uc5ec \uc989\uc2dc \ube5a\uc744 \uac1a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik betaal de schuld direct af met de spaarrekening naar 0."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u0142ug sp\u0142acam natychmiast z konta oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowego na 0."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago a d\u00edvida imediatamente com a poupan\u00e7a a 0."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0433\u0430\u0448\u0443 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0433\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u043c\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0441 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0449\u044c\u044e \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u043a\u043d\u0438\u0436\u043a\u0438 \u0434\u043e 0."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tasarruf hesab\u0131n\u0131n 0'a olan borcunu hemen kapat\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u7528\u50a8\u84c4\u5b58\u6298\u628a\u503a\u52a1\u6e05\u96f6\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u7528\u6211\u7684\u5132\u84c4\u5e33\u6236\u628a\u50b5\u52d9\u9084\u6e05\u52300\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q13.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich zahle in Raten ab, um die emotionale Sicherheit des Sparbuchs nicht zu verlieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I pay off in installments so as not to lose the emotional security of the savings account."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago a plazos para no perder la seguridad emocional de la cuenta de ahorro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je rembourse en plusieurs fois pour ne pas perdre la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 \u00e9motionnelle du compte d'\u00e9pargne."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0924\u093e\u0915\u093f \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935\u0928\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0938\u0941\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e \u0928 \u0916\u094b\u090a\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago a rate per non perdere la sicurezza emotiva del conto di risparmio."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u666e\u901a\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u306e\u7cbe\u795e\u7684\u306a\u5b89\u5168\u3092\u5931\u308f\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u5206\u5272\u3067\u8fd4\u6e08\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc801\uae08\uc758 \uc815\uc11c\uc801 \uc548\uc815\uac10\uc744 \uc783\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub3c4\ub85d \ubd84\ud560 \uc0c1\ud658\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik betaal in termijnen af \u200b\u200bom de emotionele veiligheid van de spaarrekening niet te verliezen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sp\u0142acam w ratach, \u017ceby nie straci\u0107 bezpiecze\u0144stwa emocjonalnego konta oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowego."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago parcelado para n\u00e3o perder a seguran\u00e7a emocional da poupan\u00e7a."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044f\u043c\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u0442\u044c \u044d\u043c\u043e\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0431\u0435\u0437\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u043a\u043d\u0438\u0436\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tasarruf hesab\u0131n\u0131n duygusal g\u00fcvenli\u011fini kaybetmemek i\u00e7in taksitle \u00f6deme yap\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5206\u671f\u4ed8\u6b3e\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u5931\u53bb\u5b58\u6298\u7684\u60c5\u611f\u5b89\u5168\u611f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5206\u671f\u9084\u6b3e\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u5931\u53bb\u5132\u84c4\u5e33\u6236\u7684\u60c5\u7dd2\u4fdd\u969c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q13.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich investiere das Sparbuch in risikoreiche Aktien, um die Kreditzinsen zu schlagen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I invest the savings account in high-risk stocks to beat the loan interest rates."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invierto la cuenta de ahorros en acciones de alto riesgo para superar las tasas de inter\u00e9s del pr\u00e9stamo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'investis le compte d'\u00e9pargne dans des actions \u00e0 haut risque pour battre les taux d'int\u00e9r\u00eat des pr\u00eats."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090b\u0923 \u0915\u0940 \u092c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u091c \u0926\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092e\u093e\u0924 \u0926\u0947\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0916\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0915\u094b \u0909\u091a\u094d\u091a \u091c\u094b\u0916\u093f\u092e \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0947 \u0936\u0947\u092f\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Investo il conto di risparmio in azioni ad alto rischio per battere i tassi di interesse del prestito."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30ed\u30fc\u30f3\u91d1\u5229\u306b\u52dd\u3064\u305f\u3081\u306b\u666e\u901a\u9810\u91d1\u53e3\u5ea7\u3092\u9ad8\u30ea\u30b9\u30af\u682a\u306b\u6295\u8cc7\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub300\ucd9c\uae08\ub9ac\ub97c \uc774\uae30\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uc800\ucd95\uacc4\uc88c\ub97c \uace0\uc704\ud5d8\uc8fc\uc5d0 \ud22c\uc790\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik beleg de spaarrekening in aandelen met een hoog risico om de rente op leningen te verslaan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inwestuj\u0119 konto oszcz\u0119dno\u015bciowe w akcje wysokiego ryzyka, aby pokona\u0107 stopy procentowe kredyt\u00f3w."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu invisto a conta poupan\u00e7a em a\u00e7\u00f5es de alto risco para vencer as taxas de juros dos empr\u00e9stimos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0441\u0431\u0435\u0440\u043a\u043d\u0438\u0436\u043a\u0443 \u0432 \u0440\u0438\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043e\u0431\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kredi faiz oranlar\u0131n\u0131 a\u015fmak i\u00e7in tasarruf hesab\u0131m\u0131 y\u00fcksek riskli hisse senetlerine yat\u0131r\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u628a\u50a8\u84c4\u5b58\u6298\u6295\u8d44\u4e8e\u9ad8\u98ce\u9669\u80a1\u7968\uff0c\u4ee5\u6218\u80dc\u8d37\u6b3e\u5229\u606f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c07\u5132\u84c4\u5e33\u6236\u6295\u8cc7\u65bc\u9ad8\u98a8\u96aa\u80a1\u7968\uff0c\u4ee5\u4f4e\u65bc\u8cb8\u6b3e\u5229\u7387\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q13.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich zahle nur die Mindestrate ab und ignoriere die Zinsen komplett."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I only pay off the minimum installment and ignore the interest completely."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo pago la cuota m\u00ednima e ignoro por completo los intereses."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne paie que le versement minimum et ignore compl\u00e8tement les int\u00e9r\u00eats."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u0915\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u093e \u092d\u0941\u0917\u0924\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u091c \u0915\u094b \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0928\u091c\u0930\u0905\u0902\u0926\u093e\u091c \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago solo la rata minima e ignoro completamente gli interessi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u4f4e\u8fd4\u6e08\u984d\u306e\u307f\u3092\u8fd4\u6e08\u3057\u3001\u5229\u606f\u306f\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u7121\u8996\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ucd5c\uc18c\ud560\ubd80\uae08\ub9cc \uac1a\uace0 \uc774\uc790\ub294 \uc544\uc608 \ubb34\uc2dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik betaal alleen de minimale termijn af en negeer de rente volledig."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sp\u0142acam tylko minimaln\u0105 rat\u0119 i ca\u0142kowicie ignoruj\u0119 odsetki."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pago apenas a parcela m\u00ednima e ignoro completamente os juros."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u0437\u043d\u043e\u0441 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sadece asgari taksiti \u00f6d\u00fcyorum ve faizi tamamen g\u00f6z ard\u0131 ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u652f\u4ed8\u6700\u4f4e\u8fd8\u6b3e\u989d\uff0c\u5b8c\u5168\u5ffd\u7565\u5229\u606f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u9084\u6e05\u6700\u4f4e\u5206\u671f\u4ed8\u6b3e\uff0c\u5b8c\u5168\u5ffd\u7565\u5229\u606f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q14": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie viel Geld gibst du in einer durchschnittlichen Woche unsichtbar f\u00fcr Kaffee to go, kleine Snacks oder Energydrinks aus?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much money do you spend invisibly on coffee to go, small snacks or energy drinks in an average week?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00bfCu\u00e1nto dinero gastas de forma invisible en caf\u00e9 para llevar, peque\u00f1os snacks o bebidas energ\u00e9ticas en una semana normal?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien d'argent d\u00e9pensez-vous de mani\u00e8re invisible en caf\u00e9 \u00e0 emporter, en petites collations ou en boissons \u00e9nergisantes au cours d'une semaine moyenne\u00a0?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u090f\u0915 \u0914\u0938\u0924 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u0949\u092b\u0940, \u091b\u094b\u091f\u0947-\u092e\u094b\u091f\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0928\u0948\u0915\u094d\u0938 \u092f\u093e \u090f\u0928\u0930\u094d\u091c\u0940 \u0921\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0902\u0915 \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0926\u0943\u0936\u094d\u092f \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u092a\u0948\u0938\u093e \u0916\u0930\u094d\u091a \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quanti soldi spendi invisibilmente in caff\u00e8 da asporto, piccoli snack o bevande energetiche in una settimana media?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u3001\u5e73\u5747\u3057\u3066 1 \u9031\u9593\u306b\u3001\u6301\u3061\u5e30\u308a\u7528\u306e\u30b3\u30fc\u30d2\u30fc\u3001\u8efd\u98df\u3001\u30a8\u30ca\u30b8\u30fc\u30c9\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u306a\u3069\u306b\u3001\u76ee\u306b\u898b\u3048\u306a\u3044\u91d1\u984d\u3092\u3069\u308c\u304f\u3089\u3044\u8cbb\u3084\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud3c9\uade0 \uc77c\uc8fc\uc77c \ub3d9\uc548 \ud14c\uc774\ud06c\uc544\uc6c3 \ucee4\ud53c, \uac04\ub2e8\ud55c \uc2a4\ub0b5 \ub610\ub294 \uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0 \uc74c\ub8cc\uc5d0 \ub208\uc5d0 \ubcf4\uc774\uc9c0 \uc54a\uac8c \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ub9ce\uc740 \ub3c8\uc744 \uc9c0\ucd9c\ud569\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoeveel geld geef jij gemiddeld per week onzichtbaar uit aan koffie to go, kleine snacks of energiedrankjes?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ile pieni\u0119dzy w przeci\u0119tnym tygodniu wydajesz niewidocznie na kaw\u0119 na wynos, drobne przek\u0105ski czy napoje energetyczne?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quanto dinheiro voc\u00ea gasta invisivelmente em caf\u00e9 para viagem, pequenos lanches ou bebidas energ\u00e9ticas em uma semana normal?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043d\u0435\u0433 \u0432\u044b \u043d\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0438\u043c\u043e \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0444\u0435 \u0441 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0439, \u043d\u0435\u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0443\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442\u043a\u0438 \u0432 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u043c \u0437\u0430 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044e?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ortalama bir haftada paket kahveye, k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck at\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmal\u0131klara veya enerji i\u00e7eceklerine g\u00f6r\u00fcnmez bir \u015fekilde ne kadar para harc\u0131yorsunuz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5728\u4e00\u5468\u4e2d\u5e73\u5747\u4f1a\u65e0\u5f62\u4e2d\u82b1\u591a\u5c11\u94b1\u5728\u5916\u5e26\u5496\u5561\u3001\u5c0f\u96f6\u98df\u6216\u80fd\u91cf\u996e\u6599\u4e0a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5e73\u5747\u6bcf\u9031\u5728\u5916\u5e36\u5496\u5561\u3001\u5c0f\u9ede\u5fc3\u6216\u80fd\u91cf\u98f2\u6599\u4e0a\u7121\u5f62\u5730\u82b1\u4e86\u591a\u5c11\u9322\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q14.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine Ahnung. Ich tippe einfach die Karte an und denke nicht dr\u00fcber nach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No idea. I just tap the card and don't think about it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni idea. Simplemente toco la tarjeta y no pienso en ello."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune id\u00e9e. Je tape simplement la carte et n'y pense pas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0938 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u091f\u0948\u092a \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nessuna idea. Tocco semplicemente la carta e non ci penso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4f55\u3082\u8003\u3048\u305a\u306b\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u30bf\u30c3\u30d7\u3059\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubaa8\ub974\uaca0\uc5b4\uc694. \uadf8\ub0e5 \uce74\ub4dc\ub9cc \ud0ed\ud558\uace0 \uc544\ubb34 \uc0dd\uac01\ub3c4 \uc548 \ud574\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geen idee. Ik tik gewoon op de kaart en denk er niet over na."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie mam poj\u0119cia. Po prostu dotykam karty i nie my\u015bl\u0119 o tym."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e3o fa\u00e7o ideia. Eu apenas toco no cart\u00e3o e n\u00e3o penso nisso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0411\u0435\u0437 \u043f\u043e\u043d\u044f\u0442\u0438\u044f. \u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0436\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0443 \u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7bir fikrim yok. Sadece karta dokunuyorum ve bunu d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnm\u00fcyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u968f\u4fbf\u5237\u4e00\u4e0b\u5361\uff0c\u4e0d\u53bb\u60f3\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u8f15\u62cd\u5361\u7247\uff0c\u6c92\u6709\u591a\u60f3\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q14.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bestimmt 30-50\u20ac. Das ist mein Luxus, den ich mir bewusst g\u00f6nne."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Definitely 30-50\u20ac. This is my luxury that I consciously allow myself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Definitivamente 30-50\u20ac. Este es mi lujo que me permito conscientemente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certainement 30-50\u20ac. C\u2019est mon luxe que je me permets consciemment."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0928\u093f\u0936\u094d\u091a\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 30-50\u20ac. \u092f\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0935\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u091a\u0947\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0905\u0928\u0941\u092e\u0924\u093f \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sicuramente 30-50\u20ac. Questo \u00e8 il mio lusso che mi concedo consapevolmente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306a\u304f30\u301c50\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u308c\u306f\u79c1\u304c\u610f\u8b58\u7684\u306b\u81ea\u5206\u306b\u8a31\u53ef\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u79c1\u306e\u8d05\u6ca2\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud655\uc2e4\ud788 30-50\u20ac\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc774\uac83\uc740 \ub0b4\uac00 \uc758\uc2dd\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ud5c8\uc6a9\ud558\ub294 \ub098\uc758 \uc0ac\uce58\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeker 30-50 \u20ac. Dit is mijn luxe die ik mezelf bewust gun."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zdecydowanie 30-50 \u20ac. To m\u00f3j luksus, na kt\u00f3ry \u015bwiadomie sobie pozwalam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Definitivamente 30-50\u20ac. Este \u00e9 o meu luxo que me permito conscientemente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041e\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0451\u043d\u043d\u043e 30-50\u20ac. \u042d\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043e\u044f \u0440\u043e\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0448\u044c, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0443\u044e \u044f \u043e\u0441\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044f\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kesinlikle 30-50\u20ac. Bu benim bilin\u00e7li olarak kendime izin verdi\u011fim l\u00fcks\u00fcm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5927\u7ea630-50\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u8fd9\u662f\u6211\u6709\u610f\u8bc6\u5730\u4eab\u53d7\u7684\u5962\u4f88\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u80af\u5b9a\u662f30-50\u6b50\u5143\u3002\u9019\u662f\u6211\u6709\u610f\u8b58\u5730\u5141\u8a31\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u5962\u4f88\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q14.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unter 10\u20ac. Ich bereite mir das meiste gezielt zu Hause vor."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Under 10\u20ac. I prepare most of it at home."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos de 10\u20ac. La mayor parte lo preparo en casa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moins de 10\u20ac. J'en pr\u00e9pare la plupart \u00e0 la maison."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10\u20ac \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e. \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0902\u0936 \u092d\u093e\u0917 \u0918\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u0939\u0940 \u0924\u0948\u092f\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sotto i 10\u20ac. La maggior parte la preparo a casa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u672a\u6e80\u3002\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u3092\u81ea\u5b85\u3067\u6e96\u5099\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10\u20ac \ubbf8\ub9cc. \ub300\ubd80\ubd84 \uc9d1\uc5d0\uc11c \uc900\ube44\ud574\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onder de 10\u20ac. Het meeste bereid ik thuis."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poni\u017cej 10 \u20ac. Wi\u0119kszo\u015b\u0107 z nich przygotowuj\u0119 w domu."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menos de 10\u20ac. Eu preparo a maior parte em casa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435 10\u20ac. \u0411\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0443\u044e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c \u044f \u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432\u043b\u044e \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 \u20ac'nun alt\u0131nda. \u00c7o\u011funu evde haz\u0131rl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u523010\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u6211\u5927\u591a\u6570\u98df\u7269\u90fd\u662f\u5728\u5bb6\u7cbe\u5fc3\u51c6\u5907\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 \u6b50\u5143\u4ee5\u4e0b\u3002\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u90fd\u662f\u6211\u5728\u5bb6\u88e1\u6e96\u5099\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q14.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich versuche es st\u00e4ndig zu vermeiden, breche aber mehrmals die Woche ein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I try to avoid it all the time, but I cave in several times a week."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intento evitarlo todo el tiempo, pero cedo varias veces a la semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'essaie de l'\u00e9viter tout le temps, mais je c\u00e8de plusieurs fois par semaine."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0939\u0930 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0907\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0908 \u092c\u093e\u0930 \u091a\u0942\u0915 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerco sempre di evitarlo, ma cedo pi\u00f9 volte alla settimana."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3044\u3064\u3082\u305d\u308c\u3092\u907f\u3051\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u9031\u306b\u6570\u56de\u306f\u5931\u6557\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ud56d\uc0c1 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ud53c\ud558\ub824\uace0 \ub178\ub825\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc77c\uc8fc\uc77c\uc5d0 \uc5ec\ub7ec \ubc88 \ub3d9\uad74\uc5d0 \ube60\uc9c0\uac8c \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik probeer het de hele tijd te vermijden, maar ik bezwijk meerdere keren per week."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ca\u0142y czas staram si\u0119 tego unika\u0107, ale kilka razy w tygodniu ulegam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tento evitar isso o tempo todo, mas desisto v\u00e1rias vezes por semana."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0438\u0437\u0431\u0435\u0433\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u043d\u043e \u0441\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0437 \u0432 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her zaman bundan ka\u00e7\u0131nmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum ama haftada birka\u00e7 kez pes ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u76f4\u5c3d\u529b\u907f\u514d\uff0c\u4f46\u6bcf\u5468\u8fd8\u662f\u4f1a\u7834\u9632\u597d\u51e0\u6b21\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u76f4\u8a66\u5716\u907f\u514d\u5b83\uff0c\u4f46\u6bcf\u9031\u6211\u90fd\u6703\u5c48\u670d\u5e7e\u6b21\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q15": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du an 'viel Geld' denkst \u2013 welches dieser vier W\u00f6rter beschreibt dein wahres Ziel am besten?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you think of 'a lot of money' - which of these four words best describes your true goal?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando piensas en \"mucho dinero\", \u00bfcu\u00e1l de estas cuatro palabras describe mejor tu verdadero objetivo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lorsque vous pensez \u00e0 \u00ab beaucoup d\u2019argent \u00bb, lequel de ces quatre mots d\u00e9crit le mieux votre v\u00e9ritable objectif\u00a0?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u091c\u092c \u0906\u092a '\u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092a\u0948\u0938\u0947' \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 - \u0924\u094b \u0907\u0928 \u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0936\u092c\u094d\u0926\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u094c\u0928 \u0938\u093e \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935\u093f\u0915 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0915\u093e \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0923\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando pensi a \"un sacco di soldi\", quale di queste quattro parole descrive meglio il tuo vero obiettivo?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u300c\u591a\u984d\u306e\u304a\u91d1\u300d\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8003\u3048\u308b\u3068\u304d\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u672c\u5f53\u306e\u76ee\u6a19\u3092\u6700\u3082\u3088\u304f\u8868\u3059\u8a00\u8449\u306f\u6b21\u306e 4 \u3064\u306e\u3046\u3061\u3069\u308c\u3067\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'\ub9ce\uc740 \ub3c8'\uc744 \uc0dd\uac01\ud560 \ub54c, \ub2e4\uc74c \ub124 \ub2e8\uc5b4 \uc911 \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \uc9c4\uc815\ud55c \ubaa9\ud45c\ub97c \uac00\uc7a5 \uc798 \uc124\uba85\ud558\ub294 \ub2e8\uc5b4\ub294 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als u aan 'veel geld' denkt: welke van deze vier woorden beschrijft dan het beste uw ware doel?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kiedy my\u015blisz o \u201edu\u017co pieni\u0119dzy\u201d \u2013 kt\u00f3re z tych czterech s\u0142\u00f3w najlepiej opisuje Tw\u00f3j prawdziwy cel?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando voc\u00ea pensa em \u201cmuito dinheiro\u201d \u2013 qual destas quatro palavras melhor descreve seu verdadeiro objetivo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043e '\u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0433\u0430\u0445' \u2014 \u043a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0435 \u0438\u0437 \u044d\u0442\u0438\u0445 \u0447\u0435\u0442\u044b\u0440\u0451\u0445 \u0441\u043b\u043e\u0432 \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043e\u043f\u0438\u0441\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044e \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0449\u0443\u044e \u0446\u0435\u043b\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'\u00c7ok para'y\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnd\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fczde, bu d\u00f6rt kelimeden hangisi ger\u00e7ek hedefinizi en iyi \u015fekilde tan\u0131ml\u0131yor?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f53\u4f60\u60f3\u5230\u201c\u5f88\u591a\u94b1\u201d\u65f6\u2014\u2014\u8fd9\u56db\u4e2a\u8bcd\u4e2d\u54ea\u4e00\u4e2a\u6700\u80fd\u63cf\u8ff0\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5b9e\u76ee\u6807\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7576\u60a8\u60f3\u5230\u300c\u5f88\u591a\u9322\u300d\u6642\uff0c\u9019\u56db\u500b\u8a5e\u4e2d\u54ea\u4e00\u500b\u6700\u80fd\u63cf\u8ff0\u60a8\u7684\u771f\u6b63\u76ee\u6a19\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q15.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freiheit (Selbst bestimmen, wie ich meine Zeit verbringe)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freedom (deciding how I spend my time)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Libertad (decidir c\u00f3mo paso mi tiempo)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Libert\u00e9 (d\u00e9cider comment je passe mon temps)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u094d\u0935\u0924\u0902\u0924\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093e (\u092f\u0939 \u0924\u092f \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0924\u0940\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e)\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Libert\u00e0 (decidere come trascorrere il mio tempo)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u7531\uff08\u6642\u9593\u3092\u3069\u3046\u4f7f\u3046\u304b\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u308b\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc790\uc720(\uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \ubcf4\ub0bc\uc9c0 \uacb0\uc815)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vrijheid (beslissen hoe ik mijn tijd besteed)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wolno\u015b\u0107 (decydowanie o tym, jak sp\u0119dzam czas)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Liberdade (decidir como gasto meu tempo)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0432\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0434\u0430 (\u0441\u0430\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0436\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0451 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6zg\u00fcrl\u00fck (zaman\u0131m\u0131 nas\u0131l ge\u00e7irece\u011fime karar vermek)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u7531\uff08\u81ea\u5df1\u51b3\u5b9a\u5982\u4f55\u5ea6\u8fc7\u6211\u7684\u65f6\u95f4\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u7531\uff08\u6c7a\u5b9a\u6211\u5982\u4f55\u5ea6\u904e\u6642\u9593\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q15.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sicherheit (Nie wieder Angst vor Rechnungen haben)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Security (never be afraid of bills again)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seguridad (nunca m\u00e1s tengas miedo a las facturas)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S\u00e9curit\u00e9 (n'ayez plus jamais peur des factures)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u0941\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e (\u092c\u093f\u0932\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0928 \u0921\u0930\u0947\u0902)\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sicurezza (non aver mai pi\u00f9 paura delle bollette)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30bb\u30ad\u30e5\u30ea\u30c6\u30a3 (\u3082\u3046\u8acb\u6c42\u66f8\u3092\u6050\u308c\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093)\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubcf4\uc548(\ub2e4\uc2dc\ub294 \uccad\uad6c\uc11c\ub97c \ub450\ub824\uc6cc\ud558\uc9c0 \ub9c8\uc138\uc694)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veiligheid (wees nooit meer bang voor rekeningen)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bezpiecze\u0144stwo (nigdy wi\u0119cej nie b\u00f3j si\u0119 rachunk\u00f3w)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seguran\u00e7a (nunca mais tenha medo de contas)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0411\u0435\u0437\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c (\u0411\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u044f\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0441\u0447\u0435\u0442\u043e\u0432)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00fcvenlik (bir daha asla faturalardan korkmay\u0131n)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b89\u5168\uff08\u518d\u4e5f\u4e0d\u5fc5\u62c5\u5fc3\u8d26\u5355\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b89\u5168\uff08\u518d\u4e5f\u4e0d\u7528\u5bb3\u6015\u5e33\u55ae\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q15.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (Der Welt zeigen, dass ich zur Elite geh\u00f6re)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (Showing the world that I belong to the elite)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estado (Mostrar al mundo que pertenezco a la \u00e9lite)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Statut (Montrer au monde que j'appartiens \u00e0 l'\u00e9lite)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u094d\u0925\u093f\u0924\u093f (\u0926\u0941\u0928\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0917 \u0915\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901)\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (mostrare al mondo che appartengo all'\u00e9lite)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30bf\u30b9\uff08\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u30a8\u30ea\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u5c5e\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u793a\u3059\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0c1\ud0dc(\ub0b4\uac00 \uc5d8\ub9ac\ud2b8\uc5d0 \uc18d\ud574 \uc788\uc74c\uc744 \uc138\uc0c1\uc5d0 \ubcf4\uc5ec\uc90c)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (de wereld laten zien dat ik tot de elite behoor)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (Pokazanie \u015bwiatu, \u017ce nale\u017c\u0119 do elity)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status (Mostrar ao mundo que perten\u00e7o \u00e0 elite)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0443\u0441 (\u041f\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0443, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u044f \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0434\u043b\u0435\u0436\u0443 \u043a \u044d\u043b\u0438\u0442\u0435)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durum (D\u00fcnyaya se\u00e7kinlere ait oldu\u011fumu g\u00f6stermek)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5730\u4f4d\uff08\u5411\u4e16\u754c\u5c55\u793a\u6211\u5c5e\u4e8e\u7cbe\u82f1\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5730\u4f4d\uff08\u5411\u4e16\u754c\u8868\u660e\u6211\u5c6c\u65bc\u7cbe\u82f1\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.finance.q15.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Macht (Anderen die Regeln diktieren k\u00f6nnen)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Power (being able to dictate rules to others)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poder (poder dictar reglas a los dem\u00e1s)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pouvoir (\u00eatre capable de dicter des r\u00e8gles aux autres)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0936\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f (\u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u092e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0927\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0915\u094d\u0937\u092e \u0939\u094b\u0928\u093e)\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potere (essere in grado di dettare regole agli altri)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6a29\u529b\uff08\u4ed6\u4eba\u306b\u30eb\u30fc\u30eb\u3092\u6307\u793a\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3053\u3068\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uad8c\ub825(\ub2e4\ub978 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc5d0\uac8c \uaddc\uce59\uc744 \uc9c0\uc2dc\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc74c)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Macht (in staat zijn om regels aan anderen te dicteren)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u0142adza (mo\u017cliwo\u015b\u0107 dyktowania zasad innym)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poder (ser capaz de ditar regras aos outros)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c (\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u043c \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u0430)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00fc\u00e7 (kurallar\u0131 ba\u015fkalar\u0131na dikte edebilme)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6743\u529b\uff08\u80fd\u591f\u5bf9\u4ed6\u4eba\u5236\u5b9a\u89c4\u5219\uff09"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6b0a\u529b\uff08\u80fd\u5920\u5411\u4ed6\u4eba\u898f\u5b9a\u898f\u5247\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
