          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q1": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tag 1 deines neuen Plans lief perfekt. An Tag 2 regnet es, du bist extrem m\u00fcde und hast absolut null Motivation. Was tust du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Day 1 of your new plan went perfectly. On day 2 it's raining, you're extremely tired and have absolutely zero motivation. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El d\u00eda 1 de tu nuevo plan sali\u00f3 perfecto. El d\u00eda 2 llueve, est\u00e1s extremadamente cansado y no tienes ninguna motivaci\u00f3n. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier jour de votre nouveau plan s'est parfaitement d\u00e9roul\u00e9. Le deuxi\u00e8me jour, il pleut, vous \u00eates extr\u00eamement fatigu\u00e9 et n'avez absolument aucune motivation. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0928\u0908 \u092f\u094b\u091c\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u0922\u093c\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e\u0964 \u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0936 \u0939\u094b \u0930\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948, \u0906\u092a \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0925\u0915\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0930\u0923\u093e \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0936\u0942\u0928\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il primo giorno del tuo nuovo piano \u00e8 andato perfettamente. Il secondo giorno piove, sei estremamente stanco e hai assolutamente zero motivazione. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u8a08\u753b\u306e 1 \u65e5\u76ee\u306f\u5b8c\u74a7\u306b\u9032\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002 2\u65e5\u76ee\u306f\u96e8\u304c\u964d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\u6975\u5ea6\u306b\u75b2\u308c\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3084\u308b\u6c17\u304c\u307e\u3063\u305f\u304f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0c8 \uacc4\ud68d\uc758 \uccab \ubc88\uc9f8 \ub0a0\uc740 \uc644\ubcbd\ud558\uac8c \uc9c4\ud589\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub458\uc9f8 \ub0a0\uc5d0\ub294 \ube44\uac00 \uc640\uc11c \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \ud53c\uace4\ud558\uace0 \uc758\uc695\uc774 \uc804\ud600 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dag 1 van je nieuwe plan verliep perfect. Op dag 2 regent het, ben je extreem moe en heb je absoluut geen motivatie. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pierwszy dzie\u0144 nowego planu poszed\u0142 doskonale. Drugiego dnia pada deszcz, jeste\u015b bardzo zm\u0119czony i nie masz absolutnie \u017cadnej motywacji. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O primeiro dia do seu novo plano correu perfeitamente. No segundo dia est\u00e1 chovendo, voc\u00ea est\u00e1 extremamente cansado e sem motiva\u00e7\u00e3o. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0414\u0435\u043d\u044c 1 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0451\u043b \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e. \u041d\u0430 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c 2 \u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442 \u0434\u043e\u0436\u0434\u044c, \u0442\u044b \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b \u0438 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0430\u0431\u0441\u043e\u043b\u044e\u0442\u043d\u043e \u043d\u043e\u043b\u044c \u043c\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0438. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yeni plan\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n 1. g\u00fcn\u00fc m\u00fckemmel ge\u00e7ti. 2. g\u00fcnde ya\u011fmur ya\u011f\u0131yor, son derece yorgunsunuz ve motivasyonunuz kesinlikle s\u0131f\u0131r. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u65b0\u8ba1\u5212\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u5929\u8fdb\u884c\u5f97\u5f88\u5b8c\u7f8e\u3002\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u5374\u4e0b\u96e8\uff0c\u4f60\u975e\u5e38\u75b2\u60eb\uff0c\u5b8c\u5168\u6ca1\u6709\u52a8\u529b\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u65b0\u8a08\u756b\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u5929\u9032\u884c\u5f97\u5f88\u9806\u5229\u3002\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u4e0b\u8457\u96e8\uff0c\u4f60\u975e\u5e38\u75b2\u5026\uff0c\u52d5\u529b\u5b8c\u5168\u70ba\u96f6\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q1.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich pausiere heute. Auf den K\u00f6rper zu h\u00f6ren ist auch wichtig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm taking a break today. Listening to your body is also important."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoy me tomo un descanso. Escuchar a tu cuerpo tambi\u00e9n es importante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je fais une pause aujourd'hui. \u00catre \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9coute de son corps est \u00e9galement important."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0906\u091c \u091b\u0941\u091f\u094d\u091f\u0940 \u0932\u0947 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0936\u0930\u0940\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u0941\u0928\u0928\u093e \u092d\u0940 \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi prendo una pausa oggi. Anche ascoltare il proprio corpo \u00e8 importante."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u4f11\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u4f53\u306e\u58f0\u3092\u805e\u304f\u3053\u3068\u3082\u5927\u5207\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ub298\uc740 \uc26c\uc5b4\uc694. \ubab8\uc758 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub97c \ub4e3\ub294 \uac83\ub3c4 \uc911\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik neem vandaag een pauze. Luisteren naar je lichaam is ook belangrijk."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dzi\u015b robi\u0119 sobie przerw\u0119. Wa\u017cne jest r\u00f3wnie\u017c s\u0142uchanie swojego cia\u0142a."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou fazendo uma pausa hoje. Ouvir seu corpo tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 importante."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e \u043f\u0430\u0443\u0437\u0443. \u0421\u043b\u0443\u0448\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0442\u0435\u043b\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0436\u0435 \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bug\u00fcn biraz ara veriyorum. V\u00fccudunuzu dinlemek de \u00f6nemlidir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u4f11\u606f\u3002\u542c\u4ece\u8eab\u4f53\u7684\u58f0\u97f3\u4e5f\u5f88\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u4f11\u606f\u4e00\u4e0b\u3002\u50be\u807d\u8eab\u9ad4\u7684\u8072\u97f3\u4e5f\u5f88\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q1.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich warte ein paar Stunden, ob die Motivation noch kommt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll wait a few hours to see if the motivation still comes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esperar\u00e9 unas horas para ver si la motivaci\u00f3n a\u00fan llega."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais attendre quelques heures pour voir si la motivation vient toujours."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0907\u0902\u0924\u091c\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e \u0915\u093f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0930\u0923\u093e \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u0906\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aspetter\u00f2 qualche ora per vedere se la motivazione arriva ancora."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e2\u30c1\u30d9\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u304c\u307e\u3060\u4e0a\u304c\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u6570\u6642\u9593\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc758\uc695\uc774 \uc5ec\uc804\ud788 \ub098\uc624\ub294\uc9c0 \uba87 \uc2dc\uac04 \uc815\ub3c4 \uae30\ub2e4\ub824 \ubcf4\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik wacht een paar uur om te zien of de motivatie nog steeds komt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poczekam kilka godzin, \u017ceby zobaczy\u0107, czy motywacja nadal przyjdzie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou esperar algumas horas para ver se a motiva\u00e7\u00e3o ainda surge."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0443 \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432, \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044e, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Motivasyonun hala gelip gelmedi\u011fini g\u00f6rmek i\u00e7in birka\u00e7 saat bekleyece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7b49\u51e0\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\uff0c\u770b\u770b\u52a8\u529b\u662f\u5426\u8fd8\u4f1a\u6765\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7b49\u5e7e\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\uff0c\u770b\u770b\u52d5\u529b\u662f\u5426\u4ecd\u7136\u5b58\u5728\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q1.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verhandle mit mir selbst: 'Nur 5 Minuten anfangen', ziehe es dann aber oft durch."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I negotiate with myself: 'Just start for 5 minutes', but then I often follow through."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Negocio conmigo mismo: \"S\u00f3lo empiezo por 5 minutos\", pero luego a menudo sigo hasta el final."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je n\u00e9gocie avec moi-m\u00eame : \u00ab\u00a0Commencez juste pendant 5 minutes\u00a0\u00bb, mais ensuite je vais souvent jusqu'au bout."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0924\u091a\u0940\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902: '\u092c\u0938 5 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0941\u0906\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902', \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u0915\u094d\u0938\u0930 \u0909\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u092e\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Negozio con me stesso: \"Inizia solo per 5 minuti\", ma poi spesso vado avanti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u300c5\u5206\u3060\u3051\u59cb\u3081\u3066\u300d\u3068\u81ea\u5206\u306b\u8a00\u3044\u805e\u304b\u305b\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5f8c\u306f\u3084\u308a\u9042\u3052\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u591a\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'5\ubd84\ub9cc \uc2dc\uc791\ud574 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694'\ub77c\uace0 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \ud611\uc0c1\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc, \uadf8\ub7ec\ub2e4\uac00 \ub05d\uae4c\uc9c0 \ub530\ub77c\uac00\ub294 \uacbd\uc6b0\uac00 \ub9ce\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik onderhandel met mezelf: \u2018Begin maar 5 minuten\u2019, maar dan ga ik vaak door."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Negocjuj\u0119 ze sob\u0105: \u201eZacznij od 5 minut\u201d, ale potem cz\u0119sto dotrzymuj\u0119 s\u0142owa."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu negocio comigo mesmo: 'Comece por 5 minutos', mas depois muitas vezes sigo em frente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0432\u0435\u0434\u0443 \u0441 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044b: \u00ab\u0422\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 5 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442\u00bb, \u043d\u043e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0436\u0443 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u043e \u0434\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendimle pazarl\u0131k yap\u0131yorum: 'Sadece 5 dakikal\u0131\u011f\u0131na ba\u015fla', ama sonra \u00e7o\u011fu zaman sonuna kadar devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e0e\u81ea\u5df1\u8c08\u5224\uff1a\u2018\u53ea\u5f00\u59cb\u4e94\u5206\u949f\u2019\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u7ecf\u5e38\u6700\u7ec8\u575a\u6301\u4e0b\u53bb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8207\u81ea\u5df1\u5354\u5546\uff1a\u201c\u53ea\u958b\u59cb 5 \u5206\u9418\u201d\uff0c\u4f46\u96a8\u5f8c\u6211\u7d93\u5e38\u5805\u6301\u5230\u5e95\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q1.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schalte das Gehirn komplett ab und f\u00fchre die Aufgabe emotionslos wie eine Maschine aus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I switch off my brain completely and carry out the task emotionlessly like a machine."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apago mi cerebro por completo y realizo la tarea sin emociones, como una m\u00e1quina."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'\u00e9teins compl\u00e8tement mon cerveau et j'ex\u00e9cute la t\u00e2che sans \u00e9motion, comme une machine."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0926\u093f\u092e\u093e\u0917 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092e\u0936\u0940\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u092d\u093e\u0935\u0928\u093e\u0939\u0940\u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0915\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spengo completamente il cervello ed eseguo il compito senza emozioni, come una macchina."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u8133\u306e\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u3092\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u30aa\u30d5\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3001\u6a5f\u68b0\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u7121\u611f\u60c5\u306b\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u5b9f\u884c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub1cc\ub97c \uc644\uc804\ud788 \ub044\uace0 \uae30\uacc4\ucc98\ub7fc \uac10\uc815 \uc5c6\uc774 \uc77c\uc744 \uc218\ud589\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik schakel mijn hersenen volledig uit en voer de taak emotieloos uit als een machine."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wy\u0142\u0105czam ca\u0142kowicie m\u00f3zg i wykonuj\u0119 zadanie bez emocji jak maszyna."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desligo meu c\u00e9rebro completamente e executo a tarefa sem emo\u00e7\u00e3o, como uma m\u00e1quina."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0432\u044b\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0430\u044e \u043c\u043e\u0437\u0433 \u0438 \u0432\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u044f\u044e \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u044d\u043c\u043e\u0446\u0438\u0439, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043c\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043d\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beynimi tamamen kapat\u0131yorum ve g\u00f6revi bir makine gibi duygusuz bir \u015fekilde yerine getiriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u5173\u95ed\u5927\u8111\uff0c\u50cf\u673a\u5668\u4e00\u6837\u65e0\u60c5\u5730\u5b8c\u6210\u4efb\u52a1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u95dc\u9589\u5927\u8166\uff0c\u50cf\u6a5f\u5668\u4e00\u6a23\u6beb\u7121\u611f\u60c5\u5730\u57f7\u884c\u4efb\u52d9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q2": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast eine massive, komplexe Aufgabe vor dir, die diese Woche fertig werden muss. Du setzt dich an den Schreibtisch. Was ist deine allererste Handlung?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have a massive, complex task ahead of you that needs to be completed this week. You sit down at the desk. What is your very first action?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiene una tarea enorme y compleja por delante que debe completarse esta semana. Te sientas en el escritorio. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es tu primera acci\u00f3n?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez une t\u00e2che \u00e9norme et complexe qui vous attend et qui doit \u00eatre accomplie cette semaine. Vous vous asseyez au bureau. Quelle est votre toute premi\u00e8re action ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u092e\u0928\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u093e, \u091c\u091f\u093f\u0932 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0947 \u0907\u0938 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0921\u0947\u0938\u094d\u0915 \u092a\u0930 \u092c\u0948\u0920 \u091c\u093e\u0907\u092f\u0947. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0940 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai davanti a te un compito enorme e complesso che deve essere completato questa settimana. Ti siedi alla scrivania. Qual \u00e8 la tua primissima azione?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u306f\u3001\u4eca\u9031\u5b8c\u4e86\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u5927\u898f\u6a21\u3067\u8907\u96d1\u306a\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u304c\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u673a\u306b\u5ea7\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u6700\u521d\u306e\u30a2\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0 \uc55e\uc5d0\ub294 \uc774\ubc88 \uc8fc\uc5d0 \uc644\ub8cc\ud574\uc57c \ud560 \uac70\ub300\ud558\uace0 \ubcf5\uc7a1\ud55c \uc791\uc5c5\uc774 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ucc45\uc0c1\uc5d0 \uc549\ub294\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uccab \ubc88\uc9f8 \ud589\ub3d9\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er ligt een enorme, complexe taak voor u die deze week moet worden voltooid. Je gaat aan het bureau zitten. Wat is jouw allereerste actie?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przed Tob\u0105 ogromne, z\u0142o\u017cone zadanie, kt\u00f3re musisz wykona\u0107 w tym tygodniu. Siadasz przy biurku. Jaka jest Twoja pierwsza akcja?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea tem uma tarefa enorme e complexa pela frente que precisa ser conclu\u00edda esta semana. Voc\u00ea se senta \u00e0 mesa. Qual \u00e9 a sua primeira a\u00e7\u00e3o?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438 \u043e\u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0430\u044f, \u0441\u043b\u043e\u0436\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0430, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0437\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0439 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435. \u0422\u044b \u0441\u0430\u0434\u0438\u0448\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0437\u0430 \u043f\u0438\u0441\u044c\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u043b. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0451 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6n\u00fcn\u00fczde bu hafta tamamlanmas\u0131 gereken devasa, karma\u015f\u0131k bir g\u00f6rev var. Masaya oturuyorsun. \u0130lk eyleminiz nedir?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u9762\u524d\u6709\u4e00\u4e2a\u5e9e\u5927\u800c\u590d\u6742\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u8fd9\u5468\u5fc5\u987b\u5b8c\u6210\u3002\u4f60\u5750\u5230\u4e66\u684c\u524d\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u6b65\u884c\u52a8\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u9762\u524d\u6709\u4e00\u9805\u8271\u9245\u800c\u8907\u96dc\u7684\u4efb\u52d9\u9700\u8981\u5728\u672c\u9031\u5b8c\u6210\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u8fa6\u516c\u684c\u524d\u5750\u4e0b\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u500b\u884c\u52d5\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q2.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich r\u00e4ume erst mal den Schreibtisch auf und schreibe eine sch\u00f6ne To-Do-Liste."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First I tidy up my desk and write a nice to-do list."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero ordeno mi escritorio y escribo una bonita lista de tareas pendientes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u2019abord, je range mon bureau et j\u2019\u00e9cris une belle liste de choses \u00e0 faire."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0921\u0947\u0938\u094d\u0915 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u093e\u092b \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940 \u0932\u093f\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per prima cosa riordino la scrivania e scrivo una bella lista di cose da fare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u307e\u305a\u3001\u673a\u3092\u7247\u4ed8\u3051\u3066\u3001\u3084\u308b\u3079\u304d\u3053\u3068\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u66f8\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uba3c\uc800 \ucc45\uc0c1\uc744 \uc815\ub9ac\ud558\uace0 \ud560 \uc77c \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \uc791\uc131\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eerst ruim ik mijn bureau op en schrijf een mooie to-do lijst."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Najpierw sprz\u0105tam biurko i pisz\u0119 list\u0119 rzeczy do zrobienia."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primeiro arrumo minha mesa e escrevo uma bela lista de tarefas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u0430 \u044f \u0443\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0438\u0441\u044c\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u043b \u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044e \u0445\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u0434\u0435\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6nce masam\u0131 toplar\u0131m ve g\u00fczel bir yap\u0131lacaklar listesi yazar\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5148\u6574\u7406\u4e00\u4e0b\u4e66\u684c\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u5199\u4e00\u4efd\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5f85\u529e\u4e8b\u9879\u6e05\u5355\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9996\u5148\uff0c\u6211\u6574\u7406\u8fa6\u516c\u684c\u4e26\u5beb\u4e0b\u4e00\u4efd\u6f02\u4eae\u7684\u5f85\u8fa6\u4e8b\u9805\u6e05\u55ae\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q2.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bearbeite zuerst E-Mails oder kleine, leichte Aufgaben, um 'rein zu kommen'."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I work on emails or small, easy tasks first to 'get in'."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Primero trabajo en correos electr\u00f3nicos o tareas peque\u00f1as y f\u00e1ciles para \"entrar\"."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je travaille d'abord sur des e-mails ou sur de petites t\u00e2ches faciles pour \u00ab entrer \u00bb."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 '\u0905\u0902\u0926\u0930 \u0906\u0928\u0947' \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0908\u092e\u0947\u0932 \u092f\u093e \u091b\u094b\u091f\u0947, \u0906\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lavoro prima su e-mail o attivit\u00e0 piccole e facili per \"entrare\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u307e\u305a\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u3084\u5c0f\u3055\u304f\u3066\u7c21\u5358\u306a\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u306b\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u307f\u3001\u300c\u6163\u308c\u308b\u300d\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 '\ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00\uae30' \uc704\ud574 \uba3c\uc800 \uc774\uba54\uc77c\uc774\ub098 \uc791\uace0 \uc26c\uc6b4 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \ucc98\ub9ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik werk eerst aan e-mails of kleine, gemakkelijke taken om 'binnen te komen'."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Najpierw pracuj\u0119 nad e-mailami lub ma\u0142ymi, \u0142atwymi zadaniami, aby \u201edosta\u0107 si\u0119\u201d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu trabalho primeiro com e-mails ou tarefas pequenas e f\u00e1ceis para 'entrar'."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u0430 \u044f \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0431\u0430\u0442\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u044d\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u0438\u0441\u044c\u043c\u0430 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043c\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u044c\u043a\u0438\u0435, \u043b\u0451\u0433\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u00ab\u0432\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u0432 \u043a\u0443\u0440\u0441 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'\u0130\u00e7eri girmek' i\u00e7in \u00f6nce e-postalar veya k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck, kolay g\u00f6revler \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9996\u5148\u5904\u7406\u7535\u5b50\u90ae\u4ef6\u6216\u4e00\u4e9b\u5c0f\u7684\u3001\u8f7b\u677e\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u2018\u8fdb\u5165\u72b6\u6001\u2019\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9996\u5148\u8655\u7406\u96fb\u5b50\u90f5\u4ef6\u6216\u5c0f\u800c\u7c21\u55ae\u7684\u4efb\u52d9\u4f86\u300c\u9032\u5165\u300d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q2.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00f6ffne das Dokument/Programm und greife sofort den schwersten, ekligsten Teil der Aufgabe an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I open the document/program and immediately attack the hardest, nastiest part of the task."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abro el documento/programa e inmediatamente ataco la parte m\u00e1s dif\u00edcil y desagradable de la tarea."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ouvre le document/programme et attaque imm\u00e9diatement la partie la plus difficile et la plus d\u00e9sagr\u00e9able de la t\u00e2che."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0926\u0938\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0935\u0947\u091c\u093c/\u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0917\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928, \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0916\u0930\u093e\u092c \u0939\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0939\u092e\u0932\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apro il documento/programma e attacco immediatamente la parte pi\u00f9 difficile e sgradevole dell'attivit\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8/\u30d7\u30ed\u30b0\u30e9\u30e0\u3092\u958b\u3044\u3066\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u306e\u6700\u3082\u56f0\u96e3\u3067\u5384\u4ecb\u306a\u90e8\u5206\u306b\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ubb38\uc11c/\ud504\ub85c\uadf8\ub7a8\uc744 \uc5f4\uace0 \uc989\uc2dc \uc791\uc5c5\uc758 \uac00\uc7a5 \uc5b4\ub835\uace0 \uac00\uc7a5 \ubd88\ucf8c\ud55c \ubd80\ubd84\uc744 \uacf5\uaca9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik open het document/programma en val onmiddellijk het moeilijkste en smerigste deel van de taak aan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otwieram dokument/program i natychmiast przyst\u0119puj\u0119 do najtrudniejszej, najpaskudniejszej cz\u0119\u015bci zadania."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abro o documento/programa e imediatamente ataco a parte mais dif\u00edcil e desagrad\u00e1vel da tarefa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0434\u043e\u043a\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442/\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u0443 \u0438 \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0436\u0435 \u0431\u0435\u0440\u0443\u0441\u044c \u0437\u0430 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u0443\u044e \u0442\u0440\u0443\u0434\u043d\u0443\u044e, \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belgeyi/program\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131yorum ve hemen g\u00f6revin en zor, en i\u011fren\u00e7 k\u0131sm\u0131na sald\u0131r\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6253\u5f00\u6587\u6863/\u7a0b\u5e8f\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u7acb\u5373\u5904\u7406\u4efb\u52a1\u4e2d\u6700\u96be\u3001\u6700\u6076\u5fc3\u7684\u90e8\u5206\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6253\u958b\u6587\u4ef6/\u7a0b\u5f0f\u4e26\u7acb\u5373\u958b\u59cb\u57f7\u884c\u4efb\u52d9\u4e2d\u6700\u56f0\u96e3\u3001\u6700\u4ee4\u4eba\u8a0e\u53ad\u7684\u90e8\u5206\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q2.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich prokrastiniere am Handy, bis der Druck kurz vor der Deadline unertr\u00e4glich wird."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I procrastinate on my cell phone until the pressure becomes unbearable right before the deadline."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Procrastino en mi tel\u00e9fono celular hasta que la presi\u00f3n se vuelve insoportable justo antes de la fecha l\u00edmite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je tergiverse sur mon t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable jusqu'\u00e0 ce que la pression devienne insupportable juste avant la date limite."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947\u0932 \u092b\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0924\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u091f\u093e\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u091c\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u0915\u093f \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0938\u0940\u092e\u093e \u0938\u0947 \u0920\u0940\u0915 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0926\u092c\u093e\u0935 \u0905\u0938\u0939\u0928\u0940\u092f \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Procrastino sul cellulare finch\u00e9 la pressione non diventa insopportabile proprio prima della scadenza."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7de0\u3081\u5207\u308a\u76f4\u524d\u306b\u30d7\u30ec\u30c3\u30b7\u30e3\u30fc\u306b\u8010\u3048\u3089\u308c\u306a\u304f\u306a\u308b\u307e\u3067\u3001\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u3092\u3044\u3058\u3063\u3066\u5148\u5ef6\u3070\u3057\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub9c8\uac10 \uc9c1\uc804\uc5d0 \uc555\ubc15\uac10\uc774 \uacac\ub51c \uc218 \uc5c6\uc744 \ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0 \ud734\ub300\uc804\ud654\ub97c \ubbf8\ub8e8\uace4 \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stel het uit met mijn mobiele telefoon totdat de druk vlak voor de deadline ondraaglijk wordt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwlekam z telefonem kom\u00f3rkowym, dop\u00f3ki presja nie stanie si\u0119 nie do zniesienia tu\u017c przed ostatecznym terminem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu procrastino no meu celular at\u00e9 que a press\u00e3o se torne insuport\u00e1vel logo antes do prazo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0441 \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d\u043e\u043c, \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430 \u0434\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0434\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e\u043c \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0435\u0432\u044b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0438\u043c\u044b\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son teslim tarihinin hemen \u00f6ncesinde bask\u0131 dayan\u0131lmaz hale gelinceye kadar cep telefonumu erteliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u624b\u673a\u4e0a\u62d6\u5ef6\uff0c\u76f4\u5230\u4e34\u8fd1\u6700\u540e\u671f\u9650\u7684\u538b\u529b\u53d8\u5f97\u65e0\u6cd5\u5fcd\u53d7\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7528\u624b\u6a5f\u62d6\u5ef6\uff0c\u76f4\u5230\u622a\u6b62\u65e5\u671f\u524d\u58d3\u529b\u8b8a\u5f97\u96e3\u4ee5\u627f\u53d7\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q3": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Projekt ist zu 80 \uff05 fertig und bereits gut genug, um eine Top-Bewertung zu bekommen. Die restlichen 20 \uff05 w\u00fcrden dich noch einmal 10 Stunden kosten. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your project is 80\uff05 complete and already good enough to get a top rating. The remaining 20\uff05 \u200b\u200bwould cost you another 10 hours. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su proyecto est\u00e1 completo en un 80\uff05 y ya es lo suficientemente bueno como para obtener la m\u00e1xima calificaci\u00f3n. El 20\uff05 restante te costar\u00eda otras 10 horas. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre projet est termin\u00e9 \u00e0 80\u00a0\uff05 et est d\u00e9j\u00e0 suffisamment bon pour obtenir la meilleure note. Les 20 \uff05 restants vous co\u00fbteraient encore 10 heures. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f 80\uff05 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0939\u094b \u091a\u0941\u0915\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0936\u0940\u0930\u094d\u0937 \u0930\u0947\u091f\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u092a\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u092b\u0940 \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0936\u0947\u0937 20\uff05 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b 10 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0932\u0917\u0947\u0902\u0917\u0947\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo progetto \u00e8 completo all'80\uff05 e gi\u00e0 sufficientemente buono per ottenere una valutazione massima. Il restante 20\uff05 ti costerebbe altre 10 ore. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306f 80\uff05 \u5b8c\u4e86\u3057\u3066\u304a\u308a\u3001\u3059\u3067\u306b\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u8a55\u4fa1\u3092\u5f97\u308b\u306e\u306b\u5341\u5206\u306a\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u306b\u9054\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6b8b\u308a\u306e 20\uff05 \u3067\u306f\u3055\u3089\u306b 10 \u6642\u9593\u304b\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ub294 80\uff05 \uc644\ub8cc\ub418\uc5c8\uc73c\uba70 \uc774\ubbf8 \ucd5c\uace0 \ud3c9\uac00\ub97c \ubc1b\uc744 \ub9cc\ud07c \ucda9\ubd84\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\uba38\uc9c0 20\uff05\uc5d0\ub294 10\uc2dc\uac04\uc774 \ub354 \uc18c\uc694\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uw project is voor 80\uff05 voltooid en al goed genoeg om een \u200b\u200btopbeoordeling te krijgen. De overige 20\uff05 kost je nog eens 10 uur. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j projekt jest uko\u0144czony w 80\uff05 i ju\u017c wystarczaj\u0105co dobry, aby uzyska\u0107 najwy\u017csz\u0105 ocen\u0119. Pozosta\u0142e 20\uff05 b\u0119dzie kosztowa\u0107 kolejne 10 godzin. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu projeto est\u00e1 80\uff05 conclu\u00eddo e j\u00e1 \u00e9 bom o suficiente para obter uma classifica\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima. Os 20\uff05 restantes custariam mais 10 horas. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432 \u043d\u0430 80 \uff05 \u0438 \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0445\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0448, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043e\u0442\u043b\u0438\u0447\u043d\u0443\u044e \u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u043a\u0443. \u041e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0435 20 \uff05 \u043e\u0431\u043e\u0448\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c \u0431\u044b \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0432 10 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Projenizin \uff0580'i tamamland\u0131 ve zaten en y\u00fcksek puan\u0131 almaya yetecek kadar iyi. Kalan \uff0520 size 10 saat daha mal olacak. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u9879\u76ee\u5df2\u7ecf\u5b8c\u6210\u4e8680\uff05\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u5df2\u7ecf\u8db3\u591f\u597d\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u83b7\u5f97\u6700\u9ad8\u8bc4\u4ef7\u3002\u5269\u4e0b\u768420\uff05\u5c06\u4f1a\u518d\u82b1\u4f6010\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u5c08\u6848\u5df2\u5b8c\u6210 80\uff05\uff0c\u4e26\u4e14\u8db3\u4ee5\u7372\u5f97\u6700\u9ad8\u8a55\u7d1a\u3002\u5269\u4e0b\u768420\uff05\u53c8\u8981\u82b1\u4f6010\u5c0f\u6642\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q3.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich opfere die 10 Stunden, weil es absolut perfekt sein muss. Alles andere ist Versagen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I sacrifice the 10 hours because it has to be absolutely perfect. Everything else is failure."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sacrifico las 10 horas porque tiene que ser absolutamente perfecto. Todo lo dem\u00e1s es fracaso."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je sacrifie les 10 heures car il faut que ce soit absolument parfait. Tout le reste est un \u00e9chec."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 10 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0924\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u093e \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f\u0964 \u092c\u093e\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u092c \u0935\u093f\u092b\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sacrifico le 10 ore perch\u00e9 deve essere assolutamente perfetto. Tutto il resto \u00e8 fallimento."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7d76\u5bfe\u306b\u5b8c\u74a7\u3067\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u3089\u306a\u3044\u306e\u3067\u300110\u6642\u9593\u3092\u72a0\u7272\u306b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u305d\u308c\u4ee5\u5916\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u5931\u6557\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc644\ubcbd\ud574\uc57c \ud558\uae30 \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 10\uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \ud76c\uc0dd\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\ub978 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uac83\uc740 \uc2e4\ud328\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik offer de 10 uur op omdat het absoluut perfect moet zijn. Al het andere is mislukking."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po\u015bwi\u0119cam te 10 godzin, bo musi by\u0107 absolutnie perfekcyjnie. Wszystko inne to pora\u017cka."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu sacrifico as 10 horas porque tem que ser absolutamente perfeito. Todo o resto \u00e9 fracasso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0436\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0432\u0443\u044e 10 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c \u0430\u0431\u0441\u043e\u043b\u044e\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e. \u0412\u0441\u0451 \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10 saatimi feda ediyorum \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc kesinlikle m\u00fckemmel olmas\u0131 gerekiyor. Geriye kalan her \u015fey ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131kt\u0131r."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u727a\u7272\u8fd910\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u5b83\u5fc5\u987b\u7edd\u5bf9\u5b8c\u7f8e\u3002\u5176\u4ed6\u4e00\u5207\u90fd\u662f\u5931\u8d25\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u72a7\u7272\u4e86 10 \u500b\u5c0f\u6642\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u5b83\u5fc5\u9808\u7d55\u5c0d\u5b8c\u7f8e\u3002\u5176\u4ed6\u4e00\u5207\u90fd\u662f\u5931\u6557\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q3.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich gebe es genau so ab, hake es ab und nutze die 10 Stunden f\u00fcr das n\u00e4chste Projekt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I hand it in exactly as it is, check it off and use the 10 hours for the next project."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo entrego exactamente como est\u00e1, lo marco y uso las 10 horas para el siguiente proyecto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le rends exactement tel quel, je le coche et j'utilise les 10 heures pour le prochain projet."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u0938\u094c\u0902\u092a\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092f\u0939 \u0939\u0948, \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f 10 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo consegno esattamente cos\u00ec com'\u00e8, lo controllo e utilizzo le 10 ore per il progetto successivo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u63d0\u51fa\u3057\u3066\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u5165\u308c\u3001\u305d\u306e 10 \u6642\u9593\u3092\u6b21\u306e\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306b\u5145\u3066\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8\ub300\ub85c \uc804\ub2ec\ud558\uace0, \ud655\uc778 \ud6c4 10\uc2dc\uac04\uc740 \ub2e4\uc74c \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uc5d0 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik lever het precies in zoals het is, vink het af en gebruik de 10 uur voor het volgende project."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oddaj\u0119 dok\u0142adnie tak jak jest, sprawdzam i 10 godzin wykorzystuj\u0119 na kolejny projekt."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrego exatamente como est\u00e1, marquei e uso as 10 horas para o pr\u00f3ximo projeto."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0434\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0442\u0430\u043a \u0436\u0435, \u043e\u0442\u043c\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e \u0433\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0447\u043a\u043e\u0439 \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u044e 10 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onu oldu\u011fu gibi teslim ediyorum, kontrol ediyorum ve 10 saati bir sonraki proje i\u00e7in kullan\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c31\u6309\u539f\u6837\u63d0\u4ea4\uff0c\u52fe\u6389\u5b83\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u628a\u8fd910\u5c0f\u65f6\u7528\u5728\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u9879\u76ee\u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u539f\u5c01\u4e0d\u52d5\u5730\u628a\u5b83\u4ea4\u51fa\u53bb\uff0c\u6838\u5c0d\u4e00\u4e0b\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u7528\u9019 10 \u500b\u5c0f\u6642\u9032\u884c\u4e0b\u4e00\u500b\u5c08\u6848\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q3.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich arbeite immer mal wieder daran rum, ohne es jemals richtig abzuschlie\u00dfen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I keep working on it without ever really completing it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigo trabajando en ello sin llegar a completarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je continue \u00e0 travailler dessus sans jamais vraiment le terminer."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u093f\u090f \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0940 \u0907\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuo a lavorarci senza mai completarlo veramente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9f\u969b\u306b\u5b8c\u6210\u3055\u305b\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306a\u304f\u4f5c\u696d\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc2e4\uc81c\ub85c \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \uc644\ub8cc\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud55c \ucc44 \uacc4\uc18d\ud574\uc11c \uc791\uc5c5\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik blijf eraan werken zonder het ooit echt af te maken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ci\u0105gle nad tym pracuj\u0119, nigdy go nie ko\u0144cz\u0105c."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuo trabalhando nisso sem nunca termin\u00e1-lo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043e\u0442 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u044d\u0442\u0438\u043c, \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u0432."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7 tamamlamadan \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u603b\u662f\u4e0d\u65f6\u5730\u505a\u4e9b\u4e8b\u60c5\uff0c\u4f46\u4ece\u672a\u771f\u6b63\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u76f4\u5728\u52aa\u529b\uff0c\u4f46\u5f9e\u672a\u771f\u6b63\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q3.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich h\u00f6re auf, weil ich keine Lust mehr habe, nicht aus strategischen Gr\u00fcnden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I stop because I don't feel like it anymore, not for strategic reasons."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paro porque ya no tengo ganas, no por motivos estrat\u00e9gicos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'arr\u00eate parce que je n'en ai plus envie, pas pour des raisons strat\u00e9giques."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0930\u0941\u0915 \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u0905\u092c \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0910\u0938\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e, \u0930\u0923\u0928\u0940\u0924\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi fermo perch\u00e9 non ne ho pi\u00f9 voglia, non per ragioni strategiche."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6226\u7565\u7684\u306a\u7406\u7531\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3082\u3046\u6c17\u5206\u304c\u4e57\u3089\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3089\u3084\u3081\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc804\ub7b5\uc801\uc778 \uc774\uc720\uac00 \uc544\ub2c8\ub77c \ub354 \uc774\uc0c1 \uadf8\ub7ec\uace0 \uc2f6\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc544\uc11c \uc911\ub2e8\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stop omdat ik er geen zin meer in heb, niet om strategische redenen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przestaj\u0119, bo nie mam ju\u017c na to ochoty, a nie ze wzgl\u0119d\u00f3w strategicznych."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paro porque n\u00e3o tenho mais vontade, n\u00e3o por quest\u00f5es estrat\u00e9gicas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044e, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0445\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f, \u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u043c \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Art\u0131k can\u0131m istemedi\u011fi i\u00e7in duruyorum, stratejik nedenlerden dolay\u0131 de\u011fil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u505c\u6b62\u662f\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u7ee7\u7eed\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u51fa\u4e8e\u6218\u7565\u539f\u56e0\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u505c\u4e0b\u4f86\u662f\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u4e0d\u518d\u559c\u6b61\u5b83\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u51fa\u65bc\u6230\u7565\u539f\u56e0\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q4": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist 23:00 Uhr. Du hattest einen extrem stressigen Tag ohne eine Minute f\u00fcr dich. Du musst morgen fr\u00fch raus. Was tust du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's 11:00 p.m. You had an extremely stressful day without a minute to yourself. You have to go out tomorrow morning. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son las 11:00 p.m. Tuviste un d\u00eda extremadamente estresante sin tener un minuto para ti. Tienes que salir ma\u00f1ana por la ma\u00f1ana. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est 23h00. Vous avez pass\u00e9 une journ\u00e9e extr\u00eamement stressante sans une minute pour vous. Tu dois sortir demain matin. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0930\u093e\u0924 \u0915\u0947 11:00 \u092c\u091c\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902. \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u092d\u0940 \u0916\u0930\u094d\u091a \u0915\u093f\u090f \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0924\u0928\u093e\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0930\u0939\u093e\u0964 \u0924\u0941\u092e\u094d\u0939\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0932 \u0938\u0941\u092c\u0939 \u092c\u093e\u0939\u0930 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0948. \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono le 23:00 Hai avuto una giornata estremamente stressante senza un minuto per te. Domani mattina devi uscire. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5348\u5f8c11\u6642\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u81ea\u8eab\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306e\u6642\u9593\u304c\u306a\u304f\u3001\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30b9\u306e\u591a\u3044\u4e00\u65e5\u3092\u904e\u3054\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u660e\u65e5\u306e\u671d\u306f\u51fa\u304b\u3051\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ud6c4 11\uc2dc\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud63c\uc790\ub9cc\uc758 \uc2dc\uac04\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uc774 \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub808\uc2a4\uac00 \ub9ce\uc740 \ud558\ub8e8\ub97c \ubcf4\ub0c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub0b4\uc77c \uc544\uce68\uc5d0 \ub098\uac00\uc57c \ud574\uc694. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het is 23.00 uur. Je hebt een extreem stressvolle dag gehad zonder een minuut voor jezelf. Morgenochtend moet je weg. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jest godzina 23:00. Mia\u0142e\u015b wyj\u0105tkowo stresuj\u0105cy dzie\u0144 bez minuty dla siebie. Musisz wyjecha\u0107 jutro rano. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S\u00e3o 23h. Voc\u00ea teve um dia extremamente estressante sem um minuto para si mesmo. Voc\u00ea tem que sair amanh\u00e3 de manh\u00e3. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 23:00. \u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0431\u044b\u043b \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442\u044b \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f. \u0417\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u043d\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saat 23.00. Kendinize ay\u0131raca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bir dakika bile olmadan son derece stresli bir g\u00fcn ge\u00e7irdiniz. Yar\u0131n sabah d\u0131\u015far\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kman gerekiyor. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u73b0\u5728\u662f23:00\u3002\u4f60\u5ea6\u8fc7\u4e86\u6781\u5176\u538b\u529b\u5927\u7684\u4e00\u5929\uff0c\u6ca1\u6709\u4e00\u5206\u949f\u5c5e\u4e8e\u81ea\u5df1\u3002\u4f60\u660e\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u5fc5\u987b\u8d77\u5e8a\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u505a\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u73fe\u5728\u662f\u665a\u4e0a 11:00\u3002\u4f60\u5ea6\u904e\u4e86\u58d3\u529b\u6975\u5927\u7684\u4e00\u5929\uff0c\u6c92\u6709\u4e00\u5206\u9418\u7684\u7368\u8655\u6642\u9593\u3002\u660e\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u4f60\u5fc5\u9808\u51fa\u53bb\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q4.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich scrolle stundenlang am Handy, um mir wenigstens ein bisschen 'Freizeit' zur\u00fcckzuholen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I scroll on my phone for hours to get at least a little bit of 'free time' back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me desplazo en mi tel\u00e9fono durante horas para recuperar al menos un poco de \"tiempo libre\"."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je fais d\u00e9filer mon t\u00e9l\u00e9phone pendant des heures pour r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer au moins un peu de \u00ab temps libre \u00bb."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u092e \u0925\u094b\u0921\u093c\u093e \u0938\u093e '\u0916\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u092f' \u0935\u093e\u092a\u0938 \u092a\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092b\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094d\u0930\u0949\u0932 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scorro le ore sul telefono per riprendermi almeno un po' di \"tempo libero\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c11\u306a\u304f\u3068\u3082\u5c11\u3057\u306e\u300c\u81ea\u7531\u6642\u9593\u300d\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u623b\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u3092\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u3082\u30b9\u30af\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ucd5c\uc18c\ud55c '\uc790\uc720 \uc2dc\uac04'\uc744 \ub418\ucc3e\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uba87 \uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \ud734\ub300\ud3f0\uc744 \uc2a4\ud06c\ub864\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik scroll urenlang op mijn telefoon om in ieder geval een klein beetje \u2018vrije tijd\u2019 terug te krijgen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przegl\u0105dam telefon godzinami, \u017ceby odzyska\u0107 cho\u0107 odrobin\u0119 \u201ewolnego czasu\u201d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu rodo meu telefone por horas para recuperar pelo menos um pouco do 'tempo livre'."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u043b\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0430\u044e \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0443\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0445\u043e\u0442\u044f \u0431\u044b \u043d\u0435\u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e '\u0441\u0432\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438'."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En az\u0131ndan biraz 'bo\u015f zaman' kazanmak i\u00e7in saatlerce telefonumda geziniyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u624b\u673a\u4e0a\u6ed1\u52a8\u597d\u51e0\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\uff0c\u4ee5\u627e\u56de\u81f3\u5c11\u4e00\u70b9\u70b9\u201c\u81ea\u7531\u65f6\u95f4\u201d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u624b\u6a5f\u4e0a\u6efe\u52d5\u5e7e\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\uff0c\u4ee5\u7372\u5f97\u81f3\u5c11\u4e00\u9ede\u300c\u7a7a\u9592\u6642\u9593\u300d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q4.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schlafe sofort, weil mir klar ist, dass Schlaf der einzige Weg ist, morgen nicht wieder zu versagen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I immediately sleep because I realize that sleep is the only way to not fail again tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inmediatamente me duermo porque me doy cuenta de que dormir es la \u00fanica manera de no volver a fallar ma\u00f1ana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dors imm\u00e9diatement parce que je me rends compte que le sommeil est le seul moyen de ne plus \u00e9chouer demain."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0938\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u090f\u0939\u0938\u093e\u0938 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0928\u0940\u0902\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u0915\u0932 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0905\u0938\u092b\u0932 \u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u090f\u0915\u092e\u093e\u0924\u094d\u0930 \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dormo subito perch\u00e9 mi rendo conto che dormire \u00e8 l'unico modo per non fallire nuovamente domani."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u660e\u65e5\u518d\u3073\u5931\u6557\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u7761\u7720\u304c\u552f\u4e00\u306e\u65b9\u6cd5\u3060\u3068\u609f\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u5bdd\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub0b4\uc77c\ub3c4 \uc2e4\ud328\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uc720\uc77c\ud55c \ubc29\ubc95\uc740 \uc7a0\ubfd0\uc774\ub77c\ub294 \uc0ac\uc2e4\uc744 \uae68\ub2eb\uace0 \ubc14\ub85c \uc7a0\uc744 \uc794\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik slaap meteen omdat ik besef dat slapen de enige manier is om morgen niet opnieuw te falen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Od razu zasypiam, bo zdaj\u0119 sobie spraw\u0119, \u017ce sen to jedyny spos\u00f3b, \u017ceby jutro znowu nie zawie\u015b\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durmo imediatamente porque percebo que dormir \u00e9 a \u00fanica maneira de n\u00e3o falhar novamente amanh\u00e3."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u0441\u044b\u043f\u0430\u044e, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0441\u043e\u043d \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043f\u0435\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430 \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen uyuyorum \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc yar\u0131n tekrar ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olmaman\u0131n tek yolunun uyku oldu\u011funu anl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u5c31\u7761\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u6e05\u695a\u5730\u77e5\u9053\uff0c\u7761\u89c9\u662f\u660e\u5929\u4e0d\u518d\u5931\u8d25\u7684\u552f\u4e00\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u7761\u89ba\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u610f\u8b58\u5230\u7761\u7720\u662f\u660e\u5929\u4e0d\u518d\u5931\u6557\u7684\u552f\u4e00\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q4.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lese ein Buch, bis mir die Augen zufallen, bin am Ende aber trotzdem \u00fcberm\u00fcdet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I read a book until my eyes close, but at the end I'm still tired."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leo un libro hasta que se me cierran los ojos, pero al final todav\u00eda estoy cansado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je lis un livre jusqu'\u00e0 ce que mes yeux se ferment, mais \u00e0 la fin je suis toujours fatigu\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u093e\u092c \u0924\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u091c\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0906\u0902\u0916\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u0925\u0915 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leggo un libro finch\u00e9 non mi si chiudono gli occhi, ma alla fine sono ancora stanco."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u76ee\u304c\u9589\u3058\u308b\u307e\u3067\u672c\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u6700\u5f8c\u306b\u306f\u307e\u3060\u75b2\u308c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub208\uc744 \uac10\uc744 \ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0 \ucc45\uc744 \uc77d\uc5c8\uc9c0\ub9cc, \uacb0\uad6d\uc5d0\ub294 \uc5ec\uc804\ud788 \ud53c\uace4\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik lees een boek tot mijn ogen sluiten, maar aan het einde ben ik nog steeds moe."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Czytam ksi\u0105\u017ck\u0119 a\u017c oczy mi si\u0119 zamykaj\u0105, ale pod koniec i tak jestem zm\u0119czona."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leio um livro at\u00e9 fechar os olhos, mas no final ainda estou cansado."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u044e \u043a\u043d\u0438\u0433\u0443, \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430 \u0443 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0430\u0434\u044f\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0433\u043b\u0430\u0437\u0430, \u043d\u043e \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u043e\u0432 \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0443\u0442\u043e\u043c\u043b\u0451\u043d."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00f6zlerim kapanana kadar kitap okurum ama sonunda h\u00e2l\u00e2 yorgunum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8bfb\u4e66\u8bfb\u5230\u773c\u775b\u90fd\u5feb\u95ed\u4e0a\u4e86\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u540e\u8fd8\u662f\u5f88\u75b2\u5026\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8b80\u4e86\u4e00\u672c\u66f8\u76f4\u5230\u6211\u9589\u4e0a\u773c\u775b\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u5f8c\u6211\u9084\u662f\u5f88\u7d2f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q4.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00e4rgere mich \u00fcber den Tag und liege stundenlang wach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I get annoyed during the day and lie awake for hours."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me enfado durante el d\u00eda y me quedo despierto durante horas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suis ennuy\u00e9 pendant la journ\u00e9e et je reste \u00e9veill\u00e9 pendant des heures."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0917\u0941\u0938\u094d\u0938\u093e \u0906\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi arrabbio durante il giorno e rimango sveglio per ore."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65e5\u4e2d\u30a4\u30e9\u30a4\u30e9\u3057\u3066\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u3082\u8d77\u304d\u3066\u6a2a\u305f\u308f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub0ae\uc5d0\ub294 \uc9dc\uc99d\uc774 \ub098\uc11c \uba87 \uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \uae68\uc5b4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overdag erger ik me en lig ik urenlang wakker."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W ci\u0105gu dnia denerwuj\u0119 si\u0119 i godzinami le\u017c\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fico irritado durante o dia e fico acordado por horas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0437\u043b\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u0434\u043d\u044f \u0438 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u043b\u0435\u0436\u0443 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u0441\u043d\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00fcn i\u00e7inde sinirleniyorum ve saatlerce uyan\u0131k yat\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e3a\u8fd9\u4e00\u5929\u611f\u5230\u751f\u6c14\uff0c\u8eba\u5728\u90a3\u91cc\u6574\u591c\u65e0\u6cd5\u5165\u7761\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u767d\u5929\u5f88\u7169\u8e81\uff0c\u5e7e\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\u90fd\u7761\u4e0d\u8457\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q5": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist seit 20 Minuten hochkonzentriert bei der Arbeit. Pl\u00f6tzlich vibriert dein Handy \u2013 eine Nachricht von einer Person, die du extrem interessant findest."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have been highly concentrated at work for 20 minutes. Suddenly your phone vibrates - a message from someone you find extremely interesting."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Has estado muy concentrado en el trabajo durante 20 minutos. De repente, tu tel\u00e9fono vibra: es un mensaje de alguien que te parece extremadamente interesante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez \u00e9t\u00e9 tr\u00e8s concentr\u00e9 au travail pendant 20 minutes. Soudain, votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone vibre \u2013 un message de quelqu'un que vous trouvez extr\u00eamement int\u00e9ressant."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a 20 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u0924\u0915 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u0947\u0902\u0926\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0905\u091a\u093e\u0928\u0915 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u0902\u092a\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 - \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0910\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0936 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0926\u093f\u0932\u091a\u0938\u094d\u092a \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sei stato molto concentrato sul lavoro per 20 minuti. All'improvviso il tuo telefono vibra: un messaggio da qualcuno che trovi estremamente interessante."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f 20 \u5206\u9593\u3001\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u96c6\u4e2d\u3057\u3066\u4ed5\u4e8b\u306b\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u7a81\u7136\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u304c\u632f\u52d5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u8208\u5473\u6df1\u3044\u4eba\u304b\u3089\u306e\u30e1\u30c3\u30bb\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 20\ubd84 \ub3d9\uc548 \uc9c1\uc7a5\uc5d0 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc9d1\uc911\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uac11\uc790\uae30 \ud734\ub300\uc804\ud654\uac00 \uc9c4\ub3d9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9e4\uc6b0 \ud765\ubbf8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc774 \ubcf4\ub0b8 \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U bent gedurende 20 minuten zeer geconcentreerd aan het werk geweest. Plots trilt je telefoon: een bericht van iemand die je buitengewoon interessant vindt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By\u0142e\u015b bardzo skoncentrowany w pracy przez 20 minut. Nagle Tw\u00f3j telefon wibruje \u2013 wiadomo\u015b\u0107 od osoby, kt\u00f3r\u0105 uwa\u017casz za niezwykle interesuj\u0105c\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea esteve altamente concentrado no trabalho por 20 minutos. De repente, seu telefone vibra \u2013 uma mensagem de algu\u00e9m que voc\u00ea acha extremamente interessante."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0443\u0436\u0435 20 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c. \u0412\u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d \u0437\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043b \u2014 \u0441\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e\u0442 \u0447\u0435\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043a\u0430, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0442\u044b \u043d\u0430\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0448\u044c \u0447\u0440\u0435\u0437\u0432\u044b\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043d\u044b\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20 dakika boyunca i\u015finize son derece konsantre oldunuz. Aniden telefonunuz titrer; son derece ilgin\u00e7 buldu\u011funuz birinden gelen bir mesaj."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u4e13\u6ce8\u5de5\u4f5c20\u5206\u949f\u4e86\u3002\u7a81\u7136\u4f60\u7684\u624b\u673a\u632f\u52a8\u2014\u2014\u4e00\u6761\u6765\u81ea\u4f60\u89c9\u5f97\u975e\u5e38\u6709\u8da3\u7684\u4eba\u7684\u4fe1\u606f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5df2\u7d93\u9ad8\u5ea6\u5c08\u6ce8\u5730\u5de5\u4f5c\u4e86 20 \u5206\u9418\u3002\u7a81\u7136\u4f60\u7684\u624b\u6a5f\u9707\u52d5\u4e86\u2014\u2014\u4e00\u5247\u4f86\u81ea\u4f60\u89ba\u5f97\u975e\u5e38\u6709\u8da3\u7684\u4eba\u7684\u8a0a\u606f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q5.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schaue sofort nach und antworte kurz. Das dauert ja nur 10 Sekunden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll check immediately and answer briefly. That only takes 10 seconds."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo comprobar\u00e9 inmediatamente y responder\u00e9 brevemente. Eso s\u00f3lo lleva 10 segundos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais v\u00e9rifier imm\u00e9diatement et r\u00e9pondre bri\u00e8vement. Cela ne prend que 10 secondes."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u091c\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u0902\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0947\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964 \u0907\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 10 \u0938\u0947\u0915\u0902\u0921 \u0932\u0917\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controllo subito e rispondo brevemente. Ci vogliono solo 10 secondi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3059\u3050\u306b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u7c21\u5358\u306b\u304a\u7b54\u3048\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6240\u8981\u6642\u9593\u306f\u308f\u305a\u304b 10 \u79d2\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubc14\ub85c \ud655\uc778\ud558\uace0 \uac04\ub7b5\ud558\uac8c \ub2f5\ubcc0 \ub4dc\ub9ac\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e8 10\ucd08\ubc16\uc5d0 \uac78\ub9ac\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik zal het meteen controleren en kort antwoorden. Dat duurt slechts 10 seconden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaraz sprawdz\u0119 i kr\u00f3tko odpowiem. To zajmuje tylko 10 sekund."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou verificar imediatamente e responder brevemente. Isso leva apenas 10 segundos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u044e \u0438 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0443. \u042d\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0439\u043c\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e 10 \u0441\u0435\u043a\u0443\u043d\u0434."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen kontrol edip k\u0131saca cevap verece\u011fim. Bu yaln\u0131zca 10 saniye s\u00fcrer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9a6c\u4e0a\u67e5\u4e00\u4e0b\uff0c\u5f88\u5feb\u5c31\u56de\u590d\u3002\u8fd9\u53ea\u9700\u898110\u79d2\u949f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7acb\u5373\u6aa2\u67e5\u4e26\u7c21\u8981\u56de\u7b54\u3002\u9019\u53ea\u9700\u8981 10 \u79d2\u9418\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q5.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich versuche es zu ignorieren, kann aber an nichts anderes mehr denken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I try to ignore it, but I can't think of anything else."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intento ignorarlo, pero no puedo pensar en nada m\u00e1s."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'essaie de l'ignorer, mais je ne peux penser \u00e0 rien d'autre."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0928\u091c\u093c\u0930\u0905\u0902\u0926\u093e\u091c\u093c \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0914\u0930 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a \u092a\u093e\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerco di ignorarlo, ma non riesco a pensare ad altro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7121\u8996\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4ed6\u306b\u4f55\u3082\u8003\u3048\u3089\u308c\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubb34\uc2dc\ud558\ub824\uace0 \ub178\ub825\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \ub2e4\ub978 \uac83\uc740 \uc0dd\uac01\ub098\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik probeer het te negeren, maar kan aan niets anders denken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pr\u00f3buj\u0119 to zignorowa\u0107, ale nie przychodzi mi do g\u0142owy nic innego."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tento ignorar, mas n\u00e3o consigo pensar em mais nada."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u043d\u043e \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0438 \u043e \u0447\u0451\u043c \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043c \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu g\u00f6rmezden gelmeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum ama akl\u0131ma ba\u015fka bir \u015fey gelmiyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8bd5\u7740\u5ffd\u7565\u5b83\uff0c\u4f46\u5374\u65e0\u6cd5\u60f3\u5230\u522b\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8a66\u8457\u5ffd\u7565\u5b83\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u7121\u6cd5\u601d\u8003\u5176\u4ed6\u4e8b\u60c5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q5.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mein Handy ist ohnehin in einem anderen Raum oder im harten Fokus-Modus. Ich merke es gar nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My phone is in another room or in hard focus mode anyway. I don't even notice it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi tel\u00e9fono est\u00e1 en otra habitaci\u00f3n o en modo de enfoque intenso de todos modos. Ni siquiera lo noto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mon t\u00e9l\u00e9phone est de toute fa\u00e7on dans une autre pi\u00e8ce ou en mode de mise au point dure. Je ne le remarque m\u00eame pas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0947\u0930\u093e \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0940 \u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u0947 \u0915\u092e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0939\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0921 \u092b\u094b\u0915\u0938 \u092e\u094b\u0921 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0927\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0906\u0924\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il mio telefono \u00e8 comunque in un'altra stanza o in modalit\u00e0 messa a fuoco intensa. Non me ne accorgo nemmeno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306e\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u306f\u5225\u306e\u90e8\u5c4b\u306b\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3001\u3068\u306b\u304b\u304f\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30ab\u30b9\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u3082\u305d\u308c\u306b\u6c17\u3065\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5b4\uca0c\ub4e0 \ub0b4 \uc804\ud654\uae30\ub294 \ub2e4\ub978 \ubc29\uc5d0 \uc788\uac70\ub098 \ud558\ub4dc \ud3ec\ucee4\uc2a4 \ubaa8\ub4dc\uc5d0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ub208\uce58 \ucc44\uc9c0\ub3c4 \ubabb\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mijn telefoon bevindt zich sowieso in een andere kamer of in de harde focusmodus. Ik merk het niet eens."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M\u00f3j telefon i tak jest w innym pokoju lub w trybie ostrego ustawiania ostro\u015bci. Nawet tego nie zauwa\u017cam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meu telefone est\u00e1 em outra sala ou no modo de foco forte. Eu nem percebo isso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u043e\u0439 \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d \u0432 \u043b\u044e\u0431\u043e\u043c \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0432 \u0440\u0435\u0436\u0438\u043c\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0439 \u0444\u043e\u043a\u0443\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438. \u042f \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0434\u0430\u0436\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Telefonum zaten ba\u015fka bir odada ya da yo\u011fun odak modunda. Bunu fark etmiyorum bile."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7684\u624b\u673a\u65e0\u8bba\u5982\u4f55\u90fd\u5728\u53e6\u4e00\u4e2a\u623f\u95f4\u91cc\uff0c\u6216\u5904\u4e8e\u4e25\u683c\u7684\u4e13\u6ce8\u6a21\u5f0f\u3002\u6211\u6839\u672c\u6ca1\u6ce8\u610f\u5230\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7121\u8ad6\u5982\u4f55\uff0c\u6211\u7684\u624b\u6a5f\u5728\u53e6\u4e00\u500b\u623f\u9593\u6216\u8655\u65bc\u786c\u5c0d\u7126\u6a21\u5f0f\u3002\u6211\u4ec0\u81f3\u6c92\u6709\u8a3b\u610f\u5230\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q5.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schaue drauf, antworte nicht, brauche aber 10 Minuten, um wieder in den Fokus zu kommen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I look at it, don't answer, but need 10 minutes to come back into focus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo miro, no respondo, pero necesito 10 minutos para volver a enfocarme."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le regarde, je ne r\u00e9ponds pas, mais j'ai besoin de 10 minutes pour me recentrer."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u091c\u0935\u093e\u092c \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092b\u094b\u0915\u0938 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0935\u093e\u092a\u0938 \u0906\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f 10 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo guardo, non rispondo, ma ho bisogno di 10 minuti per rimettermi a fuoco."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3001\u7b54\u3048\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304c\u3001\u7126\u70b9\u304c\u623b\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306b 10 \u5206\u304b\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ubcf4\uace0 \ub300\ub2f5\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \ub2e4\uc2dc \ucd08\uc810\uc744 \ub9de\ucd94\ub294 \ub370 10\ubd84\uc774 \ud544\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik kijk ernaar, geef geen antwoord, maar heb 10 minuten nodig om weer scherp te worden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patrz\u0119 na to, nie odpowiadam, ale potrzebuj\u0119 10 minut, \u017ceby si\u0119 skupi\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu olho para ele, n\u00e3o respondo, mas preciso de 10 minutos para voltar ao foco."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044e \u043d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e, \u043d\u0435 \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e, \u043d\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e 10 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430 \u0441\u043e\u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bak\u0131yorum, cevap vermiyorum ama tekrar odaklanmam i\u00e7in 10 dakikaya ihtiyac\u0131m var."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u770b\uff0c\u4f46\u4e0d\u56de\u7b54\uff0c\u9700\u898110\u5206\u949f\u624d\u80fd\u91cd\u65b0\u96c6\u4e2d\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u770b\u8457\u5b83\uff0c\u6c92\u6709\u56de\u7b54\uff0c\u4f46\u9700\u8981 10 \u5206\u9418\u624d\u80fd\u6062\u5fa9\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q6": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du lernst seit 3 Monaten eine harte F\u00e4higkeit (z.B. Programmieren). Es wird gerade z\u00e4h. Jemand erz\u00e4hlt dir von einem neuen, 'viel schnelleren' Weg, um erfolgreich zu werden. Deine Reaktion?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have been learning a hard skill (e.g. programming) for 3 months. It's just getting tough. Someone tells you about a new, 'much faster' way to become successful. Your reaction?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha estado aprendiendo una habilidad dif\u00edcil (por ejemplo, programaci\u00f3n) durante 3 meses. Se est\u00e1 poniendo dif\u00edcil. Alguien le habla de una forma nueva y \"mucho m\u00e1s r\u00e1pida\" de alcanzar el \u00e9xito. \u00bfTu reacci\u00f3n?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous apprenez une comp\u00e9tence technique (par exemple la programmation) depuis 3 mois. Cela devient juste difficile. Quelqu\u2019un vous parle d\u2019une nouvelle mani\u00e8re \u00ab beaucoup plus rapide \u00bb de r\u00e9ussir. Votre r\u00e9action ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0924\u0940\u0928 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u094c\u0936\u0932 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0917\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e\u093f\u0902\u0917) \u0938\u0940\u0916 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u092c\u0938 \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0938\u092b\u0932 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u090f, '\u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0924\u0947\u091c\u093c' \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0924\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai imparato un'abilit\u00e0 difficile (ad esempio la programmazione) per 3 mesi. Sta diventando sempre pi\u00f9 difficile. Qualcuno ti parla di un modo nuovo e \"molto pi\u00f9 veloce\" per avere successo. La tua reazione?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f 3 \u304b\u6708\u9593\u3001\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb (\u30d7\u30ed\u30b0\u30e9\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u306a\u3069) \u3092\u5b66\u7fd2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5927\u5909\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u3001\u6210\u529f\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u3001\u300c\u3082\u3063\u3068\u65e9\u304f\u300d\u65b9\u6cd5\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u6559\u3048\u3066\u304f\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u53cd\u5fdc\u306f\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 3\uac1c\uc6d4 \ub3d9\uc548 \uc5b4\ub824\uc6b4 \uae30\uc220(\uc608: \ud504\ub85c\uadf8\ub798\ubc0d)\uc744 \ubc30\uc6e0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc810\uc810 \ud798\ub4e4\uc5b4\uc9c0\uace0 \uc788\uc5b4\uc694. \ub204\uad70\uac00\uac00 \uc131\uacf5\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uc0c8\ub86d\uace0 '\ud6e8\uc52c \ube60\ub978' \ubc29\ubc95\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc54c\ub824\uc90d\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubc18\uc751\uc740?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je leert al 3 maanden een harde vaardigheid (bijvoorbeeld programmeren). Het wordt gewoon moeilijk. Iemand vertelt je over een nieuwe, \u2018veel snellere\u2019 manier om succesvol te worden. Jouw reactie?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przez 3 miesi\u0105ce uczysz si\u0119 trudnej umiej\u0119tno\u015bci (np. programowania). Robi si\u0119 coraz trudniej. Kto\u015b m\u00f3wi Ci o nowym, \u201eznacznie szybszym\u201d sposobie na odniesienie sukcesu. Twoja reakcja?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 aprendendo uma habilidade dif\u00edcil (por exemplo, programa\u00e7\u00e3o) h\u00e1 3 meses. Est\u00e1 ficando dif\u00edcil. Algu\u00e9m lhe fala sobre uma maneira nova e \u201cmuito mais r\u00e1pida\u201d de ter sucesso. Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0443\u0447\u0438\u0448\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u043d\u0430\u0432\u044b\u043a\u0443 (\u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043c\u0435\u0440, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044e) \u0443\u0436\u0435 3 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0430. \u0421\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0443\u0433\u043e. \u041a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043c, '\u0433\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u043e \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043c' \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0445\u0430. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u0430\u044f \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3 ayd\u0131r zor bir beceri (\u00f6rne\u011fin programlama) \u00f6\u011freniyorsunuz. Gittik\u00e7e zorla\u015f\u0131yor. Birisi size ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 olman\u0131n yeni, '\u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131' bir yolunu anlat\u0131yor. Tepkiniz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u5b66\u4e60\u4e00\u9879\u56f0\u96be\u7684\u6280\u80fd\uff08\u4f8b\u5982\u7f16\u7a0b\uff093\u4e2a\u6708\u4e86\u3002\u73b0\u5728\u5b66\u4e60\u53d8\u5f97\u5f88\u8270\u96be\u3002\u6709\u4eba\u544a\u8bc9\u4f60\u6709\u4e00\u79cd\u65b0\u7684\u201c\u66f4\u5feb\u201d\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\u53ef\u4ee5\u83b7\u5f97\u6210\u529f\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u5e94\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5df2\u7d93\u5b78\u7fd2\u4e00\u9805\u786c\u6280\u80fd\uff08\u4f8b\u5982\u7a0b\u5f0f\u8a2d\u8a08\uff093 \u500b\u6708\u4e86\u3002\u4e8b\u60c5\u8b8a\u5f97\u8d8a\u4f86\u8d8a\u8271\u96e3\u3002\u6709\u4eba\u544a\u8a34\u60a8\u4e00\u7a2e\u65b0\u7684\u3001\u300c\u66f4\u5feb\u300d\u7684\u6210\u529f\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u61c9\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q6.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich breche das Programmieren ab und st\u00fcrze mich mit voller Motivation auf die neue Sache."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I stop programming and throw myself into the new thing with full motivation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejo de programar y me lanzo a lo nuevo con plena motivaci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'arr\u00eate de programmer et me lance dans la nouveaut\u00e9 avec une pleine motivation."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0917\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0930\u0923\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u0908 \u091a\u0940\u091c \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091d\u094b\u0902\u0915 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smetto di programmare e mi butto nella novit\u00e0 con piena motivazione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30d7\u30ed\u30b0\u30e9\u30df\u30f3\u30b0\u3092\u3084\u3081\u3066\u3001\u3084\u308b\u6c17\u6e80\u3005\u3067\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306b\u6253\u3061\u8fbc\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ud504\ub85c\uadf8\ub798\ubc0d\uc744 \uba48\ucd94\uace0 \uc644\uc804\ud55c \uc758\uc695\uc744 \uac00\uc9c0\uace0 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc77c\uc5d0 \ub098 \uc790\uc2e0\uc744 \ub358\uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stop met programmeren en stort mezelf met volle motivatie op het nieuwe."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przestaj\u0119 programowa\u0107 i z pe\u0142n\u0105 motywacj\u0105 rzucam si\u0119 w co\u015b nowego."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paro de programar e me jogo no novo com total motiva\u00e7\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044e \u0437\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043c\u043c\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u0438 \u0431\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0446\u0438\u0435\u0439 \u043d\u0430 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Programlamay\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131p kendimi tam bir motivasyonla yeni \u015feye adad\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u653e\u5f03\u7f16\u7a0b\uff0c\u5168\u8eab\u5fc3\u6295\u5165\u5230\u65b0\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u4e2d\u53bb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u505c\u6b62\u7de8\u7a0b\uff0c\u4e26\u4ee5\u98fd\u6eff\u7684\u52d5\u529b\u6295\u5165\u65b0\u4e8b\u7269\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q6.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich versuche beides gleichzeitig zu machen und scheitere an beidem."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I try to do both at the same time and fail at both."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intento hacer ambas cosas al mismo tiempo y fallo en ambas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'essaie de faire les deux en m\u00eame temps et j'\u00e9choue dans les deux cas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0938\u092b\u0932 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provo a fare entrambe le cose allo stesso tempo e fallisco in entrambe."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u4e21\u65b9\u3092\u540c\u6642\u306b\u3084\u308d\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e21\u65b9\u3068\u3082\u5931\u6557\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub450 \uac00\uc9c0\ub97c \ub3d9\uc2dc\uc5d0 \uc2dc\ub3c4\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \ub458 \ub2e4 \uc2e4\ud328\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik probeer beide tegelijk te doen en faal in beide."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pr\u00f3buj\u0119 robi\u0107 jedno i drugie na raz i w obu przypadkach mi si\u0119 to nie udaje."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tento fazer as duas coisas ao mesmo tempo e falho em ambas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043e\u0431\u0430 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u043f\u043b\u044e \u043d\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0432 \u043e\u0431\u043e\u0438\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130kisini de ayn\u0131 anda yapmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum ama ikisinde de ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oluyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8bd5\u7740\u540c\u65f6\u505a\u4e24\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u4f46\u4e24\u4ef6\u90fd\u5931\u8d25\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5617\u8a66\u540c\u6642\u505a\u9019\u5169\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u4f46\u90fd\u5931\u6557\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q6.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich ignoriere die neue Sache komplett. Der Schmerz bedeutet, dass ich gerade wachse. Ich bleibe dran."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I completely ignore the new thing. The pain means I'm growing. I'll stay tuned."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro por completo lo nuevo. El dolor significa que estoy creciendo. Estar\u00e9 atento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ignore compl\u00e8tement la nouveaut\u00e9. La douleur signifie que je grandis. Je resterai \u00e0 l'\u00e9coute."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0928\u0908 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u094b \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u091c\u093c\u0930\u0905\u0902\u0926\u093e\u091c \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0926 \u0915\u093e \u092e\u0924\u0932\u092c \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0922\u093c \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0928\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro completamente la novit\u00e0. Il dolore significa che sto crescendo. Rester\u00f2 sintonizzato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306e\u306f\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u7121\u8996\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u75db\u307f\u306f\u79c1\u304c\u6210\u9577\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u610f\u5473\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u697d\u3057\u307f\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uac83\uc744 \uc644\uc804\ud788 \ubb34\uc2dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uace0\ud1b5\uc740 \ub0b4\uac00 \uc131\uc7a5\ud558\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc758\ubbf8\ud55c\ub2e4. \uacc4\uc18d \uc9c0\ucf1c\ubd10 \uc8fc\uc2dc\uae30 \ubc14\ub78d\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik negeer het nieuwe volledig. De pijn betekent dat ik groei. Ik blijf op de hoogte."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ca\u0142kowicie ignoruj\u0119 t\u0119 nowo\u015b\u0107. B\u00f3l oznacza, \u017ce \u200b\u200brosn\u0119. B\u0119d\u0119 na bie\u017c\u0105co."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu ignoro completamente a novidade. A dor significa que estou crescendo. Ficarei atento."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0443\u044e \u0432\u0435\u0449\u044c. \u0411\u043e\u043b\u044c \u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u044f \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0443. \u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yeni \u015feyi tamamen g\u00f6rmezden geliyorum. Ac\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fcd\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm anlam\u0131na geliyor. Bizi izlemeye devam edece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u5ffd\u7565\u8fd9\u4ef6\u65b0\u4e8b\u3002\u75bc\u75db\u610f\u5473\u7740\u6211\u6b63\u5728\u6210\u957f\u3002\u6211\u4f1a\u575a\u6301\u4e0b\u53bb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u5ffd\u7565\u4e86\u65b0\u4e8b\u7269\u3002\u75db\u82e6\u610f\u5473\u8457\u6211\u5728\u6210\u9577\u3002\u6211\u6703\u7e7c\u7e8c\u95dc\u6ce8\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q6.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich analysiere die neue Sache kurz rational. Wenn sie objektiv nicht besser ist, arbeite ich unbeeindruckt weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I briefly analyze the new matter rationally. If it's not objectively better, I'll continue working unimpressed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analizo brevemente el nuevo asunto de forma racional. Si no es objetivamente mejor, seguir\u00e9 trabajando sin impresionarme."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J\u2019analyse bri\u00e8vement la nouvelle question de mani\u00e8re rationnelle. Si ce n\u2019est pas objectivement mieux, je continuerai \u00e0 travailler sans \u00eatre impressionn\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0928\u090f \u092e\u093e\u092e\u0932\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0902\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0947\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0924\u0930\u094d\u0915\u0938\u0902\u0917\u0924 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u092f\u0926\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0935\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0941\u0928\u093f\u0937\u094d\u0920 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948, \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092d\u093e\u0935\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analizzo brevemente e razionalmente la nuova questione. Se non \u00e8 oggettivamente migliore, continuer\u00f2 a lavorare senza impressionarmi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u4e8b\u67c4\u3092\u5408\u7406\u7684\u306b\u7c21\u5358\u306b\u5206\u6790\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5ba2\u89b3\u7684\u306b\u826f\u304f\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306f\u3001\u611f\u52d5\u305b\u305a\u306b\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u308b\u3064\u3082\u308a\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ubb38\uc81c\ub97c \ud569\ub9ac\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uac04\ub7b5\ud558\uac8c \ubd84\uc11d\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uac1d\uad00\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub098\uc544\uc9c0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74 \uac10\ub3d9\ubc1b\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \uacc4\uc18d \uc77c\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik analyseer de nieuwe kwestie kort rationeel. Als het objectief gezien niet beter is, ga ik zonder onder de indruk door met werken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kr\u00f3tko i racjonalnie analizuj\u0119 now\u0105 spraw\u0119. Je\u015bli obiektywnie nie b\u0119dzie lepiej, b\u0119d\u0119 dalej pracowa\u0107 bez wra\u017cenia."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Analiso brevemente o novo assunto de forma racional. Se n\u00e3o for objetivamente melhor, continuarei trabalhando sem me impressionar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0442\u043a\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0443\u044e \u0432\u0435\u0449\u044c. \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u043d\u0430 \u043e\u0431\u044a\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435, \u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u043f\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0442\u043b\u044f\u044f\u0441\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yeni konuyu k\u0131saca rasyonel olarak analiz ediyorum. Nesnel olarak daha iyi de\u011filse, etkilenmeden \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya devam edece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7406\u6027\u5730\u7b80\u8981\u5206\u6790\u8fd9\u4ef6\u65b0\u4e8b\u7269\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5b83\u5ba2\u89c2\u4e0a\u6ca1\u6709\u66f4\u597d\uff0c\u6211\u4f1a\u6beb\u4e0d\u52a8\u6447\u5730\u7ee7\u7eed\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c0d\u65b0\u4e8b\u7269\u9032\u884c\u4e86\u7c21\u8981\u7684\u7406\u6027\u5206\u6790\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5ba2\u89c0\u4e0a\u6c92\u6709\u66f4\u597d\uff0c\u6211\u5c07\u4e0d\u70ba\u6240\u52d5\u5730\u7e7c\u7e8c\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q7": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du schaust auf deine To-Do-Liste und siehst 35 Aufgaben, die dich v\u00f6llig erschlagen. Du ger\u00e4tst in Panik. Was ist dein n\u00e4chster Zug?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You look at your to-do list and see 35 tasks that completely overwhelm you. You panic. What's your next move?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Miras tu lista de tareas pendientes y ves 35 tareas que te abruman por completo. Entras en p\u00e1nico. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es tu pr\u00f3ximo paso?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous regardez votre liste de t\u00e2ches et voyez 35 t\u00e2ches qui vous submergent compl\u00e8tement. Vous paniquez. Quelle est votre prochaine \u00e9tape\u00a0?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0938\u0942\u091a\u0940 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902 \u0914\u0930 35 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a \u092a\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0935\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0924\u0941\u092e \u0918\u092c\u0930\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0913. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0905\u0917\u0932\u093e \u0915\u0926\u092e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guardi la tua lista di cose da fare e vedi 35 attivit\u00e0 che ti sopraffanno completamente. Vai nel panico. Qual \u00e8 la tua prossima mossa?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To Do \u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u898b\u308b\u3068\u300135 \u500b\u306e\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u5727\u5012\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u30d1\u30cb\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6b21\u306e\u884c\u52d5\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud560 \uc77c \ubaa9\ub85d\uc744 \ubcf4\uace0 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc744 \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uc555\ub3c4\ud558\ub294 35\uac00\uc9c0 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \ubd05\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ub2f9\ud669\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc74c \ud589\ubcf4\ub294 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je kijkt naar je to-do-lijst en ziet 35 taken die je volledig overweldigen. Je raakt in paniek. Wat is je volgende zet?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patrzysz na swoj\u0105 list\u0119 rzeczy do zrobienia i widzisz 35 zada\u0144, kt\u00f3re ca\u0142kowicie Ci\u0119 przyt\u0142aczaj\u0105. Panikujesz. Jaki jest tw\u00f3j nast\u0119pny ruch?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea olha para sua lista de tarefas e v\u00ea 35 tarefas que o sobrecarregam completamente. Voc\u00ea entra em p\u00e2nico. Qual \u00e9 o seu pr\u00f3ximo passo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0448\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u0434\u0435\u043b \u0438 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0438\u0448\u044c 35 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u044e\u0442. \u0422\u044b \u0432\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0432 \u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0443. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0439 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0448\u0430\u0433?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yap\u0131lacaklar listenize bak\u0131yorsunuz ve sizi tamamen bunaltacak 35 g\u00f6rev g\u00f6r\u00fcyorsunuz. Panik yap\u0131yorsun. Bir sonraki hamleniz ne?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u770b\u7740\u4f60\u7684\u5f85\u529e\u4e8b\u9879\u6e05\u5355\uff0c\u770b\u523035\u9879\u4efb\u52a1\u8ba9\u4f60\u5b8c\u5168\u4e0d\u77e5\u6240\u63aa\u3002\u4f60\u5f00\u59cb\u60ca\u614c\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u4e0b\u4e00\u6b65\u52a8\u4f5c\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u67e5\u770b\u5f85\u8fa6\u4e8b\u9805\u5217\u8868\uff0c\u767c\u73fe 35 \u9805\u4efb\u52d9\u8b93\u60a8\u5fb9\u5e95\u4e0d\u77e5\u6240\u63aa\u3002\u4f60\u9a5a\u614c\u5931\u63aa\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u4e0b\u4e00\u6b65\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q7.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich streiche gnadenlos 32 Aufgaben weg, isoliere die 3 wichtigsten und ignoriere den Rest."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I mercilessly eliminate 32 tasks, isolate the 3 most important and ignore the rest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino sin piedad 32 tareas, a\u00edslo las 3 m\u00e1s importantes e ignoro el resto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J\u2019\u00e9limine sans piti\u00e9 32 t\u00e2ches, j\u2019isole les 3 plus importantes et ignore le reste."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0926\u092f\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0915 32 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u092e\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, 3 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0915\u094b \u0905\u0932\u0917 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u093e\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u091c\u0930\u0905\u0902\u0926\u093e\u091c \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino senza piet\u00e0 32 compiti, isolo i 3 pi\u00f9 importanti e ignoro il resto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u5bb9\u8d66\u306a\u304f 32 \u306e\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3057\u3001\u6700\u3082\u91cd\u8981\u306a 3 \u3064\u306e\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u5206\u96e2\u3057\u3001\u6b8b\u308a\u306f\u7121\u8996\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 32\uac1c\uc758 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \ubb34\uc790\ube44\ud558\uac8c \uc81c\uac70\ud558\uace0 \uac00\uc7a5 \uc911\uc694\ud55c 3\uac1c\ub97c \ubd84\ub9ac\ud558\uace0 \ub098\uba38\uc9c0\ub294 \ubb34\uc2dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik elimineer genadeloos 32 taken, isoleer de 3 belangrijkste en negeer de rest."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bezlito\u015bnie eliminuj\u0119 32 zadania, wyodr\u0119bniam 3 najwa\u017cniejsze, a reszt\u0119 ignoruj\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino impiedosamente 32 tarefas, isolo as 3 mais importantes e ignoro as restantes."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0431\u0435\u0437\u0436\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0432\u044b\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043a\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e 32 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u0432\u044b\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044f\u044e 3 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0445 \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0438 \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "32 g\u00f6revi ac\u0131mas\u0131zca ortadan kald\u0131r\u0131yorum, en \u00f6nemli 3 tanesini ay\u0131r\u0131yorum ve gerisini g\u00f6rmezden geliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u65e0\u60c5\u5730\u5212\u638932\u9879\u4efb\u52a1\uff0c\u9694\u79bb\u51fa\u6700\u91cd\u8981\u76843\u9879\uff0c\u5e76\u5ffd\u7565\u5176\u4f59\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7121\u60c5\u5730\u6d88\u9664\u4e86 32 \u9805\u4efb\u52d9\uff0c\u9694\u96e2\u51fa\u6700\u91cd\u8981\u7684 3 \u9805\uff0c\u5ffd\u7565\u5176\u9918\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q7.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich klappe den Laptop zu, lenke mich ab und hoffe, dass das Gef\u00fchl der \u00dcberforderung weggeht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I close the laptop, distract myself and hope that the feeling of being overwhelmed goes away."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cierro el port\u00e1til, me distraigo y espero que la sensaci\u00f3n de agobio desaparezca."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ferme l'ordinateur portable, me distrait et esp\u00e8re que le sentiment d'\u00eatre d\u00e9pass\u00e9 dispara\u00eetra."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0932\u0948\u092a\u091f\u0949\u092a \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0927\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0928 \u092d\u091f\u0915\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u0936\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u0905\u092d\u093f\u092d\u0942\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935\u0928\u093e \u0926\u0942\u0930 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chiudo il portatile, mi distraggo e spero che la sensazione di sopraffazione se ne vada."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30e9\u30c3\u30d7\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u3092\u9589\u3058\u3066\u6c17\u3092\u7d1b\u3089\u308f\u305b\u3001\u5727\u5012\u3055\u308c\u305f\u6c17\u6301\u3061\u304c\u6d88\u3048\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u671b\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub178\ud2b8\ubd81\uc744 \ub2eb\uace0 \uc815\uc2e0\uc744 \ub534 \ub370\ub85c \ub3cc\ub9ac\uba70 \uc555\ub3c4\ub2f9\ud558\ub294 \ub290\ub08c\uc774 \uc0ac\ub77c\uc9c0\uae30\ub97c \ubc14\ub78d\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik klap de laptop dicht, leid mezelf af en hoop dat het gevoel van overweldiging verdwijnt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zamykam laptopa, odwracam swoj\u0105 uwag\u0119 i mam nadziej\u0119, \u017ce uczucie przyt\u0142oczenia minie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fecho o laptop, me distraio e espero que a sensa\u00e7\u00e3o de estar sobrecarregada desapare\u00e7a."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0437\u0430\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u043d\u043e\u0443\u0442\u0431\u0443\u043a, \u043e\u0442\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0434\u0435\u044e\u0441\u044c, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0443\u0439\u0434\u0451\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diz\u00fcst\u00fc bilgisayar\u0131 kapat\u0131yorum, dikkatimi da\u011f\u0131t\u0131yorum ve bunalm\u0131\u015fl\u0131k hissinin ge\u00e7mesini umuyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5408\u4e0a\u7b14\u8bb0\u672c\u7535\u8111\uff0c\u8f6c\u79fb\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\uff0c\u5e0c\u671b\u90a3\u79cd\u4e0d\u77e5\u6240\u63aa\u7684\u611f\u89c9\u4f1a\u6d88\u5931\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5408\u4e0a\u7b46\u96fb\uff0c\u5206\u6563\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\uff0c\u5e0c\u671b\u90a3\u7a2e\u4e0d\u77e5\u6240\u63aa\u7684\u611f\u89ba\u80fd\u5920\u6d88\u5931\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q7.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich arbeite blind von oben nach unten ab, egal ob die Aufgabe wichtig oder unwichtig ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I work blindly from top to bottom, regardless of whether the task is important or unimportant."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabajo a ciegas, de arriba a abajo, sin importar si la tarea es importante o no."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je travaille \u00e0 l'aveugle de haut en bas, que la t\u00e2che soit importante ou sans importance."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090a\u092a\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0924\u0915 \u0906\u0902\u0916 \u092e\u0942\u0902\u0926\u0915\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0939\u094b \u092f\u093e \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lavoro alla cieca da cima a fondo, indipendentemente dal fatto che il compito sia importante o meno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91cd\u8981\u306a\u4ed5\u4e8b\u304b\u305d\u3046\u3067\u306a\u3044\u4ed5\u4e8b\u304b\u306b\u95a2\u4fc2\u306a\u304f\u3001\u4e0a\u304b\u3089\u4e0b\u307e\u3067\u76f2\u76ee\u7684\u306b\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3092\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc77c\uc774 \uc911\uc694\ud558\ub4e0 \uc911\uc694\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub4e0 \uc0c1\uad00\uc5c6\uc774 \uc704\uc5d0\uc11c \uc544\ub798\ub85c \ub9f9\ubaa9\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uc77c\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik werk blindelings van boven naar beneden, ongeacht of de taak belangrijk of onbelangrijk is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pracuj\u0119 na \u015blepo od g\u00f3ry do do\u0142u, niezale\u017cnie od tego, czy zadanie jest wa\u017cne, czy niewa\u017cne."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabalho cegamente de cima para baixo, independentemente de a tarefa ser importante ou n\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u044e \u0432\u0441\u043b\u0435\u043f\u0443\u044e \u0441\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0445\u0443 \u0432\u043d\u0438\u0437, \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0441\u0438\u043c\u043e \u043e\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0430 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00f6revin \u00f6nemli ya da \u00f6nemsiz olmas\u0131na bakmaks\u0131z\u0131n tepeden t\u0131rna\u011fa k\u00f6r\u00fc k\u00f6r\u00fcne \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u76f2\u76ee\u5730\u4ece\u4e0a\u5230\u4e0b\u5904\u7406\uff0c\u4e0d\u7ba1\u4efb\u52a1\u662f\u91cd\u8981\u8fd8\u662f\u4e0d\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5f9e\u4e0a\u5230\u4e0b\u76f2\u76ee\u5730\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u4e0d\u7ba1\u4efb\u52d9\u91cd\u8981\u9084\u662f\u4e0d\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q7.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verbringe 2 Stunden damit, die Aufgaben neu zu sortieren und farblich zu markieren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I spend 2 hours re-sorting and color-coding the tasks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paso 2 horas reclasificando y codificando por colores las tareas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je passe 2 heures \u00e0 re-trier et \u00e0 coder par couleur les t\u00e2ches."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0915\u094d\u0930\u092e\u092c\u0926\u094d\u0927 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0930\u0902\u0917-\u0915\u094b\u0921\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 2 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trascorro 2 ore a riordinare e codificare a colori le attivit\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u518d\u5206\u985e\u3057\u3066\u8272\u5206\u3051\u3059\u308b\u306e\u306b 2 \u6642\u9593\u3092\u8cbb\u3084\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \ub2e4\uc2dc \uc815\ub82c\ud558\uace0 \uc0c9\uc0c1\uc744 \uc9c0\uc815\ud558\ub294 \ub370 2\uc2dc\uac04\uc774 \uc18c\uc694\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik besteed 2 uur aan het opnieuw sorteren en kleurcoderen van de taken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sp\u0119dzam 2 godziny na ponownym sortowaniu i kodowaniu zada\u0144 kolorami."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passo 2 horas reorganizando e codificando as tarefas por cores."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0447\u0443 2 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u0442\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0437\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438 \u0438 \u043e\u0442\u043c\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0438\u0445 \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00f6revleri yeniden s\u0131ralamak ve renk kodlamas\u0131 yapmak i\u00e7in 2 saat harc\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u82b1\u4e86\u4e24\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u91cd\u65b0\u6574\u7406\u4efb\u52a1\u5e76\u7528\u989c\u8272\u6807\u8bb0\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u82b1\u4e86 2 \u500b\u5c0f\u6642\u5c0d\u4efb\u52d9\u9032\u884c\u91cd\u65b0\u6392\u5e8f\u548c\u984f\u8272\u7de8\u78bc\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q8": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Zug/Bus hat 15 Minuten Versp\u00e4tung oder jemand l\u00e4sst dich unangek\u00fcndigt warten. Du bist unvorbereitet. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your train/bus is 15 minutes late or someone makes you wait unannounced. You are unprepared. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu tren/autob\u00fas llega con 15 minutos de retraso o alguien te hace esperar sin avisar. No est\u00e1s preparado. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre train/bus a 15 minutes de retard ou quelqu'un vous fait attendre \u00e0 l'improviste. Vous n'\u00eates pas pr\u00e9par\u00e9. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928/\u092c\u0938 15 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u0932\u0947\u091f \u0939\u0948 \u092f\u093e \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u092c\u0924\u093e\u090f \u0907\u0902\u0924\u091c\u093c\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0924\u0948\u092f\u093e\u0930 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0902. \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo treno/autobus \u00e8 in ritardo di 15 minuti o qualcuno ti fa aspettare senza preavviso. Sei impreparato. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u96fb\u8eca\u3084\u30d0\u30b9\u304c 15 \u5206\u9045\u308c\u305f\u308a\u3001\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u4e88\u544a\u306a\u3057\u306b\u5f85\u305f\u305b\u305f\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6e96\u5099\u304c\u3067\u304d\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uae30\ucc28/\ubc84\uc2a4\uac00 15\ubd84 \ub2a6\uac70\ub098 \ub204\uad70\uac00\uac00 \uc608\uace0\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uc774 \uae30\ub2e4\ub9ac\uac8c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc900\ube44\uac00 \ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je trein/bus is 15 minuten te laat of iemand laat je onaangekondigd wachten. Je bent onvoorbereid. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j poci\u0105g/autobus jest sp\u00f3\u017aniony 15 minut lub kto\u015b ka\u017ce Ci czeka\u0107 bez zapowiedzi. Jeste\u015b nieprzygotowany. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu trem/\u00f4nibus est\u00e1 15 minutos atrasado ou algu\u00e9m faz voc\u00ea esperar sem avisar. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o est\u00e1 preparado. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0435\u0437\u0434/\u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0441 \u043e\u043f\u0430\u0437\u0434\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0430 15 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0436\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0443\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f. \u0422\u044b \u043d\u0435\u043f\u043e\u0434\u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treniniz/otob\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fcz 15 dakika gecikti ya da birisi sizi haber vermeden bekletti. Haz\u0131rl\u0131ks\u0131zs\u0131n. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u706b\u8f66/\u516c\u4ea4\u665a\u70b9\u4e8615\u5206\u949f\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u6709\u4eba\u8ba9\u4f60\u65e0\u9884\u8b66\u5730\u7b49\u5f85\u3002\u4f60\u6ca1\u6709\u51c6\u5907\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u529e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u706b\u8eca/\u5df4\u58eb\u665a\u9ede 15 \u5206\u9418\uff0c\u6216\u6709\u4eba\u672a\u7d93\u901a\u77e5\u5c31\u8b93\u60a8\u7b49\u5f85\u3002\u4f60\u6beb\u7121\u6e96\u5099\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q8.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00f6ffne automatisch Instagram/TikTok und lasse mich berieseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I automatically open Instagram/TikTok and let myself be showered."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autom\u00e1ticamente abro Instagram/TikTok y me dejo duchar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ouvre automatiquement Instagram/TikTok et je me laisse doucher."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u091a\u093e\u0932\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0907\u0902\u0938\u094d\u091f\u093e\u0917\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e/\u091f\u093f\u0915\u091f\u0949\u0915 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u0939\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apro automaticamente Instagram/TikTok e mi lascio fare la doccia."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram/TikTok \u3092\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u958b\u304d\u3001\u30b7\u30e3\u30ef\u30fc\u3092\u6d74\u3073\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc790\ub3d9\uc73c\ub85c Instagram/TikTok\uc744 \uc5f4\uace0 \uc0e4\uc6cc\ub97c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik open automatisch Instagram/TikTok en laat me douchen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatycznie otwieram Instagram/TikTok i daj\u0119 si\u0119 wyk\u0105pa\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abro automaticamente o Instagram/TikTok e deixo-me tomar banho."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0430\u0432\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e Instagram/TikTok \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044f\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0451\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otomatik olarak Instagram/TikTok'u a\u00e7\u0131yorum ve du\u015f almama izin veriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u6253\u5f00Instagram/TikTok\uff0c\u8ba9\u81ea\u5df1\u88ab\u5185\u5bb9\u6df9\u6ca1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u81ea\u52d5\u6253\u958b Instagram/TikTok\uff0c\u8b93\u81ea\u5df1\u6d17\u6fa1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q8.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich nutze die Zeit, um mental herunterzufahren und einfach nur meine Umgebung zu beobachten (Boredom-Training)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I use the time to mentally shut down and just observe my surroundings (boredom training)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizo el tiempo para cerrarme mentalmente y simplemente observar mi entorno (entrenamiento para el aburrimiento)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'utilise le temps pour m'arr\u00eater mentalement et simplement observer mon environnement (entra\u00eenement contre l'ennui)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0938\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 (\u092c\u094b\u0930\u093f\u092f\u0924 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923) \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sfrutto il tempo per chiudermi mentalmente e osservare semplicemente ci\u00f2 che mi circonda (allenamento contro la noia)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u6642\u9593\u3092\u7cbe\u795e\u7684\u306b\u30b7\u30e3\u30c3\u30c8\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u3057\u3066\u3001\u305f\u3060\u5468\u56f2\u3092\u89b3\u5bdf\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u4f7f\u3044\u307e\u3059\uff08\u9000\u5c48\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8 \uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \uc815\uc2e0\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub2eb\uace0 \uc8fc\ubcc0\uc744 \uad00\ucc30\ud558\ub294 \ub370 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4(\uc2ec\uc2ec\ud568 \ud6c8\ub828)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik gebruik de tijd om me mentaal af te sluiten en alleen maar mijn omgeving te observeren (vervelingstraining)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wykorzystuj\u0119 ten czas na mentalne wy\u0142\u0105czenie si\u0119 i po prostu obserwacj\u0119 otoczenia (trening z nud\u00f3w)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu aproveito o tempo para me desligar mentalmente e apenas observar o que est\u00e1 ao meu redor (treinamento de t\u00e9dio)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0441\u0438\u0445\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043b\u0430\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0430\u0431\u043b\u044e\u0434\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430 \u043e\u043a\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0430\u044e\u0449\u0438\u043c (\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0430 \u0441\u043a\u0443\u043a\u0438)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu zaman\u0131 zihinsel olarak kendimi kapat\u0131p sadece \u00e7evremi g\u00f6zlemlemek i\u00e7in kullan\u0131yorum (s\u0131k\u0131lma e\u011fitimi)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5229\u7528\u8fd9\u6bb5\u65f6\u95f4\u6765\u8ba9\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u7cbe\u795e\u653e\u677e\uff0c\u53ea\u662f\u89c2\u5bdf\u5468\u56f4\u7684\u73af\u5883\uff08\u65e0\u804a\u8bad\u7ec3\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5229\u7528\u9019\u6bb5\u6642\u9593\u5728\u7cbe\u795e\u4e0a\u95dc\u9589\u4e26\u89c0\u5bdf\u5468\u570d\u7684\u74b0\u5883\uff08\u7121\u804a\u8a13\u7df4\uff09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q8.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich rege mich 15 Minuten lang lautstark \u00fcber die Versp\u00e4tung auf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I complain loudly about the delay for 15 minutes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me quejo en voz alta por el retraso de 15 minutos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je me plains bruyamment du retard de 15 minutes."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 15 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f \u0915\u0940 \u0926\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u094b\u0930-\u091c\u094b\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u093f\u0915\u093e\u092f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi lamento a gran voce del ritardo di 15 minuti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15\u5206\u3082\u9045\u308c\u308b\u3068\u5927\u58f0\u3067\u6587\u53e5\u3092\u8a00\u3046\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 15\ubd84 \uc9c0\uc5f0\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \ud070 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub85c \ubd88\ud3c9\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik klaag luid over de vertraging van 15 minuten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u0142o\u015bno narzekam na 15-minutowe op\u00f3\u017anienie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reclamo em voz alta do atraso de 15 minutos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043a\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u043e\u043f\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0432 \u0442\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 15 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 dakikal\u0131k gecikmeden y\u00fcksek sesle \u015fikayet ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u58f0\u62b1\u6028\u5ef6\u8bef\u5341\u4e94\u5206\u949f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u8072\u62b1\u6028\u5ef6\u8aa4\u4e8615\u5206\u9418\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q8.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00f6ffne meine Notizen, beantworte Nachrichten oder h\u00f6re ein H\u00f6rbuch. Keine Zeit wird verschwendet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I open my notes, answer messages or listen to an audio book. No time is wasted."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abro mis notas, respondo mensajes o escucho un audiolibro. No se pierde tiempo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ouvre mes notes, je r\u00e9ponds \u00e0 des messages ou j'\u00e9coute un livre audio. Aucun temps n'est perdu."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u094b\u091f\u094d\u0938 \u0916\u094b\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0936\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0911\u0921\u093f\u092f\u094b \u092a\u0941\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0915 \u0938\u0941\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092c\u0930\u094d\u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apro i miei appunti, rispondo ai messaggi o ascolto un audiolibro. Non si perde tempo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30e1\u30e2\u3092\u958b\u3044\u305f\u308a\u3001\u30e1\u30c3\u30bb\u30fc\u30b8\u306b\u8fd4\u4fe1\u3057\u305f\u308a\u3001\u30aa\u30fc\u30c7\u30a3\u30aa\u30d6\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u805e\u3044\u305f\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6642\u9593\u306f\u7121\u99c4\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub178\ud2b8\ub97c \uc5f4\uace0, \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\uc5d0 \ub2f5\ud558\uace0, \uc624\ub514\uc624\ubd81\uc744 \ub4e3\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc2dc\uac04\uc774 \ub0ad\ube44\ub418\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik open mijn notities, beantwoord berichten of luister naar een audioboek. Er wordt geen tijd verspild."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Otwieram notatki, odpowiadam na wiadomo\u015bci lub s\u0142ucham audiobooka. \u017baden czas nie jest marnowany."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abro minhas anota\u00e7\u00f5es, respondo mensagens ou ou\u00e7o um audiolivro. Nenhum tempo \u00e9 perdido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0442\u043a\u0438, \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0448\u0430\u044e \u0430\u0443\u0434\u0438\u043e\u043a\u043d\u0438\u0433\u0443. \u041d\u0438\u043a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043d\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432\u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0443\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notlar\u0131m\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131yorum, mesajlar\u0131 yan\u0131tl\u0131yorum veya sesli kitap dinliyorum. Zaman bo\u015fa harcanmaz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6253\u5f00\u7b14\u8bb0\u3001\u56de\u590d\u6d88\u606f\u6216\u542c\u6709\u58f0\u4e66\u3002\u6ca1\u6709\u6d6a\u8d39\u65f6\u95f4\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6253\u958b\u7b46\u8a18\u3001\u56de\u8986\u8a0a\u606f\u6216\u807d\u6709\u8072\u66f8\u3002\u6c92\u6709\u6642\u9593\u88ab\u6d6a\u8cbb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q9": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du wolltest jeden Tag ins Gym gehen/lesen. An Tag 18 bricht dein Streak, weil du es einfach vergessen hast. Was ist dein interner Monolog am Tag danach?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You wanted to go to the gym/read every day. On day 18 your streak breaks because you simply forgot. What is your internal monologue the day after?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quer\u00edas ir al gimnasio/leer todos los d\u00edas. El d\u00eda 18 tu racha se rompe porque simplemente lo olvidaste. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es tu mon\u00f3logo interno al d\u00eda siguiente?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous vouliez aller \u00e0 la salle de sport/lire tous les jours. Au jour 18, votre s\u00e9quence s'interrompt parce que vous avez simplement oubli\u00e9. Quel est votre monologue int\u00e9rieur du lendemain ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0926\u093f\u0928 \u091c\u093f\u092e \u091c\u093e\u0928\u093e/\u092a\u0922\u093c\u0928\u093e \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u0947 \u0925\u0947\u0964 18\u0935\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0936\u0943\u0902\u0916\u0932\u093e \u091f\u0942\u091f \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u0906\u092a \u092c\u0938 \u092d\u0942\u0932 \u0917\u090f \u0925\u0947\u0964 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0906\u0902\u0924\u0930\u093f\u0915 \u090f\u0915\u093e\u0932\u093e\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volevi andare in palestra/leggere tutti i giorni. Il giorno 18 la tua serie di vittorie si interrompe perch\u00e9 semplicemente te ne sei dimenticato. Qual \u00e8 il tuo monologo interiore il giorno dopo?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bce\u65e5\u30b8\u30e0\u306b\u884c\u3063\u305f\u308a\u672c\u3092\u8aad\u3093\u3060\u308a\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002 18 \u65e5\u76ee\u306b\u306f\u3001\u5358\u7d14\u306b\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u305f\u3081\u3001\u9023\u7d9a\u8a18\u9332\u304c\u9014\u5207\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u7fcc\u65e5\u306e\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u5185\u306a\u308b\u72ec\u308a\u8a00\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uccb4\uc721\uad00\uc5d0 \uac00\uace0 \uc2f6\uac70\ub098 \ub9e4\uc77c \ucc45\uc744 \uc77d\uace0 \uc2f6\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 18\uc77c\uc9f8\uc5d0\ub294 \ub2e8\uc21c\ud788 \uc78a\uc5b4\ubc84\ub838\uae30 \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 \uc5f0\uc18d \uae30\ub85d\uc774 \uae68\uc84c\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc74c\ub0a0 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ub0b4\ubd80 \ub3c5\ubc31\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je wilde elke dag naar de sportschool gaan/lezen. Op dag 18 breekt je streak omdat je het gewoon vergeten bent. Wat is je interne monoloog de dag erna?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chcia\u0142a\u015b codziennie chodzi\u0107 na si\u0142owni\u0119/czyta\u0107. W 18. dniu Twoja passa zostanie przerwana, poniewa\u017c po prostu zapomnia\u0142e\u015b. Jaki jest Tw\u00f3j wewn\u0119trzny monolog nast\u0119pnego dnia?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea queria ir \u00e0 academia/ler todos os dias. No dia 18, sua seq\u00fc\u00eancia de rebatidas quebra porque voc\u00ea simplesmente esqueceu. Qual \u00e9 o seu mon\u00f3logo interno no dia seguinte?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0445\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043b \u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0437\u0430\u043b/\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c. \u041d\u0430 18-\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0438\u044f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0431\u044b\u043b. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432\u044b \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0432\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043c\u044b\u0448\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her g\u00fcn spor salonuna gitmek/kitap okumak istediniz. 18. g\u00fcnde seriniz k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc unuttunuz. Ertesi g\u00fcn i\u00e7 monolo\u011funuz nedir?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u672c\u6765\u60f3\u6bcf\u5929\u53bb\u5065\u8eab\u623f/\u770b\u4e66\u3002\u7b2c18\u5929\u4f60\u56e0\u4e3a\u5fd8\u8bb0\u800c\u6253\u65ad\u4e86\u4f60\u7684\u8fde\u80dc\u3002\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u4f60\u7684\u5185\u5fc3\u72ec\u767d\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u60f3\u53bb\u5065\u8eab\u623f/\u6bcf\u5929\u8b80\u66f8\u3002\u7b2c 18 \u5929\uff0c\u4f60\u7684\u9023\u7e8c\u8a18\u9304\u5c31\u7d42\u6b62\u4e86\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u4f60\u5fd8\u8a18\u4e86\u3002\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u4f60\u7684\u5167\u5fc3\u7368\u767d\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q9.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Jetzt ist der Streak eh kaputt. Ich fange am Montag wieder neu an.'"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Now the streak is broken anyway. I'll start again on Monday.'"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Ahora la racha se ha roto de todos modos. Empezar\u00e9 de nuevo el lunes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Maintenant, la s\u00e9quence est interrompue de toute fa\u00e7on. Je recommencerai lundi."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'\u0905\u092c \u092f\u0939 \u0938\u093f\u0932\u0938\u093f\u0932\u093e \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0940 \u091f\u0942\u091f \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u092e\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964'"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00abAdesso comunque la serie di vittorie \u00e8 interrotta. Luned\u00ec ricomincio\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u300c\u3044\u305a\u308c\u306b\u305b\u3088\u3001\u3053\u308c\u3067\u9023\u52dd\u8a18\u9332\u306f\u9014\u5207\u308c\u305f\u3002\u6708\u66dc\u65e5\u304b\u3089\u307e\u305f\u59cb\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002\u300d"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'\uc774\uc81c \uc5b4\uca0c\ub4e0 \uadf8 \ud589\uc9c4\uc740 \uae68\uc84c\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc6d4\uc694\uc77c\ubd80\ud130 \ub2e4\uc2dc \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.'"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Nu is de streak toch gebroken. Maandag begin ik weer.'"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "- Teraz passa i tak zosta\u0142a przerwana. Zaczn\u0119 od nowa w poniedzia\u0142ek."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Agora a sequ\u00eancia est\u00e1 quebrada de qualquer maneira. Come\u00e7arei de novo na segunda-feira."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00ab\u0422\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440\u044c \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0438\u044f \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0441\u043b\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0430. \u042f \u043d\u0430\u0447\u043d\u0443 \u0437\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e \u0432 \u043f\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043a.\u00bb"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'Art\u0131k seri yine de bozuldu. Pazartesi g\u00fcn\u00fc tekrar ba\u015flayaca\u011f\u0131m.'"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u2018\u73b0\u5728\u8fde\u80dc\u53cd\u6b63\u5df2\u7ecf\u65ad\u4e86\u3002\u6211\u661f\u671f\u4e00\u91cd\u65b0\u5f00\u59cb\u3002\u2019"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u300c\u73fe\u5728\u7121\u8ad6\u5982\u4f55\uff0c\u9023\u52dd\u7d00\u9304\u90fd\u88ab\u6253\u7834\u4e86\u3002\u6211\u6703\u5728\u5468\u4e00\u91cd\u65b0\u958b\u59cb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q9.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bestrafe mich mental daf\u00fcr, wie unf\u00e4hig ich bin, und zweifle an mir."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I mentally punish myself for how incompetent I am and doubt myself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me castigo mentalmente por lo incompetente que soy y dudo de m\u00ed mismo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je me punis mentalement pour mon incomp\u00e9tence et je doute de moi-m\u00eame."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0938\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0902\u0921\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0905\u0915\u094d\u0937\u092e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u092a\u0930 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0939 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi punisco mentalmente per quanto sono incompetente e dubito di me stesso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u3069\u308c\u307b\u3069\u7121\u80fd\u3067\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3092\u7cbe\u795e\u7684\u306b\u7f70\u3057\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u81ea\u8eab\u3092\u7591\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0b4\uac00 \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ubb34\ub2a5\ud55c\uc9c0 \uc815\uc2e0\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub098 \uc790\uc2e0\uc744 \ucc98\ubc8c\ud558\uace0 \ub098 \uc790\uc2e0\uc744 \uc758\uc2ec\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik straf mezelf mentaal voor hoe incompetent ik ben en twijfel aan mezelf."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Karz\u0119 si\u0119 psychicznie za swoj\u0105 niekompetencj\u0119 i w\u0105tpi\u0119 w siebie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu me castigo mentalmente por ser incompetente e duvido de mim mesmo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043c\u044b\u0441\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0430\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0437\u0430 \u0442\u043e, \u043a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0439 \u044f \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043d\u044b\u0439, \u0438 \u0441\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0432 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne kadar beceriksiz oldu\u011fum i\u00e7in kendimi zihinsel olarak cezaland\u0131r\u0131yorum ve kendimden \u015f\u00fcphe ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u5fc3\u7406\u4e0a\u60e9\u7f5a\u81ea\u5df1\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u6709\u591a\u4e48\u65e0\u80fd\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u6000\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u7cbe\u795e\u4e0a\u61f2\u7f70\u81ea\u5df1\u662f\u591a\u9ebc\u7121\u80fd\u4e26\u61f7\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q9.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gar nichts. Ich analysiere, warum ich es vergessen habe, baue eine Erinnerung ein und mache heute weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing at all. I analyze why I forgot it, put a reminder in it, and move on today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nada en absoluto. Analizo por qu\u00e9 lo olvid\u00e9, le pongo un recordatorio y sigo adelante hoy."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rien du tout. J'analyse pourquoi je l'ai oubli\u00e9, j'y mets un rappel et je passe \u00e0 autre chose aujourd'hui."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u0941\u091b \u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0932\u0947\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u092d\u0942\u0932 \u0917\u092f\u093e, \u0907\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0938\u094d\u092e\u093e\u0930\u0915 \u0921\u093e\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u091c \u0906\u0917\u0947 \u092c\u0922\u093c\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niente di niente. Analizzo il motivo per cui l'ho dimenticato, ci metto un promemoria e vado avanti oggi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f55\u3082\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u306a\u305c\u5fd8\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u306e\u304b\u3092\u5206\u6790\u3057\u3001\u30ea\u30de\u30a4\u30f3\u30c0\u30fc\u3092\u5165\u308c\u3066\u3001\u4eca\u65e5\u3092\u9032\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc804\ud600 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc78a\uc5b4\ubc84\ub9b0 \uc774\uc720\ub97c \ubd84\uc11d\ud558\uace0 \uc54c\ub9bc\uc744 \ub123\uc740 \ub4a4 \uc624\ub298\uc744 \uc774\uc5b4\uac11\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helemaal niets. Ik analyseer waarom ik het vergeten ben, stop er een herinnering in en ga vandaag verder."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nic. Analizuj\u0119, dlaczego o tym zapomnia\u0142em, umieszczam przypomnienie i id\u0119 dalej."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Absolutamente nada. Analiso por que esqueci, coloco um lembrete e sigo em frente hoje."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e. \u042f \u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e, \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u044f \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0437\u0430\u0431\u044b\u043b, \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430\u043f\u043e\u043c\u0438\u043d\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7bir \u015fey. Neden unuttu\u011fumu analiz edip, i\u00e7ine bir hat\u0131rlatma koyuyorum ve bug\u00fcn yoluma devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e00\u70b9\u4e5f\u4e0d\u3002\u6211\u5206\u6790\u81ea\u5df1\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u5fd8\u8bb0\u4e86\u5b83\uff0c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4e00\u4e2a\u63d0\u9192\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u4eca\u5929\u7ee7\u7eed\u505a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ec0\u9ebc\u90fd\u6c92\u6709\u3002\u6211\u5206\u6790\u70ba\u4ec0\u9ebc\u6211\u5fd8\u8a18\u4e86\u5b83\uff0c\u5728\u88e1\u9762\u6dfb\u52a0\u4e00\u500b\u63d0\u9192\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u4eca\u5929\u7e7c\u7e8c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q9.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich versuche heute die doppelte Menge zu machen, um gestern auszugleichen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm trying to make double the amount today to make up for yesterday."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy tratando de ganar el doble de la cantidad hoy para compensar lo de ayer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'essaie de gagner le double du montant d'aujourd'hui pour rattraper celui d'hier."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0932 \u0915\u0940 \u092d\u0930\u092a\u093e\u0908 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0906\u091c \u0926\u094b\u0917\u0941\u0928\u0940 \u0930\u0915\u092e \u0915\u092e\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sto cercando di raddoppiare la cifra oggi per compensare quella di ieri."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6628\u65e5\u306e\u5206\u3092\u53d6\u308a\u623b\u3059\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u500d\u306e\u91cf\u3092\u4f5c\u308d\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5b4\uc81c\ub97c \ubcf4\uc0c1\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uc624\ub298 \uae08\uc561\uc758 \ub450 \ubc30\ub97c \ubc8c\ub824\uace0 \ub178\ub825 \uc911\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik probeer vandaag het dubbele bedrag te verdienen om gisteren goed te maken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pr\u00f3buj\u0119 dzisiaj zarobi\u0107 podw\u00f3jn\u0105 kwot\u0119, \u017ceby nadrobi\u0107 wczoraj."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou tentando ganhar o dobro hoje para compensar ontem."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f \u044f \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0434\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0435\u043d\u0441\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0447\u0435\u0440\u0430\u0448\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u00fcnk\u00fc telafi i\u00e7in bug\u00fcn miktar\u0131n iki kat\u0131n\u0131 kazanmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u5c1d\u8bd5\u505a\u53cc\u500d\u7684\u91cf\uff0c\u4ee5\u5f25\u8865\u6628\u5929\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u52aa\u529b\u8cfa\u96d9\u500d\u7684\u9322\u4f86\u5f4c\u88dc\u6628\u5929\u7684\u640d\u5931\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q10": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du probierst ein neues Lernsystem oder einen neuen Workflow aus, aber nach 2 Wochen hast du das Gef\u00fchl, es bringt nichts. Was machst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You try out a new learning system or workflow, but after 2 weeks you feel like it's not working. What are you doing?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pruebas un nuevo sistema de aprendizaje o flujo de trabajo, pero despu\u00e9s de 2 semanas sientes que no funciona. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1s haciendo?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous essayez un nouveau syst\u00e8me d'apprentissage ou un nouveau workflow, mais apr\u00e8s 2 semaines, vous avez l'impression que cela ne fonctionne pas. Que fais-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u0908 \u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0923\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u092f\u093e \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0915\u092b\u093c\u094d\u0932\u094b \u0906\u091c\u093c\u092e\u093e\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 2 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u094b?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provi un nuovo sistema di apprendimento o flusso di lavoro, ma dopo 2 settimane hai la sensazione che non funzioni. Cosa fai?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u5b66\u7fd2\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3084\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u30d5\u30ed\u30fc\u3092\u8a66\u3057\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u30012 \u9031\u9593\u5f8c\u306b\u306f\u52b9\u679c\u304c\u306a\u3044\u3068\u611f\u3058\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u3057\u3066\u308b\u306e\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud559\uc2b5 \uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c\uc774\ub098 \uc791\uc5c5 \ud750\ub984\uc744 \uc2dc\ud5d8\ud574 \ubcf4\uc9c0\ub9cc 2\uc8fc \ud6c4\uc5d0\ub294 \uc791\ub3d9\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294 \uac83 \uac19\uc740 \ub290\ub08c\uc774 \ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb50\ud558\uc138\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je probeert een nieuw leersysteem of workflow uit, maar na 2 weken heb je het gevoel dat het niet werkt. Wat ben je aan het doen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wypr\u00f3bujesz nowy system nauczania lub przep\u0142yw pracy, ale po 2 tygodniach czujesz, \u017ce to nie dzia\u0142a. Co robisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea experimenta um novo sistema de aprendizagem ou fluxo de trabalho, mas depois de duas semanas sente que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 funcionando. O que voc\u00ea est\u00e1 fazendo?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0443\u044e \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u043e\u0431\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0447\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0446\u0435\u0441\u0441, \u043d\u043e \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 2 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0438 \u043a \u0447\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yeni bir \u00f6\u011frenme sistemi veya i\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 deniyorsunuz ancak 2 hafta sonra bunun i\u015fe yaramad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorsunuz. Ne yap\u0131yorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5c1d\u8bd5\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u7684\u5b66\u4e60\u7cfb\u7edf\u6216\u65b0\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u6d41\u7a0b\uff0c\u4f46\u4e24\u5468\u540e\u4f60\u611f\u89c9\u6ca1\u6709\u7528\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u505a\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5617\u8a66\u65b0\u7684\u5b78\u7fd2\u7cfb\u7d71\u6216\u5de5\u4f5c\u6d41\u7a0b\uff0c\u4f46\u5169\u9031\u5f8c\u60a8\u611f\u89ba\u5b83\u4e0d\u8d77\u4f5c\u7528\u3002\u4f60\u5728\u5e79\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q10.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich wechsle sofort wieder zu meiner alten Methode, die war bequemer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I immediately switch back to my old method, it was more convenient."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inmediatamente vuelvo a mi antiguo m\u00e9todo, era m\u00e1s conveniente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je reviens imm\u00e9diatement \u00e0 mon ancienne m\u00e9thode, c'\u00e9tait plus pratique."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u092a\u0941\u0930\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u092a\u0926\u094d\u0927\u0924\u093f \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093e\u092a\u0938 \u0906 \u0917\u092f\u093e, \u092f\u0939 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u0941\u0935\u093f\u0927\u093e\u091c\u0928\u0915 \u0925\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ritorno subito al mio vecchio metodo, era pi\u00f9 conveniente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3059\u3050\u306b\u4ee5\u524d\u306e\u65b9\u6cd5\u306b\u623b\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u305d\u306e\u65b9\u304c\u4fbf\u5229\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc989\uc2dc \uc774\uc804 \ubc29\ubc95\uc73c\ub85c \ub2e4\uc2dc \uc804\ud658\ud588\ub294\ub370, \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \ub354 \ud3b8\ub9ac\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik schakel meteen terug naar mijn oude methode, dat was handiger."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Od razu wracam do mojej starej metody, by\u0142a wygodniejsza."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voltei imediatamente para o meu m\u00e9todo antigo, era mais conveniente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0436\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043a \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u043c\u0435\u0442\u043e\u0434\u0443, \u043e\u043d \u0431\u044b\u043b \u0443\u0434\u043e\u0431\u043d\u0435\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen eski y\u00f6ntemime d\u00f6n\u00fcyorum, daha kullan\u0131\u015fl\u0131yd\u0131."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9a6c\u4e0a\u53c8\u56de\u5230\u6211\u4ee5\u524d\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\uff0c\u90a3\u66f4\u65b9\u4fbf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u6539\u56de\u539f\u4f86\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\uff0c\u9019\u6a23\u6bd4\u8f03\u65b9\u4fbf\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q10.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schaue mir die harten Daten an (Noten, Zeiten). Wenn die nicht besser wurden, passe ich das System an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I look at the hard data (grades, times). If they don't get better, I'll adjust the system."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Miro los datos concretos (notas, tiempos). Si no mejoran, ajustar\u00e9 el sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je regarde les donn\u00e9es concr\u00e8tes (notes, temps). S'ils ne s'am\u00e9liorent pas, j'ajusterai le syst\u00e8me."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928 \u0921\u0947\u091f\u093e (\u0917\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0921, \u0938\u092e\u092f) \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u092f\u0926\u093f \u0935\u0947 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u093f\u0938\u094d\u091f\u092e \u0915\u094b \u0938\u092e\u093e\u092f\u094b\u091c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Guardo i dati concreti (voti, tempi). Se non migliorano, adeguer\u00f2 il sistema."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\uff08\u6210\u7e3e\u3001\u30bf\u30a4\u30e0\uff09\u3092\u898b\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6539\u5584\u3057\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306f\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3092\u8abf\u6574\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud558\ub4dc\ub370\uc774\ud130(\uc131\uc801, \ud68c\ucc28)\ub97c \ubd05\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\uc544\uc9c0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74 \uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c\uc744 \uc870\uc815\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik kijk naar de harde gegevens (cijfers, tijden). Als ze niet beter worden, pas ik het systeem aan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patrz\u0119 na twarde dane (oceny, czasy). Je\u015bli sytuacja si\u0119 nie poprawi, dostosuj\u0119 system."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu olho para os dados concretos (notas, tempos). Se n\u00e3o melhorarem, ajustarei o sistema."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044e \u043d\u0430 \u0436\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 (\u043e\u0446\u0435\u043d\u043a\u0438, \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0430). \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u043d\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c, \u044f \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Somut verilere (notlar, zamanlar) bak\u0131yorum. E\u011fer d\u00fczelmezlerse sistemi ayarlayaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u67e5\u770b\u786c\u6570\u636e\uff08\u6210\u7ee9\u3001\u65f6\u95f4\uff09\u3002\u5982\u679c\u8fd9\u4e9b\u6ca1\u6709\u6539\u5584\uff0c\u6211\u4f1a\u8c03\u6574\u7cfb\u7edf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u67e5\u770b\u786c\u6578\u64da\uff08\u6210\u7e3e\u3001\u6642\u9593\uff09\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4ed6\u5011\u6c92\u6709\u597d\u8f49\uff0c\u6211\u6703\u8abf\u6574\u7cfb\u7d71\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q10.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich ziehe es stumpf weitere 3 Monate durch, auch wenn es nicht funktioniert (blinder Flei\u00df)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll just stick with it for another 3 months, even if it doesn't work (blind diligence)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seguir\u00e9 haci\u00e9ndolo otros 3 meses, incluso si no funciona (diligencia ciega)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais m'y tenir encore 3 mois, m\u00eame si \u00e7a ne marche pas (diligence aveugle)."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0947 3 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0932\u0917\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e, \u092d\u0932\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0947 (\u0905\u0902\u0927\u093e \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0930\u092e)\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer\u00f2 a farlo per altri 3 mesi, anche se non funziona (cieca diligenza)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305f\u3068\u3048\u52b9\u679c\u304c\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u3042\u30683\u304b\u6708\u306f\u7d9a\u3051\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3059\uff08\u76f2\u76ee\u7684\u306a\u52e4\u52c9\u3055\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc548 \ub418\ub354\ub77c\ub3c4 3\uac1c\uc6d4\ub9cc \ub354 \ubc84\ud2f0\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4(\ub9f9\ubaa9\uc801\uc778 \uadfc\uba74)."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik blijf er gewoon nog 3 maanden mee doorgaan, ook al werkt het niet (blinde diligence)."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po prostu b\u0119d\u0119 si\u0119 tego trzyma\u0107 przez kolejne 3 miesi\u0105ce, nawet je\u015bli to nie zadzia\u0142a (\u015blepa staranno\u015b\u0107)."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou continuar por mais 3 meses, mesmo que n\u00e3o funcione (dilig\u00eancia cega)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0442\u0443\u043f\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0443 \u0435\u0449\u0435 3 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0430, \u0434\u0430\u0436\u0435 \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c (\u0441\u043b\u0435\u043f\u0430\u044f \u0443\u0441\u0435\u0440\u0434\u0438\u0435)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130\u015fe yaramasa bile (k\u00f6r titizlik) buna 3 ay daha devam edece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u6b7b\u677f\u5730\u518d\u575a\u6301\u4e09\u4e2a\u6708\uff0c\u5373\u4f7f\u5b83\u4e0d\u8d77\u4f5c\u7528\uff08\u76f2\u76ee\u7684\u52aa\u529b\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u4f7f\u4e0d\u8d77\u4f5c\u7528\uff08\u76f2\u76ee\u52aa\u529b\uff09\uff0c\u6211\u4e5f\u6703\u518d\u5805\u6301\u4e09\u500b\u6708\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q10.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich kaufe mir ein Buch/einen Kurs dar\u00fcber, wie man besser lernt, anstatt selbst nachzudenken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm buying a book/course on how to learn better instead of thinking for myself."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy comprando un libro/curso sobre c\u00f3mo aprender mejor en lugar de pensar por m\u00ed mismo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ach\u00e8te un livre/un cours sur la fa\u00e7on de mieux apprendre au lieu de penser par moi-m\u00eame."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u091c\u093e\u092f \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930 \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0940\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u093e\u092c/\u092a\u093e\u0920\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u092e \u0916\u0930\u0940\u0926 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sto comprando un libro/corso su come imparare meglio invece di pensare con la mia testa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u5206\u3067\u8003\u3048\u308b\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u304f\u3001\u3088\u308a\u826f\u304f\u5b66\u3076\u65b9\u6cd5\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u306e\u672c\u3084\u30b3\u30fc\u30b9\u3092\u8cfc\u5165\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \uc0dd\uac01\ud558\ub294 \ub300\uc2e0 \ub354 \uc798 \ubc30\uc6b0\ub294 \ubc29\ubc95\uc5d0 \uad00\ud55c \ucc45/\uac15\uc88c\ub97c \uad6c\uc785\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik koop een boek/cursus over hoe ik beter kan leren in plaats van zelf na te denken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupuj\u0119 ksi\u0105\u017ck\u0119/kurs o tym, jak lepiej si\u0119 uczy\u0107, zamiast samodzielnie my\u015ble\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou comprando um livro/curso sobre como aprender melhor em vez de pensar por mim mesmo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0443\u043f\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043a\u043d\u0438\u0433\u0443/\u043a\u0443\u0440\u0441 \u043e \u0442\u043e\u043c, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435 \u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f, \u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0430\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendi ad\u0131ma d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnmek yerine nas\u0131l daha iyi \u00f6\u011frenebilece\u011fime dair bir kitap/kurs sat\u0131n al\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ed9\u81ea\u5df1\u4e70\u4e86\u4e00\u672c\u4e66/\u4e00\u95e8\u5173\u4e8e\u5982\u4f55\u66f4\u597d\u5b66\u4e60\u7684\u8bfe\u7a0b\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u81ea\u5df1\u601d\u8003\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6b63\u5728\u8cfc\u8cb7\u4e00\u672c\u95dc\u65bc\u5982\u4f55\u66f4\u597d\u5730\u5b78\u7fd2\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u81ea\u5df1\u601d\u8003\u7684\u66f8/\u8ab2\u7a0b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q11": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du musst bei einem Projekt mit anderen zusammenarbeiten. Deine Partner sind langsam und unzuverl\u00e4ssig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You need to collaborate with others on a project. Your partners are slow and unreliable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitas colaborar con otros en un proyecto. Tus socios son lentos y poco confiables."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous devez collaborer avec d\u2019autres sur un projet. Vos partenaires sont lents et peu fiables."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u092a\u0930 \u0926\u0942\u0938\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u0939\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925\u0940 \u0927\u0940\u092e\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0935\u0938\u0928\u0940\u092f \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devi collaborare con altri su un progetto. I tuoi partner sono lenti e inaffidabili."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u4ed6\u306e\u4eba\u3068\u5354\u529b\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u30ca\u30fc\u306f\u9045\u304f\u3066\u4fe1\u983c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uc5d0\uc11c \ub2e4\ub978 \uc0ac\ub78c\ub4e4\uacfc \ud611\ub825\ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadc0\ud558\uc758 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108\ub294 \ub290\ub9ac\uace0 \uc2e0\ub8b0\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je moet samenwerken met anderen aan een project. Uw partners zijn traag en onbetrouwbaar."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musisz wsp\u00f3\u0142pracowa\u0107 z innymi nad projektem. Twoi partnerzy s\u0105 powolni i zawodni."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea precisa colaborar com outras pessoas em um projeto. Seus parceiros s\u00e3o lentos e n\u00e3o confi\u00e1veis."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0435 \u0441 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u043c\u0438. \u0422\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0442\u043d\u0451\u0440\u044b \u043c\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0438 \u043d\u0435\u043d\u0430\u0434\u0451\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir projede ba\u015fkalar\u0131yla i\u015fbirli\u011fi yapman\u0131z gerekir. Ortaklar\u0131n\u0131z yava\u015f ve g\u00fcvenilmez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5fc5\u987b\u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u9879\u76ee\u4e2d\u4e0e\u4ed6\u4eba\u5408\u4f5c\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u5408\u4f5c\u4f19\u4f34\u5f88\u6162\u4e14\u4e0d\u53ef\u9760\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u9700\u8981\u8207\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u5408\u4f5c\u5b8c\u6210\u4e00\u500b\u5c08\u6848\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u5408\u4f5c\u5925\u4f34\u884c\u52d5\u9072\u7de9\u4e14\u4e0d\u53ef\u9760\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q11.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache einfach alles selbst. Dann wei\u00df ich, dass es perfekt wird."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I just do everything myself. Then I know it will be perfect."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simplemente hago todo yo mismo. Entonces s\u00e9 que ser\u00e1 perfecto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je fais tout moi-m\u00eame. Alors je sais que ce sera parfait."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0938 \u0938\u092c \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. \u0924\u092c \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u092e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faccio semplicemente tutto da solo. Allora so che sar\u00e0 perfetto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u81ea\u5206\u3067\u3084\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002\u305d\u3046\u3059\u308c\u3070\u5b8c\u74a7\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u308f\u304b\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub2e8\uc9c0 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uac83\uc744 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \ud560 \ubfd0\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub7ec\uba74 \ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \uc644\ubcbd\ud560 \uac83\uc774\ub77c\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc555\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik doe gewoon alles zelf. Dan weet ik dat het perfect zal zijn."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po prostu wszystko robi\u0119 sam. Wtedy wiem, \u017ce b\u0119dzie idealnie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu simplesmente fa\u00e7o tudo sozinho. Ent\u00e3o eu sei que ser\u00e1 perfeito."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0441\u0430\u043c. \u0422\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u044f \u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her \u015feyi kendim yap\u0131yorum. O zaman m\u00fckemmel olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 biliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5e72\u4ec0\u4e48\u90fd\u81ea\u5df1\u505a\u3002\u8fd9\u6837\u6211\u5c31\u77e5\u9053\u4f1a\u5b8c\u7f8e\u65e0\u7f3a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u81ea\u5df1\u505a\u4e00\u5207\u3002\u7136\u5f8c\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u9019\u5c07\u662f\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q11.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich setze ihnen knallharte, extrem kleine Deadlines und kontrolliere sie t\u00e4glich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I set them tough, extremely short deadlines and check them daily."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les pongo plazos estrictos y extremadamente cortos y los reviso a diario."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je leur fixe des d\u00e9lais stricts, extr\u00eamement courts, et je les v\u00e9rifie quotidiennement."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0928\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928, \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u091b\u094b\u091f\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u092f-\u0938\u0940\u092e\u093e \u0924\u092f \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0930\u094b\u091c\u093e\u0928\u093e \u0909\u0928\u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ho fissato scadenze rigorose ed estremamente brevi e le controllo quotidianamente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53b3\u3057\u304f\u3001\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u77ed\u3044\u671f\u9650\u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u3001\u6bce\u65e5\u30c1\u30a7\u30c3\u30af\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\ub4e4\uc744 \uae4c\ub2e4\ub86d\uace0 \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \uc9e7\uc740 \ub9c8\uac10\uc77c\ub85c \uc124\uc815\ud558\uace0 \ub9e4\uc77c \ud655\uc778\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stel ze harde, extreem korte deadlines en controleer ze dagelijks."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wyznaczam im rygorystyczne, niezwykle kr\u00f3tkie terminy i codziennie je sprawdzam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu estabele\u00e7o prazos r\u00edgidos e extremamente curtos e os verifico diariamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044e \u0438\u043c \u0436\u0451\u0441\u0442\u043a\u0438\u0435, \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u043c\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u044c\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0438 \u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0438\u0445 \u0435\u0436\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0432\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onlara zorlu, son derece k\u0131sa teslim tarihleri \u200b\u200bbelirliyorum ve bunlar\u0131 her g\u00fcn kontrol ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ed9\u4ed6\u4eec\u8bbe\u5b9a\u975e\u5e38\u4e25\u683c\u3001\u6781\u5176\u7d27\u8feb\u7684\u622a\u6b62\u65e5\u671f\uff0c\u5e76\u6bcf\u5929\u8fdb\u884c\u76d1\u7763\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7d66\u5b83\u5011\u8a2d\u5b9a\u4e86\u56b4\u683c\u3001\u6975\u77ed\u7684\u671f\u9650\uff0c\u4e26\u6bcf\u5929\u6aa2\u67e5\u5b83\u5011\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q11.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich rege mich beim Lehrer/Chef auf, liefere aber am Ende nur meinen Teil ab."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I get upset with the teacher/boss, but in the end I just do my part."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me enojo con el maestro/jefe, pero al final simplemente hago mi parte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suis en col\u00e8re contre le professeur/patron, mais en fin de compte, je fais juste ma part."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0915/\u092c\u0949\u0938 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0930\u0947\u0936\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0938 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi arrabbio con l'insegnante/capo, ma alla fine faccio solo la mia parte."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5148\u751f\u3084\u4e0a\u53f8\u306b\u306f\u8179\u304c\u7acb\u3061\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u7d50\u5c40\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u5f79\u5272\u3092\u679c\u305f\u3059\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc120\uc0dd\ub2d8/\uc0c1\uc0ac\uc5d0\uac8c \ud654\uac00 \ub098\uc9c0\ub9cc \uacb0\uad6d \ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \uc5ed\ud560\uc744 \ub2e4\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik word boos op de leraar/baas, maar uiteindelijk doe ik gewoon mijn deel."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denerwuj\u0119 si\u0119 na nauczyciela/szefa, ale ostatecznie robi\u0119, co do mnie nale\u017cy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fico chateado com o professor/chefe, mas no final apenas fa\u00e7o a minha parte."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0437\u043b\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f/\u0448\u0435\u0444\u0430, \u043d\u043e \u0432 \u0438\u0442\u043e\u0433\u0435 \u0441\u0434\u0430\u044e \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u044e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6\u011fretmene/patronuma k\u0131z\u0131yorum ama sonunda \u00fczerime d\u00fc\u015feni yap\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u5bf9\u8001\u5e08/\u8001\u677f\u53d1\u706b\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u540e\u53ea\u4ea4\u4ed8\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u4e00\u90e8\u5206\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c0d\u8001\u5e2b/\u8001\u95c6\u611f\u5230\u4e0d\u6eff\uff0c\u4f46\u6700\u7d42\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u76e1\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u4e00\u4efd\u529b\u91cf\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q11.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich passe mich ihrem langsamen Tempo an, um keinen Stress in der Gruppe zu verursaken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I adapt to their slow pace so as not to cause stress in the group."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me adapto a su ritmo lento para no causar estr\u00e9s en el grupo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m'adapte \u00e0 leur rythme lent pour ne pas cr\u00e9er de stress dans le groupe."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0928\u0915\u0940 \u0927\u0940\u092e\u0940 \u0917\u0924\u093f \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0915\u0942\u0932 \u0922\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0924\u093e\u0915\u093f \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0924\u0928\u093e\u0935 \u0928 \u0939\u094b\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi adatto al loro ritmo lento per non causare stress nel gruppo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u96c6\u56e3\u306b\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30b9\u3092\u4e0e\u3048\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u5f7c\u3089\u306e\u3086\u3063\u304f\u308a\u3068\u3057\u305f\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u306b\u9069\u5fdc\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\ub8f9\uc5d0 \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub808\uc2a4\ub97c \uc8fc\uc9c0 \uc54a\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uadf8\ub4e4\uc758 \ub290\ub9b0 \uc18d\ub3c4\uc5d0 \uc801\uc751\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik pas me aan hun trage tempo aan om geen stress te veroorzaken in de groep."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dostosowuj\u0119 si\u0119 do ich wolnego tempa, aby nie powodowa\u0107 stresu w grupie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me adapto ao ritmo lento deles para n\u00e3o causar estresse no grupo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043f\u043e\u0434 \u0438\u0445 \u043c\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0442\u0435\u043c\u043f, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441 \u0432 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043f\u043f\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grupta stres yaratmamak i\u00e7in yava\u015f tempolar\u0131na uyum sa\u011fl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u9002\u5e94\u4ed6\u4eec\u7684\u6162\u8282\u594f\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u7ed9\u56e2\u961f\u5e26\u6765\u538b\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9069\u61c9\u4ed6\u5011\u7de9\u6162\u7684\u7bc0\u594f\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u7d66\u5718\u968a\u5e36\u4f86\u58d3\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q12": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast eine geniale Idee f\u00fcr ein Projekt. Wie sieht deine erste Woche aus?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have a brilliant idea for a project. What does your first week look like?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tienes una idea brillante para un proyecto. \u00bfC\u00f3mo es tu primera semana?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez une brillante id\u00e9e de projet. \u00c0 quoi ressemble votre premi\u00e8re semaine ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u0936\u093e\u0928\u0926\u093e\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0939\u0948. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092a\u0939\u0932\u093e \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u093e \u0926\u093f\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai un'idea brillante per un progetto. Come sar\u00e0 la tua prima settimana?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u7d20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6700\u521d\u306e\u4e00\u9031\u9593\u306f\u3069\u3093\u306a\u611f\u3058\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ud6cc\ub96d\ud55c \uc544\uc774\ub514\uc5b4\ub97c \uac00\uc9c0\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uccab \uc8fc\ub294 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \ubaa8\uc2b5\uc778\uac00\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt een briljant idee voor een project. Hoe ziet jouw eerste week eruit?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masz genialny pomys\u0142 na projekt. Jak wygl\u0105da Tw\u00f3j pierwszy tydzie\u0144?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea tem uma ideia brilhante para um projeto. Como \u00e9 sua primeira semana?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0433\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0438\u0434\u0435\u044f \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0430. \u041a\u0430\u043a \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u044b\u0433\u043b\u044f\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044c \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044f \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0430\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir proje i\u00e7in harika bir fikriniz var. \u0130lk haftan\u0131z nas\u0131l g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6709\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f88\u68d2\u7684\u9879\u76ee\u521b\u610f\u3002\u4f60\u7b2c\u4e00\u5468\u4f1a\u600e\u6837\u5b89\u6392\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5c0d\u4e00\u500b\u9805\u76ee\u6709\u4e00\u500b\u7d55\u5999\u7684\u60f3\u6cd5\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u7b2c\u4e00\u9031\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\u6a23\u7684\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q12.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lese 5 B\u00fccher dazu, schaue 20 YouTube-Tutorials und baue eine perfekte Strategie auf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I read 5 books, watch 20 YouTube tutorials and build a perfect strategy."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leo 5 libros, miro 20 tutoriales de YouTube y construyo una estrategia perfecta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai lu 5 livres, regard\u00e9 20 tutoriels YouTube et construit une strat\u00e9gie parfaite."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 5 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u093e\u092c\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u0922\u093c\u0940\u0902, 20 \u092f\u0942\u091f\u094d\u092f\u0942\u092c \u091f\u094d\u092f\u0942\u091f\u094b\u0930\u093f\u092f\u0932 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u091f\u0940\u0915 \u0930\u0923\u0928\u0940\u0924\u093f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0908\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ho letto 5 libri, guardo 20 tutorial su YouTube e costruisco una strategia perfetta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f5\u518a\u306e\u672c\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u300120\u306eYouTube\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u3092\u898b\u3066\u3001\u5b8c\u74a7\u306a\u6226\u7565\u3092\u69cb\u7bc9\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ucc45 5\uad8c\uc744 \uc77d\uace0 \uc720\ud29c\ube0c \ud29c\ud1a0\ub9ac\uc5bc 20\uac1c\ub97c \uc2dc\uccad\ud558\uba70 \uc644\ubcbd\ud55c \uc804\ub7b5\uc744 \uc138\uc6c1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik lees 5 boeken, bekijk 20 YouTube-tutorials en bouw een perfecte strategie."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przeczyta\u0142em 5 ksi\u0105\u017cek, obejrza\u0142em 20 tutoriali na YouTubie i zbudowa\u0142em idealn\u0105 strategi\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Li 5 livros, assisto 20 tutoriais no YouTube e construo uma estrat\u00e9gia perfeita."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u044e 5 \u043a\u043d\u0438\u0433 \u043f\u043e \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0443, \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044e 20 \u043e\u0431\u0443\u0447\u0430\u044e\u0449\u0438\u0445 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043e \u043d\u0430 YouTube \u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u044e \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433\u0438\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 kitap okudum, 20 YouTube dersi izledim ve m\u00fckemmel bir strateji olu\u015fturdum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e3a\u6b64\u8bfb\u4e865\u672c\u4e66\uff0c\u770b\u4e8620\u4e2aYouTube\u6559\u7a0b\uff0c\u5e76\u5236\u5b9a\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684\u7b56\u7565\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8b80\u4e86 5 \u672c\u66f8\uff0c\u89c0\u770b\u4e86 20 \u500b YouTube \u6559\u5b78\u4e26\u88fd\u5b9a\u4e86\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684\u7b56\u7565\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q12.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich baue in 48 Stunden einen dreckigen Prototyp (Minimal Viable Product) und teste ihn sofort in der Realit\u00e4t."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I build a dirty prototype (Minimal Viable Product) in 48 hours and immediately test it in reality."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Construyo un prototipo sucio (Producto M\u00ednimo Viable) en 48 horas y lo pruebo inmediatamente en la realidad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je construis un prototype sale (Minimal Viable Product) en 48 heures et je le teste imm\u00e9diatement dans la r\u00e9alit\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 48 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0917\u0902\u0926\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091f\u094b\u091f\u093e\u0907\u092a (\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0935\u0939\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u093e\u0926) \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935\u093f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u092a\u0930\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Costruisco un prototipo sporco (Minimal Viable Product) in 48 ore e lo provo immediatamente nella realt\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "48 \u6642\u9593\u3067\u30c0\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3 \u30d7\u30ed\u30c8\u30bf\u30a4\u30d7 (Minimal Viable Product) \u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u5b9f\u969b\u306b\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "48\uc2dc\uac04 \uc548\uc5d0 \ub354\ud2f0 \ud504\ub85c\ud1a0\ud0c0\uc785(\ucd5c\uc18c \uc2e4\ud589 \uac00\ub2a5 \uc81c\ud488)\uc744 \uc81c\uc791\ud558\uace0 \uc989\uc2dc \ud604\uc2e4\uc5d0\uc11c \ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b8\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik bouw in 48 uur een vies prototype (Minimal Viable Product) en test het meteen in de realiteit."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buduj\u0119 brudny prototyp (Minimal Viable Product) w 48 godzin i od razu testuj\u0119 go w rzeczywisto\u015bci."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu construo um prot\u00f3tipo sujo (Produto M\u00ednimo Vi\u00e1vel) em 48 horas e imediatamente testo na realidade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u044e \u0437\u0430 48 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432 \u0433\u0440\u044f\u0437\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0442\u0438\u043f (\u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0435\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0443\u043a\u0442) \u0438 \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0436\u0435 \u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0432 \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "48 saat i\u00e7inde kirli bir prototip (Minimal Uygulanabilir \u00dcr\u00fcn) olu\u015fturuyorum ve onu hemen ger\u00e7ekte test ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u572848\u5c0f\u65f6\u5185\u5efa\u9020\u4e00\u4e2a\u80ae\u810f\u7684\u539f\u578b\uff08\u6700\u5c0f\u53ef\u884c\u4ea7\u54c1\uff09\uff0c\u5e76\u7acb\u5373\u5728\u73b0\u5b9e\u4e2d\u8fdb\u884c\u6d4b\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728 48 \u5c0f\u6642\u5167\u5efa\u7acb\u4e86\u4e00\u500b\u9ad2\u539f\u578b\uff08\u6700\u5c0f\u53ef\u884c\u7522\u54c1\uff09\u4e26\u7acb\u5373\u5728\u73fe\u5be6\u4e2d\u9032\u884c\u6e2c\u8a66\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q12.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich erz\u00e4hle all meinen Freunden davon, genie\u00dfe den Applaus, fange aber nie an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tell all my friends about it, enjoy the applause, but never start."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se lo cuento a todos mis amigos, disfruto de los aplausos, pero nunca empiezo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'en parle \u00e0 tous mes amis, j'appr\u00e9cie les applaudissements, mais je ne commence jamais."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u092d\u0940 \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0924\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0924\u093e\u0932\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u0906\u0928\u0902\u0926 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0941\u0906\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo dico a tutti i miei amici, mi godo gli applausi, ma non inizio mai."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53cb\u9054\u5168\u54e1\u306b\u305d\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8a71\u3057\u3001\u62cd\u624b\u3092\u697d\u3057\u307f\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u6c7a\u3057\u3066\u59cb\u3081\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c \uadf8\uac83\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \ub9d0\ud558\uace0 \ubc15\uc218\ub97c \uc990\uae30\uc9c0\ub9cc \uacb0\ucf54 \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik vertel het aan al mijn vrienden, geniet van het applaus, maar begin er nooit aan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opowiadam o tym wszystkim znajomym, ciesz\u0119 si\u0119 brawami, ale nigdy nie zaczynam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conto isso a todos os meus amigos, gosto dos aplausos, mas nunca come\u00e7o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0432\u0441\u0435\u043c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f\u043c, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u043b\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0430\u043f\u043b\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0441\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u043d\u043e \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu b\u00fct\u00fcn arkada\u015flar\u0131ma anlat\u0131r\u0131m, alk\u0131\u015flar\u0131n tad\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131r\u0131m ama asla ba\u015flamam."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u628a\u8fd9\u4ef6\u4e8b\u544a\u8bc9\u6211\u6240\u6709\u7684\u670b\u53cb\uff0c\u4eab\u53d7\u638c\u58f0\uff0c\u4f46\u4ece\u672a\u771f\u6b63\u5f00\u59cb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u544a\u8a34\u6211\u6240\u6709\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u9019\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u4eab\u53d7\u638c\u8072\uff0c\u4f46\u5f9e\u672a\u958b\u59cb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q12.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich fange an, sto\u00dfe beim ersten gro\u00dfen Problem auf eine Wand und verliere die Lust."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I start, hit a wall at the first big problem and lose interest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empiezo, choco contra una pared ante el primer gran problema y pierdo el inter\u00e9s."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je commence, je me heurte au premier gros probl\u00e8me et je perds tout int\u00e9r\u00eat."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0940 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u092a\u0930 \u0926\u0940\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u091f\u0915\u0930\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0930\u0941\u091a\u093f \u0916\u094b \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inizio, sbatto contro un muro al primo grosso problema e perdo interesse."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u59cb\u3081\u308b\u3068\u3001\u6700\u521d\u306e\u5927\u304d\u306a\u554f\u984c\u3067\u58c1\u306b\u3076\u3064\u304b\u308a\u3001\u8208\u5473\u3092\u5931\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uace0 \uccab \ubc88\uc9f8 \ud070 \ubb38\uc81c\uc5d0\uc11c \ubcbd\uc5d0 \ubd80\ub52a\ud788\uace0 \ud765\ubbf8\ub97c \uc783\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik begin, loop tegen een muur aan bij het eerste grote probleem en verlies mijn interesse."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaczynam, uderzam w \u015bcian\u0119 przy pierwszym powa\u017cnym problemie i trac\u0119 zainteresowanie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu come\u00e7o, bato no muro no primeiro grande problema e perco o interesse."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e, \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u043a\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0439, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0441\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0439, \u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u044e \u0436\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ba\u015fl\u0131yorum, ilk b\u00fcy\u00fck problemde duvara \u00e7arp\u0131yorum ve ilgimi kaybediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u5f00\u59cb\uff0c\u5728\u9047\u5230\u7b2c\u4e00\u4e2a\u5927\u95ee\u9898\u65f6\u5c31\u78b0\u58c1\uff0c\u5931\u53bb\u4e86\u5174\u8da3\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u958b\u59cb\u5c31\u5728\u7b2c\u4e00\u500b\u5927\u554f\u984c\u4e0a\u78b0\u58c1\u4e26\u5931\u53bb\u4e86\u8208\u8da3\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q13": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du merkst, dass du am Tag 4 Stunden am Handy h\u00e4ngst. Du beschlie\u00dft, das zu \u00e4ndern. Dein Ansatz?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You notice that you are on your cell phone for 4 hours a day. You decide to change that. Your approach?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notas que est\u00e1s en tu celular durante 4 horas al d\u00eda. T\u00fa decides cambiar eso. \u00bfSu enfoque?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous remarquez que vous \u00eates sur votre t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable 4 heures par jour. Vous d\u00e9cidez de changer cela. Votre approche ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u093e \u0915\u093f \u0906\u092a \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 4 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947\u0932 \u092b\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0909\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0926\u0932\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0923\u092f \u0932\u0947\u0902. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0926\u0943\u0937\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0915\u094b\u0923?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noti che stai al cellulare per 4 ore al giorno. Decidi di cambiarlo. Il tuo approccio?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f1\u65e5\u306b4\u6642\u9593\u3082\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u6c17\u3065\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u5909\u3048\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u6c7a\u610f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c1\u306f\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud558\ub8e8\uc5d0 4\uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \ud734\ub300\ud3f0\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud558\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4\ub294 \uc0ac\uc2e4\uc744 \uc54c\uac8c \ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ubc14\uafb8\uae30\ub85c \uacb0\uc815\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc811\uadfc \ubc29\uc2dd\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc785\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je merkt dat je 4 uur per dag op je mobiele telefoon zit. Je besluit daar verandering in te brengen. Jouw aanpak?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zauwa\u017casz, \u017ce sp\u0119dzasz na telefonie kom\u00f3rkowym 4 godziny dziennie. Postanawiasz to zmieni\u0107. Twoje podej\u015bcie?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea percebe que est\u00e1 no celular 4 horas por dia. Voc\u00ea decide mudar isso. Sua abordagem?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0437\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0448\u044c 4 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430 \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0441 \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d\u043e\u043c. \u0422\u044b \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0445\u043e\u0434?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00fcnde 4 saat cep telefonunuzda oldu\u011funuzu fark ediyorsunuz. Bunu de\u011fi\u015ftirmeye karar verirsin. Yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131n\u0131z?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u53d1\u73b0\u81ea\u5df1\u6bcf\u5929\u82b14\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u5728\u624b\u673a\u4e0a\u3002\u4f60\u51b3\u5b9a\u6539\u53d8\u8fd9\u79cd\u60c5\u51b5\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u767c\u73fe\u81ea\u5df1\u6bcf\u5929\u4f7f\u7528\u624b\u6a5f\u7684\u6642\u9593\u70ba 4 \u5c0f\u6642\u3002\u4f60\u6c7a\u5b9a\u6539\u8b8a\u9019\u4e00\u9ede\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q13.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich l\u00f6sche alle Apps, halte es 2 Tage aus und lade sie dann heimlich wieder runter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I delete all apps, wait 2 days and then secretly download them again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino todas las aplicaciones, espero 2 d\u00edas y luego las vuelvo a descargar en secreto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je supprime toutes les applications, j'attends 2 jours, puis je les t\u00e9l\u00e9charge \u00e0 nouveau secr\u00e8tement."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u092d\u0940 \u0910\u092a\u094d\u0938 \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, 2 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0907\u0902\u0924\u091c\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0928\u094d\u0939\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0921\u093e\u0909\u0928\u0932\u094b\u0921 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino tutte le app, aspetto 2 giorni e poi le scarico di nuovo segretamente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3057\u30012\u65e5\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u304b\u3089\u5bc6\u304b\u306b\u518d\u5ea6\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc571\uc744 \uc0ad\uc81c\ud558\uace0 2\uc77c \ud6c4\uc5d0 \ube44\ubc00\ub9ac\uc5d0 \ub2e4\uc2dc \ub2e4\uc6b4\ub85c\ub4dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verwijder alle apps, wacht 2 dagen en download ze dan stiekem opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usuwam wszystkie aplikacje, czekam 2 dni, a nast\u0119pnie potajemnie pobieram je ponownie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu excluo todos os aplicativos, espero 2 dias e os baixo secretamente novamente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u044f\u044e \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f, \u0432\u044b\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043d\u0438\u0445 2 \u0434\u043d\u044f \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0442\u0430\u0439\u043a\u043e\u043c \u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430 \u0438\u0445 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u00fcm uygulamalar\u0131 siliyorum, 2 g\u00fcn bekleyip sonra gizlice tekrar indiriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5220\u9664\u6240\u6709\u5e94\u7528\uff0c\u575a\u6301\u4e24\u5929\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u5077\u5077\u5730\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5b83\u4eec\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u522a\u9664\u4e86\u6240\u6709\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5e8f\uff0c\u7b49\u5f85\u5169\u5929\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u518d\u6b21\u5077\u5077\u4e0b\u8f09\u5b83\u5011\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q13.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich nutze App-Blocker und physikalische Barrieren (Handy im Tresor), weil ich meiner Willenskraft nicht traue."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I use app blockers and physical barriers (phone in the safe) because I don't trust my willpower."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizo bloqueadores de aplicaciones y barreras f\u00edsicas (el tel\u00e9fono en la caja fuerte) porque no conf\u00edo en mi fuerza de voluntad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'utilise des bloqueurs d'applications et des barri\u00e8res physiques (t\u00e9l\u00e9phone dans le coffre-fort) car je ne fais pas confiance \u00e0 ma volont\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0910\u092a \u092c\u094d\u0932\u0949\u0915\u0930\u094d\u0938 \u0914\u0930 \u092d\u094c\u0924\u093f\u0915 \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e\u0913\u0902 (\u0938\u0941\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093f\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092b\u094b\u0928) \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0907\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e\u0936\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u092a\u0930 \u092d\u0930\u094b\u0938\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizzo blocchi app e barriere fisiche (telefono in cassaforte) perch\u00e9 non mi fido della mia forza di volont\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u610f\u5fd7\u306e\u529b\u3092\u4fe1\u3058\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3001\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u30d6\u30ed\u30c3\u30ab\u30fc\u3068\u7269\u7406\u7684\u306a\u969c\u58c1\uff08\u91d1\u5eab\u306e\u4e2d\u306b\u96fb\u8a71\uff09\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \uc758\uc9c0\ub825\uc744 \ubbff\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud558\uae30 \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 \uc571 \ucc28\ub2e8\uae30\uc640 \ubb3c\ub9ac\uc801 \uc7a5\ubcbd(\uae08\uace0 \uc548\uc758 \uc804\ud654)\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik gebruik app-blockers en fysieke barri\u00e8res (telefoon in de kluis) omdat ik mijn wilskracht niet vertrouw."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U\u017cywam blokad aplikacji i barier fizycznych (telefon w sejfie), poniewa\u017c nie ufam swojej sile woli."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilizo bloqueadores de aplicativos e barreiras f\u00edsicas (telefone no cofre) porque n\u00e3o confio na minha for\u00e7a de vontade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443\u044e \u0431\u043b\u043e\u043a\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0449\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0438 \u0444\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0431\u0430\u0440\u044c\u0435\u0440\u044b (\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d \u0432 \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0444\u0435), \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u044f\u044e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u0441\u0438\u043b\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u043b\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130rademe g\u00fcvenmedi\u011fim i\u00e7in uygulama engelleyicileri ve fiziksel engelleri (kasadaki telefon) kullan\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f7f\u7528\u5e94\u7528\u7a0b\u5e8f\u62e6\u622a\u5668\u548c\u7269\u7406\u5c4f\u969c\uff08\u5c06\u624b\u673a\u653e\u5728\u4fdd\u9669\u7bb1\u91cc\uff09\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u610f\u5fd7\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f7f\u7528\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\u6514\u622a\u5668\u548c\u7269\u7406\u5c4f\u969c\uff08\u624b\u6a5f\u653e\u5728\u4fdd\u96aa\u7bb1\u88e1\uff09\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u610f\u5fd7\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q13.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich nehme mir einfach fest vor, ab morgen weniger aufs Handy zu schauen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll just resolve to look at my cell phone less starting tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simplemente decidir\u00e9 mirar menos mi celular a partir de ma\u00f1ana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais juste me r\u00e9soudre \u00e0 moins regarder mon t\u00e9l\u00e9phone portable \u00e0 partir de demain."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0932 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947\u0932 \u092b\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u094b \u0915\u092e \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0938\u0902\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a \u0932\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decider\u00f2 semplicemente di guardare meno il cellulare da domani."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u660e\u65e5\u304b\u3089\u306f\u643a\u5e2f\u96fb\u8a71\u3092\u898b\u308b\u306e\u3092\u6e1b\u3089\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306b\u6c7a\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8\ub0e5 \ub0b4\uc77c\ubd80\ud130 \ud734\ub300\ud3f0\uc744 \ub35c \ubcf4\uaca0\ub2e4\uace0 \ub2e4\uc9d0\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik neem me voor om vanaf morgen minder naar mijn mobiele telefoon te kijken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po prostu postanowi\u0119 od jutra mniej patrze\u0107 na telefon kom\u00f3rkowy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou apenas resolver olhar menos para o meu celular a partir de amanh\u00e3."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0442\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0434\u043e \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0430\u044e \u0441 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0448\u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0434\u043d\u044f \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0444\u043e\u043d."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yar\u0131ndan itibaren cep telefonuma daha az bakmaya karar verece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u4e0b\u5b9a\u51b3\u5fc3\uff0c\u4ece\u660e\u5929\u5f00\u59cb\u5c11\u770b\u624b\u673a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6c7a\u5b9a\u5f9e\u660e\u5929\u958b\u59cb\u5c11\u770b\u624b\u6a5f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q13.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich \u00e4ndere nichts, weil 'die heutige Welt nun mal so funktioniert'."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm not changing anything because 'that's just how the world works today'."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No voy a cambiar nada porque 'as\u00ed es como funciona el mundo hoy'."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne change rien parce que \u00ab c\u2019est ainsi que fonctionne le monde aujourd\u2019hui \u00bb."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092c\u0926\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f '\u0906\u091c \u0926\u0941\u0928\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0907\u0938\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964'"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non cambio nulla perch\u00e9 \"\u00e8 cos\u00ec che funziona il mondo oggi\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u300c\u305d\u308c\u304c\u4eca\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u306e\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3060\u300d\u3068\u3044\u3046\u7406\u7531\u3067\u79c1\u306f\u4f55\u3082\u5909\u3048\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 '\uc624\ub298 \uc138\uc0c1\uc774 \uadf8\ub7f0 \uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \ub3cc\uc544\uac00\uae30' \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 \uc544\ubb34\uac83\ub3c4 \ubc14\uafb8\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verander niets, want \u2018zo werkt de wereld vandaag de dag\u2019."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niczego nie zmieniam, bo \u201etak w\u0142a\u015bnie dzia\u0142a dzisiejszy \u015bwiat\u201d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N\u00e3o estou mudando nada porque \u201c\u00e9 assim que o mundo funciona hoje\u201d."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u044e, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u00ab\u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f\u0448\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043c\u0438\u0440 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0442\u0430\u043a \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043d\u00bb."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hi\u00e7bir \u015feyi de\u011fi\u015ftirmiyorum \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc 'bug\u00fcn d\u00fcnya b\u00f6yle i\u015fliyor'."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4ec0\u4e48\u90fd\u4e0d\u6539\u53d8\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u201c\u4eca\u5929\u7684\u4e16\u754c\u5c31\u662f\u8fd9\u6837\u8fd0\u4f5c\u7684\u201d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e0d\u6703\u6539\u8b8a\u4efb\u4f55\u4e8b\u60c5\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u300c\u9019\u5c31\u662f\u7576\u4eca\u4e16\u754c\u7684\u904b\u4f5c\u65b9\u5f0f\u300d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q14": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist Samstagmorgen. Du hast keine Termine, keine Verpflichtungen. Wie entfaltet sich der Tag?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's Saturday morning. You have no appointments, no obligations. How does the day unfold?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es s\u00e1bado por la ma\u00f1ana. No tienes citas, ni obligaciones. \u00bfC\u00f3mo transcurre el d\u00eda?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est samedi matin. Vous n'avez aucun rendez-vous, aucune obligation. Comment se d\u00e9roule la journ\u00e9e ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0936\u0928\u093f\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0940 \u0938\u0941\u092c\u0939 \u0939\u0948. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948, \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0926\u093e\u092f\u093f\u0924\u094d\u0935 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u0924\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c8 sabato mattina. Non hai appuntamenti, n\u00e9 obblighi. Come si svolge la giornata?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u571f\u66dc\u306e\u671d\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u306e\u7d04\u675f\u3082\u7fa9\u52d9\u3082\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u4e00\u65e5\u306f\u3069\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u5c55\u958b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud1a0\uc694\uc77c \uc544\uce68\uc774\uc5d0\uc694. \uc57d\uc18d\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uace0 \uc758\ubb34\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ud558\ub8e8\ub294 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \uc804\uac1c\ub418\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "domineren Het is zaterdagochtend. Je hebt geen afspraken, geen verplichtingen. Hoe verloopt de dag?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jest sobotni poranek. Nie masz \u017cadnych spotka\u0144, \u017cadnych zobowi\u0105za\u0144. Jak wygl\u0105da dzie\u0144?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c9 s\u00e1bado de manh\u00e3. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o tem compromissos, nem obriga\u00e7\u00f5es. Como o dia se desenrola?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0421\u0443\u0431\u0431\u043e\u0442\u043d\u0435\u0435 \u0443\u0442\u0440\u043e. \u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447, \u043d\u0438\u043a\u0430\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u043e\u0431\u044f\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432. \u041a\u0430\u043a \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cumartesi sabah\u0131. Randevunuz yok, y\u00fck\u00fcml\u00fcl\u00fc\u011f\u00fcn\u00fcz yok. G\u00fcn nas\u0131l geli\u015fiyor?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u73b0\u5728\u662f\u661f\u671f\u516d\u65e9\u4e0a\u3002\u4f60\u6ca1\u6709\u7ea6\u4f1a\uff0c\u4e5f\u6ca1\u6709\u4efb\u4f55\u4e49\u52a1\u3002\u8fd9\u4e00\u5929\u4f1a\u5982\u4f55\u5c55\u5f00\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u73fe\u5728\u662f\u661f\u671f\u516d\u65e9\u4e0a\u3002\u60a8\u6c92\u6709\u7d04\u6703\uff0c\u6c92\u6709\u7fa9\u52d9\u3002\u9019\u4e00\u5929\u7684\u9032\u5c55\u5982\u4f55\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q14.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schlafe bis 12, chille auf der Couch und der Tag verschwindet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I sleep until 12, chill on the couch and the day disappears."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duermo hasta las 12, me relajo en el sof\u00e1 y el d\u00eda desaparece."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dors jusqu'\u00e0 midi, je me d\u00e9tends sur le canap\u00e9 et le jour dispara\u00eet."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 12 \u092c\u091c\u0947 \u0924\u0915 \u0938\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0938\u094b\u092b\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0906\u0930\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0917\u093e\u092f\u092c \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dormo fino alle 12, mi rilasso sul divano e la giornata svanisce."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12\u6642\u307e\u3067\u5bdd\u3066\u3001\u200b\u200b\u30bd\u30d5\u30a1\u3067\u304f\u3064\u308d\u3050\u3068\u4e00\u65e5\u304c\u6d88\u3048\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12\uc2dc\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc790\uace0 \uc18c\ud30c\uc5d0 \ub204\uc6cc \uc26c\ub2e4 \ubcf4\uba74 \ud558\ub8e8\uac00 \uc0ac\ub77c\uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik slaap tot 12 uur, chill op de bank en de dag verdwijnt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015api\u0119 do 12, odpoczywam na kanapie i dzie\u0144 znika."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durmo at\u00e9 as 12, relaxo no sof\u00e1 e o dia desaparece."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043f\u043b\u044e \u0434\u043e 12, \u043e\u0442\u0434\u044b\u0445\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430 \u0434\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0435 \u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0438\u0441\u0447\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0435\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "12'ye kadar uyuyorum, kanepede dinleniyorum ve g\u00fcn kayboluyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7761\u523012\u70b9\uff0c\u8eba\u5728\u6c99\u53d1\u4e0a\u653e\u677e\uff0c\u65f6\u95f4\u5c31\u8fd9\u6837\u6d88\u5931\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7761\u523012\u9ede\uff0c\u5728\u6c99\u767c\u4e0a\u653e\u9b06\u4e00\u4e0b\uff0c\u767d\u5929\u5c31\u6d88\u5931\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q14.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe schon am Freitagabend 3 extrem wichtige Ziele f\u00fcr das Wochenende aufgeschrieben und arbeite sie bis mittags ab."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I wrote down 3 extremely important goals for the weekend on Friday evening and worked on them by lunchtime."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El viernes por la noche escrib\u00ed 3 objetivos extremadamente importantes para el fin de semana y trabaj\u00e9 en ellos a la hora del almuerzo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai not\u00e9 3 objectifs extr\u00eamement importants pour le week-end vendredi soir et j'ai travaill\u00e9 dessus \u00e0 l'heure du d\u00e9jeuner."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0930\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0936\u093e\u092e \u0915\u094b \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939\u093e\u0902\u0924 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f 3 \u0905\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0932\u093f\u0916\u0947 \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u094b\u092a\u0939\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u092d\u094b\u091c\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0924\u0915 \u0909\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Venerd\u00ec sera ho scritto 3 obiettivi estremamente importanti per il fine settimana e ci ho lavorato sopra entro l'ora di pranzo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u91d1\u66dc\u65e5\u306e\u591c\u306b\u9031\u672b\u306e\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u91cd\u8981\u306a\u76ee\u6a19\u3092 3 \u3064\u66f8\u304d\u51fa\u3057\u3001\u663c\u4f11\u307f\u307e\u3067\u306b\u305d\u308c\u306b\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uae08\uc694\uc77c \uc800\ub141\uc5d0 \uc8fc\ub9d0 \ub3d9\uc548 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc911\uc694\ud55c \ubaa9\ud45c 3\uac00\uc9c0\ub97c \uc801\uc5b4 \uc810\uc2ec\uc2dc\uac04\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc2e4\ucc9c\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Op vrijdagavond schreef ik drie uiterst belangrijke doelen voor het weekend op en werkte daar rond lunchtijd aan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W pi\u0105tkowy wiecz\u00f3r zapisa\u0142em 3 niezwykle wa\u017cne cele na weekend i pracowa\u0142em nad nimi do po\u0142udnia."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anotei tr\u00eas metas extremamente importantes para o fim de semana na noite de sexta-feira e trabalhei nelas na hora do almo\u00e7o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0432 \u043f\u044f\u0442\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0443 \u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043e\u043c \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043b 3 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0432\u044b\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u044e \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0434\u043e \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0434\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuma ak\u015fam\u0131 hafta sonu i\u00e7in son derece \u00f6nemli 3 hedefi yazd\u0131m ve \u00f6\u011fle yeme\u011fine kadar \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5df2\u7ecf\u5728\u5468\u4e94\u665a\u4e0a\u5199\u4e0b\u4e86\u5468\u672b\u7684\u4e09\u4e2a\u975e\u5e38\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u76ee\u6807\uff0c\u5e76\u4f1a\u5728\u4e2d\u5348\u524d\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u4eec\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5728\u5468\u4e94\u665a\u4e0a\u5beb\u4e0b\u4e86\u5468\u672b\u7684 3 \u500b\u6975\u5176\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u76ee\u6a19\uff0c\u4e26\u5728\u5348\u9910\u6642\u9593\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u5011\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q14.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich fange an aufzur\u00e4umen, verliere mich in Details und habe abends das Gef\u00fchl, nichts geschafft zu haben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I start to tidy up, get lost in details and in the evening I feel like I haven't accomplished anything."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empiezo a ordenar, me pierdo en los detalles y por la noche siento que no he logrado nada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je commence \u00e0 ranger, je me perds dans les d\u00e9tails et le soir j'ai l'impression de n'avoir rien accompli."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u093e\u092b-\u0938\u092b\u093e\u0908 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0935\u093f\u0935\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0936\u093e\u092e \u0915\u094b \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0910\u0938\u093e \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u092d\u0940 \u0939\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comincio a riordinare, mi perdo nei dettagli e la sera mi sembra di non aver concluso nulla."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7247\u4ed8\u3051\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u3066\u3001\u7d30\u304b\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306b\u5922\u4e2d\u306b\u306a\u308a\u3001\u5915\u65b9\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u3082\u9054\u6210\u3067\u304d\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3088\u3046\u306b\u611f\u3058\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc815\ub9ac\ub97c \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uace0, \uc138\ubd80\uc0ac\ud56d\uc5d0 \ube60\uc838\ub4e4\uace0, \uc800\ub141\uc5d0\ub294 \uc544\ubb34\uac83\ub3c4 \uc131\ucde8\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud55c \uac83 \uac19\uc740 \uae30\ubd84\uc774 \ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik begin met opruimen, verdwaal in details en 's avonds heb ik het gevoel dat ik niets heb bereikt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaczynam sprz\u0105ta\u0107, gubi\u0119 si\u0119 w szczeg\u00f3\u0142ach i wieczorem czuj\u0119, \u017ce nic nie osi\u0105gn\u0119\u0142am."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Come\u00e7o a arrumar, me perco nos detalhes e \u00e0 noite sinto que n\u00e3o consegui nada."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e \u0443\u0431\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044f\u0445 \u0438 \u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043e\u043c \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u044e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ortal\u0131\u011f\u0131 toparlamaya ba\u015fl\u0131yorum, detaylarda kayboluyorum ve ak\u015famlar\u0131 hi\u00e7bir \u015feyi ba\u015faramam\u0131\u015f gibi hissediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5f00\u59cb\u6574\u7406\uff0c\u9677\u5165\u7ec6\u8282\u4e4b\u4e2d\uff0c\u665a\u4e0a\u611f\u89c9\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e5f\u6ca1\u5b8c\u6210\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u958b\u59cb\u6536\u62fe\u6771\u897f\uff0c\u8ff7\u5931\u5728\u7d30\u7bc0\u4e2d\uff0c\u5230\u4e86\u665a\u4e0a\u611f\u89ba\u81ea\u5df1\u4ec0\u9ebc\u90fd\u6c92\u5b8c\u6210\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q14.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich treffe mich spontan mit Freunden. Wochenende ist schlie\u00dflich zum Abschalten da."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I spontaneously meet up with friends. After all, weekends are for switching off."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me encuentro espont\u00e1neamente con amigos. Al fin y al cabo, los fines de semana son para desconectar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je retrouve spontan\u00e9ment des amis. Apr\u00e8s tout, les week-ends sont destin\u00e9s \u00e0 se d\u00e9connecter."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0939\u0940 \u092e\u093f\u0924\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964 \u0906\u0916\u093c\u093f\u0930\u0915\u093e\u0930, \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939\u093e\u0902\u0924 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u093f\u091a-\u0911\u092b\u093c \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi incontro spontaneamente con gli amici. Dopotutto, i fine settimana servono per staccare la spina."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u7136\u3068\u53cb\u9054\u3068\u4f1a\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u7d50\u5c40\u306e\u3068\u3053\u308d\u3001\u9031\u672b\u306f\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u3092\u30aa\u30d5\u306b\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc790\uc5f0\uc2a4\ub7fd\uac8c \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc744 \ub9cc\ub09c\ub2e4. \uacb0\uad6d \uc8fc\ub9d0\uc740 \uc804\uc6d0\uc744 \ub044\ub294 \uc2dc\uac04\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ontmoet spontaan vrienden. Weekends zijn er tenslotte om uit te schakelen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spontanicznie spotykam si\u0119 ze znajomymi. W ko\u0144cu weekendy s\u0105 po to, \u017ceby si\u0119 wy\u0142\u0105czy\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Encontro-me espontaneamente com amigos. Afinal, fins de semana s\u00e3o para desligar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f\u043c\u0438. \u0412 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u043e\u0432, \u0432\u044b\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043d\u044b \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043e\u0442\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arkada\u015flar\u0131mla kendili\u011finden bulu\u015fuyorum. Sonu\u00e7ta hafta sonlar\u0131 kapanmak i\u00e7indir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e34\u65f6\u548c\u670b\u53cb\u89c1\u9762\u3002\u6bd5\u7adf\u5468\u672b\u5c31\u662f\u7528\u6765\u653e\u677e\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u81ea\u767c\u6027\u5730\u8207\u670b\u53cb\u898b\u9762\u3002\u7562\u7adf\uff0c\u9031\u672b\u662f\u7528\u4f86\u4f11\u606f\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q15": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du reflektierst dein letztes Jahr. Du hast keines deiner gro\u00dfen Ziele erreicht. Was ist deine ehrliche Diagnose?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You reflect on your last year. You haven't achieved any of your big goals. What is your honest diagnosis?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reflexionas sobre tu \u00faltimo a\u00f1o. No has logrado ninguno de tus grandes objetivos. \u00bfCu\u00e1l es su diagn\u00f3stico honesto?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous r\u00e9fl\u00e9chissez \u00e0 votre derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e. Vous n\u2019avez atteint aucun de vos grands objectifs. Quel est votre diagnostic honn\u00eate ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u093f\u091b\u0932\u0947 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0937 \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u092d\u0940 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u093e \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0939\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948. \u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0908\u092e\u093e\u0928\u0926\u093e\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u0926\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rifletti sul tuo ultimo anno. Non hai raggiunto nessuno dei tuoi grandi obiettivi. Qual \u00e8 la tua diagnosi onesta?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u6628\u5e74\u3092\u632f\u308a\u8fd4\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u5927\u304d\u306a\u76ee\u6a19\u3092\u4f55\u3082\u9054\u6210\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u6b63\u76f4\u306a\u8a3a\u65ad\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc9c0\ub09c \ud55c \ud574\ub97c \ubc18\uc131\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ud070 \ubaa9\ud45c\ub97c \ub2ec\uc131\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc194\uc9c1\ud55c \uc9c4\ub2e8\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc778\uac00\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je reflecteert op je afgelopen jaar. Je hebt nog geen van je grote doelen bereikt. Wat is jouw eerlijke diagnose?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zastanawiasz si\u0119 nad swoim ostatnim rokiem. Nie osi\u0105gn\u0105\u0142e\u015b \u017cadnego ze swoich najwa\u017cniejszych cel\u00f3w. Jaka jest Twoja szczera diagnoza?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea reflete sobre seu \u00faltimo ano. Voc\u00ea n\u00e3o alcan\u00e7ou nenhum de seus grandes objetivos. Qual \u00e9 o seu diagn\u00f3stico honesto?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043c\u044b\u0448\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0451\u043c \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0448\u043b\u043e\u043c \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0443. \u0422\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0433 \u043d\u0438 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u0437 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0446\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439. \u041a\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0438\u0430\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0437?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ge\u00e7en y\u0131l\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcyorsunuz. B\u00fcy\u00fck hedeflerinizden hi\u00e7birine ula\u015famad\u0131n\u0131z. D\u00fcr\u00fcst tan\u0131n\u0131z nedir?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5728\u53cd\u601d\u81ea\u5df1\u8fc7\u53bb\u7684\u4e00\u5e74\u3002\u4f60\u6ca1\u6709\u5b9e\u73b0\u4efb\u4f55\u4e00\u4e2a\u91cd\u8981\u76ee\u6807\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u771f\u5b9e\u8bca\u65ad\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u56de\u9867\u904e\u53bb\u7684\u4e00\u5e74\u3002\u4f60\u9084\u6c92\u6709\u5be6\u73fe\u4efb\u4f55\u5927\u76ee\u6a19\u3002\u60a8\u7684\u8aa0\u5be6\u8a3a\u65b7\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q15.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich hatte einfach extrem viel Pech und die Umst\u00e4nde waren gegen mich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I was just extremely unlucky and the circumstances were against me."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simplemente tuve mucha mala suerte y las circunstancias estaban en mi contra."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai simplement \u00e9t\u00e9 extr\u00eamement malchanceux et les circonstances \u00e9taient contre moi."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u092c\u0926\u0915\u093f\u0938\u094d\u092e\u0924 \u0925\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0932\u093e\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0916\u093c\u093f\u0932\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0925\u0947\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono stato semplicemente estremamente sfortunato e le circostanze erano contro di me."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u305f\u3060\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u4e0d\u904b\u3067\u3001\u72b6\u6cc1\u304c\u79c1\u306b\u3068\u3063\u3066\u4e0d\u5229\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc6b4\uc774 \uc88b\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\uace0 \uc0c1\ud669\uc740 \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c \ubd88\ub9ac\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik had gewoon ontzettend veel pech en de omstandigheden waren tegen mij."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mia\u0142em po prostu ogromnego pecha i okoliczno\u015bci by\u0142y przeciwko mnie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tive muito azar e as circunst\u00e2ncias estavam contra mim."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0437\u043b\u043e, \u0438 \u043e\u0431\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son derece \u015fanss\u0131zd\u0131m ve ko\u015fullar bana kar\u015f\u0131yd\u0131."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u975e\u5e38\u5012\u9709\uff0c\u60c5\u51b5\u5bf9\u6211\u4e0d\u5229\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u975e\u5e38\u4e0d\u5e78\uff0c\u74b0\u5883\u5c0d\u6211\u4e0d\u5229\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q15.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe mich st\u00e4ndig mit irrelevanter Theorie aufgehalten und mich nie getraut, die echten Hebel zu ziehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I was constantly dwelling on irrelevant theory and never dared to pull the real levers."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estaba constantemente pensando en teor\u00edas irrelevantes y nunca me atrev\u00eda a tirar de las palancas reales."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m\u2019attardais constamment sur des th\u00e9ories non pertinentes et je n\u2019osais jamais actionner les vrais leviers."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u093e\u0930 \u0905\u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u0938\u0902\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u093f\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093e\u0902\u0924 \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0925\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0935\u093e\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0935\u093f\u0915 \u0932\u0940\u0935\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0939\u093f\u092e\u094d\u092e\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930 \u092a\u093e\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi soffermavo costantemente su teorie irrilevanti e non osavo mai tirare le vere leve."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u5e38\u306b\u7121\u95a2\u4fc2\u306a\u7406\u8ad6\u306b\u56fa\u57f7\u3057\u3001\u5b9f\u969b\u306e\u30ec\u30d0\u30fc\u3092\u5f15\u304f\u52c7\u6c17\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub04a\uc784\uc5c6\uc774 \uad00\ub828 \uc5c6\ub294 \uc774\ub860\uc5d0 \ube60\uc838 \uc788\uc5c8\uace0 \uac10\ud788 \uc2e4\uc81c \ub808\ubc84\ub97c \ub2f9\uae30\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik was voortdurend bezig met irrelevante theorie\u00ebn en durfde nooit aan de echte hefbomen te trekken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ci\u0105gle rozwodzi\u0142em si\u0119 nad nieistotn\u0105 teori\u0105 i nigdy nie odwa\u017cy\u0142em si\u0119 poci\u0105gn\u0105\u0107 za prawdziw\u0105 d\u017awigni\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu estava constantemente pensando em teorias irrelevantes e nunca ousei puxar as alavancas reais."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0437\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u043b\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0441\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0442\u0435\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0435\u0439 \u0438 \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u043c\u0435\u043b \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0435\u0439\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u0449\u0438\u0435 \u0440\u044b\u0447\u0430\u0433\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S\u00fcrekli olarak alakas\u0131z teoriler \u00fczerinde duruyordum ve ger\u00e7ek kald\u0131ra\u00e7lar\u0131 \u00e7ekmeye asla cesaret edemiyordum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u76f4\u6c89\u8ff7\u4e8e\u65e0\u5173\u7684\u7406\u8bba\uff0c\u4ece\u672a\u6562\u771f\u6b63\u53bb\u53d1\u6325\u5173\u952e\u4f5c\u7528\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7e3d\u662f\u6c89\u8ff7\u65bc\u7121\u95dc\u7dca\u8981\u7684\u7406\u8ad6\uff0c\u5f9e\u4f86\u4e0d\u6562\u62c9\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u69d3\u687f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q15.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe jedes Mal aufgegeben, wenn es keinen Spa\u00df mehr gemacht hat."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I gave up every time it stopped being fun."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me rend\u00ed cada vez que dej\u00f3 de ser divertido."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai abandonn\u00e9 \u00e0 chaque fois que \u00e7a n'\u00e9tait plus amusant."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0939\u0930 \u092c\u093e\u0930 \u091c\u092c \u0907\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u091c\u093c\u093e \u0906\u0928\u093e \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0939\u094b \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0939\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0932\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi arrendevo ogni volta che smetteva di essere divertente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u697d\u3057\u304f\u306a\u304f\u306a\u308b\u305f\u3073\u306b\u8ae6\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc7ac\ubbf8\uac00 \uc5c6\uc5b4\uc9c8 \ub54c\ub9c8\ub2e4 \ud3ec\uae30\ud588\uc5b4\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elke keer als het niet meer leuk was, gaf ik het op."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poddawa\u0142am si\u0119 za ka\u017cdym razem, gdy przesta\u0142o by\u0107 zabawne."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desisti toda vez que isso deixou de ser divertido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0441\u044f \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437, \u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043b\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0443\u0434\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E\u011flenceli olmay\u0131 b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131 her an vazge\u00e7tim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bcf\u6b21\u4e00\u65e6\u4e0d\u518d\u6709\u4e50\u8da3\uff0c\u6211\u5c31\u653e\u5f03\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bcf\u7576\u5b83\u4e0d\u518d\u6709\u8da3\u6642\u6211\u5c31\u653e\u68c4\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.growth.q15.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle drei oben genannten Punkte treffen zu. Ich \u00fcbernehme die volle Verantwortung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All three points above apply. I take full responsibility."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se aplican los tres puntos anteriores. Asumo toda la responsabilidad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les trois points ci-dessus s\u2019appliquent. J'en assume l'enti\u00e8re responsabilit\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0909\u092a\u0930\u094b\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0924\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u092c\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0941 \u0932\u093e\u0917\u0942 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u091c\u093f\u092e\u094d\u092e\u0947\u0926\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si applicano tutti e tre i punti precedenti. Mi assumo la piena responsabilit\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u8a18\u306e3\u70b9\u304c\u3059\u3079\u3066\u5f53\u3066\u306f\u307e\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u304c\u5168\u8cac\u4efb\u3092\u8ca0\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc704\uc758 \uc138 \uac00\uc9c0 \uc0ac\ud56d\uc774 \ubaa8\ub450 \uc801\uc6a9\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ucc45\uc784\uc744 \uc9d1\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle drie bovenstaande punten zijn van toepassing. Ik neem de volledige verantwoordelijkheid."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obowi\u0105zuj\u0105 wszystkie trzy powy\u017csze punkty. Bior\u0119 na siebie pe\u0142n\u0105 odpowiedzialno\u015b\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todos os tr\u00eas pontos acima se aplicam. Assumo total responsabilidade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0441\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0438 \u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435\u0443\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043f\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0442\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u044b. \u042f \u0431\u0435\u0440\u0443 \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0443\u044e \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yukar\u0131daki \u00fc\u00e7 noktan\u0131n t\u00fcm\u00fc ge\u00e7erlidir. T\u00fcm sorumlulu\u011fu al\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u8ff0\u4e09\u70b9\u90fd\u9002\u7528\u3002\u6211\u627f\u62c5\u5168\u90e8\u8d23\u4efb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0a\u8ff0\u4e09\u9ede\u5747\u9069\u7528\u3002\u6211\u627f\u64d4\u5168\u90e8\u8cac\u4efb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
