            "value": "Sars\u0131lmaz olan"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u575a\u5b9a\u4e0d\u79fb\u7684\u4eba"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u53ef\u52d5\u6416\u7684\u90a3\u500b"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q1": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein gr\u00f6\u00dftes, lang ersehntes Projekt scheitert am allerletzten Tag durch eine Formalit\u00e4t. Was passiert in deinem Kopf?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your biggest, long-awaited project fails on the very last day due to a technicality. What's happening in your head?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su proyecto m\u00e1s grande y tan esperado fracasa el \u00faltimo d\u00eda debido a un tecnicismo. \u00bfQu\u00e9 est\u00e1 pasando en tu cabeza?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre projet le plus important et tant attendu \u00e9choue le tout dernier jour en raison d\u2019un probl\u00e8me technique. Que se passe-t-il dans ta t\u00eate ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u0940, \u0932\u0902\u092c\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093f\u0924 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u092f\u094b\u091c\u0928\u093e \u0924\u0915\u0928\u0940\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0906\u0916\u093f\u0930\u0940 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0935\u093f\u092b\u0932 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u092e\u093e\u0917 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u091a\u0932 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo progetto pi\u00f9 grande e tanto atteso fallisce proprio l'ultimo giorno a causa di un cavillo. Cosa sta succedendo nella tua testa?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f85\u671b\u306e\u6700\u5927\u306e\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u304c\u3001\u6280\u8853\u7684\u306a\u554f\u984c\u306b\u3088\u308a\u6700\u7d42\u65e5\u306b\u5931\u6557\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u982d\u306e\u4e2d\u3067\u4f55\u304c\u8d77\u3053\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ub7ab\ub3d9\uc548 \uae30\ub2e4\ub824\uc628 \uac00\uc7a5 \ud070 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uac00 \uae30\uc220 \ubb38\uc81c\ub85c \uc778\ud574 \ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9 \ub0a0 \uc2e4\ud328\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uba38\ub9ac \uc18d\uc5d0\uc11c \ubb34\uc2a8 \uc77c\uc774 \uc77c\uc5b4\ub098\uace0 \uc788\ub294 \uac78\uae4c\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je grootste, langverwachte project mislukt op de allerlaatste dag vanwege een technisch probleem. Wat gebeurt er in je hoofd?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j najwi\u0119kszy, d\u0142ugo oczekiwany projekt ko\u0144czy si\u0119 niepowodzeniem ostatniego dnia ze wzgl\u0119d\u00f3w technicznych. Co si\u0119 dzieje w Twojej g\u0142owie?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu maior e mais esperado projeto falha no \u00faltimo dia devido a um detalhe t\u00e9cnico. O que est\u00e1 acontecendo na sua cabe\u00e7a?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u043e\u0439, \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0433\u043e\u0436\u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u043f\u0438\u0442 \u043d\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0432 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0438\u0441\u0445\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442 \u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432 \u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0435?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uzun zamand\u0131r bekledi\u011finiz en b\u00fcy\u00fck projeniz teknik bir sorun nedeniyle son g\u00fcnde ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. Kafan\u0131n i\u00e7inde neler oluyor?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6700\u5927\u7684\u3001\u671f\u5f85\u5df2\u4e45\u7684\u9879\u76ee\u5728\u6700\u540e\u4e00\u5929\u56e0\u4e3a\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f62\u5f0f\u95ee\u9898\u800c\u5931\u8d25\u3002\u4f60\u8111\u5b50\u91cc\u4f1a\u53d1\u751f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u671f\u5f85\u5df2\u4e45\u7684\u6700\u5927\u5c08\u6848\u5728\u6700\u5f8c\u4e00\u5929\u7531\u65bc\u6280\u8853\u539f\u56e0\u5931\u6557\u4e86\u3002\u4f60\u8166\u5b50\u88e1\u767c\u751f\u4e86\u4ec0\u9ebc\u4e8b\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q1.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das war\u2019s. Ich fasse so etwas nie wieder an, das Schicksal ist gegen mich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That's it. I'll never touch something like that again, fate is against me."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso es todo. Nunca volver\u00e9 a tocar algo as\u00ed, el destino est\u00e1 en mi contra."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est \u00e7a. Je ne toucherai plus jamais \u00e0 quelque chose comme \u00e7a, le destin est contre moi."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0939\u0940\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u094b \u0926\u094b\u092c\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091b\u0942\u090a\u0902\u0917\u093e, \u092d\u093e\u0917\u094d\u092f \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0916\u093c\u093f\u0932\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo \u00e8 tutto. Non toccher\u00f2 mai pi\u00f9 una cosa del genere, il destino \u00e8 contro di me."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u308c\u3067\u304a\u3057\u307e\u3044\u3002\u3042\u3093\u306a\u3082\u306e\u306b\u306f\u4e8c\u5ea6\u3068\u89e6\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3001\u904b\u547d\u306f\u79c1\u306b\u6575\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8\uac8c \ub2e4\uc57c. \ub098\ub294 \ub2e4\uc2dc\ub294 \uadf8\ub7f0 \uac83\uc744 \ub9cc\uc9c0\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc6b4\uba85\uc740 \ub098\ub97c \ubc18\ub300\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dat is het. Zoiets raak ik nooit meer aan, het lot is tegen mij."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To wszystko. Nigdy wi\u0119cej nie dotkn\u0119 czego\u015b takiego, los jest przeciwko mnie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c9 isso. Nunca mais tocarei em algo assim, o destino est\u00e1 contra mim."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u043e\u0442 \u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0451. \u042f \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u0437\u044c\u043c\u0443\u0441\u044c \u0437\u0430 \u0442\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0435, \u0441\u0443\u0434\u044c\u0431\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130\u015fte bu. Bir daha asla b\u00f6yle bir \u015feye dokunmayaca\u011f\u0131m, kader bana kar\u015f\u0131."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c31\u8fd9\u6837\u3002\u6211\u518d\u4e5f\u4e0d\u4f1a\u78b0\u8fd9\u79cd\u4e1c\u897f\u4e86\uff0c\u547d\u8fd0\u5bf9\u6211\u4e0d\u5229\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c31\u662f\u9019\u6a23\u3002\u6211\u518d\u4e5f\u4e0d\u6703\u78b0\u9019\u6a23\u7684\u6771\u897f\u4e86\uff0c\u547d\u904b\u5c0d\u6211\u4e0d\u5229\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q1.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bet\u00e4ube mich tagelang mit Netflix/Social Media, um nicht daran zu denken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I numb myself with Netflix/social media for days to avoid thinking about it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me adormezco con Netflix/las redes sociales durante d\u00edas para evitar pensar en ello."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m'engourdis avec Netflix/les r\u00e9seaux sociaux pendant des jours pour \u00e9viter d'y penser."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0928\u0947\u091f\u092b\u094d\u0932\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0938/\u0938\u094b\u0936\u0932 \u092e\u0940\u0921\u093f\u092f\u093e \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u0908 \u0926\u093f\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u0941\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u0930 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi intorpidisco con Netflix/social media per giorni per evitare di pensarci."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u305d\u308c\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u8003\u3048\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u907f\u3051\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u3001\u4f55\u65e5\u3082Netflix\u3084\u30bd\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30eb\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2\u3067\u81ea\u5206\u3092\u9ebb\u75fa\u3055\u305b\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uc0dd\uac01\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uba70\uce60 \ub3d9\uc548 Netflix/\uc18c\uc15c \ubbf8\ub514\uc5b4\uc5d0 \ubb34\uac10\uac01\ud574\uc84c\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verdoof mezelf dagenlang met Netflix/sociale media om er niet aan te denken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odr\u0119twiam si\u0119 od Netflixa/medi\u00f3w spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych przez kilka dni, aby unikn\u0105\u0107 my\u015blenia o tym."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu me entorpe\u00e7o com o Netflix/m\u00eddia social por dias para evitar pensar nisso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u043d\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0442 \u043e\u0431\u0435\u0437\u0431\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f Netflix/\u0441\u043e\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0442\u044f\u043c\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043e\u0431 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnmemek i\u00e7in g\u00fcnlerce Netflix/sosyal medyayla kendimi uyu\u015fturdum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6574\u5929\u7528Netflix/\u793e\u4ea4\u5a92\u4f53\u9ebb\u75f9\u81ea\u5df1\uff0c\u4ee5\u514d\u53bb\u60f3\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7528Netflix/\u793e\u7fa4\u5a92\u9ad4\u9ebb\u75fa\u4e86\u81ea\u5df1\u597d\u5e7e\u5929\uff0c\u4ee5\u907f\u514d\u53bb\u60f3\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q1.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gibt es einen Plan B? Wenn nicht, fange ich morgen fr\u00fch mit Projekt Nummer zwei an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Is there a plan B? If not, I'll start project number two tomorrow morning."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00bfExiste un plan B? Si no, ma\u00f1ana por la ma\u00f1ana empezar\u00e9 el proyecto n\u00famero dos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Y a-t-il un plan B ? Sinon, je commencerai le projet num\u00e9ro deux demain matin."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u092a\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0928 \u092c\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u0939\u0948? \u092f\u0926\u093f \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0932 \u0938\u0941\u092c\u0939 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0928\u0902\u092c\u0930 \u0926\u094b \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esiste un piano B? In caso contrario, inizier\u00f2 il progetto numero due domani mattina."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30d7\u30e9\u30f3B\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f\u305d\u3046\u3067\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306f\u3001\u660e\u65e5\u306e\u671d\u304b\u3089\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8 2 \u3092\u958b\u59cb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud50c\ub79c B\uac00 \uc788\ub098\uc694? \uadf8\ub807\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub2e4\uba74 \ub0b4\uc77c \uc544\uce68\uc5d0 \ub450 \ubc88\uc9f8 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\ub97c \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bestaat er een plan B? Zo niet, dan begin ik morgenochtend met project nummer twee."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Czy istnieje plan B? Je\u015bli nie, jutro rano rozpoczn\u0119 projekt numer dwa."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Existe um plano B? Caso contr\u00e1rio, iniciarei o projeto n\u00famero dois amanh\u00e3 de manh\u00e3."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0415\u0441\u0442\u044c \u043b\u0438 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d \u0411? \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0442, \u044f \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430 \u0443\u0442\u0440\u043e\u043c \u043d\u0430\u0447\u043d\u0443 \u0441 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0430 \u043d\u043e\u043c\u0435\u0440 \u0434\u0432\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir B plan\u0131 var m\u0131? Aksi halde yar\u0131n sabah iki numaral\u0131 projeye ba\u015flayaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u6ca1\u6709\u5907\u9009\u8ba1\u5212\uff1f\u5982\u679c\u6ca1\u6709\uff0c\u6211\u660e\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u5c31\u5f00\u59cb\u7b2c\u4e8c\u4e2a\u9879\u76ee\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709B\u8a08\u5283\u55ce\uff1f\u5982\u679c\u6c92\u6709\uff0c\u6211\u660e\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u5c31\u6703\u958b\u59cb\u7b2c\u4e8c\u500b\u5c08\u6848\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q1.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich suche w\u00fctend nach dem Schuldigen, der diese Formalit\u00e4t verbockt hat."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm furiously searching for the culprit who messed up this formality."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy buscando furiosamente al culpable que arruin\u00f3 esta formalidad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je recherche furieusement le coupable qui a rat\u00e9 cette formalit\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0938 \u0905\u092a\u0930\u093e\u0927\u0940 \u0915\u0940 \u0936\u093f\u0926\u094d\u0926\u0924 \u0938\u0947 \u0924\u0932\u093e\u0936 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0928\u0947 \u0907\u0938 \u0914\u092a\u091a\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0915\u094b \u092c\u093f\u0917\u093e\u0921\u093c \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sto cercando furiosamente il colpevole che ha incasinato questa formalit\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3053\u306e\u624b\u7d9a\u304d\u3092\u53f0\u7121\u3057\u306b\u3057\u305f\u72af\u4eba\u3092\u731b\u70c8\u306b\u63a2\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc774 \ud615\uc2dd\uc744 \uc5b4\uc9c0\ub7fd\ud78c \ubc94\uc778\uc744 \ub9f9\ub82c\ud788 \ucc3e\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ben verwoed op zoek naar de dader die deze formaliteit heeft verprutst."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pilnie poszukuj\u0119 sprawcy, kt\u00f3ry zawali\u0142 t\u0119 formalno\u015b\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou procurando furiosamente o culpado que estragou essa formalidade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u044f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0449\u0443 \u0432\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0438\u043b \u044d\u0442\u0443 \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu formaliteyi bozan su\u00e7luyu \u00f6fkeyle ar\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6124\u6012\u5730\u5bfb\u627e\u90a3\u4e2a\u628a\u8fd9\u9879\u624b\u7eed\u5f04\u7838\u7684\u8d23\u4efb\u4eba\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6b63\u5728\u760b\u72c2\u5730\u5c0b\u627e\u641e\u7838\u9019\u500b\u5100\u5f0f\u7684\u7f6a\u9b41\u798d\u9996\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q2": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist extrem ersch\u00f6pft und hast dir den Abend f\u00fcr dich geblockt. Ein entfernter Bekannter fragt, ob du ihm bei einem banalen Problem hilfst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are extremely exhausted and have blocked out the evening for yourself. A distant acquaintance asks if you can help him with a trivial problem."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Est\u00e1s extremadamente agotado y has bloqueado la noche para ti. Un conocido lejano te pregunta si puedes ayudarlo con un problema trivial."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous \u00eates extr\u00eamement \u00e9puis\u00e9 et avez r\u00e9serv\u00e9 la soir\u00e9e pour vous-m\u00eame. Une connaissance lointaine vous demande si vous pouvez l'aider \u00e0 r\u00e9soudre un probl\u00e8me insignifiant."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0925\u0915\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0936\u093e\u092e \u0915\u094b \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0930\u094b\u0915 \u0932\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u090f\u0915 \u0926\u0942\u0930 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0930\u093f\u091a\u093f\u0924 \u092a\u0942\u091b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0906\u092a \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u090f\u0915 \u091b\u094b\u091f\u0940 \u0938\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u0926\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sei estremamente esausto e hai bloccato la serata per te stesso. Un lontano conoscente ti chiede se puoi aiutarlo con un problema banale."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u6975\u5ea6\u306b\u75b2\u308c\u304d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\u591c\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306b\u8cbb\u3084\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u9060\u65b9\u306e\u77e5\u4eba\u304b\u3089\u3001\u4e9b\u7d30\u306a\u554f\u984c\u3067\u52a9\u3051\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u983c\u307e\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \uc9c0\uccd0\uc11c \uc800\ub141 \uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \ub9c9\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uba3c \uc9c0\uc778\uc774 \uc0ac\uc18c\ud55c \ubb38\uc81c\ub97c \ub3c4\uc640\uc904 \uc218 \uc788\ub294\uc9c0 \ubb3b\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je bent extreem uitgeput en hebt de avond voor jezelf geblokkeerd. Een verre kennis vraagt \u200b\u200bof je hem kunt helpen met een triviaal probleem."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeste\u015b skrajnie wyczerpany i masz zarezerwowany wiecz\u00f3r dla siebie. Daleki znajomy pyta, czy mo\u017cesz mu pom\u00f3c w trywialnym problemie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 extremamente exausto e bloqueou a noite para si mesmo. Um conhecido distante pergunta se voc\u00ea pode ajud\u00e1-lo com um problema trivial."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0438 \u0437\u0430\u0431\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b \u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435\u0440 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f. \u0414\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043c\u044b\u0439 \u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442, \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043b\u0438 \u0442\u044b \u0435\u043c\u0443 \u0441 \u0431\u0430\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0439."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son derece yorgunsunuz ve ak\u015fam\u0131 kendinize ay\u0131rd\u0131n\u0131z. Uzak bir tan\u0131d\u0131k ona \u00f6nemsiz bir sorunda yard\u0131m edip edemeyece\u011finizi soruyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6781\u5ea6\u75b2\u60eb\uff0c\u5e76\u4e3a\u81ea\u5df1\u7559\u51fa\u4e86\u665a\u4e0a\u3002\u4e00\u4f4d\u4e0d\u592a\u719f\u6089\u7684\u719f\u4eba\u95ee\u4f60\uff0c\u662f\u5426\u80fd\u5e2e\u4ed6\u89e3\u51b3\u4e00\u4e2a\u7410\u788e\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7d93\u975e\u5e38\u75b2\u618a\u4e86\uff0c\u4e26\u4e14\u5df2\u7d93\u70ba\u81ea\u5df1\u5b89\u6392\u4e86\u4e00\u500b\u665a\u4e0a\u3002\u4e00\u4f4d\u9060\u65b9\u7684\u719f\u4eba\u554f\u4f60\u662f\u5426\u53ef\u4ee5\u5e6b\u4ed6\u89e3\u6c7a\u4e00\u500b\u5c0f\u554f\u984c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q2.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich sage zu, weil ich Angst habe, dass er mich sonst nicht mehr mag."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I say yes because I'm afraid that otherwise he won't like me anymore."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digo que s\u00ed porque tengo miedo de que, de lo contrario, ya no le agrado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dis oui parce que j'ai peur que sinon il ne m'aime plus."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0939\u093e\u0901 \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0921\u0930 \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0925\u093e \u0935\u0939 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0905\u092c \u092a\u0938\u0902\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dico di s\u00ec perch\u00e9 ho paura che altrimenti non gli piacer\u00f2 pi\u00f9."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u304c\u300c\u306f\u3044\u300d\u3068\u8a00\u3046\u306e\u306f\u3001\u305d\u3046\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3068\u5f7c\u304c\u79c1\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3082\u3046\u597d\u304d\u3058\u3083\u306a\u304f\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u5fc3\u914d\u3060\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\ub807\ub2e4\uace0 \ub300\ub2f5\ud55c\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub807\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74 \uadf8 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc774 \ub354 \uc774\uc0c1 \ub098\ub97c \uc88b\uc544\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uae4c\ubd10 \ub450\ub835\uae30 \ub54c\ubb38\uc774\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik zeg ja omdat ik bang ben dat hij mij anders niet meer leuk zal vinden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "M\u00f3wi\u0119 tak, bo boj\u0119 si\u0119, \u017ce inaczej ju\u017c mnie nie polubi."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digo que sim porque tenho medo de que, caso contr\u00e1rio, ele n\u00e3o goste mais de mim."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043e\u0433\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0431\u043e\u044e\u0441\u044c, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043e\u043d \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u044e\u0431\u0438\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evet diyorum \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc aksi halde art\u0131k beni sevmeyece\u011finden korkuyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7b54\u5e94\u4e86\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u5bb3\u6015\u4ed6\u4f1a\u4e0d\u518d\u559c\u6b22\u6211\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8aaa\u662f\u7684\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u64d4\u5fc3\u5426\u5247\u4ed6\u4e0d\u6703\u518d\u559c\u6b61\u6211\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q2.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich l\u00fcge und erfinde eine dramatische Ausrede, warum ich nicht kann."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I lie and make up a dramatic excuse as to why I can't."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Miento e invento una excusa dram\u00e1tica de por qu\u00e9 no puedo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je mens et invente une excuse dramatique pour expliquer pourquoi je ne peux pas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091d\u0942\u0920 \u092c\u094b\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u093e\u091f\u0915\u0940\u092f \u092c\u0939\u093e\u0928\u093e \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0910\u0938\u093e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mento e invento una scusa drammatica per spiegare perch\u00e9 non posso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u306a\u305c\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u306e\u304b\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u5618\u3092\u3064\u3044\u305f\u308a\u3001\u5287\u7684\u306a\u8a00\u3044\u8a33\u3092\u3067\u3063\u3061\u4e0a\u3052\u305f\u308a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uac70\uc9d3\ub9d0\uc744 \ud558\uace0 \uc65c \uadf8\ub807\uac8c \ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\ub294\uc9c0\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \uadf9\uc801\uc778 \ubcc0\uba85\uc744 \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik lieg en verzin een dramatisch excuus waarom ik dat niet kan."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K\u0142ami\u0119 i wymy\u015blam dramatyczn\u0105 wym\u00f3wk\u0119, dlaczego nie mog\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minto e invento uma desculpa dram\u00e1tica para explicar por que n\u00e3o posso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043b\u0433\u0443 \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0443\u043c\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0434\u0440\u0430\u043c\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435, \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u0433\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yalan s\u00f6yl\u00fcyorum ve neden yapamad\u0131\u011f\u0131ma dair dramatik bir bahane uyduruyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6492\u8c0e\u5e76\u7f16\u9020\u4e00\u4e2a\u620f\u5267\u6027\u7684\u501f\u53e3\uff0c\u8bf4\u660e\u6211\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u4e0d\u80fd\u53bb\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6492\u8b0a\u4e26\u7de8\u9020\u4e86\u4e00\u500b\u6232\u5287\u6027\u7684\u85c9\u53e3\u4f86\u89e3\u91cb\u70ba\u4ec0\u9ebc\u6211\u4e0d\u80fd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q2.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich sage klar Nein, ohne mich gro\u00dfartig zu rechtfertigen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I say no clearly, without justifying myself too much."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digo que no claramente, sin justificarme demasiado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dis non clairement, sans trop me justifier."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0909\u091a\u093f\u0924 \u0920\u0939\u0930\u093e\u090f \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e, \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 '\u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902' \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dico no chiaramente, senza giustificarmi troppo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u3092\u6b63\u5f53\u5316\u3057\u3059\u304e\u305a\u306b\u3001\u306f\u3063\u304d\u308a\u3068\u30ce\u30fc\u3068\u8a00\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \uc790\uc2e0\uc744 \ub108\ubb34 \uc815\ub2f9\ud654\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \ubd84\uba85\ud788 \uac70\uc808\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik zeg duidelijk nee, zonder mezelf al te veel te rechtvaardigen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stanowczo m\u00f3wi\u0119 nie, nie usprawiedliwiaj\u0105c si\u0119 zbytnio."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digo n\u00e3o com clareza, sem me justificar demais."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u044f\u0441\u043d\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044e \u00ab\u043d\u0435\u0442\u00bb, \u043d\u0435 \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044f\u0441\u044c \u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendimi \u00e7ok fazla hakl\u0131 \u00e7\u0131karmadan a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a hay\u0131r diyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u660e\u786e\u5730\u8bf4\u4e0d\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u505a\u8fc7\u591a\u89e3\u91ca\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u660e\u78ba\u5730\u8aaa\u201c\u4e0d\u201d\uff0c\u4f46\u53c8\u6c92\u6709\u70ba\u81ea\u5df1\u8faf\u89e3\u592a\u591a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q2.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich ignoriere die Nachricht tagelang, weil mir Konfrontation unangenehm ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I ignore the message for days because I'm uncomfortable with confrontation."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro el mensaje durante d\u00edas porque me incomoda la confrontaci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ignore le message pendant des jours parce que je ne suis pas \u00e0 l'aise avec la confrontation."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0908 \u0926\u093f\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u091c\u0930\u0905\u0902\u0926\u093e\u091c \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091f\u0915\u0930\u093e\u0935 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0938\u0939\u091c \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro il messaggio per giorni perch\u00e9 mi sento a disagio nel confronto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bfe\u7acb\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304c\u4e0d\u5feb\u306a\u306e\u3067\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u4f55\u65e5\u3082\u30e1\u30c3\u30bb\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7121\u8996\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub300\uacb0\uc774 \ubd88\ud3b8\ud574\uc11c \uba70\uce60 \ub3d9\uc548 \uadf8 \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\ub97c \ubb34\uc2dc\ud588\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik negeer het bericht dagenlang omdat ik me niet op mijn gemak voel bij confrontatie."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoruj\u0119 t\u0119 wiadomo\u015b\u0107 przez kilka dni, poniewa\u017c nie czuj\u0119 si\u0119 komfortowo w obliczu konfrontacji."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ignoro a mensagem durante dias porque me sinto desconfort\u00e1vel com o confronto."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u0433\u043d\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e \u0441\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u043d\u044f\u043c\u0438, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0438\u044f\u0442\u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Y\u00fczle\u015fmekten rahats\u0131z oldu\u011fum i\u00e7in g\u00fcnlerce mesaj\u0131 g\u00f6rmezden geliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u8fde\u7eed\u597d\u51e0\u5929\u5ffd\u7565\u90a3\u6761\u6d88\u606f\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u4e0d\u559c\u6b22\u9762\u5bf9\u51b2\u7a81\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u597d\u5e7e\u5929\u90fd\u5ffd\u7565\u9019\u8a0a\u606f\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u5c0d\u5c0d\u6297\u611f\u5230\u4e0d\u8212\u670d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q3": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast die Wahl: Ein Job mit 4.000\u20ac netto, bei dem du dich jeden Tag zu Tode langweilst, oder ein Job mit 2.500\u20ac netto, der dich t\u00e4glich an deine intellektuellen Grenzen bringt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have the choice: a job with \u20ac4,000 net that will bore you to death every day, or a job with \u20ac2,500 net that pushes you to your intellectual limits every day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tienes la opci\u00f3n: un trabajo con 4.000 \u20ac netos que te aburrir\u00e1 cada d\u00eda, o un trabajo con 2.500 \u20ac netos que te llevar\u00e1 cada d\u00eda al l\u00edmite intelectual."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez le choix : un boulot \u00e0 4 000 \u20ac net qui vous ennuiera \u00e0 mourir chaque jour, ou un boulot \u00e0 2 500 \u20ac net qui vous pousse chaque jour dans vos limites intellectuelles."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a \u0939\u0948: \u20ac4,000 \u0928\u0947\u091f \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0928\u094c\u0915\u0930\u0940 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0939\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u094c\u0924 \u0915\u0947 \u092e\u0941\u0902\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0927\u0915\u0947\u0932 \u0926\u0947\u0917\u0940, \u092f\u093e \u20ac2,500 \u0928\u0947\u091f \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0928\u094c\u0915\u0930\u0940 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0939\u0930 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092c\u094c\u0926\u094d\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u0940\u092e\u093e \u0924\u0915 \u0927\u0915\u0947\u0932 \u0926\u0947\u0917\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai la scelta: un lavoro da 4.000 euro netti che ti annoier\u00e0 a morte ogni giorno, o un lavoro da 2.500 euro netti che ti spinge ogni giorno ai tuoi limiti intellettuali."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u306f\u9078\u629e\u80a2\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u6bce\u65e5\u6b7b\u306c\u307b\u3069\u9000\u5c48\u306a\u7d14\u984d4,000\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306e\u4ed5\u4e8b\u304b\u3001\u6bce\u65e5\u77e5\u7684\u9650\u754c\u307e\u3067\u8ffd\u3044\u8fbc\u307e\u308c\u308b\u7d14\u984d2,500\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u306e\u4ed5\u4e8b\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc120\ud0dd\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4: \ub9e4\uc77c \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc744 \uc8fd\uac8c \ub9cc\ub4dc\ub294 \u20ac4,000\uc758 \uc21c\uc775\uc744 \uac00\uc9c4 \uc9c1\uc5c5, \ub610\ub294 \ub9e4\uc77c \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc9c0\uc801 \ud55c\uacc4\uae4c\uc9c0 \ubc00\uc5b4\ubd99\uc774\ub294 \u20ac2,500\uc758 \uc21c\uc775\uc744 \uac00\uc9c4 \uc9c1\uc5c5."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt de keuze: een baan van \u20ac 4.000 netto die je elke dag doodverveelt, of een baan van \u20ac 2.500 netto die je elke dag tot het uiterste drijft."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masz wyb\u00f3r: prac\u0119 za 4000 euro netto, kt\u00f3ra ka\u017cdego dnia zanudzi Ci\u0119 na \u015bmier\u0107, albo prac\u0119 za 2500 euro netto, kt\u00f3ra ka\u017cdego dnia popycha Ci\u0119 do granic mo\u017cliwo\u015bci intelektualnych."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea tem a escolha: um emprego com 4.000 euros l\u00edquidos que o deixar\u00e1 entediado todos os dias, ou um trabalho com 2.500 euros l\u00edquidos que o levar\u00e1 ao seu limite intelectual todos os dias."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0432\u044b\u0431\u043e\u0440: \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430 \u0441 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0439 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0439 4000 \u20ac, \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u0442\u044b \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0443\u043c\u0438\u0440\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043e\u0442 \u0441\u043a\u0443\u043a\u0438, \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430 \u0441 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0439 \u0437\u0430\u0440\u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0439 2500 \u20ac, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0430\u044f \u0435\u0436\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0432\u043d\u043e \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u043b\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0443\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0432\u044b\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se\u00e7ene\u011finiz var: net 4.000 Euro'luk sizi her g\u00fcn can\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 s\u0131kacak bir i\u015f ya da net 2.500 Euro'luk sizi her g\u00fcn entelekt\u00fcel s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 zorlayan bir i\u015f."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6709\u9009\u62e9\uff1a\u4e00\u4efd\u51c0\u6536\u51654000\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u6bcf\u5929\u65e0\u804a\u5f97\u8981\u6b7b\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u4e00\u4efd\u51c0\u6536\u51652500\u6b27\u5143\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u6bcf\u5929\u90fd\u8ba9\u4f60\u53d1\u6325\u667a\u529b\u6781\u9650\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u9078\u64c7\uff1a\u6de8\u6536\u5165\u70ba 4,000 \u6b50\u5143\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u6bcf\u5929\u90fd\u6703\u8b93\u4f60\u53ad\u7169\u5f97\u8981\u6b7b\uff1b\u6216\u4e00\u4efd\u6de8\u6536\u5165\u70ba 2,500 \u6b50\u5143\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u6bcf\u5929\u90fd\u6703\u628a\u4f60\u903c\u5230\u667a\u529b\u6975\u9650\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q3.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000\u20ac, ganz klar. Ich sitze die Zeit ab und lebe f\u00fcr das Wochenende."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac4,000, of course. I sit through the time and live for the weekend."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000\u20ac, por supuesto. Paso el tiempo y vivo para el fin de semana."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 000 \u20ac, bien s\u00fbr. Je passe le temps et je vis le week-end."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac4,000, \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u092c\u0948\u0920\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u092a\u094d\u0924\u093e\u0939\u093e\u0902\u0924 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u091c\u0940\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000 euro, ovviamente. Mi siedo attraverso il tempo e vivo per il fine settimana."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3082\u3061\u308d\u30934,000\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u6642\u9593\u3092\u904e\u3054\u3057\u3066\u9031\u672b\u3092\u751f\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubb3c\ub860 \u20ac4,000\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \ubcf4\ub0b4\uace0 \uc8fc\ub9d0\uc744 \uc704\ud574 \uc0b0\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac 4.000,- uiteraard. Ik zit door de tijd heen en leef voor het weekend."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oczywi\u015bcie 4000 euro. Sp\u0119dzam czas i \u017cyj\u0119 weekendem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000\u20ac, claro. Eu sento o tempo e vivo para o fim de semana."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000\u20ac, \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u044f\u0441\u043d\u043e. \u042f \u043e\u0442\u0441\u0438\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u0438 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0443 \u0440\u0430\u0434\u0438 \u0432\u044b\u0445\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044b\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tabii ki 4.000 \u20ac. Zaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde oturuyorum ve hafta sonu i\u00e7in ya\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4000\u6b27\u5143\uff0c\u6beb\u65e0\u7591\u95ee\u3002\u6211\u71ac\u8fc7\u8fd9\u6bb5\u65f6\u95f4\uff0c\u53ea\u4e3a\u4e86\u5468\u672b\u751f\u6d3b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7576\u7136\u662f 4,000 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u6211\u5750\u8457\u5ea6\u904e\u6642\u9593\uff0c\u904e\u9031\u672b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q3.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die 2.500\u20ac. Ich will gefordert werden, verliere aber bei zu viel Stress auch schnell die Lust."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The \u20ac2,500. I want to be challenged, but I quickly lose interest when there is too much stress."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los 2.500\u20ac. Quiero que me desaf\u00eden, pero r\u00e1pidamente pierdo el inter\u00e9s cuando hay demasiado estr\u00e9s."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les 2 500 \u20ac. J'ai envie d'\u00eatre mis au d\u00e9fi, mais je perds vite tout int\u00e9r\u00eat lorsqu'il y a trop de stress."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac2,500. \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u094c\u0924\u0940 \u092a\u093e\u0928\u093e \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u091c\u092c \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0924\u0928\u093e\u0935 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u0932\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0939\u0940 \u0930\u0941\u091a\u093f \u0916\u094b \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I 2.500\u20ac. Voglio essere sfidato, ma perdo rapidamente interesse quando c'\u00e8 troppo stress."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2,500\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3002\u6311\u6226\u3057\u305f\u3044\u306e\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30b9\u304c\u591a\u3059\u304e\u308b\u3068\u3059\u3050\u306b\u8208\u5473\u3092\u5931\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac2,500. \ub3c4\uc804\ud558\uace0 \uc2f6\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub808\uc2a4\uac00 \ub108\ubb34 \ub9ce\uc73c\uba74 \uae08\ubc29 \ud765\ubbf8\ub97c \uc783\uac8c \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De \u20ac 2.500,-. Ik wil uitgedaagd worden, maar bij teveel stress verlies ik snel mijn interesse."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2500 euro. Chc\u0119 podejmowa\u0107 wyzwania, ale szybko trac\u0119 zainteresowanie, gdy jest za du\u017co stresu."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os 2.500\u20ac. Quero ser desafiado, mas perco rapidamente o interesse quando h\u00e1 muito estresse."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.500\u20ac. \u042f \u0445\u043e\u0447\u0443, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0432\u044b\u0437\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u043d\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0448\u043a\u043e\u043c \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u043e\u043c \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0435 \u044f \u0442\u043e\u0436\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e \u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u044e \u0436\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.500 \u20ac. Bana meydan okunmak istiyorum ama \u00e7ok fazla stres oldu\u011funda ilgimi h\u0131zla kaybediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd92500\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u6211\u5e0c\u671b\u53d7\u5230\u6311\u6218\uff0c\u4f46\u5728\u538b\u529b\u592a\u5927\u65f6\u4e5f\u4f1a\u5f88\u5feb\u5931\u53bb\u5174\u8da3\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2,500 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u6211\u60f3\u63a5\u53d7\u6311\u6230\uff0c\u4f46\u58d3\u529b\u592a\u5927\u6642\u6211\u5f88\u5feb\u5c31\u6703\u5931\u53bb\u8208\u8da3\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q3.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die 2.500\u20ac. Ich brauche den Schmerz des Wachstums, sonst gehe ich ein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The \u20ac2,500. I need the pain of growth, otherwise I will die."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los 2.500\u20ac. Necesito el dolor del crecimiento, de lo contrario morir\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les 2 500 \u20ac. J'ai besoin de la douleur de la croissance, sinon je mourrai."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac2,500. \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u093e \u0926\u0930\u094d\u0926 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f, \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092e\u0930 \u091c\u093e\u090a\u0901\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I 2.500\u20ac. Ho bisogno del dolore della crescita, altrimenti morir\u00f2."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2,500\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3002\u6210\u9577\u306e\u75db\u307f\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3060\u3001\u305d\u3046\u3067\u306a\u3044\u3068\u6b7b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac2,500. \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c\ub294 \uc131\uc7a5\uc758 \uace0\ud1b5\uc774 \ud544\uc694\ud558\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub807\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc73c\uba74 \ub098\ub294 \uc8fd\uc744 \uac83\uc774\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De \u20ac 2.500,-. Ik heb de pijn van de groei nodig, anders ga ik dood."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2500 euro. Potrzebuj\u0119 b\u00f3lu wzrostu, inaczej umr\u0119."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os 2.500\u20ac. Preciso da dor do crescimento, caso contr\u00e1rio morrerei."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.500\u20ac. \u041c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c \u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430, \u0438\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435 \u044f \u043f\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0431\u043d\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.500 \u20ac. B\u00fcy\u00fcmenin ac\u0131s\u0131na ihtiyac\u0131m var, yoksa \u00f6lece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2,500\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u6211\u9700\u8981\u6210\u957f\u7684\u75db\u82e6\uff0c\u5426\u5219\u6211\u4f1a\u67af\u840e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2,500 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u6211\u9700\u8981\u6210\u9577\u7684\u75db\u82e6\uff0c\u5426\u5247\u6211\u5c31\u6703\u6b7b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q3.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die 4.000\u20ac, aber ich w\u00fcrde mich st\u00e4ndig dar\u00fcber beschweren, wie sinnlos mein Job ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The \u20ac4,000, but I would constantly complain about how pointless my job is."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los 4.000\u20ac, pero me quejar\u00eda constantemente de lo in\u00fatil que es mi trabajo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les 4 000 \u20ac, mais je me plaignais constamment de l'inutilit\u00e9 de mon travail."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac4,000, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u093e\u0930 \u0936\u093f\u0915\u093e\u092f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0925\u093e \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0947\u0930\u093e \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0930\u094d\u0925 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I 4.000 euro, ma mi lamenterei continuamente di quanto sia inutile il mio lavoro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4,000\u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u4ed5\u4e8b\u304c\u3069\u308c\u307b\u3069\u7121\u610f\u5473\u3067\u3042\u308b\u304b\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u5e38\u306b\u4e0d\u5e73\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u20ac4,000, \ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \uc9c1\uc5c5\uc774 \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ubb34\uc758\ubbf8\ud55c\uc9c0\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \ub04a\uc784\uc5c6\uc774 \ubd88\ud3c9\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De \u20ac 4.000, maar ik klaagde voortdurend over hoe zinloos mijn werk is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4000 euro, ale ci\u0105gle narzeka\u0142am, jak bezsensowna jest moja praca."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os 4.000\u20ac, mas queixava-me constantemente de qu\u00e3o in\u00fatil \u00e9 o meu trabalho."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000 \u20ac, \u043d\u043e \u044f \u0431\u044b \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0436\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0442\u043e, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0431\u0435\u0441\u0441\u043c\u044b\u0441\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430 \u043c\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4.000\u20ac ama i\u015fimin ne kadar anlams\u0131z oldu\u011fundan s\u00fcrekli \u015fikayet ederdim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4000\u6b27\u5143\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u4f1a\u4e0d\u505c\u5730\u62b1\u6028\u6211\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u6709\u591a\u4e48\u6beb\u65e0\u610f\u4e49\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4,000 \u6b50\u5143\uff0c\u4f46\u6211\u6703\u4e0d\u65b7\u62b1\u6028\u6211\u7684\u5de5\u4f5c\u6beb\u7121\u610f\u7fa9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q4": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du postest eine Leistung, auf die du extrem stolz bist, auf Social Media. Niemand likt oder kommentiert es. Null Reaktionen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You post an accomplishment that you are extremely proud of on social media. Nobody likes or comments on it. Zero reactions."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Publicas un logro del que est\u00e1s extremadamente orgulloso en las redes sociales. A nadie le gusta ni comenta al respecto. Cero reacciones."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous publiez une r\u00e9alisation dont vous \u00eates extr\u00eamement fier sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux. Personne ne l\u2019aime ni ne le commente. Z\u00e9ro r\u00e9action."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0938\u094b\u0936\u0932 \u092e\u0940\u0921\u093f\u092f\u093e \u092a\u0930 \u090f\u0915 \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u0909\u092a\u0932\u092c\u094d\u0927\u093f \u092a\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0917\u0930\u094d\u0935 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0907\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0915 \u092f\u093e \u0915\u092e\u0947\u0902\u091f \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e. \u0936\u0942\u0928\u094d\u092f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u090f\u0901."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pubblichi un risultato di cui sei estremamente orgoglioso sui social media. Nessuno mette mi piace o commenta. Reazioni zero."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u3001\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u8a87\u308a\u306b\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u6210\u679c\u3092\u30bd\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u30eb \u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2\u306b\u6295\u7a3f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u8ab0\u3082\u3044\u3044\u306d\u3082\u30b3\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u3082\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u53cd\u5fdc\u30bc\u30ed\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc18c\uc15c \ubbf8\ub514\uc5b4\uc5d0 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc790\ub791\uc2a4\ub7ec\uc6cc\ud558\ub294 \uc131\uacfc\ub97c \uac8c\uc2dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc544\ubb34\ub3c4 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \uc88b\uc544\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ub313\uae00\uc744 \ub2ec\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubc18\uc751\uc774 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je plaatst een prestatie waar je enorm trots op bent op sociale media. Niemand vindt het leuk of geeft er commentaar op. Nul reacties."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Publikujesz w mediach spo\u0142eczno\u015bciowych osi\u0105gni\u0119cie, z kt\u00f3rego jeste\u015b niezwykle dumny. Nikt tego nie lubi i nie komentuje. Zero reakcji."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea publica uma conquista da qual est\u00e1 extremamente orgulhoso nas redes sociais. Ningu\u00e9m gosta ou comenta sobre isso. Zero rea\u00e7\u00f5es."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043f\u0443\u0431\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u043c \u0442\u044b \u0447\u0440\u0435\u0437\u0432\u044b\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0440\u0434\u0438\u0448\u044c\u0441\u044f, \u0432 \u0441\u043e\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0441\u0435\u0442\u044f\u0445. \u041d\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442 \u043b\u0430\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u0442. \u041d\u043e\u043b\u044c \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son derece gurur duydu\u011funuz bir ba\u015far\u0131y\u0131 sosyal medyada payla\u015f\u0131yorsunuz. Kimse onu be\u011fenmiyor ve yorum yapm\u0131yor. S\u0131f\u0131r reaksiyon."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5728\u793e\u4ea4\u5a92\u4f53\u4e0a\u53d1\u5e03\u4e86\u4e00\u9879\u4f60\u975e\u5e38\u81ea\u8c6a\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u3002\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u70b9\u8d5e\u6216\u8bc4\u8bba\u3002\u96f6\u53cd\u5e94\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5728\u793e\u7fa4\u5a92\u9ad4\u4e0a\u767c\u5e03\u4e86\u4e00\u9805\u4ee4\u60a8\u611f\u5230\u975e\u5e38\u81ea\u8c6a\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u3002\u6c92\u6709\u4eba\u559c\u6b61\u6216\u8a55\u8ad6\u5b83\u3002\u96f6\u53cd\u61c9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q4.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich l\u00f6sche den Post nach ein paar Stunden, weil es mir peinlich ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I delete the post after a few hours because I'm embarrassed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elimino la publicaci\u00f3n despu\u00e9s de unas horas porque me da verg\u00fcenza."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je supprime le message au bout de quelques heures car je suis g\u00ean\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u092a\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0936\u0930\u094d\u092e\u093f\u0902\u0926\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancello il post dopo qualche ora perch\u00e9 sono in imbarazzo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6065\u305a\u304b\u3057\u3044\u306e\u3067\u6570\u6642\u9593\u5f8c\u306b\u6295\u7a3f\u3092\u524a\u9664\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ubd80\ub044\ub7ec\uc6cc\uc11c \uba87 \uc2dc\uac04 \ud6c4\uc5d0 \uae00\uc744 \uc0ad\uc81c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verwijder het bericht na een paar uur omdat ik me schaam."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po kilku godzinach usuwam post, bo jest mi wstyd."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Excluo a postagem depois de algumas horas porque estou com vergonha."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u044f\u044e \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u044b\u0434\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utand\u0131\u011f\u0131m i\u00e7in birka\u00e7 saat sonra g\u00f6nderiyi siliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u5728\u51e0\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u540e\u5220\u9664\u5e16\u5b50\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u6211\u611f\u5230\u5c34\u5c2c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5e7e\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\u5f8c\u6211\u522a\u9664\u4e86\u8a72\u5e16\u5b50\uff0c\u56e0\u70ba\u6211\u611f\u5230\u5c37\u5c2c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q4.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich zweifle an meiner Leistung und \u00fcberlege, ob es doch nicht so gut war."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I doubt my performance and wonder whether it wasn't so good after all."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dudo de mi desempe\u00f1o y me pregunto si no fue tan bueno despu\u00e9s de todo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je doute de ma performance et me demande si elle n'\u00e9tait pas si bonne finalement."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0926\u0930\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0939 \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u0936\u094d\u091a\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0906\u0916\u093c\u093f\u0930\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u092f\u0939 \u0907\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0925\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dubito della mia prestazione e mi chiedo se non fosse poi cos\u00ec buona."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30d1\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u30b9\u3092\u7591\u3063\u3066\u3001\u7d50\u5c40\u3042\u307e\u308a\u826f\u304f\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u304b\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub0b4 \uc5f0\uae30\ub3c4 \uc758\uc2ec\uc2a4\ub7fd\uace0 \uacb0\uad6d \uadf8\ub807\uac8c \uc88b\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\ub098 \uc2f6\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik twijfel aan mijn prestatie en vraag me af of het toch niet zo goed was."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u0105tpi\u0119 w sw\u00f3j wyst\u0119p i zastanawiam si\u0119, czy mimo wszystko nie by\u0142 taki dobry."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Duvido do meu desempenho e me pergunto se n\u00e3o foi t\u00e3o bom, afinal."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u0440\u0435\u0437\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0430\u0442\u0430\u0445 \u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043c\u044b\u0448\u043b\u044f\u044e, \u0431\u044b\u043b\u043e \u043b\u0438 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0451-\u0442\u0430\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0442\u0430\u043a \u0445\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0448\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Performans\u0131mdan \u015f\u00fcpheliyim ve o kadar da iyi olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 merak ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6000\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8868\u73b0\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u8003\u8651\u662f\u5426\u771f\u7684\u4e0d\u90a3\u4e48\u597d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u61f7\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u8868\u73fe\uff0c\u60f3\u77e5\u9053\u662f\u4e0d\u662f\u8868\u73fe\u4e0d\u592a\u597d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q4.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ist mir egal. Ich wei\u00df, was ich geleistet habe, das reicht mir."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I don't care. I know what I have achieved is enough for me."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No me importa. S\u00e9 que lo que he logrado es suficiente para m\u00ed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m'en fiche. Je sais que ce que j\u2019ai accompli me suffit."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092a\u0930\u0935\u093e\u0939 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u091c\u094b \u0939\u093e\u0938\u093f\u0932 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0935\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u093e\u092b\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non mi interessa. So che quello che ho ottenuto mi basta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u6c17\u306b\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u304c\u9054\u6210\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3067\u5341\u5206\u3060\u3068\u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc0c1\uad00\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \ub0b4\uac00 \uc131\ucde8\ud55c \uac83\uc774 \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c \ucda9\ubd84\ud558\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het maakt mij niet uit. Ik weet dat wat ik heb bereikt genoeg voor mij is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nie obchodzi mnie to. Wiem, \u017ce to, co osi\u0105gn\u0105\u0142em, mi wystarczy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu n\u00e3o ligo. Eu sei que o que consegui \u00e9 suficiente para mim."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e. \u042f \u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e, \u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u044f \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0433, \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umurumda de\u011fil. Kazand\u0131klar\u0131m\u0131n benim i\u00e7in yeterli oldu\u011funu biliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u65e0\u6240\u8c13\u3002\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u81ea\u5df1\u505a\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\uff0c\u8fd9\u5bf9\u6211\u6765\u8bf4\u5c31\u591f\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e0d\u5728\u4e4e\u3002\u6211\u77e5\u9053\u6211\u6240\u53d6\u5f97\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u5c0d\u6211\u4f86\u8aaa\u5df2\u7d93\u8db3\u5920\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q4.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bin sauer auf meine Freunde/Follower, weil sie mich nicht unterst\u00fctzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm mad at my friends/followers for not supporting me."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy enojado con mis amigos/seguidores por no apoyarme."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suis en col\u00e8re contre mes amis/abonn\u00e9s qui ne me soutiennent pas."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0924\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0902/\u0905\u0928\u0941\u092f\u093e\u092f\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u093e\u0930\u093e\u091c\u093c \u0939\u0942\u0901 \u0915\u093f \u0909\u0928\u094d\u0939\u094b\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u093e \u0938\u092e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono arrabbiato con i miei amici/follower che non mi supportano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u3092\u30b5\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u304f\u308c\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f\u53cb\u9054\u3084\u30d5\u30a9\u30ed\u30ef\u30fc\u306b\u8179\u304c\u7acb\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub098\ub97c \uc9c0\uc9c0\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294 \ub0b4 \uce5c\uad6c/\ud314\ub85c\uc6cc\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c \ud654\uac00 \ub09c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ben boos op mijn vrienden/volgers omdat ze mij niet steunen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jestem z\u0142y na moich przyjaci\u00f3\u0142/obserwator\u00f3w za to, \u017ce mnie nie wspieraj\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou bravo com meus amigos/seguidores por n\u00e3o me apoiarem."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0437\u043b\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0439/\u043f\u043e\u0434\u043f\u0438\u0441\u0447\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0432, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043e\u043d\u0438 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beni desteklemedikleri i\u00e7in arkada\u015flar\u0131ma/takip\u00e7ilerime k\u0131zg\u0131n\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5bf9\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb/\u7c89\u4e1d\u611f\u5230\u751f\u6c14\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u4ed6\u4eec\u4e0d\u652f\u6301\u6211\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c0d\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb/\u8ffd\u96a8\u8005\u4e0d\u652f\u6301\u6211\u611f\u5230\u751f\u6c23\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q5": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jemand in deiner Firma, der extrem faul ist, bekommt durch reines Gl\u00fcck oder Networking die Bef\u00f6rderung, f\u00fcr die du monatelang geblutet hast. Deine Reaktion?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone at your company who is extremely lazy gets the promotion you've been bleeding for for months through sheer luck or networking. Your reaction?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alguien en su empresa que es extremadamente vago consigue el ascenso que ha estado sangrando durante meses por pura suerte o por networking. \u00bfTu reacci\u00f3n?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu'un dans votre entreprise qui est extr\u00eamement paresseux obtient la promotion depuis des mois gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la chance ou au r\u00e9seautage. Votre r\u00e9action ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u0902\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u091c\u094b \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0906\u0932\u0938\u0940 \u0939\u0948, \u0909\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u092d\u093e\u0917\u094d\u092f \u092f\u093e \u0928\u0947\u091f\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0915\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0915\u0947 \u092e\u093e\u0927\u094d\u092f\u092e \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u0939 \u092a\u0926\u094b\u0928\u094d\u0928\u0924\u093f \u092e\u093f\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0906\u092a \u0915\u0908 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0925\u0947\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualcuno nella tua azienda che \u00e8 estremamente pigro ottiene la promozione per la quale stai sanguinando da mesi per pura fortuna o networking. La tua reazione?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u4f1a\u793e\u306e\u6975\u5ea6\u306e\u6020\u3051\u8005\u304c\u3001\u307e\u3063\u305f\u304f\u306e\u904b\u3084\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u306e\u304a\u304b\u3052\u3067\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u4f55\u304b\u6708\u3082\u8840\u3092\u6d41\u3057\u3066\u6607\u9032\u3092\u679c\u305f\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u53cd\u5fdc\u306f\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud68c\uc0ac\uc5d0\uc11c \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \uac8c\uc73c\ub978 \ub204\uad70\uac00\uac00 \uc21c\uc804\ud55c \ud589\uc6b4\uc774\ub098 \ub124\ud2b8\uc6cc\ud0b9\uc744 \ud1b5\ud574 \uba87 \ub2ec \ub3d9\uc548 \ud53c \ud758\ub9ac\uba70 \uc2b9\uc9c4\ud574 \uc628 \uc2b9\uc9c4\uc744 \uc5bb\uac8c \ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubc18\uc751\uc740?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iemand binnen uw bedrijf die extreem lui is, krijgt de promotie waar u al maanden naar verlangt door puur geluk of netwerken. Jouw reactie?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osoba w Twojej firmie, kt\u00f3ra jest wyj\u0105tkowo leniwa, dzi\u0119ki szcz\u0119\u015bciu lub networkingowi otrzymuje awans, na kt\u00f3ry czeka\u0142e\u015b od miesi\u0119cy. Twoja reakcja?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algu\u00e9m em sua empresa que \u00e9 extremamente pregui\u00e7oso consegue a promo\u00e7\u00e3o pela qual voc\u00ea est\u00e1 sangrando h\u00e1 meses por pura sorte ou networking. Sua rea\u00e7\u00e3o?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0438, \u043a\u0442\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0432, \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e \u0441\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u0441\u0432\u044f\u0437\u0438, \u0437\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0435 \u0442\u044b \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043b \u043a\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044c. \u0422\u0432\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015eirketinizde son derece tembel olan biri, aylard\u0131r bekledi\u011finiz terfiyi s\u0131rf \u015fans ya da a\u011f kurma sayesinde elde ediyor. Tepkiniz?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u516c\u53f8\u91cc\u4e00\u4e2a\u975e\u5e38\u61d2\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u4ec5\u51ed\u8fd0\u6c14\u6216\u4eba\u8109\u5c31\u83b7\u5f97\u4e86\u4f60\u8f9b\u8f9b\u82e6\u82e6\u51e0\u4e2a\u6708\u624d\u4e89\u53d6\u5230\u7684\u664b\u5347\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u5e94\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u516c\u53f8\u88e1\u4e00\u500b\u6975\u5ea6\u61f6\u60f0\u7684\u4eba\u7d14\u7cb9\u662f\u9760\u904b\u6c23\u6216\u4eba\u969b\u7db2\u7d61\u7372\u5f97\u4e86\u4f60\u5e7e\u500b\u6708\u4f86\u4e00\u76f4\u5728\u52aa\u529b\u722d\u53d6\u7684\u6649\u5347\u3002\u4f60\u7684\u53cd\u61c9\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q5.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich rege mich tagelang bei Freunden dar\u00fcber auf, wie unfair das System ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I spend days complaining to friends about how unfair the system is."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paso d\u00edas quej\u00e1ndome con mis amigos de lo injusto que es el sistema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je passe des journ\u00e9es \u00e0 me plaindre aupr\u00e8s de mes amis du caract\u00e8re injuste du syst\u00e8me."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u093f\u0915\u093e\u092f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u093f\u0924\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u0938\u093f\u0938\u094d\u091f\u092e \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0905\u0928\u0941\u091a\u093f\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trascorro giorni a lamentarmi con gli amici di quanto sia ingiusto il sistema."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3053\u306e\u5236\u5ea6\u304c\u3044\u304b\u306b\u4e0d\u516c\u5e73\u3067\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3092\u53cb\u4eba\u306b\u611a\u75f4\u308a\u306a\u304c\u3089\u65e5\u3005\u3092\u904e\u3054\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc2dc\uc2a4\ud15c\uc774 \uc5bc\ub9c8\ub098 \ubd88\uacf5\ud3c9\ud55c\uc9c0 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c \ubd88\ud3c9\ud558\uba74\uc11c \uba70\uce60\uc744 \ubcf4\ub0b8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik breng dagen door met klagen bij vrienden over hoe oneerlijk het systeem is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dniami narzekam przyjacio\u0142om, jak niesprawiedliwy jest ten system."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passo dias reclamando com amigos sobre o qu\u00e3o injusto \u00e9 o sistema."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0434\u043d\u0435\u0439 \u0443 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u0435\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043f\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0443 \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u0430 \u0441\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0435\u043c\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G\u00fcnlerimi arkada\u015flar\u0131ma sistemin ne kadar adaletsiz oldu\u011fu konusunda \u015fikayet ederek ge\u00e7iriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u5728\u670b\u53cb\u9762\u524d\u4e3a\u7cfb\u7edf\u6709\u591a\u4e0d\u516c\u5e73\u800c\u6c14\u6124\u597d\u51e0\u5929\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u82b1\u4e86\u5e7e\u5929\u6642\u9593\u5411\u670b\u53cb\u62b1\u6028\u9019\u500b\u5236\u5ea6\u6709\u591a\u4e0d\u516c\u5e73\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q5.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich versuche, ihn heimlich schlecht zu machen oder seine Fehler aufzudecken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I try to secretly badmouth him or expose his mistakes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intento hablar mal de \u00e9l en secreto o exponer sus errores."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'essaie de le d\u00e9nigrer secr\u00e8tement ou d'exposer ses erreurs."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0917\u0941\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u092c\u0941\u0930\u093e\u0908 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u092f\u093e \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u0917\u0932\u0924\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0901 \u0909\u091c\u093e\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerco segretamente di parlargli male o di esporre i suoi errori."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u5bc6\u304b\u306b\u5f7c\u306e\u60aa\u53e3\u3092\u8a00\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3001\u5f7c\u306e\u9593\u9055\u3044\u3092\u66b4\u9732\u3057\u305f\u308a\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ubab0\ub798 \uadf8\ub97c \uc695\ud558\uac70\ub098 \uadf8\uc758 \uc2e4\uc218\ub97c \ud3ed\ub85c\ud558\ub824\uace0 \ub178\ub825\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik probeer hem in het geheim kwaad te spreken of zijn fouten bloot te leggen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pr\u00f3buj\u0119 potajemnie go obrazi\u0107 lub ujawni\u0107 jego b\u0142\u0119dy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tento falar mal dele secretamente ou expor seus erros."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0442\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e \u043e\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u044b\u044f\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gizlice ona k\u00f6t\u00fc s\u00f6z s\u00f6ylemeye ya da hatalar\u0131n\u0131 if\u015fa etmeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8bd5\u56fe\u6697\u4e2d\u8d2c\u4f4e\u4ed6\u6216\u63ed\u9732\u4ed6\u7684\u9519\u8bef\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8a66\u8457\u6697\u4e2d\u8aaa\u4ed6\u7684\u58de\u8a71\u6216\u63ed\u9732\u4ed6\u7684\u932f\u8aa4\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q5.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interessant. Er hat das Spiel verstanden. Ich muss an meinem Networking arbeiten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interesting. He understood the game. I need to work on my networking."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interesante. Entendi\u00f3 el juego. Necesito trabajar en mi networking."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Int\u00e9ressant. Il a compris le jeu. Je dois travailler sur mon r\u00e9seau."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0926\u093f\u0932\u091a\u0938\u094d\u092a\u0964 \u0935\u0939 \u0916\u0947\u0932 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u092e\u091d \u0917\u092f\u093e. \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0928\u0947\u091f\u0935\u0930\u094d\u0915\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u091c\u0930\u0942\u0930\u0924 \u0939\u0948."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interessante. Ha capito il gioco. Devo lavorare sulla mia rete."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9762\u767d\u3044\u3002\u5f7c\u306f\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u7406\u89e3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u3080\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud765\ubbf8\ub85c\uc6b4. \uadf8\ub294 \uac8c\uc784\uc744 \uc774\ud574\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub124\ud2b8\uc6cc\ud0b9 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interessant. Hij begreep het spel. Ik moet aan mijn netwerk werken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ciekawy. Rozumia\u0142 t\u0119 gr\u0119. Musz\u0119 popracowa\u0107 nad sieci\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interessante. Ele entendeu o jogo. Preciso trabalhar na minha rede."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0418\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043d\u043e. \u041e\u043d \u043f\u043e\u043d\u044f\u043b \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0443. \u041c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0443\u0436\u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u043c\u043e\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0441\u0432\u044f\u0437\u044f\u043c\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0130lgin\u00e7. Oyunu anlad\u0131. A\u011f\u0131m \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmam gerekiyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u8da3\u3002\u4ed6\u7406\u89e3\u4e86\u6e38\u620f\u3002\u6211\u5fc5\u987b\u52aa\u529b\u63d0\u5347\u6211\u7684\u4eba\u8109\u7f51\u7edc\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u8da3\u7684\u3002\u4ed6\u4e86\u89e3\u6bd4\u8cfd\u3002\u6211\u9700\u8981\u52a0\u5f37\u6211\u7684\u7db2\u8def\u5de5\u4f5c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q5.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich werfe hin und strenge mich in Zukunft auch nicht mehr an. Lohnt sich ja nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm giving up and not making any more effort in the future. It's not worth it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me rindo y no hago m\u00e1s esfuerzos en el futuro. No vale la pena."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'abandonne et je ne fais plus d'efforts \u00e0 l'avenir. Cela n'en vaut pas la peine."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0939\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092d\u0935\u093f\u0937\u094d\u092f \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093e\u092f\u0915 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi arrendo e non far\u00f2 pi\u00f9 alcuno sforzo in futuro. Non ne vale la pena."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3082\u3046\u8ae6\u3081\u3066\u4eca\u5f8c\u306f\u52aa\u529b\u3057\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u305d\u308c\u306f\u4fa1\u5024\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud3ec\uae30\ud558\uace0 \uc55e\uc73c\ub85c\ub294 \ub354 \uc774\uc0c1 \ub178\ub825\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc744 \uc0dd\uac01\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub7f4 \uac00\uce58\uac00 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik geef het op en doe in de toekomst geen moeite meer. Het is het niet waard."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poddaj\u0119 si\u0119 i nie b\u0119d\u0119 ju\u017c wi\u0119cej pr\u00f3bowa\u0107 w przysz\u0142o\u015bci. To nie jest tego warte."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou desistindo e n\u00e3o fazendo mais nenhum esfor\u00e7o no futuro. N\u00e3o vale a pena."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0434\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0438 \u0432 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0449\u0435\u043c \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f. \u042d\u0442\u043e \u0436\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u0438\u0442 \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vazge\u00e7iyorum ve gelecekte daha fazla \u00e7aba sarf etmiyorum. Buna de\u011fmez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u653e\u5f03\u4e86\uff0c\u4ee5\u540e\u4e5f\u4e0d\u518d\u52aa\u529b\u4e86\u3002\u53cd\u6b63\u4e0d\u503c\u5f97\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5df2\u7d93\u653e\u68c4\u4e86\uff0c\u4ee5\u5f8c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u6703\u518d\u52aa\u529b\u4e86\u3002\u9019\u662f\u4e0d\u503c\u5f97\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q6": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast dir ein extrem ambitioniertes Ziel gesetzt. Deine engsten Freunde sagen dir ins Gesicht, dass du das niemals schaffen wirst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have set yourself an extremely ambitious goal. Your closest friends tell you to your face that you'll never make it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te has fijado un objetivo extremadamente ambicioso. Tus amigos m\u00e1s cercanos te dicen en la cara que nunca lo lograr\u00e1s."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous vous \u00eates fix\u00e9 un objectif extr\u00eamement ambitieux. Vos amis les plus proches vous disent en face que vous n\u2019y arriverez jamais."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0915\u093e\u0902\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0940 \u0932\u0915\u094d\u0937\u094d\u092f \u0928\u093f\u0930\u094d\u0927\u093e\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0930\u0940\u092c\u0940 \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u091a\u0947\u0939\u0930\u0947 \u092a\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0939\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u0906\u092a \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0938\u092b\u0932 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0917\u0947\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ti sei posto un obiettivo estremamente ambizioso. I tuoi amici pi\u00f9 cari ti dicono in faccia che non ce la farai mai."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u91ce\u5fc3\u7684\u306a\u76ee\u6a19\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u81ea\u8eab\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u89aa\u3057\u3044\u53cb\u4eba\u305f\u3061\u306f\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u306f\u6c7a\u3057\u3066\u6210\u529f\u3057\u306a\u3044\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3068\u9762\u3068\u5411\u304b\u3063\u3066\u8a00\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc57c\uc2ec \ucc2c \ubaa9\ud45c\ub97c \uc138\uc6e0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uac00\uc7a5 \uac00\uae4c\uc6b4 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc740 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc774 \uacb0\ucf54 \uc131\uacf5\ud558\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud560 \uac83\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \ub300\uba74\ud558\uc5ec \ub9d0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt jezelf een uiterst ambitieus doel gesteld. Je beste vrienden vertellen je in je gezicht dat je het nooit zult redden."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Postawi\u0142e\u015b sobie niezwykle ambitny cel. Najbli\u017csi przyjaciele m\u00f3wi\u0105 ci prosto w twarz, \u017ce nigdy ci si\u0119 nie uda."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea estabeleceu uma meta extremamente ambiciosa. Seus amigos mais pr\u00f3ximos dizem na sua cara que voc\u00ea nunca conseguir\u00e1."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0439 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0430\u043c\u0431\u0438\u0446\u0438\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0446\u0435\u043b\u044c. \u0422\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0431\u043b\u0438\u0437\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f \u043f\u0440\u044f\u043c\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044f\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435 \u0432 \u043b\u0438\u0446\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0431\u044c\u0451\u0448\u044c\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendinize son derece iddial\u0131 bir hedef belirlediniz. En yak\u0131n arkada\u015flar\u0131n\u0131z y\u00fcz\u00fcn\u00fcze asla ba\u015faramayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 s\u00f6yler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7ed9\u81ea\u5df1\u5b9a\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u6781\u5177\u96c4\u5fc3\u7684\u76ee\u6807\u3002\u4f60\u6700\u4eb2\u5bc6\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u5f53\u9762\u544a\u8bc9\u4f60\uff0c\u4f60\u6c38\u8fdc\u90fd\u505a\u4e0d\u5230\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u70ba\u81ea\u5df1\u8a2d\u5b9a\u4e86\u4e00\u500b\u6975\u70ba\u96c4\u5fc3\u52c3\u52c3\u7684\u76ee\u6a19\u3002\u4f60\u6700\u89aa\u5bc6\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u7576\u9762\u544a\u8a34\u4f60\uff0c\u4f60\u6c38\u9060\u4e0d\u6703\u6210\u529f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q6.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lasse es sein. Wenn meine Freunde nicht daran glauben, wird es wohl stimmen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll let it be. If my friends don't believe it, it will probably be true."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo dejar\u00e9 ser. Si mis amigos no lo creen, probablemente ser\u00e1 verdad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais le laisser faire. Si mes amis ne le croient pas, ce sera probablement vrai."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0930\u0939\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e. \u0905\u0917\u0930 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0926\u094b\u0938\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0907\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0938 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948 \u0924\u094b \u0936\u093e\u092f\u0926 \u092f\u0947 \u0938\u091a \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lascer\u00f2 che sia. Se i miei amici non ci credono, probabilmente sar\u00e0 vero."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u306b\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u306e\u53cb\u9054\u304c\u4fe1\u3058\u306a\u3044\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u304a\u305d\u3089\u304f\u771f\u5b9f\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8\ub807\uac8c \ud558\ub3c4\ub85d \ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub0b4 \uce5c\uad6c\ub4e4\uc774 \ubbff\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294\ub2e4\uba74 \uc544\ub9c8\ub3c4 \uc0ac\uc2e4\uc77c \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik laat het zo zijn. Als mijn vrienden het niet geloven, zal het waarschijnlijk waar zijn."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pozwol\u0119 temu tak by\u0107. Je\u015bli moi przyjaciele w to nie uwierz\u0105, prawdopodobnie b\u0119dzie to prawda."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu vou deixar assim. Se meus amigos n\u00e3o acreditarem, provavelmente ser\u00e1 verdade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e. \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0437\u044c\u044f \u0432 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u044f\u0442, \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0442, \u044d\u0442\u043e, \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043e\u044f\u0442\u043d\u043e, \u0442\u0430\u043a."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Olmas\u0131na izin verece\u011fim. Arkada\u015flar\u0131m buna inanmazsa muhtemelen do\u011fru olacakt\u0131r."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u653e\u5f03\u5427\u3002\u5982\u679c\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u4eec\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\uff0c\u90a3\u5927\u6982\u662f\u771f\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c31\u9019\u6a23\u5427\u3002\u5982\u679c\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\uff0c\u90a3\u5f88\u53ef\u80fd\u662f\u771f\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q6.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Gegenwind ist mein bester Treibstoff. Ich beweise ihnen jetzt erst recht das Gegenteil."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your headwind is my best fuel. I'm proving them wrong now."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu viento en contra es mi mejor combustible. Les estoy demostrando que est\u00e1n equivocados ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre vent contraire est mon meilleur carburant. Je leur prouve le contraire maintenant."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0947\u0930\u093e \u0917\u0947\u0917\u0947\u0928\u0935\u093f\u0902\u0921 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u092c\u0938\u094d\u091f\u0949\u092b\u093c \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0924\u0930 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092c \u0909\u0928\u094d\u0939\u0947\u0902 \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0938\u093e\u092c\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo vento contrario \u00e8 il mio miglior carburante. Sto dimostrando che si sbagliavano adesso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u9006\u98a8\u306f\u79c1\u306e\u6700\u9ad8\u306e\u71c3\u6599\u3067\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u306f\u4eca\u3001\u5f7c\u3089\u304c\u9593\u9055\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8a3c\u660e\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc5ed\ud48d\uc740 \ub098\uc758 \ucd5c\uace0\uc758 \uc5f0\ub8cc\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \uc9c0\uae08 \uadf8\ub4e4\uc774 \ud2c0\ub838\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc99d\uba85\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jouw tegenwind is mijn beste brandstof. Ik bewijs nu dat ze ongelijk hebben."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j przeciwny wiatr jest moim najlepszym paliwem. Teraz udowadniam, \u017ce si\u0119 myl\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu vento contr\u00e1rio \u00e9 meu melhor combust\u00edvel. Estou provando que eles est\u00e3o errados agora."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u0430\u0448 \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u0435\u0442\u0435\u0440 \u2014 \u043c\u043e\u0439 \u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0442\u043e\u043f\u043b\u0438\u0432\u043e. \u042f \u0434\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0436\u0443 \u0438\u043c \u0442\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440\u044c \u0443\u0436 \u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u043e\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kar\u015f\u0131dan esen r\u00fczgar benim en iyi yak\u0131t\u0131md\u0131r. \u015eimdi onlara haks\u0131z olduklar\u0131n\u0131 kan\u0131tl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u4eec\u7684\u963b\u529b\u662f\u6211\u6700\u597d\u7684\u71c3\u6599\u3002\u6211\u73b0\u5728\u66f4\u8981\u5411\u4f60\u4eec\u8bc1\u660e\u6070\u6070\u76f8\u53cd\u7684\u4e8b\u5b9e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u9006\u98a8\u662f\u6211\u6700\u597d\u7684\u71c3\u6599\u3002\u6211\u73fe\u5728\u6b63\u5728\u8b49\u660e\u4ed6\u5011\u932f\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q6.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich bin zutiefst verletzt und diskutiere stundenlang mit ihnen, um sie zu \u00fcberzeugen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I am deeply hurt and argue with them for hours trying to convince them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy profundamente herido y discuto con ellos durante horas tratando de convencerlos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suis profond\u00e9ment bless\u00e9 et je discute avec eux pendant des heures pour essayer de les convaincre."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0906\u0939\u0924 \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0928\u094d\u0939\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u092e\u091d\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u0909\u0928\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0939\u0938 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono profondamente ferito e discuto con loro per ore cercando di convincerli."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u6df1\u304f\u50b7\u3064\u304d\u3001\u5f7c\u3089\u3092\u8aac\u5f97\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4f55\u6642\u9593\u3082\u5f7c\u3089\u3068\u8b70\u8ad6\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uae4a\uc740 \uc0c1\ucc98\ub97c \ubc1b\uc558\uc73c\uba70 \uadf8\ub4e4\uc744 \uc124\ub4dd\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uba87 \uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \uadf8\ub4e4\uacfc \ub17c\uc7c1\uc744 \ubc8c\uc600\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ben diep gekwetst en maak urenlang ruzie met ze om ze te overtuigen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Czuj\u0119 si\u0119 g\u0142\u0119boko zraniony i godzinami k\u0142\u00f3c\u0119 si\u0119 z nimi, pr\u00f3buj\u0105c ich przekona\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou profundamente magoado e discuto com eles durante horas tentando convenc\u00ea-los."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0433\u043b\u0443\u0431\u043e\u043a\u043e \u0440\u0430\u043d\u0435\u043d \u0438 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u044e \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0443\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0438\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c7ok k\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131m ve onlar\u0131 ikna etmeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015farak saatlerce onlarla tart\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u611f\u5230\u975e\u5e38\u53d7\u4f24\uff0c\u5e76\u4e0e\u4ed6\u4eec\u4e89\u8bba\u597d\u51e0\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u4ee5\u8bf4\u670d\u4ed6\u4eec\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6df1\u53d7\u50b7\u5bb3\uff0c\u4e26\u8207\u4ed6\u5011\u722d\u8ad6\u4e86\u5e7e\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\u8a66\u5716\u8aaa\u670d\u4ed6\u5011\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q6.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verfolge es weiter, verheimliche es aber vor ihnen, um Konflikten aus dem Weg zu gehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I continue to pursue it, but keep it secret from them to avoid conflict."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sigo persigui\u00e9ndolo, pero lo mantengo en secreto para evitar conflictos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je continue de le poursuivre, mais je le garde secret pour \u00e9viter les conflits."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u091f\u0915\u0930\u093e\u0935 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u091a\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0928\u0938\u0947 \u0917\u0941\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuo a perseguirlo, ma lo tengo segreto per evitare conflitti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u305d\u308c\u3092\u8ffd\u6c42\u3057\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u885d\u7a81\u3092\u907f\u3051\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306b\u5f7c\u3089\u306b\u306f\u79d8\u5bc6\u306b\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uacc4\uc18d\ud574\uc11c \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ucd94\uad6c\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uac08\ub4f1\uc744 \ud53c\ud558\uae30 \uc704\ud574 \uadf8\ub4e4\uc5d0\uac8c \ube44\ubc00\uc744 \uc720\uc9c0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik blijf het nastreven, maar houd het voor hen geheim om conflicten te voorkomen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nadal to robi\u0119, ale trzymam to w tajemnicy przed nimi, aby unikn\u0105\u0107 konfliktu."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuo perseguindo isso, mas mantenho segredo deles para evitar conflitos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0442\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c, \u043d\u043e \u0441\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0442 \u043d\u0438\u0445, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0438\u0437\u0431\u0435\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0444\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0432."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu takip etmeye devam ediyorum ama \u00e7at\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 \u00f6nlemek i\u00e7in bunu onlardan gizli tutuyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7ee7\u7eed\u8ffd\u8e2a\u5b83\uff0c\u4f46\u5bf9\u4ed6\u4eec\u9690\u7792\uff0c\u4ee5\u907f\u514d\u51b2\u7a81\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7e7c\u7e8c\u8ffd\u6c42\u5b83\uff0c\u4f46\u5c0d\u4ed6\u5011\u4fdd\u5bc6\u4ee5\u907f\u514d\u885d\u7a81\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q7": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jemand, den du absolut nicht leiden kannst, hat eine brillante Idee und setzt sie extrem erfolgreich um. Was denkst du?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone you absolutely dislike has a brilliant idea and implements it extremely successfully. What do you think?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alguien que no te agrada tiene una idea brillante y la implementa con gran \u00e9xito. \u00bfQu\u00e9 opinas?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu\u2019un que vous n\u2019aimez absolument pas a une id\u00e9e brillante et la met en \u0153uvre avec beaucoup de succ\u00e8s. Qu'en penses-tu?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u091c\u093f\u0938 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u0915\u094b \u0906\u092a \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0928\u093e\u092a\u0938\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0938 \u090f\u0915 \u0936\u093e\u0928\u0926\u093e\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0935\u0939 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0938\u092b\u0932\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0915 \u0932\u093e\u0917\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0938\u094b\u091a\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualcuno che non ti piace assolutamente ha un'idea brillante e la implementa con grande successo. Cosa ne pensi?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u7d76\u5bfe\u306b\u5acc\u3044\u306a\u4eba\u306f\u3001\u7d20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u3092\u6301\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\u305d\u308c\u3092\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u3046\u307e\u304f\u5b9f\u884c\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3069\u3046\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc774 \uc815\ub9d0 \uc2eb\uc5b4\ud558\ub294 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc774 \ud6cc\ub96d\ud55c \uc544\uc774\ub514\uc5b4\ub97c \uac00\uc9c0\uace0 \uc788\uace0 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc131\uacf5\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uad6c\ud604\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \uc0dd\uac01\ud558\ub098\uc694?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iemand aan wie je absoluut een hekel hebt, heeft een briljant idee en voert dit uiterst succesvol uit. Wat denk je?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kto\u015b, kogo absolutnie nie lubisz, ma genialny pomys\u0142 i wdra\u017ca go niezwykle skutecznie. Jak my\u015blisz?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algu\u00e9m de quem voc\u00ea absolutamente n\u00e3o gosta tem uma ideia brilhante e a implementa com muito sucesso. O que voc\u00ea acha?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e, \u043a\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u044b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0438\u0448\u044c, \u0438\u043c\u0435\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u043b\u0435\u0441\u0442\u044f\u0449\u0443\u044e \u0438\u0434\u0435\u044e \u0438 \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0437\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u0435\u0451 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0443\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0448\u043d\u043e. \u0427\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044b \u0434\u0443\u043c\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kesinlikle sevmedi\u011finiz birinin harika bir fikri var ve bunu son derece ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 bir \u015fekilde uyguluyor. Ne d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcyorsun?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7edd\u5bf9\u8ba8\u538c\u7684\u67d0\u4e2a\u4eba\u6709\u4e86\u4e00\u4e2a\u7edd\u5999\u7684\u4e3b\u610f\uff0c\u5e76\u4e14\u6781\u5176\u6210\u529f\u5730\u5b9e\u65bd\u4e86\u5b83\u3002\u4f60\u4f1a\u600e\u4e48\u60f3\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7d55\u5c0d\u4e0d\u559c\u6b61\u7684\u4eba\u6709\u4e00\u500b\u7d55\u5999\u7684\u60f3\u6cd5\uff0c\u4e26\u4e14\u975e\u5e38\u6210\u529f\u5730\u5be6\u65bd\u4e86\u5b83\u3002\u4f60\u600e\u9ebc\u8a8d\u70ba\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q7.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der hatte nur verdammtes Gl\u00fcck, oder er hat irgendwo betrogen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "He was just damn lucky, or he cheated somewhere."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Simplemente tuvo mucha suerte o hizo trampa en alguna parte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il a juste eu beaucoup de chance, ou alors il a trich\u00e9 quelque part."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0935\u0939 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u092d\u093e\u0917\u094d\u092f\u0936\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0925\u093e, \u092f\u093e \u0909\u0938\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0927\u094b\u0916\u093e \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c8 stato semplicemente dannatamente fortunato, oppure ha barato da qualche parte."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f7c\u306f\u305f\u3060\u904b\u304c\u826f\u304b\u3063\u305f\u304b\u3001\u3069\u3053\u304b\u3067\u4e0d\u6b63\u3092\u3057\u305f\u3060\u3051\u3060\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc740 \uc815\ub9d0 \uc6b4\uc774 \uc88b\uc558\uac70\ub098 \uc5b4\ub518\uac00\uc5d0\uc11c \ubc14\ub78c\uc744 \ud53c\uc6e0\uc744 \ubfd0\uc774\uc5d0\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hij had gewoon verdomd geluk, of hij heeft ergens vals gespeeld."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mia\u0142 po prostu cholerne szcz\u0119\u015bcie, albo gdzie\u015b oszuka\u0142."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ele teve muita sorte ou trapaceou em algum lugar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0415\u043c\u0443 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0442\u043e\u0432\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0437\u043b\u043e, \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u043d \u0433\u0434\u0435-\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0431\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0443\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c7ok \u015fansl\u0131yd\u0131 ya da bir yerlerde hile yapm\u0131\u015ft\u0131."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ed6\u53ea\u662f\u4ed6\u5988\u7684\u8fd0\u6c14\u597d\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u4ed6\u5728\u67d0\u5904\u4f5c\u5f0a\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ed6\u53ea\u662f\u592a\u5e78\u904b\u4e86\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u4ed6\u5728\u67d0\u500b\u5730\u65b9\u4f5c\u5f0a\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q7.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich hasse es, das zu sehen. Es macht mich den ganzen Tag aggressiv."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I hate to see this. It makes me aggressive all day long."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odio ver esto. Me pone agresivo todo el d\u00eda."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je d\u00e9teste voir \u00e7a. Cela me rend agressif toute la journ\u00e9e."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092f\u0939 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u092b\u0930\u0924 \u0939\u0948. \u092f\u0939 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odio vedere questo. Mi rende aggressivo tutto il giorno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3053\u308c\u3092\u898b\u308b\u306e\u306f\u5acc\u3060\u3002\u305d\u308c\u306f\u79c1\u3092\u4e00\u65e5\u4e2d\u653b\u6483\u7684\u306b\u3055\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc774\uac83\uc744 \ubcf4\ub294 \uac83\uc774 \uc2eb\ub2e4. \uadf8\uac83\uc740 \ub098\ub97c \ud558\ub8e8 \uc885\uc77c \uacf5\uaca9\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub9cc\ub4ed\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik haat het om dit te zien. Het maakt me de hele dag agressief."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nienawidz\u0119 tego widzie\u0107. To sprawia, \u017ce \u200b\u200bjestem agresywny przez ca\u0142y dzie\u0144."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu odeio ver isso. Isso me deixa agressivo o dia todo."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0435\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0436\u0443 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044c. \u042d\u0442\u043e \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0430\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0432\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu g\u00f6rmekten nefret ediyorum. Bu beni g\u00fcn boyu agresif yap\u0131yor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8ba8\u538c\u770b\u5230\u8fd9\u4e2a\u3002\u8fd9\u8ba9\u6211\u6574\u5929\u611f\u5230\u6124\u6012\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8a0e\u53ad\u770b\u5230\u9019\u500b\u3002\u9019\u8b93\u6211\u4e00\u6574\u5929\u90fd\u5145\u6eff\u653b\u64ca\u6027\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q7.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Idee war genial, die Ausf\u00fchrung stark. Ich schaue mir ab, wie er das gemacht hat."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The idea was brilliant, the execution strong. I'll see how he did it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La idea fue brillante, la ejecuci\u00f3n s\u00f3lida. Ver\u00e9 c\u00f3mo lo hizo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'id\u00e9e \u00e9tait g\u00e9niale, l'ex\u00e9cution solide. Je vais voir comment il a fait."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0935\u093f\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0936\u093e\u0928\u0926\u093e\u0930 \u0925\u093e, \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0928\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0928 \u0938\u0936\u0915\u094d\u0924\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e \u0915\u093f \u0909\u0938\u0928\u0947 \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'idea era brillante, l'esecuzione forte. Vedr\u00f2 come ha fatto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u306f\u7d20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u304f\u3001\u5b9f\u884c\u529b\u306f\u5f37\u529b\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002\u5f7c\u304c\u3069\u3046\u3084\u3063\u3066\u3084\u3063\u305f\u304b\u898b\u3066\u307f\u308b\u3088\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\uc774\ub514\uc5b4\ub294 \ud6cc\ub96d\ud588\uace0 \uc2e4\ud589\ub825\uc740 \uac15\ub825\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\uac00 \uc5b4\ub5bb\uac8c \ud588\ub294\uc9c0 \ubcfc\uac8c\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Het idee was briljant, de uitvoering sterk. Ik zal zien hoe hij het deed."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pomys\u0142 by\u0142 genialny, wykonanie mocne. Zobacz\u0119 jak to zrobi\u0142."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A ideia foi brilhante, a execu\u00e7\u00e3o forte. Vou ver como ele fez isso."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0418\u0434\u0435\u044f \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430 \u0433\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0439, \u0432\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0441\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u043c. \u042f \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043e\u043d \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fikir harikayd\u0131, uygulama g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fcyd\u00fc. Bakal\u0131m nas\u0131l yapt\u0131."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u4e2a\u60f3\u6cd5\u5f88\u68d2\uff0c\u6267\u884c\u5f97\u5f88\u51fa\u8272\u3002\u6211\u5728\u89c2\u5bdf\u4ed6\u662f\u600e\u4e48\u505a\u5230\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9019\u500b\u60f3\u6cd5\u5f88\u68d2\uff0c\u57f7\u884c\u529b\u5f88\u5f37\u3002\u6211\u4f86\u770b\u770b\u4ed6\u662f\u600e\u9ebc\u505a\u5230\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q7.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bestimmt geht das bald schief, ich warte nur auf seinen Absturz."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm sure it will go wrong soon, I'm just waiting for it to crash."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy seguro de que todo saldr\u00e1 mal pronto, s\u00f3lo estoy esperando a que falle."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je suis s\u00fbr que \u00e7a va mal tourner bient\u00f4t, j'attends juste qu'il plante."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092f\u0915\u0940\u0928 \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u091c\u0932\u094d\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e, \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0938 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0926\u0941\u0930\u094d\u0918\u091f\u0928\u093e\u0917\u094d\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0907\u0902\u0924\u091c\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono sicuro che presto andr\u00e0 storto, sto solo aspettando che vada in crash."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u304d\u3063\u3068\u3059\u3050\u306b\u30c0\u30e1\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3060\u308d\u3046\u3001\u30af\u30e9\u30c3\u30b7\u30e5\u3059\u308b\u306e\u3092\u5f85\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3060\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uace7 \ubb38\uc81c\uac00 \ubc1c\uc0dd\ud560 \uac83\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \ud655\uc2e0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ucda9\ub3cc\uc774 \ubc1c\uc0dd\ud558\uae30\ub97c \uae30\ub2e4\ub9ac\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik weet zeker dat het snel mis zal gaan, ik wacht gewoon tot het crasht."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jestem pewien, \u017ce wkr\u00f3tce co\u015b p\u00f3jdzie nie tak, czekam tylko, a\u017c si\u0119 rozbije."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tenho certeza que vai dar errado em breve, s\u00f3 estou esperando que ele trave."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0430\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u044f\u043a\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0441\u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0439\u0434\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043a\u043e\u0441\u044f\u043a, \u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0436\u0434\u0443 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0443\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yak\u0131nda ters gidece\u011finden eminim, sadece \u00e7\u00f6kmesini bekliyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8fd9\u80af\u5b9a\u5f88\u5feb\u4f1a\u51fa\u95ee\u9898\uff0c\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u5728\u7b49\u4ed6\u5931\u8d25\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u78ba\u4fe1\u5b83\u5f88\u5feb\u5c31\u6703\u51fa\u932f\uff0c\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u5728\u7b49\u5f85\u5b83\u5d29\u6f70\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q8": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du wirst vor einer gro\u00dfen Gruppe von Menschen f\u00fcr einen dummen Fehler scharf und blo\u00dfstellend kritisiert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are harshly and embarrassingly criticized in front of a large group of people for a stupid mistake."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te critican dura y vergonzosamente delante de un gran grupo de personas por un error est\u00fapido."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous \u00eates critiqu\u00e9 durement et de mani\u00e8re embarrassante devant un grand groupe de personnes pour une erreur stupide."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u090f\u0915 \u092e\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0916\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0917\u0932\u0924\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0932\u094b\u0917\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092c\u0921\u093c\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u092e\u0928\u0947 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0915\u0920\u094b\u0930 \u0914\u0930 \u0936\u0930\u094d\u092e\u0928\u093e\u0915 \u0906\u0932\u094b\u091a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vieni criticato duramente e in modo imbarazzante di fronte a un folto gruppo di persone per uno stupido errore."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u3001\u611a\u304b\u306a\u9593\u9055\u3044\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u3001\u5927\u52e2\u306e\u4eba\u3005\u306e\u524d\u3067\u53b3\u3057\u304f\u3001\u6065\u305a\u304b\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306b\u6279\u5224\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc5b4\ub9ac\uc11d\uc740 \uc2e4\uc218\ub85c \uc778\ud574 \ub9ce\uc740 \uc0ac\ub78c\ub4e4 \uc55e\uc5d0\uc11c \uac00\ud639\ud558\uace0 \ucc3d\ud53c\ud55c \ube44\ub09c\uc744 \ubc1b\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je wordt ten overstaan \u200b\u200bvan een grote groep mensen hard en beschamend bekritiseerd vanwege een domme fout."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeste\u015b ostro i zawstydzaj\u0105co krytykowany przed du\u017c\u0105 grup\u0105 ludzi za g\u0142upi b\u0142\u0105d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea \u00e9 duramente e embara\u00e7osamente criticado na frente de um grande grupo de pessoas por um erro est\u00fapido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0440\u0435\u0437\u043a\u043e \u0438 \u0443\u043d\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0443\u044e\u0442 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u043e\u0439 \u0433\u0440\u0443\u043f\u043f\u043e\u0439 \u043b\u044e\u0434\u0435\u0439 \u0437\u0430 \u0433\u043b\u0443\u043f\u0443\u044e \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aptalca bir hata nedeniyle geni\u015f bir kitlenin \u00f6n\u00fcnde sert ve utan\u00e7 verici bir \u015fekilde ele\u015ftiriliyorsunuz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u4f1a\u5728\u4e00\u5927\u7fa4\u4eba\u9762\u524d\u56e0\u4e00\u4e2a\u611a\u8822\u7684\u9519\u8bef\u800c\u53d7\u5230\u4e25\u5389\u548c\u7f9e\u8fb1\u6027\u7684\u6279\u8bc4\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u56e0\u70ba\u4e00\u500b\u611a\u8822\u7684\u932f\u8aa4\u800c\u5728\u4e00\u5927\u7fa4\u4eba\u9762\u524d\u53d7\u5230\u56b4\u53b2\u800c\u5c37\u5c2c\u7684\u6279\u8a55\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q8.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich werde rot, beginne zu stottern und fange fast an zu weinen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I blush, start to stutter, and almost start to cry."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me sonrojo, empiezo a tartamudear y casi me pongo a llorar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je rougis, je commence \u00e0 b\u00e9gayer et je me mets presque \u00e0 pleurer."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0936\u0930\u092e\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0939\u0915\u0932\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0932\u0917\u092d\u0917 \u0930\u094b\u0928\u0947 \u0932\u0917\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrossisco, comincio a balbettare e quasi comincio a piangere."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u9854\u3092\u8d64\u3089\u3081\u3001\u3069\u3082\u308a\u59cb\u3081\u3001\u6ce3\u304d\u305d\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc5bc\uad74\uc774 \ubd89\uc5b4\uc9c0\uace0, \ub9d0\uc744 \ub354\ub4ec\uae30 \uc2dc\uc791\ud558\uace0, \uac70\uc758 \uc6b8\uae30 \uc2dc\uc791\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik bloos, begin te stotteren en begin bijna te huilen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rumieni\u0119 si\u0119, zaczynam si\u0119 j\u0105ka\u0107 i prawie zaczynam p\u0142aka\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu coro, come\u00e7o a gaguejar e quase come\u00e7o a chorar."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043d\u0435\u044e, \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e \u0437\u0430\u0438\u043a\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043a\u0430\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K\u0131zar\u0131yorum, kekelemeye ba\u015fl\u0131yorum ve neredeyse a\u011flamaya ba\u015fl\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8138\u7ea2\u4e86\uff0c\u5f00\u59cb\u7ed3\u5df4\uff0c\u5dee\u70b9\u8981\u54ed\u51fa\u6765\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u81c9\u7d05\u4e86\uff0c\u958b\u59cb\u7d50\u5df4\uff0c\u5e7e\u4e4e\u8981\u54ed\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q8.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schie\u00dfe sofort aggressiv zur\u00fcck und versuche, die Schuld auf jemand anderen abzuw\u00e4lzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I immediately fire back aggressively and try to shift the blame onto someone else."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inmediatamente respondo agresivamente y trato de echarle la culpa a otra persona."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je riposte imm\u00e9diatement de mani\u00e8re agressive et j'essaie de rejeter la faute sur quelqu'un d'autre."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0906\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e\u0915 \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0935\u093e\u092c\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u0930\u0935\u093e\u0908 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0926\u094b\u0937 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u092e\u0922\u093c\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rispondo immediatamente in modo aggressivo e cerco di scaricare la colpa su qualcun altro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u3059\u3050\u306b\u7a4d\u6975\u7684\u306b\u53cd\u6483\u3057\u3001\u8cac\u4efb\u3092\u4ed6\u306e\u4eba\u306b\u8ee2\u5ac1\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc989\uc2dc \uacf5\uaca9\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ubc18\uaca9\ud558\uace0 \ucc45\uc784\uc744 \ub2e4\ub978 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc5d0\uac8c \uc804\uac00\ud558\ub824\uace0 \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik vuur onmiddellijk agressief terug en probeer de schuld op iemand anders af te schuiven."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Natychmiast agresywnie odpowiadam i pr\u00f3buj\u0119 zrzuci\u0107 win\u0119 na kogo\u015b innego."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu imediatamente respondo agressivamente e tento transferir a culpa para outra pessoa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u0436\u0435 \u0430\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0432\u043d\u043e \u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044e \u0438 \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0438\u043d\u0443 \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0433\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u0433\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen agresif bir \u015fekilde kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131k veriyorum ve su\u00e7u ba\u015fka birine atmaya \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u4ee5\u653b\u51fb\u6027\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u53cd\u51fb\uff0c\u5e76\u8bd5\u56fe\u628a\u8d23\u4efb\u63a8\u7ed9\u522b\u4eba\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u6fc0\u70c8\u56de\u64ca\uff0c\u4e26\u8a66\u5716\u5c07\u8cac\u4efb\u63a8\u5230\u5225\u4eba\u8eab\u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q8.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich gebe den Fehler sachlich zu, ohne mich tausendmal zu entschuldigen, und korrigiere ihn sp\u00e4ter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I admit the mistake matter-of-factly without apologizing a thousand times and correct it later."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Admito el error con total naturalidad sin disculparme mil veces y lo corrijo m\u00e1s tarde."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'admets l'erreur d'un ton neutre, sans m'excuser mille fois et je la corrige plus tard."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0939\u091c\u093e\u0930\u094b\u0902 \u092c\u093e\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u092b\u0940 \u092e\u093e\u0902\u0917\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u0924\u0925\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0917\u0932\u0924\u0940 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u0940\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0941\u0927\u093e\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ammetto l'errore in modo pratico senza scusarmi mille volte e lo correggo in seguito."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u4f55\u5343\u56de\u3082\u8b1d\u3089\u305a\u306b\u6de1\u3005\u3068\u9593\u9055\u3044\u3092\u8a8d\u3081\u3001\u5f8c\u3067\u8a02\u6b63\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc800\ub294 \uc218\ucc9c \ubc88 \uc0ac\uacfc\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \uc0ac\uc2e4\ub300\ub85c \uc2e4\uc218\ub97c \uc778\uc815\ud558\uace0 \ub098\uc911\uc5d0 \ubc14\ub85c\uc7a1\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik geef de fout feitelijk toe, zonder me duizend keer te verontschuldigen, en corrigeer deze later."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przyznaj\u0119 si\u0119 do b\u0142\u0119du rzeczowo, bez przepraszania tysi\u0105c razy i poprawiam go p\u00f3\u017aniej."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Admito o erro com naturalidade, sem me desculpar mil vezes e corrijo mais tarde."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u044e \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0443 \u043f\u043e \u0441\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443, \u043d\u0435 \u0438\u0437\u0432\u0438\u043d\u044f\u044f\u0441\u044c \u0442\u044b\u0441\u044f\u0447\u0443 \u0440\u0430\u0437, \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u044e \u0435\u0451 \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0436\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Binlerce kez \u00f6z\u00fcr dilemeden hatam\u0131 kabul ediyorum ve daha sonra d\u00fczeltiyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5ba2\u89c2\u5730\u627f\u8ba4\u9519\u8bef\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u53cd\u590d\u9053\u6b49\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u518d\u7ea0\u6b63\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5be6\u4e8b\u6c42\u662f\u5730\u627f\u8a8d\u932f\u8aa4\uff0c\u6c92\u6709\u9053\u6b49\u4e00\u5343\u6b21\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u6539\u6b63\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q8.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich spiele es als Witz runter, sch\u00e4me mich aber innerlich wochenlang in Grund und Boden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I play it off as a joke, but I'm ashamed inside for weeks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo tomo como una broma, pero por dentro me siento avergonzado durante semanas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je joue \u00e7a comme une blague, mais j'ai honte int\u00e9rieurement pendant des semaines."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092e\u091c\u093e\u0915 \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0947\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u0908 \u0939\u092b\u094d\u0924\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u0905\u0902\u0926\u0930 \u0939\u0940 \u0905\u0902\u0926\u0930 \u0936\u0930\u094d\u092e\u093f\u0902\u0926\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo interpreto come uno scherzo, ma dentro di me mi vergogno da settimane."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5197\u8ac7\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4f55\u9031\u9593\u3082\u5fc3\u306e\u4e2d\u3067\u306f\u6065\u305a\u304b\u3057\u304f\u601d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac83\uc744 \ub18d\ub2f4\uc73c\ub85c \uc5f0\uae30\ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc18d\uc73c\ub85c\ub294 \uba87 \uc8fc \ub3d9\uc548 \ubd80\ub044\ub7ec\uc6cc\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik speel het af als een grap, maar ik schaam me wekenlang vanbinnen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traktuj\u0119 to jako \u017cart, ale w \u015brodku wstydz\u0119 si\u0119 tego od tygodni."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fa\u00e7o isso como uma piada, mas sinto vergonha por dentro h\u00e1 semanas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0448\u0443\u0442\u043a\u0443, \u043d\u043e \u0432\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0435 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u044b\u0442\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0442\u044b\u0434 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u044f\u043c\u0438 \u0434\u043e \u043e\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u015eaka yap\u0131yorum ama i\u00e7ten i\u00e7e haftalarca utan\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u628a\u5b83\u5f53\u4f5c\u73a9\u7b11\u6765\u5904\u7406\uff0c\u4f46\u5185\u5fc3\u5374\u4e3a\u6b64\u611f\u5230\u7f9e\u6127\u597d\u51e0\u5468\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u628a\u9019\u7576\u4f5c\u4e00\u500b\u73a9\u7b11\uff0c\u4f46\u5e7e\u9031\u4f86\u6211\u5167\u5fc3\u90fd\u611f\u5230\u7f9e\u6127\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q9": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jemand beschuldigt dich einer Sache, die du definitiv NICHT getan hast. Es gibt keine Beweise gegen dich, aber auch keine f\u00fcr dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Someone accuses you of something you definitely did NOT do. There is no evidence against you, but there is no evidence for you either."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alguien te acusa de algo que definitivamente NO hiciste. No hay pruebas en su contra, pero tampoco las hay a su favor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quelqu\u2019un vous accuse de quelque chose que vous n\u2019avez certainement PAS fait. Il n\u2019y a aucune preuve contre vous, mais il n\u2019y a aucune preuve pour vous non plus."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0906\u092a \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u093e \u0906\u0930\u094b\u092a \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u093f\u0936\u094d\u091a\u093f\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0916\u093c\u093f\u0932\u093e\u092b\u093c \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u092c\u0942\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092d\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0908 \u0938\u092c\u0942\u0924 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qualcuno ti accusa di qualcosa che sicuramente NON hai fatto. Non ci sono prove contro di te, ma non ce ne sono nemmeno a tuo carico."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u7d76\u5bfe\u306b\u3084\u3063\u3066\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3067\u8ab0\u304b\u304c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3092\u975e\u96e3\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u4e0d\u5229\u306a\u8a3c\u62e0\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u304c\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u3082\u8a3c\u62e0\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub204\uad70\uac00\uac00 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc774 \ud655\uc2e4\ud788 \ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc740 \uc77c\uc5d0 \ub300\ud574 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc744 \ube44\ub09c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uc99d\uac70\ub294 \uc5c6\uc9c0\ub9cc \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \uc99d\uac70\ub3c4 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iemand beschuldigt je van iets dat je beslist NIET hebt gedaan. Er is geen bewijs tegen u, maar er is ook geen bewijs voor u."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kto\u015b oskar\u017ca Ci\u0119 o co\u015b, czego na pewno NIE zrobi\u0142e\u015b. Nie ma dowod\u00f3w przeciwko tobie, ale nie ma te\u017c dowod\u00f3w dla ciebie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algu\u00e9m acusa voc\u00ea de algo que voc\u00ea definitivamente N\u00c3O fez. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 provas contra voc\u00ea, mas tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o h\u00e1 provas a seu favor."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041a\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u043e\u0431\u0432\u0438\u043d\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432 \u0442\u043e\u043c, \u0447\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0442\u044b \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0451\u043d\u043d\u043e \u041d\u0415 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043b. \u041d\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f, \u043d\u043e \u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432 \u0432 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u044e \u043f\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0437\u0443."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Birisi sizi kesinlikle yapmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bir \u015feyle su\u00e7luyor. Aleyhinize bir delil yok ama sizin aleyhinize de bir delil yok."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u4eba\u6307\u63a7\u4f60\u505a\u4e86\u4e00\u4ef6\u4f60\u7edd\u5bf9\u6ca1\u6709\u505a\u8fc7\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u3002\u6ca1\u6709\u5bf9\u4f60\u4e0d\u5229\u7684\u8bc1\u636e\uff0c\u4f46\u4e5f\u6ca1\u6709\u5bf9\u4f60\u6709\u5229\u7684\u8bc1\u636e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6709\u4eba\u6307\u8cac\u4f60\u505a\u4e86\u4e00\u4e9b\u4f60\u7d55\u5c0d\u6c92\u6709\u505a\u904e\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u3002\u6c92\u6709\u5c0d\u4f60\u4e0d\u5229\u7684\u8b49\u64da\uff0c\u4f46\u4e5f\u6c92\u6709\u5c0d\u4f60\u6709\u5229\u7684\u8b49\u64da\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q9.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verfalle in Panik und schreibe endlose Rechtfertigungs-Nachrichten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I panic and write endless justification messages."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entro en p\u00e1nico y escribo interminables mensajes de justificaci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je panique et j\u2019\u00e9cris des messages de justification sans fin."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0918\u092c\u0930\u093e \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u0902\u0924\u0939\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u091a\u093f\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0947\u0936 \u0932\u093f\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vado nel panico e scrivo infiniti messaggi di giustificazione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30d1\u30cb\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u9665\u308a\u3001\u5ef6\u3005\u3068\u6b63\u5f53\u5316\u30e1\u30c3\u30bb\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u66f8\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub2f9\ud669\ud558\uace0 \ub05d\uc5c6\ub294 \uc815\ub2f9\ud654 \uba54\uc2dc\uc9c0\ub97c \uc501\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik raak in paniek en schrijf eindeloze rechtvaardigingsberichten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wpadam w panik\u0119 i pisz\u0119 nieko\u0144cz\u0105ce si\u0119 wiadomo\u015bci z usprawiedliwieniami."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entro em p\u00e2nico e escrevo intermin\u00e1veis \u200b\u200bmensagens de justificativa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0432\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430\u044e \u0432 \u043f\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0443 \u0438 \u043f\u0438\u0448\u0443 \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0441 \u043e\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f\u043c\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pani\u011fe kap\u0131l\u0131yorum ve sonsuz gerek\u00e7e mesajlar\u0131 yaz\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9677\u5165\u6050\u614c\uff0c\u5199\u4e0b\u65e0\u4f11\u6b62\u7684\u8fa9\u89e3\u6d88\u606f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9a5a\u614c\u5931\u63aa\uff0c\u5beb\u4e86\u6c92\u5b8c\u6c92\u4e86\u7684\u7406\u7531\u8a0a\u606f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q9.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich r\u00e4che mich sofort und beschuldige ihn ebenfalls einer Sache."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I immediately take revenge and accuse him of something too."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inmediatamente me vengo y lo acuso de algo tambi\u00e9n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je me venge imm\u00e9diatement et l'accuse aussi de quelque chose."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u092c\u0926\u0932\u093e \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u0915\u0941\u091b \u0906\u0930\u094b\u092a \u092d\u0940 \u0932\u0917\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964'"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi vendico subito e accuso anche lui di qualcosa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u3082\u3059\u3050\u306b\u5fa9\u8b90\u3057\u3001\u5f7c\u3092\u4f55\u304b\u3067\u975e\u96e3\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc989\uc2dc \ubcf5\uc218\ud558\uace0 \uadf8\uc5d0\uac8c\ub3c4 \ubb34\uc5b8\uac00\ub97c \ube44\ub09c\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik neem onmiddellijk wraak en beschuldig hem ook van iets."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Od razu si\u0119 zemszcz\u0119 i jego te\u017c o co\u015b oskar\u017cam."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu imediatamente me vingo e o acuso de alguma coisa tamb\u00e9m."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0443 \u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0449\u0443 \u0438 \u0442\u043e\u0436\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u0432\u0438\u043d\u044e \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0432 \u0447\u0435\u043c-\u0442\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen intikam al\u0131yorum ve onu da bir \u015feyle su\u00e7luyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u7acb\u5373\u62a5\u590d\uff0c\u5e76\u6307\u63a7\u4ed6\u540c\u6837\u7684\u4e00\u4ef6\u4e8b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u5373\u5831\u5fa9\u4e26\u6307\u8cac\u4ed6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q9.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich sage einmal klar, dass es nicht stimmt. Wer mir nicht glaubt, ist sein Problem. Ich gehe weiter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let me say clearly that it is not true. If you don't believe me, that's your problem. I'm moving on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D\u00e9jame decir claramente que no es cierto. Si no me crees, ese es tu problema. Estoy siguiendo adelante."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permettez-moi de dire clairement que ce n'est pas vrai. Si vous ne me croyez pas, c'est votre probl\u00e8me. Je continue."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0939 \u0926\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0938\u091a \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092f\u0926\u093f \u0906\u092a \u092e\u0941\u091d \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0938 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947, \u0924\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0906\u0917\u0947 \u092c\u0922\u093c \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lasciatemi dire chiaramente che non \u00e8 vero. Se non mi credi, \u00e8 un tuo problema. Sto andando avanti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u308c\u306f\u771f\u5b9f\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\u3068\u306f\u3063\u304d\u308a\u8a00\u3063\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u306e\u8a00\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u4fe1\u3058\u306a\u3044\u306a\u3089\u3001\u305d\u308c\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u554f\u984c\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5148\u306b\u9032\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc0ac\uc2e4\uc774 \uc544\ub2d8\uc744 \ubd84\uba85\ud788 \ub9d0\uc500\ub4dc\ub9bd\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc774 \ub098\ub97c \ubbff\uc9c0 \uc54a\ub294\ub2e4\uba74 \uadf8\uac83\uc740 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ubb38\uc81c\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\ub294 \uacc4\uc18d \ub098\uc544\uac04\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laat ik duidelijk zeggen dat dit niet waar is. Als je mij niet gelooft, is dat jouw probleem. Ik ga verder."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Powiem wyra\u017anie, \u017ce to nieprawda. Je\u015bli mi nie wierzysz, to tw\u00f3j problem. Id\u0119 dalej."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deixe-me dizer claramente que isso n\u00e3o \u00e9 verdade. Se voc\u00ea n\u00e3o acredita em mim, o problema \u00e9 seu. Estou seguindo em frente."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u044f\u0441\u043d\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u044e, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0434\u0430. \u041a\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442, \u0442\u043e\u0442 \u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0430\u043c \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0441 \u044d\u0442\u0438\u043c. \u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0438\u0434\u0442\u0438 \u0434\u0430\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunun do\u011fru olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131k\u00e7a s\u00f6yleyeyim. Bana inanm\u0131yorsan bu senin sorunun. Devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u660e\u786e\u5730\u8bf4\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e0d\u662f\u771f\u7684\u3002\u8c01\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\u6211\uff0c\u90a3\u662f\u4ed6\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002\u6211\u7ee7\u7eed\u524d\u884c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8981\u660e\u78ba\u5730\u8aaa\uff0c\u9019\u4e0d\u662f\u771f\u7684\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\u6211\uff0c\u90a3\u662f\u4f60\u7684\u554f\u984c\u3002\u6211\u7e7c\u7e8c\u524d\u9032\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q9.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich fange an, an mir selbst zu zweifeln. Vielleicht habe ich es unbewusst doch irgendwie verursacht?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm starting to doubt myself. Maybe I unconsciously caused it somehow?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy empezando a dudar de m\u00ed mismo. \u00bfQuiz\u00e1s lo caus\u00e9 inconscientemente de alguna manera?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je commence \u00e0 douter de moi. Peut-\u00eatre que je l'ai inconsciemment caus\u00e9 d'une mani\u00e8re ou d'une autre ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901, \u090f\u0915 \u0914\u0930 \u092c\u093e\u0924 \u091c\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901. \u0936\u093e\u092f\u0926 \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u091c\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u092c\u0928\u093e \u0926\u093f\u092f\u093e?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comincio a dubitare di me stesso. Forse l'ho causato inconsciamente in qualche modo?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u81ea\u5206\u81ea\u8eab\u3092\u7591\u3044\u59cb\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3057\u304b\u3057\u305f\u3089\u79c1\u304c\u7121\u610f\u8b58\u306e\u3046\u3061\u306b\u4f55\u3089\u304b\u306e\u539f\u56e0\u3092\u4f5c\u3063\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304b\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0b4 \uc790\uc2e0\uc744 \uc758\uc2ec\ud558\uae30 \uc2dc\uc791\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5b4\uca4c\uba74 \ub0b4\uac00 \ubb34\uc758\uc2dd\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uc6d0\uc778\uc744 \uc81c\uacf5\ud55c \uac83\uc740 \uc544\ub2d0\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik begin aan mezelf te twijfelen. Misschien heb ik het op de een of andere manier onbewust veroorzaakt?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaczynam w siebie w\u0105tpi\u0107. Mo\u017ce nie\u015bwiadomie w jaki\u015b spos\u00f3b to spowodowa\u0142em?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou come\u00e7ando a duvidar de mim mesmo. Talvez eu tenha causado isso inconscientemente de alguma forma?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e \u0441\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435. \u041c\u043e\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u0431\u044b\u0442\u044c, \u044f \u043a\u0430\u043a-\u0442\u043e \u0431\u0435\u0441\u0441\u043e\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0436\u0435 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0432\u044b\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043b?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendimden \u015f\u00fcphe etmeye ba\u015fl\u0131yorum. Belki bilin\u00e7sizce bir \u015fekilde buna sebep oldum?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5f00\u59cb\u6000\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u3002\u4e5f\u8bb8\u6211\u4e0d\u81ea\u89c9\u5730\u8fd8\u662f\u4ee5\u67d0\u79cd\u65b9\u5f0f\u9020\u6210\u4e86\u8fd9\u4e00\u5207\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u958b\u59cb\u61f7\u7591\u81ea\u5df1\u4e86\u3002\u4e5f\u8a31\u662f\u6211\u7121\u610f\u8b58\u5730\u9020\u6210\u7684\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q10": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du arbeitest seit 14 Stunden an einer Aufgabe, bist v\u00f6llig \u00fcberm\u00fcdet, aber es fehlt noch ein winziges, unwichtiges Detail zur Perfektion."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've been working on a task for 14 hours, you're completely exhausted, but there's still a tiny, unimportant detail missing from perfection."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Llevas 14 horas trabajando en una tarea, est\u00e1s completamente agotado, pero todav\u00eda falta un peque\u00f1o detalle sin importancia para alcanzar la perfecci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela fait 14 heures que vous travaillez sur une t\u00e2che, vous \u00eates compl\u00e8tement \u00e9puis\u00e9, mais il manque encore un tout petit d\u00e9tail sans importance \u00e0 la perfection."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u092a\u0930 14 \u0918\u0902\u091f\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0906\u092a \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0925\u0915 \u091a\u0941\u0915\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u090f\u0915 \u091b\u094b\u091f\u093e, \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u0939\u0940\u0928 \u0935\u093f\u0935\u0930\u0923 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923\u0924\u093e \u0938\u0947 \u0917\u093e\u092f\u092c \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stai lavorando a un compito da 14 ore, sei completamente esausto, ma manca ancora un piccolo dettaglio non importante per raggiungere la perfezione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 \u3064\u306e\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u306b 14 \u6642\u9593\u53d6\u308a\u7d44\u3093\u3067\u3044\u3066\u3001\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u75b2\u308c\u304d\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u5b8c\u74a7\u3092\u4fdd\u3064\u305f\u3081\u306b\u306f\u3001\u91cd\u8981\u3067\u306a\u3044\u5c0f\u3055\u306a\u7d30\u90e8\u304c\u307e\u3060\u6b20\u3051\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14\uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \uc218\ud589\ud558\uc5ec \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uc9c0\ucce4\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc644\ubcbd\ud568\uc5d0\uc11c \uc5ec\uc804\ud788 \uc791\uace0 \uc911\uc694\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc740 \uc138\ubd80 \uc0ac\ud56d\uc774 \ub204\ub77d\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je hebt 14 uur aan een taak gewerkt, je bent volledig uitgeput, maar er ontbreekt nog steeds een klein, onbelangrijk detail aan de perfectie."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pracujesz nad zadaniem 14 godzin, jeste\u015b totalnie wyczerpany, a do perfekcji brakuje jeszcze ma\u0142ego, nieistotnego szczeg\u00f3\u0142u."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 trabalhando em uma tarefa h\u00e1 14 horas, est\u00e1 completamente exausto, mas ainda falta um detalhe min\u00fasculo e sem import\u00e2ncia na perfei\u00e7\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c \u0443\u0436\u0435 14 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0432, \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u0438\u0437\u043c\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d, \u043d\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0445\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u043a\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0435\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0439, \u043d\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14 saattir bir g\u00f6rev \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorsunuz, bitkin durumdas\u0131n\u0131z ama yine de m\u00fckemmelli\u011fin i\u00e7inde k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fcc\u00fck, \u00f6nemsiz bir detay eksik."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u8fde\u7eed\u5de5\u4f5c\u4e8614\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u4efb\u52a1\u4e0a\uff0c\u5b8c\u5168\u75b2\u60eb\uff0c\u4f46\u4e3a\u4e86\u5b8c\u7f8e\u4ecd\u7136\u7f3a\u5c11\u4e00\u4e2a\u5fae\u5c0f\u3001\u4e0d\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u7ec6\u8282\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7d93\u5728\u4e00\u9805\u4efb\u52d9\u4e0a\u5de5\u4f5c\u4e86 14 \u500b\u5c0f\u6642\uff0c\u4f60\u5df2\u7d93\u7b4b\u75b2\u529b\u76e1\uff0c\u4f46\u4ecd\u7136\u7f3a\u5c11\u4e00\u500b\u5fae\u5c0f\u7684\u3001\u4e0d\u91cd\u8981\u7684\u7d30\u7bc0\uff0c\u4e0d\u5920\u5b8c\u7f8e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q10.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache es noch schnell fertig, egal wie unkonzentriert ich bin."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll finish it quickly, no matter how unfocused I am."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo terminar\u00e9 r\u00e1pido, no importa lo desconcentrado que est\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le terminerai rapidement, m\u00eame si je suis flou."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0932\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0932\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e, \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0947 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f\u0924\u0928\u093e \u092d\u0940 \u0905\u0928\u092b\u094b\u0915\u0938\u094d\u0921 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0928 \u0930\u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo finir\u00f2 velocemente, non importa quanto sono distratto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3069\u3093\u306a\u306b\u96c6\u4e2d\u529b\u304c\u306a\u304f\u3066\u3082\u3001\u3059\u3050\u306b\u7d42\u308f\u3089\u305b\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\ubb34\ub9ac \uc815\uc2e0\uc774 \uc5c6\ub354\ub77c\ub3c4 \ube68\ub9ac \ub05d\ub0b4\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik zal het snel afmaken, hoe ongericht ik ook ben."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sko\u0144cz\u0119 to szybko, niezale\u017cnie od tego, jak bardzo jestem nieskoncentrowany."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou terminar rapidamente, n\u00e3o importa o qu\u00e3o desfocado eu esteja."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e \u0437\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0443 \u044d\u0442\u043e, \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043c\u043e\u0442\u0440\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0442\u043e, \u043d\u0430\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u044f \u0440\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0435\u044f\u043d."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne kadar odaklanmam\u0131\u015f olsam da \u00e7abuk bitirece\u011fim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8fd8\u662f\u8d76\u7d27\u628a\u5b83\u505a\u5b8c\uff0c\u65e0\u8bba\u6211\u591a\u4e48\u5206\u5fc3\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0d\u7ba1\u6211\u591a\u9ebc\u4e0d\u5c08\u5fc3\uff0c\u6211\u90fd\u6703\u5f88\u5feb\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q10.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lasse es sein, es ist sowieso gut genug, merkt eh keiner."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll let it be, it's good enough anyway, no one will notice anyway."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo dejar\u00e9 as\u00ed, de todos modos es bastante bueno, de todos modos nadie se dar\u00e1 cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je laisse faire, c'est assez bien de toute fa\u00e7on, personne ne le remarquera de toute fa\u00e7on."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0930\u0939\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0942\u0901\u0917\u093e, \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0940 \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u093e\u092b\u0940 \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u092d\u0940 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u0927\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lascio stare, va bene comunque, tanto nessuno se ne accorger\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u305d\u306e\u307e\u307e\u306b\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3001\u3068\u306b\u304b\u304f\u5341\u5206\u3067\u3059\u3001\u3069\u3046\u305b\u8ab0\u3082\u6c17\u3065\u304b\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub194\ub450\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5b4\uca0c\ub4e0 \ucda9\ubd84\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc5b4\uca0c\ub4e0 \uc544\ubb34\ub3c4 \ub208\uce58 \ucc44\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud560 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik laat het maar, het is toch goed genoeg, niemand zal het toch merken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zostawi\u0119 tak, i tak jest dobrze, nikt i tak tego nie zauwa\u017cy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou deixar para l\u00e1, \u00e9 bom o suficiente de qualquer maneira, ningu\u00e9m vai notar de qualquer maneira."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e, \u043e\u043d\u043e \u0438 \u0442\u0430\u043a \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e \u0445\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0435\u0435, \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0440\u0430\u0432\u043d\u043e \u043d\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kendi haline b\u0131rakaca\u011f\u0131m, zaten yeterince iyi, zaten kimse fark etmeyecek."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c31\u7b97\u4e86\uff0c\u53cd\u6b63\u5df2\u7ecf\u591f\u597d\u4e86\uff0c\u53cd\u6b63\u6ca1\u4eba\u4f1a\u6ce8\u610f\u5230\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5c31\u9019\u6a23\u5427\uff0c\u53cd\u6b63\u5df2\u7d93\u5920\u597d\u4e86\uff0c\u53cd\u6b63\u6c92\u4eba\u6703\u6ce8\u610f\u5230\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q10.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich stoppe sofort. 95\uff05 reichen v\u00f6llig. Schlaf und Fokus f\u00fcr morgen sind strategisch wichtiger."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll stop immediately. 95\uff05 is completely sufficient. Sleep and focus for tomorrow are strategically more important."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parar\u00e9 inmediatamente. El 95\uff05 es completamente suficiente. Dormir y concentrarse para el ma\u00f1ana son estrat\u00e9gicamente m\u00e1s importantes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais arr\u00eater imm\u00e9diatement. 95\uff05 est tout \u00e0 fait suffisant. Le sommeil et la concentration pour demain sont strat\u00e9giquement plus importants."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u0930\u0941\u0915 \u091c\u093e\u090a\u0902\u0917\u093e. 95\uff05 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923\u0924\u0903 \u092a\u0930\u094d\u092f\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0928\u0940\u0902\u0926 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0932 \u092a\u0930 \u0927\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u0947\u0902\u0926\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0930\u0923\u0928\u0940\u0924\u093f\u0915 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi fermer\u00f2 immediatamente. Il 95\uff05 \u00e8 completamente sufficiente. Dormire e concentrarsi per il domani sono strategicamente pi\u00f9 importanti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3059\u3050\u306b\u3084\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002 95\uff05 \u3042\u308c\u3070\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u5341\u5206\u3067\u3059\u3002\u660e\u65e5\u3078\u306e\u7761\u7720\u3068\u96c6\u4e2d\u529b\u306f\u6226\u7565\u7684\u306b\u3088\u308a\u91cd\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc989\uc2dc \uc911\uc9c0\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 95\uff05\uba74 \ucda9\ubd84\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub0b4\uc77c\uc744 \uc704\ud55c \uc218\uba74\uacfc \uc9d1\uc911\uc774 \uc804\ub7b5\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \ub354 \uc911\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stop onmiddellijk. 95\uff05 is volledig voldoende. Slaap en focus voor morgen zijn strategisch belangrijker."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Natychmiast przestan\u0119. 95\uff05 w zupe\u0142no\u015bci wystarczy. Sen i koncentracja na jutro s\u0105 strategicznie wa\u017cniejsze."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou parar imediatamente. 95\uff05 \u00e9 completamente suficiente. O sono e o foco para amanh\u00e3 s\u00e3o estrategicamente mais importantes."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u043d\u0435\u043c\u0435\u0434\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e. 95\uff05 \u0432\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0447\u043d\u043e. \u0421\u043e\u043d \u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0435\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hemen duraca\u011f\u0131m. \uff0595 tamamen yeterli. Uyku ve yar\u0131na odaklanmak stratejik olarak daha \u00f6nemlidir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7acb\u523b\u505c\u6b62\u300295\uff05\u5df2\u7ecf\u5b8c\u5168\u8db3\u591f\u3002\u4e3a\u4e86\u660e\u5929\u7684\u7761\u7720\u548c\u4e13\u6ce8\u66f4\u5177\u6218\u7565\u610f\u4e49\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u7acb\u5373\u505c\u4e0b\u4f86\u3002 95\uff05\u5c31\u5b8c\u5168\u8db3\u5920\u4e86\u3002\u7761\u7720\u548c\u660e\u5929\u7684\u6ce8\u610f\u529b\u5728\u7b56\u7565\u4e0a\u66f4\u70ba\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q10.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich verliere mich noch 2 Stunden in Details und hasse mich am n\u00e4chsten Morgen daf\u00fcr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I lose myself in details for another 2 hours and hate myself for it the next morning."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Me pierdo en detalles durante otras 2 horas y me odio por ello a la ma\u00f1ana siguiente."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je me perds dans les d\u00e9tails pendant encore 2 heures et je me d\u00e9teste pour \u00e7a le lendemain matin."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0947 \u0926\u094b \u0918\u0902\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0935\u093f\u0935\u0930\u0923\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u094b \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0940 \u0938\u0941\u092c\u0939 \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0938\u0947 \u0928\u092b\u0930\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mi perdo nei dettagli per altre 2 ore e mi odio per questo la mattina dopo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3055\u3089\u306b2\u6642\u9593\u307b\u3069\u7d30\u90e8\u306b\u6ca1\u982d\u3057\u3001\u7fcc\u671d\u305d\u306e\u3053\u3068\u306b\u5acc\u60aa\u611f\u3092\u62b1\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub610 \ub2e4\ub978 2\uc2dc\uac04 \ub3d9\uc548 \uc138\ubd80\uc0ac\ud56d\uc5d0 \ube60\uc838\ub4e4\uace0 \ub2e4\uc74c\ub0a0 \uc544\uce68\uc5d0 \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \uc2eb\uc5b4\uc9c4\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik verlies mezelf nog twee uur lang in details en haat mezelf er de volgende ochtend om."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zatracam si\u0119 w szczeg\u00f3\u0142ach przez kolejne 2 godziny i nienawidz\u0119 si\u0119 za to nast\u0119pnego ranka."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu me perco em detalhes por mais 2 horas e me odeio por isso na manh\u00e3 seguinte."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0435\u0449\u0451 2 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043b\u044f\u0445 \u0438 \u043d\u0435\u043d\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0436\u0443 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0437\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u043b\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044e\u0449\u0435\u0435 \u0443\u0442\u0440\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 saat daha kendimi ayr\u0131nt\u0131larda kaybediyorum ve ertesi sabah kendimden nefret ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8fd8\u4f1a\u5728\u7ec6\u8282\u4e0a\u6d6a\u8d39\u4e24\u4e2a\u5c0f\u65f6\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u4e3a\u6b64\u6068\u81ea\u5df1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53c8\u5728\u7d30\u7bc0\u4e2d\u8ff7\u5931\u4e86\u5169\u500b\u5c0f\u6642\uff0c\u4e26\u5728\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u70ba\u6b64\u8a0e\u53ad\u81ea\u5df1\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q11": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Chef verlangt von dir, eine Aufgabe auf einem v\u00f6llig ineffizienten Weg zu erledigen. Du kennst einen 10x schnelleren Weg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your boss is asking you to complete a task in a completely inefficient way. You know a way 10x faster."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu jefe te pide que completes una tarea de una manera completamente ineficiente. Conoces una forma 10 veces m\u00e1s r\u00e1pida."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre patron vous demande d'accomplir une t\u00e2che de mani\u00e8re totalement inefficace. Vous connaissez un moyen 10 fois plus rapide."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u092c\u0949\u0938 \u0906\u092a\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0915\u094b \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0915\u0941\u0936\u0932 \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0915\u0939 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0906\u092a 10 \u0917\u0941\u0928\u093e \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u0924\u0947\u091c\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo capo ti sta chiedendo di completare un'attivit\u00e0 in modo del tutto inefficiente. Conosci un modo 10 volte pi\u00f9 veloce."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u4e0a\u53f8\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u3001\u307e\u3063\u305f\u304f\u975e\u52b9\u7387\u7684\u306a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3067\u30bf\u30b9\u30af\u3092\u5b8c\u4e86\u3059\u308b\u3088\u3046\u6c42\u3081\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002 10 \u500d\u9ad8\u901f\u306a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u3054\u5b58\u77e5\u3067\u3059\u304b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \uc0c1\uc0ac\ub294 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0\uac8c \uc644\uc804\ud788 \ube44\ud6a8\uc728\uc801\uc778 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \uc644\ub8cc\ud558\ub77c\uace0 \uc694\uad6c\ud558\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 10\ubc30 \ub354 \ube60\ub978 \ubc29\ubc95\uc744 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je baas vraagt \u200b\u200bje om een \u200b\u200btaak op een volkomen ineffici\u00ebnte manier uit te voeren. Je kent een manier die 10x sneller is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j szef prosi Ci\u0119 o wykonanie zadania w zupe\u0142nie nieefektywny spos\u00f3b. Znasz spos\u00f3b 10 razy szybszy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu chefe est\u00e1 pedindo que voc\u00ea conclua uma tarefa de uma forma totalmente ineficiente. Voc\u00ea conhece um caminho 10x mais r\u00e1pido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u043a \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0431\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043e\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0432\u044b\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\u044e \u043d\u0435\u044d\u0444\u0444\u0435\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e\u043c. \u0422\u044b \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u0432 10 \u0440\u0430\u0437 \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Patronunuz sizden bir g\u00f6revi tamamen verimsiz bir \u015fekilde tamamlaman\u0131z\u0131 istiyor. 10 kat daha h\u0131zl\u0131 bir yol biliyorsun."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u8001\u677f\u8981\u6c42\u4f60\u4ee5\u4e00\u79cd\u5b8c\u5168\u4f4e\u6548\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u5b8c\u6210\u4e00\u9879\u4efb\u52a1\u3002\u4f60\u77e5\u9053\u6709\u4e00\u79cd\u5feb10\u500d\u7684\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u7684\u8001\u95c6\u8981\u6c42\u60a8\u4ee5\u5b8c\u5168\u4f4e\u6548\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u5b8c\u6210\u4efb\u52d9\u3002\u4f60\u77e5\u9053\u6709\u4e00\u7a2e\u65b9\u6cd5\u53ef\u4ee5\u5feb 10 \u500d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q11.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache es stumm und z\u00e4hneknirschend so, wie er es will. Er ist der Boss."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I do it silently and gritting my teeth the way he wants. He's the boss."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo hago en silencio y apretando los dientes como \u00e9l quiere. \u00c9l es el jefe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le fais en silence et en serrant les dents comme il le souhaite. C'est le patron."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u091a\u0941\u092a\u091a\u093e\u092a \u0914\u0930 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u093e\u0901\u0924 \u092a\u0940\u0938\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f \u0935\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901 \u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u0939 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0935\u0939 \u092e\u093e\u0932\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo faccio in silenzio e stringendo i denti come vuole lui. Lui \u00e8 il capo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u5f7c\u304c\u671b\u3080\u3088\u3046\u306b\u3001\u9ed9\u3063\u3066\u6b6f\u3092\u98df\u3044\u3057\u3070\u3063\u3066\u305d\u308c\u3092\u884c\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f7c\u304c\u4e0a\u53f8\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac00 \uc6d0\ud558\ub294 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc870\uc6a9\ud788 \uc774\ub97c \uc545\ubb3c\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub294 \uc0c1\uc0ac\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik doe het in stilte en knarsetand zoals hij wil. Hij is de baas."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Robi\u0119 to po cichu i zaciskam z\u0119by, tak jak on chce. On jest szefem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fa\u00e7o isso silenciosamente e cerrando os dentes do jeito que ele quer. Ele \u00e9 o chefe."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043e\u043b\u0447\u0430 \u0438 \u0441\u043a\u0440\u0438\u043f\u044f \u0437\u0443\u0431\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0442\u0430\u043a, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u043e\u043d \u0445\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0442. \u041e\u043d \u0431\u043e\u0441\u0441."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu sessizce yap\u0131yorum ve di\u015flerimi onun istedi\u011fi gibi g\u0131c\u0131rdat\u0131yorum. O patron."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9ed8\u9ed8\u5730\u3001\u54ac\u7259\u5730\u7167\u4ed6\u60f3\u8981\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u53bb\u505a\u3002\u4ed6\u662f\u8001\u677f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9ed8\u9ed8\u5730\u505a\u8457\uff0c\u54ac\u7dca\u7259\u95dc\uff0c\u7528\u4ed6\u60f3\u8981\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u53bb\u505a\u3002\u4ed6\u662f\u8001\u95c6\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q11.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich diskutiere hitzig mit ihm, bis er genervt aufgibt oder mir den Mund verbietet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I argue heatedly with him until he gives up in annoyance or shuts me up."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discuto acaloradamente con \u00e9l hasta que se da por vencido molesto o me hace callar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je discute vivement avec lui jusqu'\u00e0 ce qu'il abandonne avec agacement ou me fasse taire."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0938\u0938\u0947 \u0924\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u0917\u0930\u092e\u093e\u0917\u0930\u092e \u092c\u0939\u0938 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u091c\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u0915\u093f \u0935\u0939 \u091d\u0941\u0902\u091d\u0932\u093e\u0915\u0930 \u0939\u093e\u0930 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u092e\u093e\u0928 \u0932\u0947\u0924\u093e \u092f\u093e \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u091a\u0941\u092a \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0930\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Discuto animatamente con lui finch\u00e9 non si arrende irritato o mi zittisce."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f7c\u304c\u30a4\u30e9\u30a4\u30e9\u3057\u3066\u8ae6\u3081\u308b\u304b\u3001\u79c1\u3092\u9ed9\u3089\u305b\u308b\u307e\u3067\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u5f7c\u3068\u6fc0\u3057\u304f\u8b70\u8ad6\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uadf8\uac00 \uc9dc\uc99d\uc744 \ub0b4\uba70 \ud3ec\uae30\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ub0b4 \uc785\uc744 \ub2eb\uc744 \ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0 \uadf8\uc640 \uc5f4\ub764 \ub17c\uc7c1\uc744 \ubc8c\uc778\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik maak hevig ruzie met hem totdat hij het ge\u00efrriteerd opgeeft of mij de mond snoert."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "K\u0142\u00f3c\u0119 si\u0119 z nim zawzi\u0119cie, dop\u00f3ki si\u0119 nie podda ze zirytowania lub mnie nie zamknie."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu discuto acaloradamente com ele at\u00e9 que ele desiste, aborrecido, ou me cala a boca."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0433\u043e\u0440\u044f\u0447\u043e \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u044e \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u043c, \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430 \u043e\u043d \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u0434\u0430\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0451\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0435\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O sinirle pes edinceye ya da beni susturana kadar hararetli bir \u015fekilde onunla tart\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e0e\u4ed6\u6fc0\u70c8\u5730\u4e89\u8bba\uff0c\u76f4\u5230\u4ed6\u607c\u6012\u5730\u653e\u5f03\u6216\u7981\u6b62\u6211\u8bf4\u8bdd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u548c\u4ed6\u6fc0\u70c8\u5730\u722d\u8ad6\uff0c\u76f4\u5230\u4ed6\u751f\u6c23\u5730\u653e\u68c4\u6216\u8b93\u6211\u9589\u5634\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q11.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache es auf meinen schnellen Weg und zeige ihm nur das fertige, perfekte Ergebnis."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I do it my quick way and just show him the finished, perfect result."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo hago a mi manera r\u00e1pida y simplemente le muestro el resultado perfecto y terminado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je le fais \u00e0 ma mani\u00e8re et je lui montre simplement le r\u00e9sultat fini et parfait."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u094d\u0935\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0924\u0930\u0940\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0902\u0924\u093f\u092e, \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u092e \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo faccio nel mio modo veloce e gli mostro semplicemente il risultato finito e perfetto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306a\u308a\u306e\u3084\u308a\u65b9\u3067\u3084\u3063\u3066\u3001\u5b8c\u6210\u3057\u305f\u5b8c\u74a7\u306a\u7d50\u679c\u3092\u5f7c\u306b\u898b\u305b\u308b\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc2e0\uc18d\ud558\uac8c \uc791\uc5c5\uc744 \uc218\ud589\ud558\uace0 \uc644\uc131\ub41c \uc644\ubcbd\ud55c \uacb0\uacfc\ub97c \uadf8\uc5d0\uac8c \ubcf4\uc5ec\uc90d\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik doe het op mijn snelle manier en laat hem gewoon het voltooide, perfecte resultaat zien."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Robi\u0119 to po swojemu i po prostu pokazuj\u0119 mu gotowy, idealny efekt."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu fa\u00e7o isso do meu jeito r\u00e1pido e apenas mostro a ele o resultado final e perfeito."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u044e \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c \u0431\u044b\u0441\u0442\u0440\u044b\u043c \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043e\u043c \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e \u0435\u043c\u0443 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439, \u0438\u0434\u0435\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0435\u0437\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0430\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu kendi h\u0131zl\u0131 y\u00f6ntemimle yap\u0131yorum ve ona bitmi\u015f, m\u00fckemmel sonucu g\u00f6steriyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u7528\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u5feb\u901f\u65b9\u6cd5\u6765\u505a\uff0c\u53ea\u5411\u4ed6\u5c55\u793a\u6700\u7ec8\u7684\u3001\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684\u7ed3\u679c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4ee5\u5feb\u901f\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u5b8c\u6210\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u5411\u4ed6\u5c55\u793a\u5b8c\u7f8e\u7684\u5b8c\u6210\u7d50\u679c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q11.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich frage h\u00f6flich, ob ich einen neuen Ansatz testen darf. Wenn er Nein sagt, siehe A."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I politely ask if I can test a new approach. If he says no, see A."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cort\u00e9smente pregunto si puedo probar un nuevo enfoque. Si dice que no, ver A."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je demande poliment si je peux tester une nouvelle approche. S'il dit non, voir A."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0935\u093f\u0928\u092e\u094d\u0930\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0915 \u092a\u0942\u091b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u090f \u0926\u0943\u0937\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0915\u094b\u0923 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u0930\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u092f\u0926\u093f \u0935\u0939 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0924\u094b \u090f \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chiedo gentilmente se posso testare un nuovo approccio. Se dice di no, vedere A."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u30a2\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c1\u3092\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3067\u304d\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3092\u4e01\u5be7\u306b\u5c0b\u306d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f7c\u304c\u30ce\u30fc\u3068\u8a00\u3063\u305f\u5834\u5408\u306f\u3001A \u3092\u53c2\u7167\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc811\uadfc \ubc29\uc2dd\uc744 \ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b8\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294\uc9c0 \uc815\uc911\ud558\uac8c \ubb3b\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\uac00 \uc544\ub2c8\uc624\ub77c\uace0 \ud558\uba74 A\ub97c \ucc38\uc870\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik vraag beleefd of ik een nieuwe aanpak mag testen. Als hij nee zegt, zie A."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grzecznie pytam, czy mog\u0119 przetestowa\u0107 nowe podej\u015bcie. Je\u015bli powie nie, zob. A."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pergunto educadamente se posso testar uma nova abordagem. Se ele disser n\u00e3o, veja A."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0432\u0435\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0432\u043e \u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e, \u043c\u043e\u0433\u0443 \u043b\u0438 \u044f \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0445\u043e\u0434. \u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u043d \u0441\u043a\u0430\u0436\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0435\u0442, \u0441\u043c. A."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kibarca yeni bir yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 test edip edemeyece\u011fimi soruyorum. Hay\u0131r diyorsa A'ya bak\u0131n."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u793c\u8c8c\u5730\u8be2\u95ee\u6211\u662f\u5426\u53ef\u4ee5\u6d4b\u8bd5\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4ed6\u8bf4\u4e0d\uff0c\u8bf7\u53c2\u89c1A\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u79ae\u8c8c\u5730\u8a62\u554f\u662f\u5426\u53ef\u4ee5\u6e2c\u8a66\u4e00\u7a2e\u65b0\u65b9\u6cd5\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4ed6\u8aaa\u4e0d\uff0c\u8acb\u53c3\u8003 A\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q12": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Partner sagt dir: 'Wenn du jetzt zu diesem Training gehst, anstatt Zeit mit mir zu verbringen, bin ich extrem sauer.'"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your partner tells you, \"If you go to this training instead of spending time with me, I'll be extremely upset.\""
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu pareja te dice: \"Si vas a esta capacitaci\u00f3n en lugar de pasar tiempo conmigo, me enojar\u00e9 mucho\"."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre partenaire vous dit : \u00ab Si vous allez \u00e0 cette formation au lieu de passer du temps avec moi, je serai extr\u00eamement contrari\u00e9. \u00bb"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u093e \u0938\u093e\u0925\u0940 \u0906\u092a\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \"\u092f\u0926\u093f \u0906\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u092c\u093f\u0924\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u091c\u093e\u092f \u0907\u0938 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0902\u0917\u0947, \u0924\u094b \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u092a\u0930\u0947\u0936\u093e\u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090a\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964\""
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo partner ti dice: \"Se partecipi a questo corso di formazione invece di passare del tempo con me, sar\u00f2 estremamente turbato\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u30ca\u30fc\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u3001\u300c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u79c1\u3068\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u6642\u9593\u3092\u904e\u3054\u3059\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b\u3053\u306e\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u305f\u3089\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u8179\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u308b\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u300d\u3068\u8a00\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc758 \ud30c\ud2b8\ub108\ub294 \"\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc774 \ub098\uc640 \ud568\uaed8 \uc2dc\uac04\uc744 \ubcf4\ub0b4\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0 \uc774 \ud6c8\ub828\uc5d0 \ucc38\uc11d\ud55c\ub2e4\uba74 \ub098\ub294 \ub9e4\uc6b0 \uc18d\uc0c1\ud560 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\"\ub77c\uace0 \ub9d0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je partner zegt tegen je: \"Als je naar deze training gaat in plaats van tijd met mij door te brengen, zal ik erg overstuur zijn.\""
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tw\u00f3j partner powie Ci: \u201eJe\u015bli p\u00f3jdziesz na to szkolenie zamiast sp\u0119dza\u0107 czas ze mn\u0105, b\u0119d\u0119 bardzo zdenerwowany\u201d."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu parceiro lhe dir\u00e1: \u201cSe voc\u00ea for a esse treinamento em vez de ficar comigo, ficarei extremamente chateado\u201d."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0442\u043d\u0451\u0440 \u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u0435: \u00ab\u0415\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0442\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u043f\u043e\u0439\u0434\u0451\u0448\u044c \u043d\u0430 \u044d\u0442\u0443 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0443 \u0432\u043c\u0435\u0441\u0442\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u0441\u043e \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0439, \u044f \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0437\u043e\u043b.\u00bb"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Partneriniz size \"Benimle vakit ge\u00e7irmek yerine bu e\u011fitime giderseniz \u00e7ok \u00fcz\u00fcl\u00fcr\u00fcm\" diyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u4f34\u4fa3\u5bf9\u4f60\u8bf4\uff1a'\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u73b0\u5728\u53bb\u53c2\u52a0\u8fd9\u4e2a\u57f9\u8bad\uff0c\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u548c\u6211\u5171\u5ea6\u65f6\u5149\uff0c\u6211\u4f1a\u975e\u5e38\u751f\u6c14\u3002'"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u7684\u4f34\u4fb6\u544a\u8a34\u4f60\uff0c\u201c\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u53bb\u53c3\u52a0\u9019\u500b\u57f9\u8a13\u800c\u4e0d\u662f\u82b1\u6642\u9593\u548c\u6211\u5728\u4e00\u8d77\uff0c\u6211\u6703\u975e\u5e38\u6cae\u55aa\u3002\u201d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q12.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich sage das Training ab. Frieden in der Beziehung ist mir wichtiger als meine Routine."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm canceling the training. Peace in the relationship is more important to me than my routine."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estoy cancelando el entrenamiento. La paz en la relaci\u00f3n es m\u00e1s importante para m\u00ed que mi rutina."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'annule la formation. La paix dans la relation est plus importante pour moi que ma routine."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u0930\u0926\u094d\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. \u0930\u093f\u0936\u094d\u0924\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0926\u093f\u0928\u091a\u0930\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0926\u093e \u092e\u0939\u0924\u094d\u0935\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923 \u0939\u0948\u0964'"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sto annullando la formazione. Per me la pace nella relazione \u00e8 pi\u00f9 importante della mia routine."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7814\u4fee\u3092\u4e2d\u6b62\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u306b\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3001\u65e5\u5e38\u751f\u6d3b\u3088\u308a\u3082\u5e73\u548c\u306a\u95a2\u4fc2\u306e\u65b9\u304c\u91cd\u8981\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud6c8\ub828\uc744 \ucde8\uc18c\ud558\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub098\uc5d0\uac8c\ub294 \uc77c\uc0c1\uc0dd\ud65c\ubcf4\ub2e4 \uad00\uacc4\uc758 \ud3c9\ud654\uac00 \ub354 \uc911\uc694\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik annuleer de opleiding. Vrede in de relatie is voor mij belangrijker dan mijn routine."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odwo\u0142uj\u0119 szkolenie. Spok\u00f3j w zwi\u0105zku jest dla mnie wa\u017cniejszy ni\u017c rutyna."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou cancelando o treinamento. A paz no relacionamento \u00e9 mais importante para mim do que minha rotina."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0442\u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f\u044e \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0443. \u041c\u0438\u0440 \u0432 \u043e\u0442\u043d\u043e\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u0445 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0432\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0435\u0435, \u0447\u0435\u043c \u043c\u043e\u044f \u0440\u0443\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antrenman\u0131 iptal ediyorum. \u0130li\u015fkideki huzur benim i\u00e7in rutinimden daha \u00f6nemli."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53d6\u6d88\u8bad\u7ec3\u3002\u5173\u7cfb\u4e2d\u7684\u548c\u5e73\u5bf9\u6211\u6765\u8bf4\u6bd4\u6211\u7684\u65e5\u5e38\u5b89\u6392\u66f4\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8981\u53d6\u6d88\u8a13\u7df4\u4e86\u5c0d\u6211\u4f86\u8aaa\uff0c\u95dc\u4fc2\u7684\u548c\u5e73\u6bd4\u6211\u7684\u65e5\u5e38\u751f\u6d3b\u66f4\u91cd\u8981\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q12.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich gehe zum Training, bin aber danach extrem w\u00fctend auf ihn/sie f\u00fcr die emotionale Erpressung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I go to training but afterwards I am extremely angry at him/her for the emotional blackmail."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voy a entrenar pero despu\u00e9s estoy muy enojado con \u00e9l/ella por el chantaje emocional."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais \u00e0 l'entra\u00eenement mais apr\u00e8s je suis extr\u00eamement en col\u00e8re contre lui \u00e0 cause du chantage \u00e9motionnel."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u0947\u0928\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0907\u092e\u094b\u0936\u0928\u0932 \u092c\u094d\u0932\u0948\u0915\u092e\u0947\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0909\u0938 \u092a\u0930 \u092c\u0947\u0939\u0926 \u0917\u0941\u0938\u094d\u0938\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vado all'allenamento ma dopo sono estremamente arrabbiato con lui/lei per il ricatto emotivo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u305d\u306e\u5f8c\u3001\u611f\u60c5\u7684\u306a\u8105\u8feb\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u975e\u5e38\u306b\u8179\u3092\u7acb\u3066\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud6c8\ub828\ud558\ub7ec \uac14\ub294\ub370 \ub098\uc911\uc5d0\ub294 \uadf8 \uc0ac\ub78c\uc5d0\uac8c \uac10\uc815\uc801\uc778 \ud611\ubc15\uc744 \ud574\uc11c \uadf9\ub3c4\ub85c \ud654\uac00 \ub0ac\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ga naar de training, maar daarna ben ik extreem boos op hem/haar vanwege de emotionele chantage."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chodz\u0119 na trening, ale potem jestem na niego bardzo z\u0142y za emocjonalny szanta\u017c."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vou treinar mas depois fico com muita raiva dele pela chantagem emocional."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0438\u0434\u0443 \u043d\u0430 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0443, \u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u044f \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0437\u043e\u043b/\u0437\u043b\u0430 \u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e/\u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0435\u0451 \u0437\u0430 \u044d\u043c\u043e\u0446\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0448\u0430\u043d\u0442\u0430\u0436."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antrenmanlara gidiyorum ama sonras\u0131nda duygusal \u015fantaj yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in kendisine \u00e7ok k\u0131z\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53bb\u8bad\u7ec3\uff0c\u4f46\u4e4b\u540e\u56e0\u4e3a\u4ed6\u7684/\u5979\u7684\u60c5\u611f\u52d2\u7d22\u800c\u5bf9\u4ed6/\u5979\u975e\u5e38\u751f\u6c14\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53bb\u53c3\u52a0\u8a13\u7df4\uff0c\u4f46\u8a13\u7df4\u7d50\u675f\u5f8c\u6211\u5c0d\u4ed6/\u5979\u7684\u60c5\u7dd2\u52d2\u7d22\u611f\u5230\u975e\u5e38\u61a4\u6012\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q12.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich sage zur H\u00e4lfte ab, gehe nur kurz zum Training und beeile mich dann v\u00f6llig gestresst nach Hause."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I cancel halfway through, just go to training for a short time and then rush home completely stressed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancelo a mitad de camino, solo voy a entrenar un rato y luego corro a casa completamente estresado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'annule \u00e0 mi-parcours, je vais juste m'entra\u00eener pendant une courte p\u00e9riode, puis je rentre chez moi compl\u00e8tement stress\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0940 \u0930\u0926\u094d\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902, \u092c\u0938 \u0925\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947 \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0936\u093f\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0923 \u092a\u0930 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0924\u0928\u093e\u0935\u0917\u094d\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0915\u0930 \u0918\u0930 \u0932\u094c\u091f\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annullo a met\u00e0, vado ad allenarmi per un breve periodo e poi corro a casa completamente stressato."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9014\u4e2d\u3067\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u3057\u3066\u3001\u77ed\u6642\u9593\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u884c\u304f\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3001\u5b8c\u5168\u306b\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30b9\u3092\u611f\u3058\u3066\u6025\u3044\u3067\u5bb6\u306b\u5e30\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc911\uac04\uc5d0 \ucde8\uc18c\ud558\uace0 \uc7a0\uc2dc \ud6c8\ub828\uc744 \uac14\ub2e4\uac00 \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub808\uc2a4\ub97c \ubc1b\uc740 \ucc44 \uc9d1\uc73c\ub85c \ub2ec\ub824\uac11\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halverwege zeg ik af, ga gewoon even trainen en haast me dan helemaal gestresst naar huis."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odwo\u0142uj\u0119 w po\u0142owie, po prostu id\u0119 na kr\u00f3tki trening, a potem p\u0119dz\u0119 do domu ca\u0142kowicie zestresowany."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancelo no meio, s\u00f3 vou treinar um pouco e depois corro para casa completamente estressado."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043d\u0430\u043f\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0438\u043d\u0443, \u0438\u0434\u0443 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0443\u044e \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0443, \u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043f\u043b\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0434\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yar\u0131 yolda iptal ediyorum, k\u0131sa bir s\u00fcreli\u011fine antrenmana gidiyorum ve ard\u0131ndan tamamen stresli bir \u015fekilde eve ko\u015fuyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u534a\u9014\u53d6\u6d88\uff0c\u53ea\u53bb\u4e86\u4e00\u4f1a\u513f\u8bad\u7ec3\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u975e\u5e38\u7d27\u5f20\u5730\u5306\u5306\u56de\u5bb6\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e2d\u9014\u53d6\u6d88\u4e86\uff0c\u53ea\u662f\u53bb\u8a13\u7df4\u4e86\u4e00\u5c0f\u6bb5\u6642\u9593\uff0c\u7136\u5f8c\u5c31\u5e36\u8457\u58d3\u529b\u885d\u56de\u5bb6\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q12.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich gehe. Wer meine Weiterentwicklung sabotiert, mit dem muss ich ein ernstes Gespr\u00e4ch \u00fcber Grenzen f\u00fchren."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I go. I have to have a serious conversation about boundaries with anyone who sabotages my further development."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voy. Tengo que tener una conversaci\u00f3n seria sobre los l\u00edmites con cualquiera que sabotee mi desarrollo futuro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'y vais. Je dois avoir une conversation s\u00e9rieuse sur les limites avec quiconque sabote mon d\u00e9veloppement ult\u00e9rieur."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0908 \u091c\u093e\u0964 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u0910\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u094d\u092f\u0915\u094d\u0924\u093f \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u0940\u092e\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0917\u0902\u092d\u0940\u0930 \u092c\u093e\u0924\u091a\u0940\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0940 \u0939\u094b\u0917\u0940 \u091c\u094b \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0947 \u0906\u0917\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0938 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e \u0921\u093e\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vado. Devo avere una conversazione seria sui confini con chiunque saboti il \u200b\u200bmio ulteriore sviluppo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u884c\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u79c1\u306e\u3055\u3089\u306a\u308b\u6210\u9577\u3092\u59a8\u5bb3\u3059\u308b\u4eba\u3068\u306f\u3001\u5883\u754c\u7dda\u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u771f\u5263\u306b\u8a71\u3057\u5408\u308f\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uac04\ub2e4. \ub098\uc758 \ubc1c\uc804\uc744 \ubc29\ud574\ud558\ub294 \uc0ac\ub78c\uacfc \uacbd\uacc4\uc5d0 \uad00\ud574 \uc9c4\uc9c0\ud55c \ub300\ud654\ub97c \ub098\ub220\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ga. Ik moet een serieus gesprek voeren over grenzen met iedereen die mijn verdere ontwikkeling saboteert."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "id\u0119. Musz\u0119 powa\u017cnie porozmawia\u0107 o granicach z ka\u017cdym, kto sabotuje m\u00f3j dalszy rozw\u00f3j."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu vou. Preciso ter uma conversa s\u00e9ria sobre limites com qualquer pessoa que sabote meu desenvolvimento futuro."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0443\u0445\u043e\u0436\u0443. \u0421 \u0442\u0435\u043c, \u043a\u0442\u043e \u0441\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u043c\u043e\u0451 \u0434\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0435\u0439\u0448\u0435\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0435, \u043c\u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u044c\u0451\u0437\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0433\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0440 \u043e \u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0430\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ben gidiyorum. Daha fazla geli\u015fimimi sabote eden herkesle s\u0131n\u0131rlar konusunda ciddi bir konu\u015fma yapmam gerekiyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u8981\u8d70\u4e86\u3002\u8c01\u7834\u574f\u6211\u7684\u53d1\u5c55\uff0c\u6211\u5c31\u5fc5\u987b\u4e0e\u4ed6\u8fdb\u884c\u4e00\u6b21\u5173\u4e8e\u754c\u9650\u7684\u4e25\u8083\u5bf9\u8bdd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u53bb\u3002\u6211\u5fc5\u9808\u8207\u4efb\u4f55\u7834\u58de\u6211\u9032\u4e00\u6b65\u767c\u5c55\u7684\u4eba\u5c31\u754c\u9650\u554f\u984c\u9032\u884c\u8a8d\u771f\u7684\u5c0d\u8a71\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q13": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist in einer hitzigen Diskussion. F\u00fcnf Leute vertreten lautstark Meinung A. Du wei\u00dft zu 100\uff05, dass Meinung B richtig ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You are in a heated discussion. Five people loudly support opinion A. You know 100\uff05 that opinion B is correct."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Est\u00e1s en una acalorada discusi\u00f3n. Cinco personas apoyan en voz alta la opini\u00f3n A. Usted sabe al 100\uff05 que la opini\u00f3n B es correcta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous \u00eates dans une discussion anim\u00e9e. Cinq personnes soutiennent haut et fort l\u2019opinion A. Vous savez \u00e0 100 \uff05 que l\u2019opinion B est correcte."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u0917\u0930\u092e\u093e\u0917\u0930\u092e \u091a\u0930\u094d\u091a\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0902. \u092a\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0932\u094b\u0917 \u091c\u094b\u0930-\u0936\u094b\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u092f \u090f \u0915\u093e \u0938\u092e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a 100\uff05 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u0930\u093e\u092f \u092c\u0940 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sei in una discussione accesa. Cinque persone sostengono fortemente l'opinione A. Sai al 100\uff05 che l'opinione B \u00e8 corretta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u767d\u71b1\u3057\u305f\u8b70\u8ad6\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002 5 \u4eba\u304c\u610f\u898b A \u3092\u58f0\u9ad8\u306b\u652f\u6301\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u610f\u898b B \u304c\u6b63\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092 100\uff05 \u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc5f4\ub764 \ud1a0\ub860\uc744 \ubc8c\uc774\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 5\uba85\uc774 A\uc758\uacac\uc744 \ud070 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub85c \uc9c0\uc9c0\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 B\uc758\uacac\uc774 \uc633\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 100\uff05 \uc54c\uace0 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je bent verwikkeld in een verhitte discussie. Vijf mensen steunen luidkeels mening A. Je weet 100\uff05 dat mening B juist is."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeste\u015b w gor\u0105cej dyskusji. Pi\u0119\u0107 os\u00f3b g\u0142o\u015bno popiera opini\u0119 A. Wiesz na 100\uff05, \u017ce opinia B jest s\u0142uszna."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voc\u00ea est\u00e1 em uma discuss\u00e3o acalorada. Cinco pessoas apoiam veementemente a opini\u00e3o A. Voc\u00ea sabe 100\uff05 que a opini\u00e3o B est\u00e1 correta."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0443\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0443\u0435\u0448\u044c \u0432 \u0433\u043e\u0440\u044f\u0447\u0435\u0439 \u0434\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0438. \u041f\u044f\u0442\u044c \u0447\u0435\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043a \u0433\u0440\u043e\u043c\u043a\u043e \u043e\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u043c\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 A. \u0422\u044b \u043d\u0430 100\uff05 \u0443\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 B \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hararetli bir tart\u0131\u015fman\u0131n i\u00e7indesiniz. Be\u015f ki\u015fi y\u00fcksek sesle A fikrini destekliyor. B g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn do\u011fru oldu\u011funu \uff05100 biliyorsunuz."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u6b63\u5904\u4e8e\u4e00\u573a\u6fc0\u70c8\u7684\u8ba8\u8bba\u4e2d\u3002\u4e94\u4e2a\u4eba\u5927\u58f0\u8868\u8fbe\u610f\u89c1A\u3002\u4f60\u767e\u5206\u4e4b\u767e\u786e\u5b9a\u610f\u89c1B\u662f\u6b63\u786e\u7684\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5011\u6b63\u5728\u9032\u884c\u6fc0\u70c8\u7684\u8a0e\u8ad6\u3002\u4e94\u500b\u4eba\u5927\u8072\u652f\u6301\u89c0\u9edeA\u3002\u4f60\u77e5\u9053\u89c0\u9edeB\u662f100\uff05\u6b63\u78ba\u7684\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q13.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich halte den Mund. Gegen f\u00fcnf Leute anzuk\u00e4mpfen, kostet zu viel Kraft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I keep my mouth shut. Fighting against five people takes too much energy."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantengo la boca cerrada. Luchar contra cinco personas requiere demasiada energ\u00eda."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je garde la bouche ferm\u00e9e. Se battre contre cinq personnes demande trop d'\u00e9nergie."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u092e\u0941\u0902\u0939 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. \u092a\u093e\u0901\u091a \u0932\u094b\u0917\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0932\u0921\u093c\u0928\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092c\u0939\u0941\u0924 \u0905\u0927\u093f\u0915 \u090a\u0930\u094d\u091c\u093e \u0932\u0917\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tengo la bocca chiusa. Combattere contro cinque persone richiede troppa energia."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53e3\u3092\u9589\u3056\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002 5\u4eba\u3067\u6226\u3046\u306e\u306f\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u304c\u304b\u304b\u308a\u3059\u304e\u308b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc785\uc744 \ub2e4\ubb3c\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4. \ub2e4\uc12f \uba85\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\ub824\uba74 \uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0\uac00 \ub108\ubb34 \ub9ce\uc774 \uc18c\ubaa8\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik houd mijn mond. Vechten tegen vijf mensen kost te veel energie."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trzymam buzi\u0119 na k\u0142\u00f3dk\u0119. Walka z pi\u0119cioma osobami poch\u0142ania zbyt du\u017co energii."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu mantenho minha boca fechada. Lutar contra cinco pessoas consome muita energia."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0443 \u0440\u043e\u0442 \u043d\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u043a\u0435. \u0421\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0438\u0432 \u043f\u044f\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044b\u0445 \u043b\u044e\u0434\u0435\u0439 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u0438\u0442 \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0448\u043a\u043e\u043c \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u0438\u043b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c7enemi kapal\u0131 tutuyorum. Be\u015f ki\u015fiye kar\u015f\u0131 sava\u015fmak \u00e7ok fazla enerji al\u0131yor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u95ed\u5634\u3002\u548c\u4e94\u4e2a\u4eba\u4f5c\u6597\u4e89\uff0c\u8017\u8d39\u592a\u591a\u7cbe\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u9589\u5634\u3002\u8207\u4e94\u500b\u4eba\u6230\u9b25\u9700\u8981\u592a\u591a\u7684\u7cbe\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q13.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich stimme ihnen am Ende scheinheilig zu, damit die Diskussion endlich aufh\u00f6rt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the end, I hypocritically agree with them so that the discussion finally stops."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al final, hip\u00f3critamente estoy de acuerdo con ellos para que la discusi\u00f3n finalmente se detenga."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au final, je suis hypocritement d\u2019accord avec eux pour que la discussion s\u2019arr\u00eate enfin."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902, \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092a\u093e\u0916\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0928\u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0939\u092e\u0924 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0924\u093e\u0915\u093f \u091a\u0930\u094d\u091a\u093e \u0905\u0902\u0924\u0924\u0903 \u092c\u0902\u0926 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alla fine, sono ipocritamente d'accordo con loro cos\u00ec che la discussione finalmente si interrompa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7d50\u5c40\u3001\u79c1\u306f\u507d\u5584\u7684\u306b\u5f7c\u3089\u306b\u540c\u610f\u3059\u308b\u306e\u3067\u3001\u8b70\u8ad6\u306f\u6700\u7d42\u7684\u306b\u6b62\u307e\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uacb0\uad6d \ub098\ub294 \uc704\uc120\uc801\uc73c\ub85c \uadf8\ub4e4\uc758 \ub9d0\uc5d0 \ub3d9\uc758\ud558\uc5ec \ub9c8\uce68\ub0b4 \ub17c\uc758\uac00 \uc911\ub2e8\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uiteindelijk ben ik het hypocriet met hen eens, zodat de discussie eindelijk stopt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W ko\u0144cu ob\u0142udnie si\u0119 z nimi zgadzam, wi\u0119c dyskusja w ko\u0144cu ustaje."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No final, concordo hipocritamente com eles para que a discuss\u00e3o finalmente pare."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u043e\u0432 \u044f \u043b\u0438\u0446\u0435\u043c\u0435\u0440\u043d\u043e \u0441\u043e\u0433\u043b\u0430\u0448\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u043d\u0438\u043c\u0438, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0434\u0438\u0441\u043a\u0443\u0441\u0441\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0430\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0435\u0446 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0430\u0441\u044c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sonunda, tart\u0131\u015fman\u0131n nihayet durmas\u0131 i\u00e7in ikiy\u00fczl\u00fc bir \u015fekilde onlara kat\u0131l\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u540e\u6211\u865a\u4f2a\u5730\u540c\u610f\u4ed6\u4eec\uff0c\u8fd9\u6837\u4e89\u8bba\u624d\u4f1a\u7ed3\u675f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u5f8c\u6211\u5047\u60fa\u60fa\u5730\u540c\u610f\u4e86\u4ed6\u5011\u7684\u89c0\u9ede\uff0c\u8a0e\u8ad6\u7d42\u65bc\u505c\u6b62\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q13.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich lege meine Argumente f\u00fcr B ruhig dar. Ob sie es kapieren oder nicht, ist nicht mein Problem."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I calmly present my arguments for B. Whether they get it or not is not my problem."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con calma presento mis argumentos a favor de B. Si lo entienden o no, no es mi problema."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je pr\u00e9sente calmement mes arguments en faveur de B. Qu\u2019ils comprennent ou non n\u2019est pas mon probl\u00e8me."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0936\u093e\u0902\u0924\u093f \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0924\u0930\u094d\u0915 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0941\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964 \u091a\u093e\u0939\u0947 \u0935\u0947 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902, \u092f\u0939 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u0938\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presento con calma le mie argomentazioni a favore di B. Che lo capiscano o meno non \u00e8 un mio problema."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u51b7\u9759\u306bB\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u4e3b\u5f35\u3092\u8ff0\u3079\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5f7c\u3089\u304c\u305d\u308c\u3092\u7406\u89e3\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u306f\u79c1\u306e\u554f\u984c\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 B\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ub0b4 \uc8fc\uc7a5\uc744 \uce68\ucc29\ud558\uac8c \uc81c\uc2dc\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\ub4e4\uc774 \uc774\ud574\ud558\ub4e0 \ub9d0\ub4e0 \uadf8\uac83\uc740 \ub0b4 \ubb38\uc81c\uac00 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik presenteer rustig mijn argumenten voor B. Of ze het snappen of niet, is niet mijn probleem."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spokojnie przedstawiam swoje argumenty na rzecz B. To, czy je zrozumiej\u0105, czy nie, nie jest moim problemem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apresento calmamente meus argumentos a favor de B. Se eles entendem ou n\u00e3o, n\u00e3o \u00e9 problema meu."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043a\u043e\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0437\u043b\u0430\u0433\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438 \u0430\u0440\u0433\u0443\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0411. \u041f\u043e\u043d\u044f\u043b\u0438 \u043e\u043d\u0438 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0442, \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u043e\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0430."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sakin bir \u015fekilde B lehine arg\u00fcmanlar\u0131m\u0131 sunuyorum. Anlay\u0131p anlamamalar\u0131 benim sorunum de\u011fil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u51b7\u9759\u5730\u9648\u8ff0\u6211\u7684\u8bba\u70b9\u7ed9B\u3002\u4ed6\u4eec\u662f\u5426\u7406\u89e3\uff0c\u8fd9\u4e0d\u662f\u6211\u7684\u95ee\u9898\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5e73\u975c\u5730\u63d0\u51fa\u6211\u5c0dB\u7684\u8ad6\u9ede\u3002\u4ed6\u5011\u662f\u5426\u660e\u767d\u4e0d\u662f\u6211\u7684\u554f\u984c\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q13.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich schreie rum und versuche, sie mit Aggression von B zu \u00fcberzeugen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I shout and try to convince her of B with aggression."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grito y trato de convencerla de B con agresi\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je crie et j'essaie de la convaincre de B avec agressivit\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u091a\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0932\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902 \u0914\u0930 \u0906\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092e\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0909\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u092e\u091d\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0915\u094b\u0936\u093f\u0936 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Urlo e cerco di convincerla di B con aggressivit\u00e0."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u53eb\u3073\u3001\u653b\u6483\u7684\u306b\u5f7c\u5973\u306bB\u3092\u8aac\u5f97\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3068\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc18c\ub9ac\ub97c \uc9c0\ub974\uba70 \uacf5\uaca9\uc801\uc73c\ub85c B\ub97c \uc124\ub4dd\ud558\ub824\uace0 \ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik schreeuw en probeer haar met agressie van B te overtuigen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krzycz\u0119 i agresj\u0105 pr\u00f3buj\u0119 j\u0105 przekona\u0107 do B."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grito e tento convenc\u00ea-la de B com agressividade."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043a\u0440\u0438\u0447\u0443 \u0438 \u043f\u044b\u0442\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0441 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0449\u044c\u044e \u0430\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0438\u0438 \u0443\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0435\u0451 \u0432 \u0411."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ba\u011f\u0131r\u0131yorum ve sald\u0131rganl\u0131kla onu B'ye ikna etmeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u58f0\u558a\u53eb\uff0c\u8bd5\u56fe\u7528\u653b\u51fb\u6027\u8bf4\u670d\u5979\u76f8\u4fe1B\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5927\u558a\u5927\u53eb\uff0c\u8a66\u5716\u7528\u653b\u64ca\u6027\u7684\u65b9\u5f0f\u8b93\u5979\u76f8\u4fe1 B\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q14": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast bereits 2 Jahre und 10.000\u20ac in ein Projekt gesteckt. Du erkennst heute glasklar: Es ist eine Sackgasse und macht dich ungl\u00fccklich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have already invested 2 years and \u20ac10,000 into a project. Today you see crystal clear: it's a dead end and it's making you unhappy."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ya has invertido 2 a\u00f1os y 10.000\u20ac en un proyecto. Hoy lo ves muy claro: es un callej\u00f3n sin salida y te est\u00e1 haciendo infeliz."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez d\u00e9j\u00e0 investi 2 ans et 10 000 \u20ac dans un projet. Aujourd'hui, vous voyez tr\u00e8s clairement : c'est une impasse et cela vous rend malheureux."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u090f\u0915 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u094b\u091c\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u092e\u0947\u0902 2 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u0914\u0930 \u20ac10,000 \u0915\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0915\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u091c \u0906\u092a \u092c\u093f\u0932\u094d\u0915\u0941\u0932 \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u0926\u0947\u0916 \u0930\u0939\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902: \u092f\u0939 \u090f\u0915 \u0917\u0924\u093f\u0930\u094b\u0927 \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u092f\u0939 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0926\u0941\u0916\u0940 \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hai gi\u00e0 investito 2 anni e 10.000 \u20ac in un progetto. Oggi lo vedi molto chiaramente: \u00e8 un vicolo cieco e ti rende infelice."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u3059\u3067\u306b 2 \u5e74\u9593\u3068 10,000 \u30e6\u30fc\u30ed\u3092\u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u306b\u6295\u8cc7\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4eca\u65e5\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u305d\u308c\u304c\u884c\u304d\u6b62\u307e\u308a\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u305d\u308c\u304c\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3092\u4e0d\u5e78\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u306f\u3063\u304d\u308a\u3068\u7406\u89e3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uc774\ubbf8 \ud504\ub85c\uc81d\ud2b8\uc5d0 2\ub144, \u20ac10,000\ub97c \ud22c\uc790\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc624\ub298 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uba85\ubc31\ud788 \uc54c \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uadf8\uac83\uc740 \ub9c9\ub2e4\ub978 \uace8\ubaa9\uc774\uace0 \uadf8\uac83\uc774 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc744 \ubd88\ud589\ud558\uac8c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uace0 \uc788\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "U heeft al 2 jaar en \u20ac 10.000,- in een project ge\u00efnvesteerd. Vandaag zie je glashelder: het is een doodlopende weg en het maakt je ongelukkig."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zainwestowa\u0142e\u015b ju\u017c 2 lata i 10 000 euro w projekt. Dzi\u015b widzisz to jasno: to \u015blepy zau\u0142ek, kt\u00f3ry sprawia, \u017ce \u200b\u200bjeste\u015b nieszcz\u0119\u015bliwy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J\u00e1 investiu 2 anos e 10.000\u20ac num projeto. Hoje voc\u00ea v\u00ea com clareza: \u00e9 um beco sem sa\u00edda e est\u00e1 te deixando infeliz."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0422\u044b \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0432\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0438\u043b 2 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430 \u0438 10 000\u20ac \u0432 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0435\u043a\u0442. \u0421\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f \u0442\u044b \u044f\u0441\u043d\u043e \u043f\u043e\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044c: \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0442\u0443\u043f\u0438\u043a \u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0441\u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u043d\u044b\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaten bir projeye 2 y\u0131l ve 10.000 \u20ac yat\u0131r\u0131m yapt\u0131n\u0131z. Bug\u00fcn \u00e7ok net g\u00f6r\u00fcyorsunuz: Bu bir \u00e7\u0131kmaz sokak ve sizi mutsuz ediyor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f60\u5df2\u7ecf\u5728\u4e00\u4e2a\u9879\u76ee\u4e0a\u6295\u5165\u4e862\u5e74\u548c10,000\u6b27\u5143\u3002\u4f60\u4eca\u5929\u6e05\u695a\u5730\u8ba4\u8bc6\u5230\uff1a\u8fd9\u662f\u4e00\u4e2a\u6b7b\u80e1\u540c\uff0c\u8ba9\u4f60\u4e0d\u5feb\u4e50\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u5df2\u7d93\u70ba\u4e00\u500b\u9805\u76ee\u6295\u8cc7\u4e86 2 \u5e74\u548c 10,000 \u6b50\u5143\u3002\u4eca\u5929\u4f60\u770b\u5f97\u4e00\u6e05\u4e8c\u695a\uff1a\u9019\u662f\u4e00\u689d\u6b7b\u80e1\u540c\uff0c\u5b83\u8b93\u4f60\u4e0d\u9ad8\u8208\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q14.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich ziehe es durch. Ich habe schon zu viel investiert, um jetzt aufzugeben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'll go through with it. I've already invested too much to give up now."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo har\u00e9. Ya he invertido demasiado para rendirme ahora."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je vais aller jusqu'au bout. J'ai d\u00e9j\u00e0 trop investi pour abandonner maintenant."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e. \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0939\u0940 \u0907\u0924\u0928\u093e \u0928\u093f\u0935\u0947\u0936 \u0915\u0930 \u0932\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u0905\u092c \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u091b\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0928\u093e \u0938\u0902\u092d\u0935 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo far\u00f2 fino in fondo. Ho gi\u00e0 investito troppo per arrendermi adesso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u3084\u308a\u9042\u3052\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3046\u6295\u8cc7\u3057\u3059\u304e\u3066\u3082\u3046\u8ae6\u3081\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub0b4\uac00 \ucc98\ub9ac\ud560\uac8c. \uc9c0\uae08 \ud3ec\uae30\ud558\uae30\uc5d0\ub294 \uc774\ubbf8 \ub108\ubb34 \ub9ce\uc740 \ud22c\uc790\ub97c \ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik ga ermee door. Ik heb al te veel ge\u00efnvesteerd om het nu op te geven."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przejd\u0119 przez to. Za du\u017co ju\u017c zainwestowa\u0142em, \u017ceby teraz rezygnowa\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eu vou em frente com isso. J\u00e1 investi demais para desistir agora."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0443 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0434\u043e \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0430. \u042f \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0448\u043a\u043e\u043c \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0438\u043d\u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0439\u0447\u0430\u0441 \u0441\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bunu halledece\u011fim. Zaten vazge\u00e7emeyecek kadar \u00e7ok yat\u0131r\u0131m yapt\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4f1a\u575a\u6301\u5230\u5e95\u3002\u6211\u5df2\u7ecf\u6295\u5165\u592a\u591a\uff0c\u4e0d\u4f1a\u73b0\u5728\u5c31\u653e\u5f03\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u6703\u5b8c\u6210\u5b83\u3002\u6211\u5df2\u7d93\u6295\u5165\u592a\u591a\uff0c\u73fe\u5728\u4e0d\u80fd\u653e\u68c4\u4e86\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q14.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich h\u00f6re auf, versinke aber monatelang in Reue \u00fcber die verlorene Zeit und das Geld."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I quit but sink into regret for months over the time and money I lost."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Renunci\u00e9, pero me arrepiento durante meses del tiempo y el dinero que perd\u00ed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai arr\u00eat\u00e9 mais je regrette pendant des mois le temps et l'argent que j'ai perdu."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u094c\u0915\u0930\u0940 \u091b\u094b\u0921\u093c \u0926\u0940 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u091c\u094b \u0938\u092e\u092f \u0914\u0930 \u092a\u0948\u0938\u093e \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0916\u094b\u092f\u093e \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0924\u0915 \u092a\u091b\u0924\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ho smesso, ma per mesi sono sprofondato nel rimorso per il tempo e i soldi che ho perso."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u8f9e\u3081\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u5931\u3063\u305f\u6642\u9593\u3068\u304a\u91d1\u306b\u5bfe\u3057\u3066\u4f55\u30f6\u6708\u3082\u5f8c\u6094\u306b\u6c88\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uadf8\ub9cc\ub450\uc5c8\uc9c0\ub9cc \uba87 \ub2ec \ub3d9\uc548 \uc783\uc5b4\ubc84\ub9b0 \uc2dc\uac04\uacfc \ub3c8\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ud6c4\ud68c\uc5d0 \ube60\uc838\ub4e4\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stopte ermee, maar kreeg maandenlang spijt van de tijd en het geld dat ik verloren had."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rzuci\u0142em palenie, ale przez wiele miesi\u0119cy pogr\u0105\u017ca\u0142em si\u0119 w \u017calu z powodu straconego czasu i pieni\u0119dzy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Desisti, mas me arrependi por meses do tempo e do dinheiro que perdi."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044e, \u043d\u043e \u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446\u0435\u0432 \u043f\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0443\u0436\u0430\u044e\u0441\u044c \u0432 \u0441\u043e\u0436\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043e \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u0440\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0433\u0430\u0445."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "B\u0131rakt\u0131m ama kaybetti\u011fim zaman ve paradan dolay\u0131 aylarca pi\u015fmanl\u0131k duydum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u505c\u6b62\u4e86\uff0c\u4f46\u5374\u957f\u65f6\u95f4\u6c89\u6d78\u5728\u5bf9\u5931\u53bb\u7684\u65f6\u95f4\u548c\u91d1\u94b1\u7684\u61ca\u6094\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u653e\u68c4\u4e86\uff0c\u4f46\u5e7e\u500b\u6708\u4f86\u6211\u5c0d\u5931\u53bb\u7684\u6642\u9593\u548c\u91d1\u9322\u611f\u5230\u5f8c\u6094\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q14.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich h\u00f6re heute auf. Die 2 Jahre sind Sunk Cost. Morgen starte ich bei null in eine neue Richtung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I'm quitting today. The 2 years are a sunk cost. Tomorrow I'll start from scratch in a new direction."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo dejo hoy. Los 2 a\u00f1os son un costo hundido. Ma\u00f1ana empezar\u00e9 de cero en una nueva direcci\u00f3n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'arr\u00eate aujourd'hui. Les 2 ans repr\u00e9sentent un co\u00fbt irr\u00e9cup\u00e9rable. Demain, je repartirai de z\u00e9ro dans une nouvelle direction."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0906\u091c \u091b\u094b\u0921\u093c \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0902. 2 \u0938\u093e\u0932 \u090f\u0915 \u0921\u0942\u092c\u0940 \u0939\u0941\u0908 \u0932\u093e\u0917\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0915\u0932 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u0908 \u0926\u093f\u0936\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0936\u0942\u0928\u094d\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0941\u0906\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0942\u0902\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smetto oggi. I 2 anni sono un costo irrecuperabile. Domani ricomincer\u00f2 da zero in una nuova direzione."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eca\u65e5\u306f\u8f9e\u3081\u307e\u3059\u3002 2\u5e74\u9593\u306f\u57cb\u6ca1\u8cbb\u7528\u3067\u3059\u3002\u660e\u65e5\u306f\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u65b9\u5411\u306b\u5411\u304b\u3063\u3066\u30bc\u30ed\u304b\u3089\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u30c8\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc624\ub298 \uadf8\ub9cc \ub450\uaca0\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. 2\ub144\uc740 \ub9e4\ubab0\ube44\uc6a9\uc774\ub2e4. \ub0b4\uc77c \ub098\ub294 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ubc29\ud5a5\uc73c\ub85c \ucc98\uc74c\ubd80\ud130 \ub2e4\uc2dc \uc2dc\uc791\ud560 \uac83\uc774\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik stop vandaag. De 2 jaar zijn verzonken kosten. Morgen begin ik helemaal opnieuw in een nieuwe richting."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dzi\u015b odchodz\u0119. Te 2 lata to koszt utopiony. Jutro zaczn\u0119 od zera w nowym kierunku."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estou desistindo hoje. Os 2 anos s\u00e3o um custo irrecuper\u00e1vel. Amanh\u00e3 come\u00e7arei do zero em uma nova dire\u00e7\u00e3o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0449\u0430\u044e \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f. \u042d\u0442\u0438 2 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430 \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0431\u0435\u0437\u0432\u043e\u0437\u0432\u0440\u0430\u0442\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044b. \u0417\u0430\u0432\u0442\u0440\u0430 \u044f \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u044e \u0441 \u043d\u0443\u043b\u044f \u0432 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043c \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bug\u00fcn b\u0131rak\u0131yorum. 2 y\u0131l bat\u0131k maliyettir. Yar\u0131n yeni bir y\u00f6nde s\u0131f\u0131rdan ba\u015flayaca\u011f\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u505c\u6b62\u3002\u8fd9\u4e24\u5e74\u662f\u6c89\u6ca1\u6210\u672c\u3002\u660e\u5929\u6211\u4ece\u96f6\u5f00\u59cb\u8d70\u5411\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u7684\u65b9\u5411\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4eca\u5929\u8981\u8fad\u8077\u4e86\u90192\u5e74\u662f\u6c89\u6c92\u6210\u672c\u3002\u660e\u5929\uff0c\u6211\u5c07\u671d\u8457\u65b0\u7684\u65b9\u5411\u5f9e\u982d\u958b\u59cb\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q14.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich mache halbherzig weiter, w\u00e4hrend ich heimlich schon nach Alternativen suche."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I carry on half-heartedly while secretly looking for alternatives."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contin\u00fao a medias mientras busco alternativas en secreto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je continue sans enthousiasme tout en cherchant secr\u00e8tement des alternatives."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902 \u0906\u0927\u0947-\u0905\u0927\u0942\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0928 \u0938\u0947 \u0917\u0941\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a \u0924\u0932\u093e\u0936\u0924\u093e \u0930\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0942\u0901\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vado avanti con poca convinzione mentre segretamente cerco alternative."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bc6\u304b\u306b\u4ee3\u66ff\u6848\u3092\u63a2\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3001\u4e2d\u9014\u534a\u7aef\u306b\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub0a8\ubab0\ub798 \ub300\uc548\uc744 \ucc3e\uc73c\uba74\uc11c \ubb35\ubb35\ud788 \uacc4\uc18d\ud55c\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halfslachtig ga ik door terwijl ik stiekem naar alternatieven zoek."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Id\u0119 dalej bez przekonania, w tajemnicy szukaj\u0105c alternatyw."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuo sem entusiasmo enquanto procuro secretamente alternativas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u044e \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0447\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0441\u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044f \u0440\u0443\u043a\u0430\u0432\u0430, \u0432 \u0442\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u044f \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0442\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e \u0438\u0449\u0443 \u0430\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0432\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gizlice alternatifler ararken g\u00f6n\u00fcls\u00fczce devam ediyorum."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u534a\u5fc3\u534a\u610f\u5730\u7ee7\u7eed\uff0c\u540c\u65f6\u6697\u4e2d\u5df2\u7ecf\u5728\u5bfb\u627e\u5176\u4ed6\u9009\u62e9\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u4e00\u908a\u534a\u5fc3\u534a\u610f\u5730\u7e7c\u7e8c\uff0c\u4e00\u908a\u6697\u81ea\u5c0b\u627e\u66ff\u4ee3\u65b9\u6848\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q15": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ist f\u00fcr dich das Schlimmste, das dir am Ende deines Lebens passieren k\u00f6nnte?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What do you think is the worst thing that could happen to you at the end of your life?"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00bfQu\u00e9 crees que es lo peor que te podr\u00eda pasar al final de tu vida?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Selon vous, quelle est la pire chose qui puisse vous arriver \u00e0 la fin de votre vie ?"
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0928\u0941\u0938\u093e\u0930 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u091c\u0940\u0935\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0905\u0902\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0941\u0930\u0940 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b \u0938\u0915\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quale pensi sia la cosa peggiore che potrebbe accaderti alla fine della tua vita?"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4eba\u751f\u306e\u7d42\u308f\u308a\u306b\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306b\u8d77\u3053\u308b\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u306e\u3042\u308b\u6700\u60aa\u306e\u3053\u3068\u306f\u4f55\u3060\u3068\u601d\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304b?"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc778\uc0dd\uc758 \ub9c8\uc9c0\ub9c9\uc5d0 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0\uac8c \uc77c\uc5b4\ub0a0 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \ucd5c\uc545\uc758 \uc77c\uc740 \ubb34\uc5c7\uc774\ub77c\uace0 \uc0dd\uac01\ud569\ub2c8\uae4c?"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat is volgens u het ergste dat u aan het einde van uw leven kan overkomen?"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jak my\u015blisz, co najgorszego mo\u017ce Ci\u0119 spotka\u0107 pod koniec \u017cycia?"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qual voc\u00ea acha que \u00e9 a pior coisa que poderia acontecer com voc\u00ea no final da sua vida?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0427\u0442\u043e \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0445\u0443\u0434\u0448\u0435\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043c\u043e\u0433\u043b\u043e \u0431\u044b \u0441 \u0442\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0439 \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435 \u0442\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0438?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sizce hayat\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n sonunda ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131za gelebilecek en k\u00f6t\u00fc \u015fey nedir?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bf9\u4f60\u6765\u8bf4\uff0c\u5728\u4f60\u751f\u547d\u7684\u5c3d\u5934\u53ef\u80fd\u53d1\u751f\u7684\u6700\u7cdf\u7cd5\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u60a8\u8a8d\u70ba\u5728\u60a8\u751f\u547d\u7684\u6700\u5f8c\u968e\u6bb5\u53ef\u80fd\u767c\u751f\u7684\u6700\u7cdf\u7cd5\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u662f\u4ec0\u9ebc\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q15.a": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niemand erinnert sich an mich oder meine Leistungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nobody remembers me or my achievements."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nadie se acuerda de m\u00ed ni de mis logros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personne ne se souvient de moi ni de mes r\u00e9alisations."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u094b\u0908 \u092d\u0940 \u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u092f\u093e \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0909\u092a\u0932\u092c\u094d\u0927\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092f\u093e\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0930\u0916\u0924\u093e."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nessuno si ricorda di me o dei miei successi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ab0\u3082\u79c1\u3084\u79c1\u306e\u696d\u7e3e\u3092\u899a\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\ubb34\ub3c4 \ub098\ub098 \ub098\uc758 \uc5c5\uc801\uc744 \uae30\uc5b5\ud558\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niemand herinnert zich mij of mijn prestaties."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nikt nie pami\u0119ta mnie i moich osi\u0105gni\u0119\u0107."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ningu\u00e9m se lembra de mim ou de minhas conquistas."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041d\u0438\u043a\u0442\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043d\u0438\u0442 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u0441\u043b\u0443\u0433\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kimse beni ya da ba\u015far\u0131lar\u0131m\u0131 hat\u0131rlam\u0131yor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u8bb0\u5f97\u6211\u6216\u6211\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6c92\u6709\u4eba\u8a18\u5f97\u6211\u6216\u6211\u7684\u6210\u5c31\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q15.b": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich habe mich zu Tode gearbeitet und das Leben nie genossen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I worked myself to death and never enjoyed life."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabaj\u00e9 hasta la muerte y nunca disfrut\u00e9 de la vida."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'ai travaill\u00e9 jusqu'\u00e0 ma mort et je n'ai jamais appr\u00e9ci\u00e9 la vie."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u092e\u094c\u0924 \u0924\u0915 \u0915\u093e\u092e \u0915\u093f\u092f\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u091c\u0940\u0935\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0906\u0928\u0902\u0926 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0932\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ho lavorato fino alla morte e non mi sono mai goduto la vita."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u6b7b\u306c\u307b\u3069\u50cd\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u304c\u3001\u4eba\u751f\u3092\u697d\u3057\u3093\u3060\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \uc8fd\uc744 \ub54c\uae4c\uc9c0 \uc77c\ud588\uace0 \uc778\uc0dd\uc744 \uc990\uae30\uc9c0 \ubabb\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik heb mezelf doodgewerkt en heb nooit van het leven genoten."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zapracowa\u0142em si\u0119 na \u015bmier\u0107 i nigdy nie cieszy\u0142em si\u0119 \u017cyciem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trabalhei at\u00e9 a morte e nunca aproveitei a vida."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u043b \u0434\u043e \u0441\u043c\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0438 \u0438 \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u043b\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0441\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u044c\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00d6lene kadar \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131m ve hayattan hi\u00e7 keyif almad\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u62fc\u547d\u5de5\u4f5c\uff0c\u5374\u4ece\u672a\u4eab\u53d7\u8fc7\u751f\u6d3b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5de5\u4f5c\u5230\u6b7b\uff0c\u537b\u5f9e\u672a\u4eab\u53d7\u904e\u751f\u6d3b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q15.c": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich muss mir eingestehen, dass ich all mein Potenzial aus Angst vor Anstrengung verschwendet habe."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have to admit to myself that I wasted all my potential because of the fear of effort."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tengo que admitirme a m\u00ed mismo que desperdici\u00e9 todo mi potencial por miedo al esfuerzo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je dois admettre que j'ai g\u00e2ch\u00e9 tout mon potentiel \u00e0 cause de la peur de l'effort."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d\u0947 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u094d\u0935\u0940\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0917\u093e \u0915\u093f \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092f\u093e\u0938 \u0915\u0947 \u0921\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u0923 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u094d\u0937\u092e\u0924\u093e \u092c\u0930\u094d\u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devo ammettere a me stesso che ho sprecato tutto il mio potenziale per paura della fatica."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u52aa\u529b\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3078\u306e\u6050\u6016\u306e\u305b\u3044\u3067\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u3092\u3059\u3079\u3066\u7121\u99c4\u306b\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u81ea\u8eab\u306b\u8a8d\u3081\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u306a\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub178\ub825\uc5d0 \ub300\ud55c \ub450\ub824\uc6c0 \ub54c\ubb38\uc5d0 \ub098\uc758 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc7a0\uc7ac\ub825\uc744 \ub0ad\ube44\ud588\ub2e4\ub294 \uac83\uc744 \uc2a4\uc2a4\ub85c \uc778\uc815\ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik moet mezelf toegeven dat ik al mijn potentieel heb verspild vanwege de angst voor inspanning."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Musz\u0119 przyzna\u0107 przed sob\u0105, \u017ce zmarnowa\u0142am ca\u0142y sw\u00f3j potencja\u0142 ze strachu przed wysi\u0142kiem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tenho que admitir para mim mesmo que desperdicei todo o meu potencial por causa do medo do esfor\u00e7o."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042f \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0435\u043d \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043b \u0432\u0435\u0441\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043d\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b \u0438\u0437 \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0445\u0430 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0443\u0441\u0438\u043b\u0438\u0435\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u00c7aba korkusu y\u00fcz\u00fcnden t\u00fcm potansiyelimi bo\u015fa harcad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131 kendime itiraf etmeliyim."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u987b\u627f\u8ba4\uff0c\u6211\u56e0\u4e3a\u5bb3\u6015\u52aa\u529b\u800c\u6d6a\u8d39\u4e86\u6211\u6240\u6709\u7684\u6f5c\u529b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u5fc5\u9808\u5411\u81ea\u5df1\u627f\u8a8d\uff0c\u7531\u65bc\u5bb3\u6015\u52aa\u529b\uff0c\u6211\u6d6a\u8cbb\u4e86\u6240\u6709\u7684\u6f5b\u529b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.mental.q15.d": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich wurde von anderen Menschen dominiert und habe nie mein eigenes Leben gelebt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I was dominated by other people and never lived my own life."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estaba dominada por otras personas y nunca viv\u00ed mi propia vida."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J'\u00e9tais domin\u00e9 par les autres et je n'ai jamais v\u00e9cu ma propre vie."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u092e\u0941\u091d \u092a\u0930 \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f \u0932\u094b\u0917\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u092d\u0941\u0924\u094d\u0935 \u0925\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u092e\u0948\u0902\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u092d\u0940 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u093e \u091c\u0940\u0935\u0928 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono stato dominato da altre persone e non ho mai vissuto la mia vita."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79c1\u306f\u4ed6\u4eba\u306b\u652f\u914d\u3055\u308c\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u4eba\u751f\u3092\u751f\u304d\u305f\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub098\ub294 \ub2e4\ub978 \uc0ac\ub78c\ub4e4\uc5d0 \uc758\ud574 \uc9c0\ubc30\ub2f9\ud588\uace0 \uacb0\ucf54 \ub0b4 \uc790\uc2e0\uc758 \uc0b6\uc744 \uc0b4\uc544\ubcf8 \uc801\uc774 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ik werd gedomineerd door andere mensen en leefde nooit mijn eigen leven."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By\u0142am zdominowana przez innych ludzi i nigdy nie \u017cy\u0142am w\u0142asnym \u017cyciem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fui dominado por outras pessoas e nunca vivi minha pr\u00f3pria vida."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041c\u0435\u043d\u044f \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0438\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u0438\u0435 \u043b\u044e\u0434\u0438, \u0438 \u044f \u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u043b \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0439 \u0441\u043e\u0431\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u044c\u044e."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ba\u015fkalar\u0131n\u0131n egemenli\u011fi alt\u0131ndayd\u0131m ve hi\u00e7bir zaman kendi hayat\u0131m\u0131 ya\u015famad\u0131m."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u88ab\u5176\u4ed6\u4eba\u652f\u914d\uff0c\u4ece\u672a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u751f\u6d3b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6211\u88ab\u5225\u4eba\u652f\u914d\uff0c\u5f9e\u4f86\u6c92\u6709\u904e\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u751f\u6d3b\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "assessment.nav.title": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assessment"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Assessment"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Evaluaci\u00f3n"
          }
        },
