            "value": "Un toque de arte y atemporalidad."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une touche d'art et d'intemporalit\u00e9."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0915\u0932\u093e \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u093e\u0932\u093e\u0924\u0940\u0924\u0924\u093e \u0915\u0940 \u090f\u0915 \u091d\u0932\u0915\u0964"
