    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tip.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "R\u00e4ume alle Energy Drinks aus dem Haus \u2013 was nicht da ist, wird nicht getrunken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove all energy drinks from the house \u2013 what's not there won't be drunk."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retira todas las bebidas energ\u00e9ticas de casa: lo que no est\u00e1 no se bebe."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retire toutes les boissons \u00e9nergisantes de la maison \u2013 ce qui n'est pas l\u00e0 ne sera pas bu."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0938\u093e\u0930\u0947 \u090f\u0928\u0930\u094d\u091c\u0940 \u0921\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0902\u0915 \u0918\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u094b \u2013 \u091c\u094b \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948, \u0935\u0939 \u092a\u0940\u092f\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rimuovi tutte le bevande energetiche da casa \u2013 quello che non c'\u00e8 non viene bevuto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a8\u30ca\u30b8\u30fc\u30c9\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u3092\u3059\u3079\u3066\u5bb6\u304b\u3089\u53d6\u308a\u9664\u304d\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u306a\u3051\u308c\u3070\u98f2\u3081\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc9d1\uc5d0\uc11c \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0 \ub4dc\ub9c1\ud06c\ub97c \uce58\uc6b0\uc138\uc694 \u2013 \uc5c6\ub294 \uac83\uc740 \ub9c8\uc2e4 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ruim alle energiedranken op uit huis \u2013 wat er niet is, wordt niet gedronken."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usu\u0144 wszystkie napoje energetyczne z domu \u2013 czego nie ma, nie zostanie wypite."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remova todos os energ\u00e9ticos de casa \u2013 o que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 l\u00e1 n\u00e3o ser\u00e1 bebido."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0423\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0438\u0437 \u0434\u043e\u043c\u0430 \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442\u043a\u0438 \u2014 \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0443 \u0432\u0430\u0441 \u0438\u0445 \u043d\u0435\u0442, \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0435\u0439\u0442\u0435."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "T\u00fcm enerji i\u00e7eceklerini evden \u00e7\u0131kar \u2013 olmayan i\u00e7ilmez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u628a\u5bb6\u91cc\u6240\u6709\u7684\u80fd\u91cf\u996e\u6599\u62ff\u8d70\u2014\u2014\u5982\u679c\u6ca1\u6709\uff0c\u5c31\u4e0d\u8981\u559d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u628a\u5bb6\u88e1\u6240\u6709\u7684\u80fd\u91cf\u98f2\u6599\u62ff\u8d70\u2014\u2014\u5982\u679c\u6c92\u6709\uff0c\u5c31\u4e0d\u8981\u559d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tip.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Energy Drinks erzeugen eine Scheinenergie, die deinen Schlaf ruiniert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Energy drinks create a false energy that ruins your sleep."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las bebidas energ\u00e9ticas crean una energ\u00eda falsa que arruina tu sue\u00f1o."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les boissons \u00e9nergisantes cr\u00e9ent une fausse \u00e9nergie qui ruine ton sommeil."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u090a\u0930\u094d\u091c\u093e \u092a\u0947\u092f \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u0915\u0932\u0940 \u090a\u0930\u094d\u091c\u093e \u0909\u0924\u094d\u092a\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u0928\u0940\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u092c\u0930\u094d\u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bevande energetiche creano un'energia falsa che rovina il tuo sonno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30a8\u30ca\u30b8\u30fc\u30c9\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u306f\u7761\u7720\u3092\u53f0\u7121\u3057\u306b\u3059\u308b\u507d\u306e\u30a8\u30cd\u30eb\u30ae\u30fc\u3092\u751f\u307f\u51fa\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0 \ub4dc\ub9c1\ud06c\ub294 \uc218\uba74\uc744 \ub9dd\uce58\ub294 \uac00\uc9dc \uc5d0\ub108\uc9c0\ub97c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4 \ub0c5\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Energiedranken cre\u00ebren schijnenergie die je slaap ru\u00efneert."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Napoje energetyczne tworz\u0105 fa\u0142szyw\u0105 energi\u0119, kt\u00f3ra niszczy tw\u00f3j sen."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Energ\u00e9ticos criam uma energia falsa que arru\u00edna seu sono."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u042d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u043f\u0438\u0442\u043a\u0438 \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0444\u0430\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u0432\u0443\u044e \u044d\u043d\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0438\u044e, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0430\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0438\u0442 \u0432\u0430\u0448 \u0441\u043e\u043d."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enerji i\u00e7ecekleri uykunuzu mahveden sahte bir enerji yarat\u0131r."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u80fd\u91cf\u996e\u6599\u4f1a\u4ea7\u751f\u865a\u5047\u80fd\u91cf\uff0c\u4ece\u800c\u7834\u574f\u60a8\u7684\u7761\u7720\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u80fd\u91cf\u98f2\u6599\u6703\u7522\u751f\u865b\u5047\u80fd\u91cf\uff0c\u7834\u58de\u60a8\u7684\u7761\u7720\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tip.3": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ersetze es durch Wasser + Zitrone \u2013 stelle es schon abends bereit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replace it with water + lemon \u2013 prepare it the evening before."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sustit\u00fayelo por agua con lim\u00f3n: prep\u00e1ralo ya por la noche."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplace-le par de l'eau + citron \u2013 pr\u00e9pare-le d\u00e8s la veille au soir."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u093e\u0928\u0940 + \u0928\u0940\u0902\u092c\u0942 \u0938\u0947 \u092c\u0926\u0932 \u0926\u0947\u0902 \u2013 \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0939\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u0947 \u0930\u093e\u0924 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0924\u0948\u092f\u093e\u0930 \u0930\u0916\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sostituiscilo con acqua + limone \u2013 preparalo gi\u00e0 la sera prima."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u30ec\u30e2\u30f3\u6c34\u306b\u7f6e\u304d\u63db\u3048\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u524d\u591c\u306b\u6e96\u5099\u3057\u3066\u304a\u304f\u3068\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ub808\ubaac \ubb3c\ub85c \ub300\uccb4\ud558\uc138\uc694 \u2013 \uc804\ub0a0 \uc800\ub141\uc5d0 \ubbf8\ub9ac \uc900\ube44\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vervang het door water + citroen \u2013 zet het al 's avonds klaar."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zast\u0105p go wod\u0105 + cytryn\u0105 \u2013 przygotuj go ju\u017c wieczorem."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Substitua por \u00e1gua + lim\u00e3o \u2013 prepare j\u00e1 na noite anterior."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0417\u0430\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0439 + \u043b\u0438\u043c\u043e\u043d\u043e\u043c \u2013 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0433\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0432\u044c\u0442\u0435 \u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435\u0440\u043e\u043c."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Su + limonla de\u011fi\u015ftir \u2013 \u00f6nceki ak\u015fam haz\u0131rla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u6c34+\u67e0\u6aac\u4ee3\u66ff\u2014\u2014\u665a\u4e0a\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7528\u6c34+\u6ab8\u6aac\u4ee3\u66ff\uff0d\u665a\u4e0a\u6e96\u5099\u597d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tip.4": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z\u00e4hle die leeren Dosen eines Monats auf \u2013 der Preis und die Koffeinmenge \u00fcberraschen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Count the empty cans from a month \u2013 the price and caffeine amount will surprise you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuenta las latas vac\u00edas de un mes: el precio y la cantidad de cafe\u00edna te sorprender\u00e1n."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compte les canettes vides d'un mois \u2013 le prix et la quantit\u00e9 de caf\u00e9ine te surprendront."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u090f\u0915 \u092e\u0939\u0940\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0916\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u0921\u093f\u092c\u094d\u092c\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0940 \u0917\u093f\u0928\u0924\u0940 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u2013 \u0915\u0940\u092e\u0924 \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0948\u092b\u0940\u0928 \u0915\u0940 \u092e\u093e\u0924\u094d\u0930\u093e \u0906\u0936\u094d\u091a\u0930\u094d\u092f\u091a\u0915\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0917\u0940\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conta le lattine vuote di un mese \u2013 il prezzo e la quantit\u00e0 di caffeina ti sorprenderanno."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1\u30f6\u6708\u5206\u306e\u7a7a\u304d\u7f36\u3092\u6570\u3048\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002\u305d\u306e\u4fa1\u683c\u3068\u30ab\u30d5\u30a7\u30a4\u30f3\u91cf\u306b\u9a5a\u304f\u306f\u305a\u3067\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\ud55c \ub2ec \ub3d9\uc548\uc758 \ube48 \uce94\uc744 \uc138\uc5b4\ubcf4\uc138\uc694 \u2013 \uac00\uaca9\uacfc \uce74\ud398\uc778 \uc591\uc774 \ub180\ub77c\uc6b8 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tel de lege blikjes van een maand op \u2013 de prijs en hoeveelheid cafe\u00efne zullen je verbazen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Policz puste puszki z miesi\u0105ca \u2013 cena i ilo\u015b\u0107 kofeiny ci\u0119 zaskocz\u0105."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conte as latas vazias de um m\u00eas \u2013 o pre\u00e7o e a quantidade de cafe\u00edna v\u00e3o te surpreender."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u0441\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044b\u0435 \u0431\u0430\u043d\u043a\u0438 \u0437\u0430 \u043c\u0435\u0441\u044f\u0446 \u2013 \u0446\u0435\u043d\u0430 \u0438 \u043a\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e \u043a\u043e\u0444\u0435\u0438\u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0430\u0441 \u0443\u0434\u0438\u0432\u044f\u0442."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir ayl\u0131k bo\u015f kutular\u0131 say \u2013 fiyat ve kafein miktar\u0131 seni \u015fa\u015f\u0131rtacak."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6570\u4e00\u6570\u4e00\u4e2a\u6708\u5185\u7684\u7a7a\u7f50\u2014\u2014\u5496\u5561\u56e0\u7684\u4ef7\u683c\u548c\u542b\u91cf\u4f1a\u8ba9\u4f60\u5927\u5403\u4e00\u60ca\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6578\u4e00\u6578\u4e00\u500b\u6708\u5167\u7684\u7a7a\u7f50\u2014\u2014\u5496\u5561\u56e0\u7684\u50f9\u683c\u548c\u542b\u91cf\u6703\u8b93\u4f60\u5927\u5403\u4e00\u9a5a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.energy_drink_kiste.tips": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Schlechte Gewohnheit loswerden (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Unsichtbar machen: Entferne die Ausl\u00f6ser aus deinem Sichtfeld.\n2. Unattraktiv machen: Mache dir die negativen Folgen bewusst.\n3. Schwierig machen: Baue H\u00fcrden ein (z.B. Apps l\u00f6schen, Stecker ziehen).\n4. Unbefriedigend machen: Verbinde die Ausf\u00fchrung mit einer Strafe.\n\n**Gute Gewohnheit etablieren (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Offensichtlich machen: Platziere den Ausl\u00f6ser gut sichtbar.\n2. Attraktiv machen: Verbinde es mit etwas, das du magst.\n3. Einfach machen: Reduziere die H\u00fcrden auf ein Minimum (z.B. nur 2 Minuten).\n4. Befriedigend machen: Belohne dich direkt im Anschluss."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**\u0916\u0930\u093e\u092c \u0906\u0926\u0924 \u0938\u0947 \u091b\u0941\u091f\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093e \u092a\u093e\u090f\u0902 (Energy Drinks)**\n1. \u0905\u0926\u0943\u0936\u094d\u092f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0928\u091c\u093c\u0930 \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u092e\u0928\u0947 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0917\u0930\u094d\u0938 \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0902\u0964\n2. \u0905\u092a\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0947\u0902\u0964\n3. \u092e\u0941\u0936\u094d\u0915\u093f\u0932 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e\u090f\u0901 \u0921\u093e\u0932\u0947\u0902 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947, \u0910\u092a\u094d\u0938 \u0939\u091f\u093e\u090f\u0901, \u092a\u094d\u0932\u0917 \u0928\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0932\u0947\u0902)\u0964\n4. \u0905\u0938\u0902\u0924\u094b\u0937\u091c\u0928\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0915\u094b \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0938\u091c\u093e \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947\u0902\u0964\n\n**\u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u0940 \u0906\u0926\u0924 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092a\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902 (\u092a\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u092a\u0940\u0928\u093e)**\n1. \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u0906\u0938\u093e\u0928\u0940 \u0938\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0908 \u0926\u0947\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0940 \u091c\u0917\u0939 \u092a\u0930 \u0930\u0916\u0947\u0902\u0964\n2. \u0906\u0915\u0930\u094d\u0937\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u091a\u0940\u091c\u093c \u0915\u0947 \u0938\u093e\u0925 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0947 \u0906\u092a \u092a\u0938\u0902\u0926 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964\n3. \u0906\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u092a\u0930 \u0932\u093e\u090f\u0901 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947, \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 2 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f)\u0964\n4. \u0938\u0902\u0924\u094b\u0937\u091c\u0928\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0916\u0941\u0926 \u0915\u094b \u0907\u0928\u093e\u092e \u0926\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Energy Drinks)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Wasser trinken)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
