        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calcule: quanto voc\u00ea gastou em compras no aplicativo este ano?"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u043e\u0441\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435: \u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0432\u044b \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u0432\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043f\u043e\u043a\u0443\u043f\u043a\u0438 \u0432 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0443?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hesapla: bu y\u0131l uygulama i\u00e7i sat\u0131n al\u0131mlara ne kadar harcad\u0131n?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ba1\u7b97\uff1a\u4eca\u5e74\u60a8\u5728\u5e94\u7528\u5185\u8d2d\u4e70\u4e0a\u82b1\u4e86\u591a\u5c11\u94b1\uff1f"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8a08\u7b97\uff1a\u4eca\u5e74\u60a8\u5728\u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f\u5167\u8cfc\u8cb7\u4e0a\u82b1\u4e86\u591a\u5c11\u9322\uff1f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.lootbox_zockerabo.tips": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Schlechte Gewohnheit loswerden (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Unsichtbar machen: Entferne die Ausl\u00f6ser aus deinem Sichtfeld.\n2. Unattraktiv machen: Mache dir die negativen Folgen bewusst.\n3. Schwierig machen: Baue H\u00fcrden ein (z.B. Apps l\u00f6schen, Stecker ziehen).\n4. Unbefriedigend machen: Verbinde die Ausf\u00fchrung mit einer Strafe.\n\n**Gute Gewohnheit etablieren (Sparen)**\n1. Offensichtlich machen: Platziere den Ausl\u00f6ser gut sichtbar.\n2. Attraktiv machen: Verbinde es mit etwas, das du magst.\n3. Einfach machen: Reduziere die H\u00fcrden auf ein Minimum (z.B. nur 2 Minuten).\n4. Befriedigend machen: Belohne dich direkt im Anschluss."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**\u0916\u0930\u093e\u092c \u0906\u0926\u0924 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e (\u091c\u0941\u0906/\u0932\u0942\u091f\u092c\u0949\u0915\u094d\u0938)**\n1. \u0905\u0926\u0943\u0936\u094d\u092f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0926\u0943\u0936\u094d\u092f \u0915\u094d\u0937\u0947\u0924\u094d\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0917\u0930\u094d\u0938 \u0939\u091f\u093e \u0926\u0947\u0902\u0964\n2. \u0905\u092a\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u092a\u0930\u093f\u0923\u093e\u092e\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0905\u0935\u0917\u0924 \u0939\u094b\u0902\u0964\n3. \u0915\u0920\u093f\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e\u090f\u0902 \u0921\u093e\u0932\u0947\u0902 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0910\u092a\u094d\u0938 \u0939\u091f\u093e\u0928\u093e, \u092a\u094d\u0932\u0917 \u0928\u093f\u0915\u093e\u0932\u0928\u093e)\u0964\n4. \u0905\u0938\u0902\u0924\u094b\u0937\u091c\u0928\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0928\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0928 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0902\u0921 \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947\u0902\u0964\n\n**\u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u0940 \u0906\u0926\u0924 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u092a\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e (\u092c\u091a\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u093e)**\n1. \u0938\u094d\u092a\u0937\u094d\u091f \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u091f\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0917\u0930 \u0915\u094b \u0905\u091a\u094d\u091b\u0940 \u0924\u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u0908 \u0926\u0947\u0928\u0947 \u0935\u093e\u0932\u0947 \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0930\u0916\u0947\u0902\u0964\n2. \u0906\u0915\u0930\u094d\u0937\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0907\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0940 \u0910\u0938\u0940 \u091a\u0940\u091c \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u094b\u0921\u093c\u0947\u0902 \u091c\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u092a\u0938\u0902\u0926 \u0939\u094b\u0964\n3. \u0906\u0938\u093e\u0928 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u092c\u093e\u0927\u093e\u0913\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u0928\u0924\u092e \u0924\u0915 \u0918\u091f\u093e\u090f\u0902 (\u091c\u0948\u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 2 \u092e\u093f\u0928\u091f)\u0964\n4. \u0938\u0902\u0924\u094b\u0937\u091c\u0928\u0915 \u092c\u0928\u093e\u090f\u0902: \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0924\u0941\u0930\u0902\u0924 \u092c\u093e\u0926 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u092f\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092a\u0941\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0915\u093e\u0930 \u0926\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Gl\u00fccksspiel/Lootboxen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Sparen)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
