            "value": "Weed Shield \u3092\u756a\u53f7 1\u30012\u3001\u304a\u3088\u3073 3 \u306b\u30c9\u30e9\u30c3\u30b0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc704\ub4dc \uc274\ub4dc\ub97c \uc22b\uc790 1, 2, 3\uc73c\ub85c \ub4dc\ub798\uadf8\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sleep het onkruidschild naar de nummers 1, 2 en 3."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Przeci\u0105gnij Tarcz\u0119 chwast\u00f3w na cyfry 1, 2 i 3."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrasta o escudo para os n\u00fameros 1, 2 e 3."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u041f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u043a \u0441\u043e\u0440\u043d\u044f\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u043d\u0430 \u0446\u0438\u0444\u0440\u044b 1, 2 \u0438 3."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ot Kalkan\u0131n\u0131 1, 2 ve 3 numaralar\u0131n\u0131n \u00fczerine s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c06\u6742\u8349\u7b26\u53f7\u62d6\u5230\u6570\u5b57 1\u30012 \u548c 3 \u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5c07\u96dc\u8349\u7b26\u865f\u62d6\u66f3\u5230\u6578\u5b57 1\u30012 \u548c 3 \u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "weed.shield.ritual.drag_active": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unkraut-Schild aktiv \u2013 zieh es auf 1, 2 und 3, um das Unkraut zu entfernen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weed Shield active \u2013 drag it onto 1, 2, and 3 to remove the weed."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escudo activo \u2013 arr\u00e1stralo a 1, 2 y 3."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bouclier actif \u2013 glisse-le sur 1, 2 et 3."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u091d\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0942-\u0922\u093e\u0932 \u0938\u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f \u2013 \u0916\u0930\u092a\u0924\u0935\u093e\u0930 \u0939\u091f\u093e\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0907\u0938\u0947 1, 2 \u0914\u0930 3 \u092a\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0947\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scudo attivo \u2013 trascinalo su 1, 2 e 3."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u96d1\u8349\u30b7\u30fc\u30eb\u30c9\u304c\u30a2\u30af\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6 \u2013 \u96d1\u8349\u3092\u9664\u53bb\u3059\u308b\u306b\u306f\u30011\u30012\u30013 \u306b\u30c9\u30e9\u30c3\u30b0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weed Shield \ud65c\uc131 \u2013 \uc7a1\ucd08\ub97c \uc81c\uac70\ud558\ub824\uba74 1, 2, 3\uc73c\ub85c \ub4dc\ub798\uadf8\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onkruidschild actief \u2013 sleep het naar 1, 2 en 3 om het onkruid te verwijderen."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktywna tarcza chwast\u00f3w \u2013 przeci\u0105gnij j\u0105 na 1, 2 i 3, aby usun\u0105\u0107 chwasty."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escudo ativo \u2013 arrasta-o para 1, 2 e 3."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0410\u043a\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d \u0449\u0438\u0442 \u043e\u0442 \u0441\u043e\u0440\u043d\u044f\u043a\u043e\u0432 \u2014 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0430 1, 2 \u0438 3, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u043e\u0440\u043d\u044f\u043a\u0438."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ot Kalkan\u0131 aktif \u2013 otu kald\u0131rmak i\u00e7in onu 1, 2 ve 3'e s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6742\u8349\u9632\u62a4\u7f69\u5904\u4e8e\u6d3b\u52a8\u72b6\u6001 - \u5c06\u5176\u62d6\u52a8\u5230 1\u30012 \u548c 3 \u4ee5\u53bb\u9664\u6742\u8349\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u96dc\u8349\u9632\u8b77\u7f69\u8655\u65bc\u6d3b\u52d5\u72c0\u614b - \u5c07\u5176\u62d6\u66f3\u5230 1\u30012 \u548c 3 \u4ee5\u53bb\u9664\u96dc\u8349\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "weed.shield.ritual.pick_first": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "W\u00e4hle unten einen Schutz \u2013 dann ziehst du das Schild auf die Zahlen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a shield below, then drag it onto the numbers."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige un escudo y arr\u00e1stralo a los n\u00fameros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisis un bouclier, puis fais-le glisser sur les num\u00e9ros."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u0938\u0941\u0930\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902 \u2013 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0906\u092a \u0938\u0902\u0916\u094d\u092f\u093e \u092a\u0930 \u0924\u0916\u094d\u0924\u0940 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091a\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli uno scudo e trascinalo sui numeri."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4e0b\u306e\u76fe\u3092\u9078\u629e\u3057\u3001\u6570\u5b57\u306e\u4e0a\u306b\u30c9\u30e9\u30c3\u30b0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\uc544\ub798\uc5d0\uc11c \ubc29\ud328\ub97c \uc120\ud0dd\ud55c \ub2e4\uc74c \uc22b\uc790 \uc704\ub85c \ub4dc\ub798\uadf8\ud558\uc138\uc694."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kies hieronder een schild en sleep het naar de cijfers."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wybierz tarcz\u0119 poni\u017cej i przeci\u0105gnij j\u0105 na liczby."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escolhe um escudo e arrasta-o para os n\u00fameros."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u0412\u044b\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442\u0443 \u043d\u0438\u0436\u0435, \u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043c \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0449\u0438\u0442 \u043d\u0430 \u0446\u0438\u0444\u0440\u044b."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan bir kalkan se\u00e7in ve onu say\u0131lar\u0131n \u00fczerine s\u00fcr\u00fckleyin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9009\u62e9\u4e0b\u9762\u7684\u4fdd\u62a4 - \u7136\u540e\u5c06\u76fe\u724c\u62d6\u5230\u6570\u5b57\u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u9078\u64c7\u4e0b\u9762\u7684\u4fdd\u8b77 - \u7136\u5f8c\u5c07\u76fe\u724c\u62d6\u5230\u6578\u5b57\u4e0a\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
